window.FWN_IDLE_TYCOON_SYSTEM_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_IDLE_TYCOON_SYSTEM_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":101,"title":"Chapter 101: Visiting Sick father, Healing bread.","paragraphs":["From shopkeeper to auction house proprietor. Career progression continues to get stranger.","\"For now,\" Lola said, returning to her usual customer role, \"I’ll take my usual order. I need to maintain energy for tomorrow’s promotional activities.\"","\"Oh, by the way, the maximum limit has increased to two items per person if you would like to buy.\"","\"Really? Then I guess that’s my new order, then.\" She smiled with obvious satisfaction.","Back to business as usual. Though nothing about this feels usual anymore.","Noah retrieved the double order from his inventory, watching Lola’s expression brighten at the prospect of increasing the purchase limit. Sixty golden coins changed hands, adding to his growing wealth while cementing another satisfied customer relationship.","...","—","Host: Noah Carter","Age: 28","Shop Level: 2","Daily Revenue: $5,000","Current Assets: $180,240.21","Shop Points: 90","Attributes: Strength: 20, Vitality: 4, Intelligence: 20, Agility: 20","Skills: Swordsmanship(Level 6), Mana Control (Level 5), Surviving on Ramen (Level 3), Cooking (Level 2), Programming (Level 2), Gaming (Level 2), Finance (Level 1)","—","[Auto-IceTea Maker]","Level: 3","Production Rate: 2 Iced teas every hour","Max Stock: 48","Progress: 4/200","—","[Auto-Baker]","Level: 3","Production Rate: 4 Loaves every hour","Max Stock: 48","Progress: 4/200","—","Shop points are back to 90 after the upgrade. But the production improvements make it worthwhile.","With two fresh loaves in his inventory, Noah made a decision that filled him with anticipation. Instead of selling them to customers, he carefully transferred both wrapped breads into his storage ring.","Time to test the dimensional item transfer properly.","The magical healing bread disappeared into his storage space with ease. For the first time since discovering his shop, he could bring supernatural benefits directly to the people who mattered most.","Dad’s going to get some good medicine that money can’t buy...well in the earth at least.","Noah placed his closed sign and stepped through the portal, feeling the familiar transition between the magical realm and the mundane reality.","Time to visit Dad.","The storage ring stood on his finger, its contents representing hope in a way that traditional medicine couldn’t match. While healing bread wouldn’t instantly cure everything, thirty percent enhanced natural recovery could make a significant difference for someone fighting a serious illness.","It’ll take more than one loaf since it increases the body’s natural healing by thirty percent, and Dad’s healing rate is low to begin with since he’s a sick human. But it’ll help nonetheless.","The GT-R’s engine purred to life as Noah settled into the driver’s seat.","I’m about to become the only person on Earth with access to magical healing. Probably the only supernatural individual on the entire planet.","The thought was outrageous.","He wasn’t just successful anymore—he was unique in ways that transcended normal human experience.","The hospital’s familiar corridors welcomed him.","Room 412. Dad’s waiting.","Noah knocked gently before entering, finding his father propped against pillows with a book resting open on his lap. Alan’s face brightened with the kind of joy that made all of Noah’s hard work feel worthwhile.","\"Noah! Wasn’t expecting you tonight.\"","\"Brought you something special, just before the visiting time ended,\" Noah replied, settling into the visitor’s chair with excitement.","Time to change everything.","\"What’s this?\" Alan asked, studying the carefully wrapped bread in Noah’s hand with curiosity.","\"Bread from a speciality bakery,\" Noah explained, keeping his explanation grounded in reality.","\"Supposed to have exceptional nutritional properties.\"","Not entirely false. It does have exceptional properties.","Alan unwrapped the golden loaf with careful attention, immediately noting its unusual warmth and the subtle glow that seemed to emanate from within.","\"This looks different from the usual bread. Almost luminescent.\"","\"High-quality ingredients,\" Noah deflected smoothly.","\"Try a piece. I think you’ll find it’s unlike anything you’ve had before.\"","His father broke off a section and took a cautious bite.","\"This is so good,\" Alan breathed, his voice carrying strength that hadn’t been there moments before.","\"I feel... energised. Like my body just remembered how to function properly.\"","\"The nutritional content is supposedly very advanced,\" Noah replied, watching his father’s transformation with satisfaction that transcended mere filial duty.","Alan continued eating with obvious appreciation, each bite bringing visible improvement to his overall condition. The magical enhancement worked through his system like gentle fire, revitalising cellular processes that had been struggling against illness.","\"I haven’t felt this good in months,\" his father admitted, sitting up straighter than he had since his hospitalisation began.","\"Where did you find this bakery?\"","\"Small speciality shop, it’s far from here. My friend brought me some, and I wanted you to try it. I can ask him for more if you want.\"","Alan nodded. \"That would be great. Thank him for me,\"","They spent the next hour talking with energy that had been missing from their recent conversations. Alan’s improved vitality made him more engaged, more present, more like the father Noah remembered from before illness had diminished his strength.","\"I should probably save some for tomorrow,\" Alan said, carefully rewrapping the remaining bread.","\"Actually,\" Noah smiled, producing the second loaf from a bag he had brought with him.","\"I brought extra.\"","His father’s expression shifted to amazement mixed with concern about expense.","\"Noah, this must have cost—\"","\"Dad,\" Noah interrupted gently, \"business has been very good. Let me worry about costs. You focus on getting better.\"","As visiting hours drew to a close, his father looked better than he had in weeks, and the remaining bread would continue enhancing his recovery.","The drive home passed in contented silence, Noah’s thoughts already turning toward tomorrow’s auction and the continuing expansion of his shop.","...","Inside the city of Esta, two figures could be seen battling each other in a courtyard.","Swish!","Whoosh!","The swords collided against each other in rapid, successive motions that made everyone watching shocked.","Swish!","Valeria’s sword collided with Alissa’s, and the sheer power from the attack sent Alissa skidding back a couple of steps.","Huff! Puff!","Alissa was breathing heavily, sweat glistening on her face, whilst Valeria had a smirk with some laboured breath, although not as much as Alissa.","\"Alissa, you’re scaring me. Do you miss him so much that you are improving so quickly?\" Valeria teased the cat-girl, whose tail wagged at the mention of Noah.","Despite her obvious embarrassment, she didn’t admit anything and continued the attacks.","’She’s already halfway through the apprentice swordsman rank...this girl is terrifying. She might reach adept in a couple of weeks and become the youngest to ever do so...’ Valeria thought, blocking Alissa’s attacks."]},{"number":102,"title":"Chapter 102: The Idle Room","paragraphs":["The next day, Noah woke up with anticipation that made coffee unnecessary.","Multiple objectives competed for his attention; he had to sell his stock, explore the new floor in the shop, and the looming auction that would raise his income to new heights.","I’ve got a busy day ahead. Better start early.","Upon arriving at his shop, Noah grabbed a golden loaf from his inventory. The familiar warmth spread through his body as he bit into the healing bread, providing both sustenance and enhancement.","Breakfast of champions. Literally.","Noah was no longer the cheapskate who didn’t dare to eat the loaf that cost $1000.","With his morning meal in hand, Noah climbed the new staircase to explore the mysterious second floor that had emerged during his upgrade. The space opened into something resembling a well-appointed apartment rather than simple employee quarters.","This is like a small house.","The main area featured comfortable furniture arranged with obvious thought—plush sofas, cushioned chairs, and a dining table that could accommodate multiple people.","A bed occupied one corner, while a separate door led to what appeared to be a private bathroom.","Better accommodations than my old apartment. Maybe I should move in here.","But another door in the far corner caught his attention. Unlike the bathroom entrance, this one seemed somehow mysterious.","What’s behind this door?","Noah approached with curiosity mixed with caution. The handle turned smoothly, revealing a space that defied his expectations entirely.","Click.","[Idle Room]","The notification appeared as question marks filled Noah’s consciousness. The room beyond looked... ordinary. Empty walls, simple flooring, nothing that suggested special purpose or function.","Idle Room? That tells me exactly nothing.","He stepped across the threshold, and another system prompt flashed across his retina.","[Welcome to the Idle Room.]","[Here, you will be able to train any skill you want whilst being idle. Your avatar will train the skill you want to improve, whilst you can enjoy your time doing what you like.]","An avatar that trains skills while I’m doing other things? This is incredible!","Noah’s excitement spiked as implications flooded his consciousness. Passive skill development while managing his shop, sleeping, or travelling between dimensions. The efficiency gains would be astronomical.","[Would you like to unlock your avatar?] [Yes | No]","Obviously yes. Why would anyone say no to automated skill training?","Noah slammed the \"Yes\" button with enthusiasm, already planning which skills to prioritise for passive development.","[Avatar unlock requires payment of $1,000,000. Proceed with transaction?] [Yes | No]","ONE MILLION DOLLARS?!","Noah’s jaw dropped so far it practically hit the floor. His excitement evaporated like water in a desert, replaced by the bitter taste of system manipulation.","They made it sound free! ’Would you like to unlock your avatar?’ Not ’Would you like to pay a fortune to unlock your avatar?’","His current assets couldn’t even cover twenty percent of the required payment. The Idle Room, which had seemed like a generous upgrade bonus, was actually a premium feature locked behind a paywall that made his protein bar prices look reasonable.","This is robbery. Digital highway robbery. Although it’s worth it, I can’t lie.","Noah’s frustration built like pressure in a boiling kettle.","The system had dangled amazing functionality in front of him, then demanded payment that exceeded his current wealth by five times.","Played. I got completely played.","He stormed out of the Idle Room, biting into his healing bread with aggressive intensity while muttering curses that would have made demons blush.","\"Stupid system. Stupid million-dollar avatar. Stupid false advertising. Make it sound free then charge a fortune.\"","This is worse than clickbait. This is feature-bait.","[Host... I can hear you.]","The system’s voice carried amusement that made Noah’s frustration spike even higher.","Of course, you can hear me. Because apparently nothing is private in this shop.","Noah stopped his verbal assault immediately, suddenly aware that insulting his primary source of supernatural power might not be strategically wise.","Right. Probably shouldn’t antagonise the entity that controls my entire livelihood.","He finished his healing bread in sullen silence, then descended to the main floor.","One million dollars. I need to make one million dollars for an avatar.","Noah flipped his shop sign to \"Open\" with perhaps more force than necessary, the wooden panel swinging with violence that reflected his emotional state.","I guess I will have to wait until I have enough money. Although it would’ve been nice if I was able to start the avatar training immediately.","The morning light streaming through his upgraded windows illuminated the elegant display cases and spacious interior, but Noah’s mood remained as dark as the Idle Room’s locked potential.","The familiar sound of footsteps approached his entrance, accompanied by an aura that made the air itself dance with mischievous energy. It was Lola wearing a smirk that suggested she’d accomplished something particularly satisfying.","\"Good morning, my favourite Shopkeep.\" Her ruby eyes sparkled with mischief.","\"Good morning, Lola,\" Noah replied back with a soft smile.","\"I spread word about your auction across the entire kingdom,\" she announced with pride.","\"Every noble, wealthy merchant, and power-hungry demon now knows about your new powerful product.\"","Noah’s frustration with the system’s prank evaporated instantly, replaced by appreciation for her promotional efforts. Word-of-mouth marketing from a Master-level succubus would reach audiences he couldn’t access independently.","\"Thank you. That’s exactly what I needed to hear.","\"I’m almost shaking with excitement,\" Lola continued, settling into her usual position near the counter.","\"Half the demon nobility is cancelling evening plans to attend.\"","\"Really? They want it that much?","\"Of course! I made sure to make it seem as if it’s a one-time event. When the supply is low, the demand increases. This will help us increase the price in the auction, just like we planned.\" She winked at him with a grin on her face.","\"Speaking of supply,\" she said with playfulness.","\"I believe my purchasing limit has increased to two items per person? You wouldn’t happen to return back to the usual overnight...right?\"","\"Absolutely. Two of each product if you want.\"","\"Perfect.\" Golden coins appeared in her palm."]},{"number":103,"title":"Chapter 103: Auction","paragraphs":["\"I’ll take the full order—two loaves, two iced teas.\"","Sixty golden coins.","Noah retrieved the items from his stock, watching Lola immediately unwrap one loaf and uncork a bottle.","The familiar ritual of bread consumption followed by iced tea enhancement played out with her obvious satisfaction.","\"Mmm,\" she sighed with contentment.","\"Your products never disappoint. They always make me...feel some type of way.\"","The remaining items disappeared into her storage space.","Their transaction concluded just as the shop door opened again with a dramatic flourish that announced Viscount Vex’s arrival before he became visible. His cape billowed with energy while Precious perched behind his ear like a hair accessory.","Right on schedule. Morning routine never varies.","Vex’s eyes immediately found Lola, and he offered a courteous nod that spoke to proper demon etiquette among social equals.","\"Lady Lola. Always a pleasure.\"","\"Viscount,\" she replied with equal courtesy, though her smirk suggested amusement at his formal mannerisms.","Vex approached the counter, his gaze immediately seeking the protein bar display case.","He began speaking with barely contained excitement. \"Noah, my friend, about yesterday’s magnificent discovery. The protein enhancement treasure—when might it become available for purchase?\"","Here we go. Time to direct him toward the auction.","\"Actually, there’s going to be an auction for it,\" Noah replied, noting how Precious’s teeth clicked with anticipation.","Vex’s expression shifted from excitement to something approaching panic.","\"Auction? But surely loyal customers deserve consideration before public bidding—\"","\"The auction is in two hours. You are one of the only people who didn’t hear about it... mainly because you are never part of the noble circle.\" Lola interrupted smoothly, her voice carrying enough authority to make Vex’s protests die instantly.","\"Central Plaza, evening marketplace. Bidding starts at sunset.\"","Vex’s expression shifted from indignation to sheepish acceptance. His shoulders sagged slightly as the truth of her words settled over him like uncomfortable clothing.","\"I suppose you are right... I never hang out with other nobles, nor am I in the inner circles. Well, thank you for the information about the auction. I really appreciate it.\"","Even demon society has its outcasts. Vex’s flower obsession probably doesn’t win him many friends among the political elite.","\"Two hours,\" Vex repeated, his mind visibly calculating something entirely different from financial preparation.","\"Yes, yes, that provides adequate time for proper gathering of my Demonicas. I will bring a few of my precious Demonicas. Noah is a nice man, and he deserves them. His products are amazing too.\"","He’s planning to trade rare plants instead of gold. That might be good...if the plant is better than Moonburgh, it might be worth the trade. I will see what the others will give too...I suppose.","Precious clicked her teeth with what sounded like enthusiastic agreement, apparently approving of her master’s generous strategy.","Rare Demonica plants as auction payment would be infinitely more valuable than mere golden coins. The benefits they could give would accelerate his development beyond anything monetary compensation could achieve.","\"That’s very generous of you, Vex,\" Noah replied with genuine appreciation.","The carnivorous flower extended tiny vine tendrils in what might have been a wave.","\"I’ll require my order first,\" Vex said, returning to immediate concerns. \"Plus additional supplies for auction preparation.\"","\"Two loaves, two bottles. Precious insists we maintain peak condition for competitive bidding.\"","The golden coins exchanged hands, and Noah stored them in his storage ring.","Vex broke off a piece of golden bread and held it toward Precious, who accepted the offering with delicate vine movements. The carnivorous flower’s needle-sharp teeth worked through it with obvious appreciation.","But the feeding ritual wasn’t one-sided. Precious’s tendrils curled around a smaller section of bread, offering it back to Vex with genuine affection between companions.","The viscount accepted the plant-delivered morsel with touching gratitude, his expression softening as he chewed the bread his flower had shared.","They actually take care of each other. It’s almost sweet, if you ignore the teeth the plant has.","Vex uncorked one bottle of iced tea, taking a sip before tilting it toward Precious. The flower’s vines wrapped around the glass container as it drank.","\"Excellent preparation,\" Vex announced. \"Precious feels magnificent, and I’m operating at optimal capacity.\"","The flower clicked her teeth in what sounded like satisfied agreement, her vine-tendrils swaying with contentment.","\"I must return home now,\" Vex continued, his voice carrying the urgency of someone with important preparations awaiting.","\"Harvesting the proper Demonica specimens requires careful consideration\"","Precious leaned forward from her perch, extending a single tendril toward Noah in what appeared to be a farewell gesture. The carnivorous flower’s usual clicking sounds had softened into something approaching gratitude.","\"We’ll return in two hours,\" Vex promised, already moving toward the exit. \"Properly equipped for serious bidding.\"","The door closed behind them with Vex’s characteristic dramatic flair, leaving Noah alone with the succubus.","...","An hour passed by in a blur.","Lola remained by Noah’s side during that time, positioning herself as both advisor and source of constant amusement.","\"You’re so cute when you’re trying to be a serious businessman,\" she teased, whispering in his ears as Noah explained auction procedures to yet another customer. \"Acting all professional when you’re practically vibrating with excitement.\"","She’s not wrong. This is my first auction, and I have no idea what I’m doing.","\"I’m maintaining appropriate decorum,\" Noah replied.","\"Sure you are,\" Lola’s tail swished with amusement. \"That’s why you’ve checked the protein bar display seventeen times in the past hour.\"","Has it really been seventeen times? I thought I was being subtle.","Throughout the hour, a steady stream of customers flowed through his expanded shop. Each transaction brought opportunities to spread the word about the evening’s main event.","\"Protein Enhancement Bar auction tonight,\" Noah would announce after completing routine sales.","\"Central Plaza, sunset bidding.\"","The responses varied dramatically based on each customer’s circumstances.","\"I’ll be there,\" declared a well-dressed demon merchant. \"Been looking for strength enhancement for years now.\"","Others showed interest tempered by financial reality.","\"Can’t afford to bid,\" admitted a young demon adventurer.","\"But I’ll definitely watch. Never seen anything like the permanent attribute enhancement before.\""]},{"number":104,"title":"Chapter 104: Royalty attending Auction","paragraphs":["\"Royalty will be attending,\" whispered a silver-horned demoness. \"Prince Malphas himself is supposedly interested.\"","The demoness clearly enjoyed gossiping and didn’t hesitate when the chance to do so revealed itself.","There is royalty coming to buy my products...this is going to be troublesome. Maybe nobody will dare to bid against them...even Lola might not. He thought, subtly glancing at Lola.","The rumour had circulated throughout Sin City with remarkable speed, transforming Noah’s auction from a local curiosity into an event that attracted the kingdom’s highest social tiers and lowest social tiers.","Royalty were adored in the demon kingdom, hence why most demons participated in the royal parade.","\"How did word reach royal circles so quickly?\" Noah asked Lola during a brief lull between customers.","\"I may have mentioned the auction to certain well-connected individuals,\" she replied with vagueness.","\"Word travels fast in noble circles, especially when it involves unprecedented magic items.\"","She’s been working her contacts. This auction’s going to be bigger than I expected.","\"Prince Malphas,\" Noah repeated, testing the name.","\"Should I be concerned about his royal attention?\"","Lola’s expression darkened subtly, her usual playful demeanour replaced by something approaching wariness. The change was slight but noticeable to someone who’d spent some time with her.","She definitely has issues with royalty. Just like I suspected.","\"Don’t worry,\" she replied with casualness.","\"The royals wouldn’t do anything out of order in daylight. Too many witnesses, too much public scrutiny, that would ruin their good image, that’s something they don’t want to do.\"","\"But the auction is in the evening,\" Noah pointed out, watching her reaction carefully.","Lola’s confident response died mid-formation. Her mouth opened, then closed without sound. For a moment, the master-level succubus looked genuinely speechless.","\"...\"","The silence stretched between them for a few seconds before Noah broke it.","\"I-It was a joke...\" Noah said finally. \"But on a serious note, are you saying he might do something in the dark?\"","Lola shrugged with nonchalance.","\"Who knows? It depends on the outcome of the auction.\"","That’s not reassuring at all.","Noah felt a chill that had nothing to do with the shop’s temperature. The protein bar represented incredible value, but attracting royal attention might create complications beyond his pay grade.","\"You’re not going to back off from our deal, right?\" he asked, worry creeping into his voice.","\"The price...arrangement?\"","If Lola withdrew her support now, the auction could become a disaster rather than a triumph. Royal intimidation might suppress other bidders, leaving him with minimal competition and disappointing returns.","Her smirk returned with intensity that reminded Noah exactly why succubi were considered dangerous.","\"The price game? No, why would I? In fact, I might go harder now... hehe.\"","\"What do you mean by ’go harder’?\" Noah pressed.","\"Let’s just say that royal presence creates... opportunities.\" Her tail swished with anticipation.","\"Princes are predictable creatures. Pride, ego, and public image—all excellent pressure points. We will use that to increase the price. Although Prince Malphas is known for his humble attitude in the public eye, it’s nothing but a facade.\"","She’s going to manipulate Prince Malphas during the auction. This should be interesting.","The door chimed as another customer entered, cutting short their conversation. But Noah caught the gleam in Lola’s eyes that suggested she was already formulating plans for the evening’s entertainment.","Royal manipulation by a master-level succubus. Either this auction becomes legendary, or I end up in a demon dungeon.","\"What if your manipulation backfires?\" Noah asked quietly after the customer left. \"What if the prince realises that he is being played?\"","Lola’s laugh carried enough confidence to reassure and terrify simultaneously.","\"Noah, I’ve been playing political games since before you were born. Trust me when I say I know exactly how to handle royalty.\"","Another wave of customers entered, their excited conversations about the upcoming auction filling the shop with anticipation.","Word continued spreading through Sin City’s population like wildfire, each retelling adding embellishments that grew the event’s reputation.","\"Besides,\" Lola continued in a whisper, \"you have something every demon in the kingdom wants. Permanent attribute enhancement doesn’t come along often. Prince or not, he’ll have to compete like everyone else.\"","Assuming the auction remains a fair competition rather than a royal decree.","...","The time for the auction had arrived, and the central plaza buzzed with energy.","It’s good that the auction is right next to my shop. Perfect location for maximum impact.","Noah had invested one hundred golden coins in hiring a professional auctioneer—a significant expense that Lola’s connections had made surprisingly reasonable. Without her influence, organising an event of this calibre would have cost many times over.","Not cheap to organise something like this, but not prohibitively expensive either, at least with the right connections. It will be worth every coin if it drives up the final price.","The protein bar remained safely secured within his shop’s protective walls. Too many unknown variables made public display risky, especially with royal attendance confirmed.","Better safe than sorry. The last thing I need is someone trying to steal it before bidding begins.","Demons began gathering in the plaza as sunset approached, their numbers growing steadily as word continued spreading through Sin City’s social networks.","\"Did you hear? The item grants permanent strength enhancement!\"","\"Impossible. Nothing provides permanent boosts without catastrophic side effects.\"","\"I disagree, the human shopkeeper had kept his word for all of his products. They are all insanely powerful, and he wouldn’t ruin his reputation for nothing. Besides, he wouldn’t dare do it, especially when royalty is in question now.\"","Near the merchant quarter, a well-dressed demoness adjusted her jewellery while speaking to her companion.","\"Prince Malphas rarely attends public auctions. His presence suggests that the item really does have an extraordinary value.\"","The auctioneer, a distinguished demon with silver horns and immaculate wear, tested his voice projection while assistants made final preparations. His presence commanded attention through sheer professional bearing.","\"Ladies and gentlemen of Sin City,\" he announced to the growing crowd, \"tonight’s auction represents an unprecedented opportunity to acquire permanent body enhancement!\"","He knows how to work a crowd."]},{"number":105,"title":"Chapter 105: The Auction Begins","paragraphs":["Murmurs rippled through the demons as newcomers arrived in steady streams.","Wealthy merchants clustered together, their expensive accessories glinting under the platform’s lights. Noble families occupied prime viewing positions, their retinues creating small islands of privilege.","The turnout exceeds my wildest expectations. This is going to be massive.","Viscount Vex arrived with his cape billowing despite the absence of any wind.","Precious perched behind his ear, her needle-sharp teeth clicking with excitement. Behind him, servants carried ornate cases that presumably contained his promised Demonica specimens.","He brought backup plants...","A commotion near the plaza’s eastern entrance announced more significant arrivals. Guards in royal livery cleared pathways through the crowd, their formation speaking to serious security protocols.","Royal entourage. This is really happening.","Prince Malphas emerged from the protective formation like a figure from legend. His presence took everyone’s immediate attention.","He was tall, imposing, with features that spoke to generations of selective breeding for power and intimidation. Every demon in the plaza seemed to unconsciously step back, creating space around his arrival.","The prince’s gaze swept across the assembled crowd with a soft smile. His expression suggested someone who viewed the evening’s proceedings as entertainment rather than a serious challenge.","Lola appeared beside Noah with her usual dramatic timing, appearing as if she’d stepped out of the shadows rather than simply walked through the crowd.","Noah got jumpscared by her sudden appearance.","\"You scared me. Can you stop with this sudden appearance?\"","\"Hehe,\" She giggled at his reaction.","Her outfit for the evening was particularly stunning—elegant enough for royal company, provocative enough to distract male bidders.","\"Excellent turnout,\" she murmured, her ruby eyes tracking various arrivals with interest.","She’s already analysing the competition. This woman doesn’t miss anything.","More notable figures continued arriving.","A group of demon merchants whose expensive carriages suggested that they had some serious purchasing power.","Several mages whose robes displayed guild affiliations and academic credentials. Even a few adventuring parties who’d apparently pooled resources for tonight’s opportunity.","Diverse crowd. Multiple bidding strategies will emerge once the action starts.","The auctioneer called for attention as the final stragglers found positions. His voice carried across the plaza with professional authority that silenced conversations and focused every eye on the central platform.","\"Distinguished guests of Sin City,\" he began, his tone building anticipation like a master storyteller.","\"Tonight, we auction an item of unprecedented magical properties. Permanent attribute enhancement—a treasure that kingdoms have waged wars to possess!\"","Building excitement through scarcity and exaggeration. This guy knows his business.","Excited murmurs rippled through the crowd.","Permanent enhancement represented the holy grail of magical development—benefits that would last lifetimes rather than temporary boosts.","\"Bidding will commence shortly,\" the auctioneer continued, \"but first, allow me to explain the extraordinary properties of tonight’s centrepiece...\"","Noah felt his pulse quicken as hundreds of demon eyes fixed on the platform where his product would soon be displayed.","He had initially wanted to keep his product inside the store, But Lola convinced him that she would protect it. Thus, he decided to place it there.","If anything goes wrong...She will pay for it.","Lola’s hand briefly touched his shoulder, a gesture of support mixed with anticipation for the chaos she was about to unleash.","\"Ready?\" she whispered.","Noah nodded, watching Prince Malphas take his position near the platform’s front.","Ready as I’ll ever be. Let’s see what happens when royalty meets marketplace competition.","The auction was about to begin.","...","The plaza settled into place as the demons found their designated seating.","Everyone’s here. Time to see how this unfolds.","The auctioneer stepped forward, his silver horns gleaming under the dramatic illumination. His voice carried across the assembled crowd with commanding presence.","\"Once again. Welcome, distinguished guests, to tonight’s extraordinary auction! We begin this evening with exceptional items from Sin City’s finest craftsmen and merchants.\"","Smart to start with regular items. Build excitement before the main event.","\"Our first lot comes from Master Korgan’s renowned forge—a Tier 3 blade of exceptional quality!\"","Two assistants carried a display case onto the platform, revealing a sword. The weapon’s dark steel held an almost liquid quality; it was easy to discern its amazing craftsmanship just by looking.","That’s definitely not standard craftsmanship. Korgan really is one of the best blacksmiths in Sin City.","\"Behold the Ironcutter Blade!\" the auctioneer announced with theatrical flourish. \"Tier 3 enhancement with magic affinity channelling, self-sharpening properties, and armour-penetration capabilities. Master Korgan has declared this among his finest works! It’s considered the best in its tier.\"","Murmurs of appreciation rippled through the crowd as experienced warriors recognised superior weaponry. The blade’s craftsmanship spoke of its maker’s skills.","\"Bidding opens at fifty golden coins!\"","Fifty coins for a Tier 3 weapon. That’s actually a reasonable starting price given the quality.","Hands rose immediately as serious collectors competed for Korgan’s masterwork. The price climbed steadily—120, 140, 160 coins as determined bidders refused to yield.","\"Sold to Lord Theron for one hundred sixty-five golden coins!\" the auctioneer declared as a demon noble claimed his prize with obvious satisfaction.","Strong opening. Good sign for tonight’s main event.","\"Next, we present an enchanted shield from the workshop of Artificer Myrax!\"","The subsequent item was a tower shield that seemed to shimmer with protective energy.","\"The Aegis Ward—Tier 2 magical protection with damage absorption, elemental resistance, and automatic repair functions. Opening bid: Thirty golden coins!\"","The bidding proceeded with enthusiasm that suggested the evening’s crowd had come prepared for serious spending. Adventurers competed against nobles while merchant collectors drove prices toward their maximum thresholds.","\"Sold for ninety-five golden coins!\"","Consistent strong results. The crowd’s definitely ready to spend.","Additional items followed in rapid succession—a pair of boots that enhanced movement speed, a cloak that provided magical concealment, and a staff that amplified elemental spells. Each lot drew competitive bidding that pushed final prices well above opening amounts.","This is a perfect warm-up. Everyone’s getting comfortable with the bidding process.","\"And now,\" the auctioneer’s voice dropped to build dramatic tension.","\"We present a collection of rare alchemical ingredients from the private vault of Master Chemist Valdris!\""]},{"number":106,"title":"Chapter 106: The Auction Begins (2)","paragraphs":["Three ornate bottles appeared on display pedestals, their contents glowing with colours that seemed to shift based on viewing angle. Even from his position, Noah could sense the magical potency contained within.","\"Phoenix Ash, Dragon Scale Powder, and Essence of Temporal Flow—materials that most alchemists can only dream of acquiring. Combined opening bid: one hundred golden coins!\"","The crowd’s spending limits are definitely in the right range for my product.","The bidding war that erupted was fierce enough to draw impressed murmurs from spectators. Wealthy mages competed against noble collectors, driving prices toward levels that made Noah’s pulse quicken with anticipation.","\"Sold for two hundred thirty golden coins!\"","Two-thirty for alchemical supplies. These people have serious money to spend.","Prince Malphas had remained silent throughout the preliminary auctions, his expression suggesting boredom with items beneath his interest level. But Noah caught him checking a timepiece, clearly waiting for the evening’s main attraction.","He’s here for the protein bar specifically. This is going to get intense.","Lola positioned herself strategically within the crowd, her ruby eyes tracking various bidders with predatory attention. She’d identified key players and was clearly preparing her manipulation tactics.","She’s ready to work her magic. Time to see what creative chaos she unleashes.","\"Distinguished guests,\" the auctioneer announced, his voice silencing everyone else’s.","\"We now arrive at tonight’s centrepiece, an item of unprecedented magical properties!\"","The crowd’s energy changed perceptibly as anticipation reached fever pitch. This was the moment everyone had gathered to witness.","\"By special arrangement with a master human craftsman named Noah, we present the Protein Enhancement Bar—the first known item capable of permanent attribute enhancement at any rank!\"","Here we go. Everything builds to this moment.","\"This extraordinary creation provides a fifty percent temporary increase to Strength attribute for twenty minutes, plus a permanent increase of ten attribute points upon first consumption!\"","Gasps echoed through the assembly. Even though they’ve heard the effects before, hearing it again didn’t make it any less powerful.","That’s a good reaction. They are still hyped for the product...I’m going to be RICH!","Prince Malphas straightened in his seat, his bored expression changing to interest.","Now I have his attention. Let’s see how deep royal pockets actually go.","\"Given the extraordinary nature of this item, bidding opens at two hundred golden coins or equivalent trade value!\"","The auctioneer’s declaration sent ripples of excitement through the assembled crowd.","Two hundred coins represented serious money, enough to fully equip a starting adventuring party.","Double the opening price I expected. It seems Lola really done me good.","Hands shot up immediately as wealthy bidders staked their claims. The competition began with enthusiasm that suggested the final price would climb far beyond the opening amount.","\"Two hundred ten!\" called a demon merchant.","\"Two hundred twenty!\" countered a mage whose staff gleamed with high-tier enchantments.","Strong opening pace. These people came prepared for serious spending.","Prince Malphas remained seated, his expression suggesting mild interest rather than urgent concern. Royal bidding typically waited until competition thinned to more manageable levels.","He’s playing the long game. Smart strategy for someone with essentially unlimited resources.","\"Two hundred thirty!\"","\"Two hundred forty!\"","The increments climbed steadily as determined bidders refused to yield early ground. Adventuring parties pooled their resources while individual collectors pushed toward their maximum limits.","This is already exceeding my most optimistic projections.","\"Two hundred sixty!\" announced Lord Theron, the same noble who’d claimed Korgan’s Voidcutter Blade earlier.","\"Two hundred seventy!\" replied a demoness.","The bidding continued its relentless climb as competitors drove prices toward levels that made casual observers wince.","Nearly three hundred coins already. At this rate, we might break four hundred.","But as the price approached three hundred coins, the pace began to slow. Bidders dropped out one by one as their financial limits approached, leaving only the most determined competitors.","\"Two hundred ninety!\" called the merchant, his voice carrying less confidence than earlier.","\"Three hundred!\" Lord Theron’s bid drew murmurs from spectators who recognised serious money in motion.","Three hundred coins. That’s already life-changing wealth.","The merchant hesitated, clearly calculating whether he would be able to contend later on. After several long seconds, he shook his head and settled back in his seat.","One down. How many serious bidders remain?","\"Three hundred ten!\" the jewellery-wearing demoness called, her voice steady despite the astronomical amounts involved.","\"Three hundred twenty!\"","But as the price climbed toward three-fifty, even determined bidders began reaching their limits. The demoness hesitated longer between bids, while the mage’s confident posture showed subtle cracks.","They’re approaching maximum sustainable spending. Time for royal intervention.","Prince Malphas chose his moment. As the bidding stalled at three hundred forty coins, he raised his hand casually.","The gesture immediately caught the attention of everyone present. The prince was finally starting to bid.","\"Four hundred golden coins.\"","Jumping sixty coins in a single bid.","The effect was immediate and devastating. Remaining bidders exchanged glances that spoke to shared recognition of futility. Competing against royal resources was financial suicide for anyone without equivalent backing.","The auctioneer paused, scanning the crowd for continued competition. \"Four hundred golden coins from His Royal Highness. Any additional bids?\"","Silence stretched across the plaza as determined bidders accepted defeat.","\"Going once at four hundred golden coins...\"","This is it. If Lola’s going to act, it has to be now.","\"Going Twi-\"","\"Four hundred ten!\"","The voice cut through the evening air with timing so perfect it seemed planned.","Every head turned toward Lola, who’d raised her hand with elegant confidence that challenged the prince.","There she is. Let the games begin.","Prince Malphas’s expression remained the same despite the unexpected competition that emerged at the last second. His eyes narrowed as he evaluated this new challenger who dared contest royal authority.","\"Four hundred twenty,\" the prince replied..","That’s a modest increase...coming from a prince.","Lola’s smile widened. \"Four hundred thirty.\"","She’s enjoying this.","The crowd’s energy transformed from resigned acceptance to anticipation. Royal bidding wars were a rare entertainment that most demons never witnessed personally."]},{"number":107,"title":"Chapter 107: The Auction Begins (3)","paragraphs":["\"Five hundred and ten,\" Prince Malphas replied, his tone remaining steady despite the astronomical figure. His expression carried the same neutral composure he’d maintained throughout the evening—focused but not emotional.","He’s treating this like a business transaction rather than a personal affront. Smarter than I expected.","Lola’s smile widened as she prepared her counter-bid, clearly enjoying the elevated price. But before she could respond, an unexpected voice cut through the tension.","\"Four hundred twenty golden coins—plus three rare Demonica specimens!\"","Vex?","Every head turned toward Viscount Vex, who stood beside his ornate plant cases.","Precious clicked her teeth with excitement from her perch behind his ear, apparently approving of her master’s bold strategy.","Clearly, Vex defied the norms of the demon society. As an outcast who didn’t really meddle with other nobles and royals. He didn’t mind bidding against the royal prince.","The auctioneer paused, clearly calculating the combined value of the monetary bid plus exotic Demonica specimens. Rare Demonica plants commanded decent prices among collectors and cultivators.","\"The honourable Viscount offers four hundred twenty coins plus Demonica trade goods,\" he announced.","\"Estimated total value approaches five hundred and eighty coins!\"","Five-eighty equivalent. Vex just jumped ahead of everyone through his bidding.","Prince Malphas studied Vex with interest rather than irritation.","The viscount’s unconventional approach represented legitimate competition rather than direct challenge to royal authority.","\"Six hundred golden coins,\" the prince stated, maintaining his measured cadence.","Straight monetary response. He’s avoiding the complications of trade evaluation.","Lola’s ruby eyes sparkled with delight as the competition intensified beyond her most optimistic projections. Three serious bidders meant sustained pressure that would drive prices toward ridiculous heights.","She’s orchestrated this perfectly. Royal bidding plus noble competition plus her own manipulation.","\"Six hundred ten,\" she called, keeping the increments manageable while maintaining pressure.","Vex consulted with Precious in a whispered conversation, the flower apparently providing advice about bidding.","Their partnership had always been unusually collaborative.","\"Five hundred twenty coins plus three Demonica specimens!\" Vex declared, expanding his offering. \"The Demonicas include a mature Shadowbloom and juvenile Crystalvine! The total price stands at seven hundred and twenty golden coins.\"","The crowd murmured with appreciation as plant enthusiasts recognised the specimens’ significance. Shadowblooms required years to mature, while Crystalvines provided ongoing benefits.","The auctioneer paused, clearly calculating the combined value while considering precedent for mixed-payment auctions. His expression suggested genuine uncertainty about proper valuation procedures.","\"The honorable Viscount’s offer totals approximately seven hundred twenty coins equivalent,\" he announced after brief consultation with his assistants.","Prince Malphas studied Vex.","The viscount’s approach represented creative problem-solving rather than simple wealth display. He wasn’t merely entering with golden coins; he was entering with what he was known for, his Demonica plants.","\"Seven hundred thirty golden coins,\" the prince responded, his tone remaining measured despite the astronomical amounts involved.","Lola’s ruby eyes sparkled with delight as the competition intensified beyond anyone’s projections. Three serious bidders created sustained pressure that would drive final prices toward ridiculous heights.","\"Eight hundred golden coins,\" Lola declared calmly, making the astronomical amount sound reasonable.","Vex’s shoulders sagged as the number registered. His face cycled through disappointment, acceptance, and finally admiration for the sheer scale of wealth being deployed.","\"I...\" he began, then stopped. Precious clicked her teeth sympathetically from her perch behind his ear.","He’s out.","\"I concede,\" Vex announced with as much dignity as he could muster. \"May the enhancement serve its new owner well.\"","The crowd murmured appreciatively at his gracious withdrawal. Losing a bidding war to royal wealth and master-level succubi carried no shame.","Down to two. Prince versus succubus. This is what everyone came to see.","Prince Malphas turned his attention fully to Lola, studying her with a calculating gaze.","\"Nine hundred golden coins,\" he stated, his tone carrying subtle weight beyond mere monetary increase.","The prince’s expression changed slightly.","\"Lady Lola, perhaps we might discuss alternative arrangements. You will do me a great favour by letting me take this item.\"","Every demon in the plaza leaned forward. Royal favours were currency more valuable than gold among the nobility.","Lola’s smile widened with satisfaction rather than concern, as if she were waiting for this moment.","\"Your Highness, while your favours are something that can’t be measured with monetary value. But I really need this item, as it might help me push past my current limits.\"","In front of all the demons present, Lola politely rejected the prince.","Her tone carried enough respect to avoid direct insult while making her position absolutely clear. Whatever favour the prince referenced wouldn’t influence this competition.","Prince Malphas nodded with what might have been approval. \"As you wish. Nine hundred golden coins stand.\"","\"Nine hundred ten,\" Lola called.","The bidding resumed its relentless climb as both competitors demonstrated a serious commitment to acquiring permanent enhancement.","\"Nine hundred ninety,\" Prince Malphas replied with steady confidence.","So close to a thousand coins. This is it—the final threshold.","But instead of continuing the monetary escalation, Lola’s expression shifted to something approaching satisfaction.","Her ruby eyes sparkled with mischief.","I know that look...chaos is incoming. She’s about to do something crazy.","\"It seems golden coins are no longer sufficient currency for such a treasure,\" she announced.","\"Therefore, I offer a treasure as a payment.\"","Lola reached into her storage space. Every demon in the plaza felt the change as another treasure entered the equation.","What is that thing?","The item appeared as a small white orb that seemed to contain swirling mana within its surface.","\"This is the Eye of Apollo—the powerful artefact that discerns truth from falsehood, sees through all deception, and reveals the nature of any being upon whom its gaze falls.\"","An artefact. She’s bidding with an actual artefact.","The crowd’s collective gasp echoed across the plaza as the implications registered. These kinds of artefacts represented power beyond monetary valuation, items that even kingdoms treasured.","Noah’s enhanced perception focused on the mysterious orb, triggering his inspection ability almost involuntarily.","[Eye of Apollo]","[Description] A powerful artefact capable of detecting truth, piercing illusions, and revealing the fundamental nature of any target. Provides absolute truth detection within its area of influence. No deception can withstand its scrutiny.","[Tier] 5","[Estimated Price] 1,100 Golden Coins"]},{"number":108,"title":"Chapter 108: Sold!","paragraphs":["Prince Malphas stared at the orb with an expression that cycled through surprise, calculation, and growing respect for Lola’s boldness.","The auctioneer stood frozen, clearly uncertain how to evaluate the artefact versus monetary bidding. His training hadn’t covered such powerful item appraisals during active auctions.","How do you price something that’s technically priceless?","\"The Eye of Apollo,\" the auctioner repeated slowly. \"A bold gambit, Lady Lola. Would you mind telling us how much it’s worth?\"","Lola nodded with a smirk that suggested she’d been waiting for exactly this question. \"One thousand one hundred golden coins... if you can find it for sale. Since you can’t, its actual price is considerably higher.\"","Eleven hundred coins minimum. She just raised the stakes beyond anything we’ve seen tonight.","The crowd murmured with appreciation for both the artefact’s value and Lola’s boldness.","Prince Malphas studied the Eye of Apollo with the calculating gaze of someone who understood exactly what kind of power was being offered. His expression suggested serious consideration rather than automatic escalation.","He’s weighing his options.","\"Since Lady Lola has decided to introduce Tier 5 items,\" the prince announced.","\"I shall naturally respond in kind.\"","The prince reached into his own storage space, withdrawing an orb that seemed to contain miniature storms within its silver surface. Wind currents swirled through its depths.","Another powerful artefact. Of course, he has one sitting in his storage ring.","\"The Wind Orb,\" Prince Malphas declared, holding the sphere aloft for the crowd’s inspection. \"Containing concentrated essence of the sky realm’s most powerful atmospheric forces.\"","Noah’s inspection ability triggered automatically as the orb’s power washed over the plaza.","[Wind Orb]","[Description: A legendary artefact containing pure wind essence harvested from celestial storms. Provides a deep understanding of atmospheric manipulation and serves as a catalyst for wind-based magical development. Contains enough elemental energy to awaken dormant affinities.]","[Tier: 5]","[Estimated Price: 1,300 Golden Coins]","Thirteen hundred coins are equivalent. He just outbid her legendary artifact with an even more valuable one.","But instead of disappointment, Lola’s expression carried satisfaction that seemed completely at odds with being outbid. Her ruby eyes found Noah’s position in the crowd, delivering a tiny smile that only he could see from his angle.","She’s done. This is what she wanted all along.","The realisation struck Noah like lightning. Lola hadn’t been trying to win the auction—she’d been manipulating Prince Malphas into offering exactly the kind of payment that would benefit Noah most.","This succubus... she’s incredible. She played everyone, including this prince.","\"Going once for the Wind Orb!\" the auctioneer called, his voice concluding one of the kingdom’s most expensive auctions.","\"Going twice!\"","Thirteen hundred coins worth of elemental artifact. Some sales redefine entire economies.","\"Sold to His Royal Highness Prince Malphas!\"","The gavel’s impact echoed across the plaza like thunder, finalising a transaction that would be discussed in demon society for decades.","[You have sold your first Protein Bar!]","[Daily Income Stream Activated!]","[Protein Bar Idle Income: Wind Orb or equivalent in gold]","[Reward: Auto-ProteinBar Level 1]","Daily income stream of legendary artefacts. The system just transformed my entire business.","Noah could barely contain his excitement as implications flooded his consciousness.","The transaction was completed almost immediately. Prince Malphas claimed his enhancement with satisfaction that suggested money well spent, while Noah accepted the Wind Orb with reverence befitting legendary treasure.","If I sold these orbs to the academy in the human realm, I could make a decent profit. Or maybe I could trade one for a different elemental affinity... That might be more valuable in the long run. Then again, I could give one to Kipp—he is a mage, and this would definitely boost his power.","Noah’s mind went through all the different possibilities that the wind orb offered him, and there were plenty.","Prince Malphas departed with his retinue, the protein bar secured within royal storage for immediate consumption. His expression carried contentment that suggested successful acquisition of the desired enhancement.","Lola melted back into the crowd subtly, avoiding any appearance of close connection to Noah’s shop. Her performance had been flawless—manipulation disguised as competition that achieved everyone’s objectives.","She couldn’t be seen entering my shop right after that performance. It would’ve been too obvious. She would return later on, and even if anyone questioned it, they had no evidence.","And if they chose to push harder?","Well, they could try.","She was a master-tier mage, after all.","The plaza gradually emptied as spectators discussed the evening’s unprecedented events. Record-breaking prices, legendary artefacts, royal participation—enough material for months of speculation.","Noah returned to his shop with the Wind Orb clutched carefully in both hands. He had already paid the auctioner his due, for now he needed to check his reward.","The artefact pulsed with contained wind power that made his senses tingle with anticipation.","Time to see if this unlocks my elemental affinity.","Inside his transformed shop, surrounded by glowing Demonica plants, Noah settled into a meditation position with the silver orb resting in his palms. Lola had discreetly provided instructions before the auction’s conclusion.","Insert mana into the orb and feel the wind.","Noah focused his Level 5 mana control, channelling energy into the small orb. The response was immediate—power flowed from his consciousness into swirling atmospheric essence contained within.","Connection established. Now what?","At first, nothing happened beyond the orb’s gentle warming against his skin. The wind essence remained foreign, unresponsive to his magical probing.","Still nothing. Maybe this won’t work after all.","But gradually, something shifted. Noah’s mana sensitivity began detecting patterns within the orb’s chaotic energy. Atmospheric currents that had seemed random revealed underlying structure.","There it is, I can feel it! Something’s changing.","Minutes passed as understanding slowly developed. The wind essence stopped feeling alien, becoming something he could almost touch with conscious intent.","Getting closer. The barrier’s weakening.","His mana merged deeper with the orb’s contained storms, consciousness expanding to encompass atmospheric forces that defied normal comprehension.","Almost there. Just a little more...","Suddenly, connection blazed through his awareness like lightning. Wind essence flooded his magical channels, transforming theoretical understanding into visceral knowledge of atmospheric manipulation.","[You have learned the skill Wind Manipulation Level 1]","\"Yes!\""]},{"number":109,"title":"Chapter 109: New Talent","paragraphs":["—","Host: Noah Carter","Age: 28","Shop Level: 2","<anno data-annotation-id=\"c3d0bb6c-87c6-a4b1-3ad9-96815b758ca6\" data-title=\"Daily Revenue: $135,000\">Daily Revenue: $135,000 1 </anno>","Current Assets: $315,240.21","Shop Points: 1010","Attributes: Strength: 20, Vitality: 4, Intelligence: 20, Agility: 20","Skills: Swordsmanship(Level 6), Mana Control (Level 5), Surviving on Ramen (Level 3), Cooking (Level 2), Programming (Level 2), Gaming (Level 2), Finance (Level 1), Wind Manipulation(Level 1)","—","Daily revenue jumped to one hundred thirty-five thousand dollars.","Noah stared at his status screen, still processing the transformation. His idle income now included a tier 5 wind orb alongside Demonica Moonburgh.","Time to test what Wind Manipulation Level 1 actually accomplishes.","Standing in his expanded shop, surrounded by the gentle glow of the sun and the star plants, Noah raised his hand and focused on the new skill. The wind essence within his mana channels responded with eager cooperation.","A gentle breeze stirred around his fingers, lifting strands of hair softly. The sensation was intoxicating.","The wind forces were now obeying his conscious will.","It works.","The basic control felt natural rather than forced, like flexing a muscle he’d always possessed but never knew how to use. Wind currents swirled around his palm, creating very tiny whirlwinds that dissipated at his command.","Level 1 has basic capabilities, but at least it’s something.","Noah experimented with different applications, discovering the skill’s current limitations through testing. He could generate breezes strong enough to cool his face or rustle papers, but nothing approaching combat effectiveness.","Baby steps. Every master started somewhere.","Focusing more intently, he managed to create a small vortex at his fingertip.","He could make wind currents spiral like a microscopic tornado. The effect lasted several seconds before his concentration wavered and the pattern collapsed.","I can make a small tornado; that’s a promising start.","The practice continued as Noah explored every aspect of his first elemental affinity. Wind responded to emotional states as much as conscious direction, swirling faster and other things.","He discovered he could influence air temperature slightly, creating pockets of cooler atmosphere through accelerated circulation. Not enough for practical cooling, but it proved that there was massive potential waiting to be unlocked.","An hour passed in experimentation as Noah pushed Level 1 Wind Manipulation toward its absolute limits. Each successful technique built confidence while revealing pathways for future applications.","It’s getting more responsive. The skill’s developing faster than I expected.","The breakthrough came during an attempt to maintain the multiple small vortexes simultaneously. Instead of controlling each one separately, Noah let his awareness expand to encompass all the air currents at once.","Suddenly, the entire shop filled with coordinated atmospheric movement. Gentle breezes circulated in perfect harmony, creating an environment that felt alive with elemental energy.","[Your Wind Manipulation skill has levelled up to Level 2!]","Level 2 already. That was fast! I expected it to take days to increase its level.","At level 2, Noah could generate stronger currents, maintain effects longer, and execute multiple techniques without mental strain.","Noah’s smile widened as he tested it.","Wait! Maybe I could improve it further by using the wind orb. It does have the wind element after all, maybe I could learn a few things.","The thought sent excitement coursing down his spine like lightning through copper wire. If his theory proved correct, he might skyrocket through skill levels faster than he had imagined possible.","Time to find out if tier 5 orbs make better teachers than meditation alone.","Noah retrieved the Wind Orb from his storage ring, feeling its contained power pulse against his palms. The orb’s surface seemed to respond to his elemental affinity, swirling wind moving faster as his mana touched its edges.","Here goes everything.","He channelled his wind manipulation directly into the artefact, feeling his consciousness merge with the concentrated elemental essence contained within.","This is incredible. Noah thought, a huge smile plastered across his face.","Knowledge flooded his brain like a dam bursting.","It wasn’t techniques or applications, but a fundamental understanding of wind itself.","How air molecules danced through space, how temperature differences created pressure variations, how currents formed and dissipated according to natural laws.","It’s teaching me the physics of wind manipulation rather than just magical techniques.","Noah’s comprehension deepened as the orb shared secrets that most wind mages spent decades discovering through trial and error. He began understanding wind not as a force to be controlled, but as a living system to be harmonised with.","Wind doesn’t want to be commanded. It wants to be guided along paths it already prefers to travel.","The revelation changed his entire approach. Instead of forcing air currents into unnatural patterns, Noah learned to read existing flows and redirect them with minimal energy expenditure.","Maximum effect through minimum intervention. You have to work with the wind, not against it.","His consciousness expanded to encompass the shop’s entire atmospheric environment. Every breath from the Demonica plants, every thermal current from the lighting, every draft through the doorway, all became visible as interconnected streams of moving air.","It’s like seeing a three-dimensional map of invisible rivers.","Noah began conducting these aerial rivers with growing experience. Gentle nudges at key points created domino effects throughout the space, transforming chaotic air movement into proper circulation.","One small change here creates larger changes there.","The orb’s teachings revealed how masters achieved seemingly impossible effects through understanding of leverage points. A tiny vortex in the right location could redirect massive air masses with elegant efficiency.","It’s not about power. It’s about knowledge.","[Your Wind Manipulation skill has levelled up to Level 3!]","Level 3 already! Half an hour of orb-assisted training versus what would have probably taken days of conventional practice.","The advancement brought enhanced sensitivity to air currents and expanded control range. Noah could now influence wind patterns throughout his entire shop rather than just the immediate vicinity.","Let’s see how far this can go.","He dove deeper into the orb’s concentrated wisdom, his consciousness merging more completely with elemental essence. The orb revealed advanced concepts that challenged his understanding of physical reality.","<annotations style=\"display: none;\">Daily revenue is always in $. However, depending on Noah’s choice, he could have the equivalence, such as the wind orb, or the demonica for the tea and bread price.","So his current Idle Income is Demonica Moonburgh + Wind Orb.</annotations>"]},{"number":110,"title":"Chapter 110: Level 4 Wind Manipulation","paragraphs":["Wind carries more than just air molecules. It carries its own signature of mana; it carries hidden information that only those with the wind talent can translate.","Noah began sensing the subtle differences between various types of air movement. Breezes created by natural temperature gradients felt different from currents generated through talent usage.","Each carried distinct signatures that revealed their origins.","Every wind tells a story about where it’s been and what created it.","The orb taught him to read these aerial narratives, understanding the different patterns, magical disturbances, and even the emotional states of nearby beings through their unconscious influence on surrounding air currents.","Beings breathe differently when they’re excited versus nervous. The wind remembers everything.","His skill development accelerated as theoretical knowledge transformed into instinctive understanding. Techniques that should have required months of practice became accessible within minutes of comprehension.","This is what learning from concentrated elemental essence feels like. Pure knowledge transfer.","Noah noticed the orb’s internal energy diminishing as he absorbed its teachings. The swirling wind moved more slowly, its luminescence fading as concentrated wind essence flowed into his developing magical channels.","It’s sacrificing itself to teach me. The orb is literally giving up its power to enhance my understanding. No wonder why orbs are so rare...it’s because the more you comprehend it, the less concentrated it becomes.","But instead of concern, Noah felt excitement.","His daily protein bar income included replacement wind orbs, meaning he had unlimited access to this kind of accelerated learning.","One orb per day. Infinite advancement potential.","What Noah failed to realise was just how shocking his casual use of legendary artefacts would appear to other mages. Tier 5 elemental orbs weren’t just rare. They were kingdom-shaking treasures, the kind of items kings went to war over and mages dreamed of acquiring in their lifetimes.","Even at the prestigious Academy of Sina in the Demon Kingdom, the most elite students, those who shattered records or ranked at the very top, were granted only a few fleeting minutes with such an orb. And even then, it was a tightly monitored privilege, used solely for rapid comprehension during breakthroughs.","Yet here Noah was treating them like snacks in his shop.","If word of this ever reached Sin City or Esta, there’d be riots. The masses wouldn’t just be outraged, they’d want Noah skinned alive and hung up as a warning to anyone else who dared waste a Tier 5 orb like it was candy.","But ignorance provided bliss as Noah continued his intensive session. The orb’s teachings revealed advanced applications that bordered on miraculous. It provided him with a few basic techniques that would help in combat, such as short levitation and quick speed bursts that would help him dodge dangerous attacks.","The levitation technique made him think of something that made his body tremble in excitement. Once he reached a high level of attainment in Wind Manipulation skill, he would be able to use flight.","The possibility sent shivers of anticipation through his body. Level 3 remained far from such advanced applications, but the foundation was being established through the usage of the concentrated Orb.","Every skill level unlocks new possibilities. This is just the beginning.","The wind orb continued sacrificing its essence for Noah’s education, each absorbed fragment bringing deeper understanding of elemental manipulation.","[Your Wind Manipulation skill has levelled up to Level 4!]","After reaching level 4, Noah decided to end his training session. He had learnt enough, although there was still a decent amount of wind concentration inside the orb, he decided to stop.","The process was mentally fatiguing. It was like sitting down to study for your exams for six to seven hours in one go. It was tiring, but very enjoyable, which made it an enjoyable session.","Checking his system status. Noah smiled.","—","Host: Noah Carter","Age: 28","Shop Level: 2","Daily Revenue: $135,000","Current Assets: $315,240.21","Shop Points: 1010","Attributes: Strength: 20, Vitality: 4, Intelligence: 20, Agility: 20","Skills: Swordsmanship(Level 6), Mana Control (Level 5), Wind Manipulation (Level 4), Surviving on Ramen (Level 3), Cooking (Level 2), Programming (Level 2), Gaming (Level 2), Finance (Level 1)","—","His current assets did not include the wind orb’s worth, which made Noah realise that his current assets would only count his monetary assets.","He could convert the wind orb to golden coins and see the assets skyrocket, but that would be foolish. Furthermore, he realised that after using the wind orb, the value of the orb had decreased to 500 golden coins. It was clear that his theory of it depleting at some point was correct.","\"Not bad. I’m what they call a wind mage, now.\" He muttered, a huge smile breaking out on his face.","\"Time to check on my auto-makers,\"","—","[Auto-IceTea Maker] Progress: 52/200","Level: 3","Production Rate: 2 Iced teas every hour","Max Stock: 48","—","[Auto-Baker] Progress: 53/200","Level: 3","Production Rate: 4 Loaves every hour","Max Stock: 48","—","[Auto-ProteinBar] Progress: 0/100","Level: 1","Production Rate: 1 bar every 2 hours","Max Stock: 12","—","As he had expected, the progress of the protein bar was zero, just like the others. But what shocked him was the insane production rate of the protein bar.","\"Damn...I can get 12 bars a day...it’s the same starting point as the Iced tea.\"","Whilst he knew that having so many bars was going to increase his wealth significantly, he also knew that there was a downside.","The astronomical price for the protein bar wasn’t because of the 50% increase in strength. But it was because of the increase in the strength attribute by 10, regardless of rank.","His fingers drummed against the counter.","\"This isn’t working, I need everyone to purchase this product. Otherwise, it will take me a millennium to increase the auto-maker to level 2,\" he muttered.","He didn’t want to sell to the elite few and have the rest of the market walk past his shop. He wanted lines out the door.","He wanted everyone —rich or poor, novice or veteran—to bite.","Then the idea hit him."]},{"number":111,"title":"Chapter 111: Price Issue, Heading to the Crimson Mountain.","paragraphs":["\"Adept-rank and higher,\" he said, \"first-time buyers... 1,000 gold. That’s fair. They know how hard it is to raise attributes at their level. I need to keep the price in the same range as the auction. Otherwise, the prince might think I’ve scammed him, I don’t want trouble knocking on my door.\"","\"For those same buyers, any repeat purchases drop to 50 gold. They’ve already gained the permanent buff, so they’re just coming back for the temporary strength boost. Keep ’em hooked.","50 golden coins is a reasonable price. It’s double the price of my iced tea, and nearly has double the effect.\"","He paused, then added another tier for the lower ranks—apprentices, novices, those still clawing their way toward adept.","\"One hundred gold for them. Still expensive, but they’ll pay it. It’s worth ten times more in attribute growth.\"","A satisfied smirk tugged at his lips. It was solid. Balanced.","Then the grin faded.","His mind conjured a scene.","Some clever novice strolling in, buys a bar for 50 gold... and flips it to an adept for 500. Or worse, some noble hiring a squad of rankless nobodies to bulk-buy on their behalf.","He sighed and rubbed his temples. \"No. Not happening.\"","After a few minutes of extra thinking, he came up with an extra security step.","\"First purchase must be eaten in-store . No exceptions. If they don’t eat it here, they don’t get it.\"","But an issue remained. Those who needed the temporary strength increase couldn’t eat the bar in the store; otherwise, they would be wasting its effect.","He decided to keep the product on hold for the time being","He’d plug the bigger holes later.","Maybe Lola would have something clever to add; she always did.","But for now, the pricing strategy was in place...for the first timers, and the shop was open.","[Current Assets: $315,240.21]","Staring at his asset value, Noah realised he could afford the second item in the shop slot. The Energy Drink sat there temptingly, offering identical effects to the protein bar except for agility enhancement instead of strength.","Same $300,000 price tag. Same permanent attribute boost.","After contemplating for several seconds, Noah decided against the purchase. There was no need to introduce another premium item when he hadn’t even solved the protein bar’s pricing complications.","\"There’s no rushing it. I can buy it another time. It’s not like anyone can spend 1,300 gold coins in my shop right now anyway.\"","Better to perfect one product line before expanding into others.","He stepped out of his shop, placing the closed sign on his door with satisfaction. The evening’s auction had been exhausting, but the results exceeded every projection.","Time to test out my Wind Manipulation skill.","The Crimson Mountains stood in the distance.","Let’s see what these new abilities can accomplish against real opponents.","What Noah failed to account for was the attention his auction performance had attracted.","Multiple interested parties had been watching his shop since the legendary artefact bidding concluded.","And stepping out without protection after displaying that kind of wealth...It was an amateur’s mistake.","\"Target has moved out of his shop. It’s time to move,\" One of the figures spoke to the others.","Three figures detached themselves from various shadowed positions around the plaza, their movements unseen. They’d been waiting for exactly this opportunity.","The first was a lean demon with scarred arms. His equipment suggested mercenary work; he was clearly an experienced man in the field.","The second figure moved with magical energy that made the air shimmer around his robes. A combat mage, probably Apprentice level, whose presence suggested this wasn’t simple robbery.","They followed at careful distances as Noah made his way toward the city gates.","Noah remained blissfully unaware of his tail as he approached the familiar crimson landscape. His thoughts focused on testing wind magic rather than potential threats lurking behind him.","The mountain paths stretched ahead, offering both privacy for training and, unfortunately, perfect conditions for ambush scenarios.","Once inside the Crimson Mountains proper, Noah spotted an unexpected figure lounging on the grass near a cluster of bouncing blue creatures.","Blop! Blop! Blop!","The slimes hopped around Lola with innocent enthusiasm while she reclined against a boulder, ruby eyes fixed on the evening sky with unusual tranquillity.","What’s a master-level mage doing in beginner hunting grounds?","Noah approached with genuine curiosity. \"What are you doing here?\"","Lola turned her head, offering him that familiar seductive smile. \"I come here every now and then to lie down and watch the sky over the crimson peaks. It’s a nice view.\"","It’s relaxation time for a succubus, I guess.","Before Noah could respond, her expression shifted. Her head snapped toward the mountain entrance with sudden alertness, smile transforming into something far more dangerous.","\"Oh? It seems like we have visitors.\" Her smirk carried lethal promise.","Visitors? That doesn’t sound good.","Lola’s body vanished like smoke dispersing in wind, leaving only the gentle blop sounds of confused slimes wondering where their observer had gone.","She disappeared. Completely gone.","Noah spun toward the entrance, his eyes finally detecting what Lola’s master-level senses had noticed immediately.","Three figures emerged from the mountain paths with weapons drawn and magic crackling around their forms.","The slimes continued their innocent hopping, completely oblivious to the violence about to unfold in their peaceful territory.","Blop! Blop! Blop!","One moment, the three attackers were advancing with confidence. Next, they found themselves teleported directly in front of Noah with Lola materialising beside them like death incarnate.","Lola didn’t have the ability to teleport, but her speed was so incredibly quick, it made it appear like she teleported.","How did she—what just happened?","The mercenary’s sword arm froze mid-swing as he processed his sudden relocation. The mage’s spell fizzled as concentration shattered.","\"Why are you all following him?\" Lola’s voice carried silky danger that made grown demons reconsider their life choices. \"Don’t tell me you’re planning on robbing our favourite shopkeeper. You wouldn’t dare to hurt him, right?\"","Our favourite shopkeeper..."]},{"number":112,"title":"Chapter 112: Demonic Oath","paragraphs":["The three scary-looking demons—who’d seemed formidable while lurking in shadows—now looked like children caught stealing cookies. Their intimidating presence evaporated under Lola’s ruby gaze.","They were just apprentice-level mages who got greedy. They didn’t have any business battling a master-level mage. That would be courting death like a certain young master once said.","\"We were just walking,\" the scarred mercenary stammered, his voice carrying all the conviction of wet paper. \"Coincidence that we ended up here.\"","\"Pure chance,\" the mage added, his hands trembling from Lola’s pressure.","Lola’s smile disappeared like sunlight behind storm clouds. The temperature around them dropped several degrees as her aura changed from playful to wrathful.","\"Do you take me for a fool?\" Her tone could have frozen fire.","\"I was planning to let you go after an apology, but not anymore.\"","Uh oh. They just...signed their death off.","Lola reached into her pocket space and withdrew the Eye of Apollo. The legendary artefact pulsed with truth-detecting energy that made reality itself seem more transparent.","The three demons’ faces went pale as they realised they had truly messed up.","They’d watched the auction. They knew exactly what that orb could accomplish.","\"Please! We’re sorry! We didn’t mean any harm!\" The mercenary dropped his weapon and fell to his knees.","\"Just wanted to see the famous shopkeeper!\" the mage added, joining his companion in desperation.","Now they’re grovelling. Too little, too late.","\"Enough with your games. You clearly tried to rob him. You know what you’ve done is punishable by death, right?\" Lola’s casual tone made the threat infinitely more terrifying.","\"Especially if I’m involved.\"","Death penalty for attempted robbery? Demon justice is harsh.","\"Therefore, I won’t let you go scot-free. Unless...\" Her smirk promised punishment that would make simple execution seem merciful.","The demon’s eyes widened in happiness.","’We have a chance to survive!’ They thought all together.","\"Unless you swear on a demonic oath.\"","The demons nodded frantically, clearly expecting promises to never attack Noah again. Standard criminal rehabilitation through oath binding.","\"We will never attack him again. We s-\"","Before the demons could finish, Lola interrupted them.","\"That’s not the oath I have in mind,\" Lola purred.","They think they’re getting off easy. Poor bastards.","Her slender hand settled on Noah’s shoulder.","\"I want you to swear an oath that you’ll be his protectors from now on. And don’t worry—I’m sure this man will not treat you badly.\"","Huh? What’s going on?","Noah blinked in confusion as the situation escalated beyond his comprehension. Three would-be robbers become his personal bodyguards through an oath contract law?","This escalated quickly.","The demons exchanged horrified glances as implications registered. Lifetime servitude versus immediate execution...they weren’t exactly generous terms.","\"We...\" the mercenary began.","A fireball materialised in Lola’s palm with menace.","\"We agree!\" all three shouted simultaneously.","Smart choice. That fireball looked dangerous. Noah thought.","\"Excellent.\" Lola’s smile returned with a satisfied nod.","\"Proceed with the oath.\"","The three demons raised their hands in resignation.","\"We swear by the only true God that we will serve as protectors of Noah Carter, defending him from harm and serving his interests, as long as he does not treat us harshly or ask us to die.\"","Demonic oaths. There’s actually such a thing as magically enforced contracts.","Golden light flared around the group as the oath took effect, binding the three former attackers to Noah’s service through mechanisms that he didn’t understand.","Everything’s happening so fast. I went from being robbed to acquiring three bodyguards in under five minutes.","Noah stared at his new protectors with bewildered fascination. The scarred mercenary looked resigned to his fate. The mage seemed to be calculating whether this was better than whatever alternatives Lola might have provided.","Wait. If demonic oaths can force people into service contracts...","The idea hit him like lightning. Magically binding agreements that customers couldn’t break.","It was the perfect solution for his protein bar supply concerns.","First-time buyers would eat inside the store. Second-time buyers would swear not to resell. The problem was solved through supernatural contract law, and the person behind it was once again...Lola.","\"Lola, are demonic oaths commonly used for business transactions?\" Noah said slowly.","Her grin widened with obvious delight. \"Oh, you’re going to love learning about commerce law.\"","This changes everything.","The slimes continued their innocent hopping, completely oblivious to the life-altering arrangements being finalised around them.","Blop! Blop! Blop!","\"Demonic oaths can be used for anything,\" Lola explained, her ruby eyes sparkling.","\"Business contracts, personal agreements, political alliances—any situation where absolute certainty is required.\"","Anything. The applications are endless.","Noah’s mind raced through possibilities.","\"The beauty lies in their absolute nature. Once sworn, the oath becomes part of the swearer’s very existence. Breaking it triggers consequences that transcend simple penalties,\" she continued.","Consequences...that sounds ominous.","\"What kind of consequences?\" Noah asked, though part of him suspected the answer wouldn’t be pleasant.","Lola’s expression grew serious, her playful demeanour once again evaporating.","\"The oath doesn’t simply punish, it destroys. First, the oathbreaker loses their hearing, cut off from the world’s sounds.\"","Complete deafness...and that’s just the beginning.","\"Then their sight fails, darkness becomes their permanent companion, isolating them further from reality.\"","The three new bodyguards shifted uncomfortably, clearly remembering their recent binding with fresh appreciation for its seriousness.","\"Next, their voice disappears entirely. No words, no cries for help, no communication with the outside world.\"","Sensory deprivation leading to complete isolation.","\"Finally, life itself abandons them. Death comes slowly, painfully, inevitably.\" Lola’s voice dropped to barely a whisper.","Progressive deterioration ending in guaranteed death. That’s absolutely terrifying.","Noah stared at his three protectors with a new understanding of their resigned acceptance. They hadn’t just agreed to service, they’d bound their very survival to keeping their word. Although at the two conditions of good treatment, and non-death resulting commands.","No wonder demonic oaths are taken seriously. Breaking them means slow, painful destruction.","\"The process typically takes weeks, plenty of time to contemplate the wisdom of oath-breaking while experiencing each stage of deterioration,\" Lola added.","Weeks of progressive sensory loss before death. That’s psychological torture on top of physical punishment.","\"So when I use oaths for business...\" Noah began.","\"Your customers will honour every agreement,\" Lola finished with satisfaction."]},{"number":113,"title":"Chapter 113: Training.","paragraphs":["The three demons straightened as formal introductions became necessary, their expressions carrying their resigned fate.","\"I’m Ed,\" announced the scarred mercenary.","\"Edd,\" added the combat mage, adjusting his robes nervously.","\"And I’m Eddie,\" concluded the third member.","Ed, Edd, and Eddie. You’ve got to be kidding me.","Noah stared at his new bodyguards with bewildered amazement. \"Are you all related?\"","\"Brothers,\" Ed confirmed as a matter of fact.","Three brothers named Ed, Edd, and Eddie, who turned to crime together. This world has a sense of humour.","\"Well, at least I’ll remember your names easily,\" Noah said, suppressing his laughter at the absurd coincidence.","The brothers positioned themselves at respectful distances as Noah prepared to resume his original purpose. Wind training required space and concentration, neither of which worked well with hovering bodyguards.","Time to test my wind manipulation’s combat applications. Let’s see what Level 4 can accomplish.","Lola settled back onto the grass, her ruby eyes tracking Noah’s movements with interest.","Her posture suggested that she was just casually observing.","So he has wind talent now... he must have used the orb.","Wind began stirring around Noah’s hands as he used his newly acquired wind manipulation skill.","Gentle currents responded to his will with enthusiasm.","Basic wind control. Not bad, for a newbie. Lola thought, watching the wind that Noah commanded.","But as Noah progressed through increasingly harder techniques, Lola’s interest transformed into genuine shock.","The way he used his skill defied his recent awakening. Noah was demonstrating comprehension that should have required a longer training period.","Wait.","T hat’s not beginner-level control, he’s approaching novice-level.","Noah created multiple small vortexes simultaneously, maintaining control while directing their movement through specific patterns of his choice.","The technique demanded skill and elemental sensitivity far beyond typical beginner capability.","For someone who awakened their element hours ago, this is...insane.","Her eyes widened as she realised something.","Noah’s attainment level resembled practitioners who’d spent weeks or months refining their elemental understanding through dedicated practice.","I don’t think he has a strong affinity to the wind element; he would have awakened it without an orb had that been true. His current attainments are Impossible. Unless he...","\"He couldn’t have used the orb for knowledge absorption at his level, right?\" she whispered, her voice carrying growing horror.","That would be the biggest waste imaginable.","Wind orbs were tier 5 artefacts precisely because they contained concentrated elemental essence that could accelerate development at any stage. But using them during initial awakening was universally considered a catastrophic resource mismanagement.","You save orbs for breakthrough moments. When advancement stalls at higher levels. Not for basic skill development.","Advanced practitioners hoarded wind orbs for decades, waiting for the perfect moment when natural progression hit insurmountable barriers. Using such treasures for foundation building was like burning money for campfire fuel.","No one in their right mind would waste Tier 5 artefacts on beginner training.","Noah continued his demonstration, progressing to techniques that incorporated movement and combat applications.","Wind-enhanced footwork that increased his speed, directed gusts that could deflect projectiles, even preliminary levitation attempts that defied gravity for brief moments.","This is months of development compressed into hours. He definitely used the orb.","After watching for several more minutes, Lola’s curiosity overcame her shock. She approached with the slow steps of someone confirming their worst suspicions.","\"Noah, how exactly did you develop your wind manipulation so quickly?\" she called, her voice calm despite her growing horror.","Please tell me you didn’t do what I think you did.","\"Used the wind orb for training, absorbed its essence to accelerate my comprehension. Pretty efficient method.\" Noah replied casually.","Noah had responded in a way that made his action sound like the most obvious thing in the world.","He actually did it. He used a tier 5 elemental orb like a textbook.","Lola’s face went pale as his confirmation hit her like a truck.","\"Noah, those orbs are incredibly rare. You should wait before using them—it’s such a waste to consume them at low attainments.\"","I can’t believe I’m explaining basic resource management to someone who treats Tier 5 orbs like study guides.","\"You’re supposed to save them for breakthrough moments when natural advancement becomes impossible, using them for foundation skills is insane,\" she continued, her voice rising with shock.","Like explaining fire safety to someone who uses phoenix feathers as kindling.","But Noah simply shrugged with the indifference of someone whose daily income included the replacement of such orbs.","\"It’s fine. I’ve got access to more when needed.\"","Access to more. He says that like wind orbs grow on trees.","Lola stared at him with the expression of someone watching world laws being casually violated. Her understanding of scarcity-based magical development was crumbling in real-time.","He’s treating priceless artefacts like consumable training materials. This defies everything I know about elemental cultivation.","The Ed brothers exchanged glances that suggested they were beginning to understand exactly whose service they’d been bound to. Someone who used tier 5 treasures for basic skill development operated on a completely different level of resource access.","’Our new boss is either completely insane or incredibly wealthy. Possibly both.’","After killing several beetles using his wind manipulation, Noah felt the satisfaction of successful monster hunting fade into boredom. The creatures that had once challenged his swordsmanship now fell to his blade work and elemental enhancement with ease.","These beetles are no longer enough for me.","His novice-level attributes, combined with Level 4 wind manipulation, had pushed him beyond the challenge that basic grass beetles could provide.","Each fight ended in the same way.","Their death without any hardship.","His wind-assisted strikes overwhelmed their simple defensive power.","Time to move up to more dangerous prey.","Noah’s gaze shifted toward the deeper sections of the Crimson Mountains, where more formidable creatures made their habitat.","The fireflies inhabited territories beyond the beginner-safe zones, representing a significant escalation in risk.","Fireflies are Tier 1 monsters. They are known to be in a completely different league from tier 0 monsters like the grass beatles."]},{"number":114,"title":"Chapter 114: Tier 1 Opponent.","paragraphs":["Tier 1 classification meant that such creatures were comparable to novice-rank mages in terms of combat capability.","They possessed magical abilities, some intelligence, and survival instincts that made them genuinely dangerous opponents rather than training dummies with claws.","They’re not weak by any standards. This would be a real test.","Noah turned toward Lola, who had been observing his beetle massacres with obvious amusement. Her expression suggested she viewed it as entertainment rather than serious combat training.","\"Do you think I can handle fireflies at my current strength level?\"","Time to get an expert opinion on my actual capabilities. I don’t want my new strength to get to my head.","\"Hmm...That’s a good question.\"","Lola’s ruby eyes studied him for a few seconds, evaluating his experience, wind manipulation skills and overall combat readiness.","She’s calculating my survival odds. That’s either reassuring or terrifying.","\"You can, but it will be difficult. You’ll most likely get injured during the fights,\" she replied after carefully considering his question.","After answering his question, Lola’s expression turned to her usual teasing one.","\"But don’t worry. I’m here to protect you... Darling.\" Lola winked.","The wink she delivered made Noah roll his eyes at her constant flirtation attempts.","Even discussing potential life-threatening combat, she finds ways to be seductive.","The Ed brothers positioned themselves with alertness. They knew that their job as protectors was going to be tested soon enough.","Noah felt excitement building despite the acknowledged risks. Fireflies represented a legitimate advancement opportunity. They were creatures that could push his developing abilities toward their current limits.","Real combat against worthy opponents. This is how skills actually improve.","Fireflies waited in their hunting zones, ready to test whether Noah’s rapid development translated into genuine combat effectiveness.","Time to find out if wind manipulation works against opponents who fight back with magical abilities.","The hunting grounds for fireflies lay deeper in the Crimson Mountains, where the terrain was slightly more rocky.","This is definitely more dangerous territory.","The Ed brothers had arranged themselves in a protective formation around Noah, their weapons drawn.","Bound by an oath, they took their new responsibilities seriously.","\"Fireflies nest in the thermal vents; they use the natural heat sources to amplify their magical affinity,\" Ed explained.","So my enemy has an environmental advantage. That makes it more difficult.","Lola moved beside Noah, her expression relaxed and confident.","As a master-level mage, her power far exceeded anything they might encounter. For her, this expedition was more of a stroll rather than genuine danger.","She’s enjoying this, probably curious to see how I handle the fireflies.","The first sign of firefly presence came through sound rather than sight.","The firefly had a distinctive buzzing that made it extremely annoying.","Bzzt! Bzzt!","The sound made Noah’s teeth ache with its piercing frequency.","That noise is incredibly annoying. How do these things not drive themselves insane?","\"There,\" Edd pointed toward a cluster of thermal vents where multiple fireflies moved with agitated energy.","\"It’s probably attracted by our approach.\"","The fireflies emerged from their nesting area with hostile intent immediately apparent. Each creature was roughly the size of a large puppy, but their proportions were abnormal.","They had oversized wings that generated the maddening buzzing sound, bodies that glowed with internal fire, and prominent pincers that clicked.","They’re bigger than I expected. And those pincers look sharp.","Bzzt! Bzzt! Bzzt!","Three fireflies rose into the air with aggression, their wings creating the maddening sound.","Here we go. This is the first real test of wind manipulation in real, life-threatening combat.","Noah drew the Zealous Quickblade and immediately began channelling wind magic around the blade’s edge.","The elemental enhancement created visible air currents that increased cutting power and provided ranged attack options.","Unfortunately, the enhancement wasn’t significant. As a tier 2 weapon, the Zealous Quickblade didn’t have the elemental channelling that stronger weapons offered. Nonetheless, it still did the job.","Wind-enhanced swordsmanship. Let’s see how this works.","The first fire fly dove toward him with alarming speed, its pincers spread wide for a crushing attack. Noah attempted to dodge while launching a wind blade toward the creature.","That attack was too slow!","The firefly’s natural agility exceeded his expectations.","It twisted mid-flight, avoiding his elemental attack while raking pincers across his shoulder. The impact sent him stumbling backwards, blood seeping through torn fabric.","They’re fast. Much faster than beetles.","Bzzt! Bzzt!","The second fire fly attacked from his blind spot, breathing a stream of concentrated flame.","Before it could reach him, Lola raised her hand and did a casual swooshing gesture.","The stream of fire was immediately extinguished. As for the second firefly, it was squashed to death by Lola’s casual gesture.","Seeing Noah’s gaze land on her in astonishment, she smiled.","\"Continue, don’t worry about any interruption. For now, just focus on one. You can worry about multiple targets later,\" She added.","Noah nodded, a grateful look on his face.","Okay, that second firefly had given me crucial information. They can use fire breath.","Eddie stepped forward, about to give Noah some clues on how to tackle the firefly.","\"You need to—\"","\"Let him learn,\" Lola interrupted smoothly, her ruby eyes fixed on Noah.","The first firefly circled Noah, clearly looking for an opening, its compound eyes tracking his movements while maintaining distance in the air.","Bzzt! Bzzt!","The firefly launched a concentrated flame stream that forced Noah into desperate evasion. The magical fire scorched the stone where he’d been standing, leaving smouldering patches that radiated heat.","Okay, I can sort of understand its attack pattern. It uses the fire stream as a ranged attack, plus those pincers for close combat or maybe to defend itself up close.","Noah attempted a wind blade counter-attack, but the creature’s aerial mobility made targeting difficult. It twisted through the air with the flexibility and agility that only flies have in the air.","Too slow, again. My attacks can’t keep up with its speed.","The firefly dove suddenly, pincers spread wide for a crushing strike. Noah raised his sword defensively, but the impact drove him backwards with bone-jarring force."]},{"number":115,"title":"Chapter 115: Tier 1 Firefly","paragraphs":["Those pincers hit like hammers. I can’t take many hits like that.","Bzzt!","Another flame breath forced him to roll sideways, his clothes smoking from the near miss. The creature was maintaining pressure, not giving him time to recover or plan.","I’m losing. It’s too fast, too aggressive.","Blood seeped from the pincer wound on his shoulder, each movement sending fresh pain through his muscles. His wind manipulation felt clumsy against such a mobile opponent.","This isn’t working. I need a different approach.","During his intense training sessions, both with Master Tanaka and absorbing the wind orb’s knowledge, he’d encountered references to advanced techniques.","Aura manipulation, the practice of channelling mana directly into one’s body for enhancement.","Mana to strengthen my body. Internal enhancement instead of external projection. I should focus on my strengths, and that was my swordsmanship skill.","As the highest level skill he had, swordsmanship was Noah’s strongest card to amplify.","Noah began redirecting his magical energy inward, feeling mana flow through his muscles and bones like liquid fire. The sensation was refreshing but intoxicating, strength-building beyond his attributes.","The firefly sensed the change and launched another aggressive assault. But when its pincers connected with Noah’s sword, they met resistance that wasn’t there before. possible.","It barely pushed me. The mana is strengthening me.","[You have learned the skill Aura Level 5]","New skill! Finally!","The notification confirmed what Noah felt throughout his body. Aura wasn’t just protection—it was amplification of every physical capability.","Noah’s counter-strike carried power that sent the firefly tumbling through the air. His mana-enhanced strength had multiplied the impact beyond normal novice limits.","Now I can actually fight back effectively.","Bzzt! Bzzt!","The creature recovered with angry buzzing, anger and wariness burning in its large eyes. It had felt the new shift in Noah’s strength.","Noah channelled aura through his sword arm while maintaining wind manipulation around the blade. The combination created cutting effects that carved through the air with visible force.","Whoosh!","Aura plus wind magic plus swordsmanship. That’s a terrifying enhancement.","The firefly attempted another flame breath, but Noah’s reflexes allowed him to dodge while closing the distance.","His aura-powered leap carried him within striking range.","This is it! The perfect chance.","His blade, now enhanced by both aura and wind magic, travelled the air in a graceful arc that sliced clean through the firefly’s left wing.","Swish! Thud!","The firefly’s wings dropped to the floor, unresponsive.","The effects of the lost wing were immediate. The firefly’s flight became erratic as asymmetrical lift sent it spiralling to the floor.","Grounded. Now it’s vulnerable.","Bzzt—crash!","The firefly hit a stone with a powerful impact, and its remaining wing crumpled from the fall. But despite being wounded, it snapped at Noah with desperate fury.","It’s still dangerous. I need to finish this quickly.","Noah’s final strike combined every enhancement he could muster. Aura flowed through his muscles while wind magic concentrated around his blade. The Zealous Quickblade carved through chitin and magical fire with devastating power.","Victory...is mine.","Silence settled over the thermal vents as the last buzzing faded. The firefly’s internal glow dimmed to darkness as life departed in a shower of sparks.","First Tier 1 monster defeated solo. That felt incredible.","[You have killed a tier 1 monster, Firefly]","Lola’s applause echoed in the air with a genuine smile of appreciation on her face. \"You are good at adapting to your environment. You discovered aura manipulation mid-combat. Good job.\"","\"Thanks, I was able to gain control over my aura, it boosted my strength to novice-level immediately, just like you told me last time,\" Noah confirmed, feeling the new skill’s warm presence throughout his body.","\"It’s really a game changer for close combat.\"","Body enhancement, plus wind magic, plus sword skills. I’m becoming a real combatant.","The Ed brothers lowered their weapons with obvious relief. Their expressions carried respect for competence demonstrated under pressure.","Lola approached him, her ruby eyes sparkling with approval. \"Ready for more challenging opponents? Single fireflies are merely introductory Tier 1 encounters. It’s time to move beyond one opponent.\"","Noah’s eyes widened.","She wants me to fight multiple fireflies? I just barely managed to defeat one.","His initial instinct was pure rejection. Fighting a single firefly had pushed him to his limits, forcing him to discover aura manipulation mid-combat just to survive.","Multiple opponents seemed like suicide.","This is insane. I’m not ready for group combat.","But as the shock faded, considerations emerged.","Lola’s protection didn’t come often—she was a master-level mage whose attention was valuable beyond measure. With her guidance, he could perhaps push his development faster than safe progression allowed.","When will I get another chance to train with a master watching my back?","The Ed brothers provided security, but their response time couldn’t match someone of Lola’s calibre. If things went catastrophically wrong, she could intervene faster than anyone else.","Risk versus opportunity. High stakes, but potentially massive advancement.","\"Sure. But can you give me some tips?\" Noah decided, surprising himself with the acceptance.","\"Of course. Let’s go.\" Lola’s smile widened with satisfaction.","Here we go. Multiple firefly combat with a succubus instructor.","They moved deeper into the thermal vent territory. The buzzing sounds grew louder as they approached more active nesting areas.","More aggressive hunting grounds.","\"There, perfect training opportunity.\" Lola pointed toward a cluster of three fireflies hovering near a particularly large thermal vent.","Three fireflies. This is going to be brutal.","Bzzt! Bzzt! Bzzt!","The creatures moved together, their combined buzzing creating an almost overwhelming ear assault. Each was roughly the same size as Noah’s previous opponent, puppy-sized bodies with oversized wings and those menacing pincers.","Same individual threat level, but group attacks will be completely different.","\"Watch carefully, group combat requires different priorities than single encounters,\" Lola whispered, her voice carrying instructions on how he should approach his upcoming fight.","Without warning, she gestured subtly toward the leftmost firefly. A nearly invisible force struck the creature, crushing it instantly without alerting its companions.","She killed one so quickly, I barely saw it happen.","\"Two opponents instead of three, this should be doable,\" she explained quietly."]},{"number":116,"title":"Chapter 116: Fighting Two Fireflies","paragraphs":["\"Go,\" she commanded with a gentle tone.","Time to see if I can handle multiple tier 1 opponents.","Noah approached the remaining fireflies with an aura already flowing through his physique. The mana enhancement felt more natural now, settling into his muscles like familiar clothing.","The first firefly spotted him immediately, its eyes reflecting its hostile intent. But instead of attacking individually, it buzzed toward its companion with clear communication.","They’re communicating. This just got more difficult.","Attacking a group of monsters was hard enough. But when the monsters could communicate, that made it even harder.","Bzzt! Bzzt!","Both creatures rose simultaneously, positioning themselves to attack from different angles. Their movement suggested intelligence and communication between them.","\"Focus on your positioning! Never let them surround you!\" Lola called from her observation point. \"Once they surround you, you will become a sitting duck waiting to be slaughtered.\"","Okay, so the first rule of fighting multiple opponents is positioning.","Noah moved toward the rocky cover that would limit their approach angles. Wind manipulation swirled around his blade while aura continued flowing through his combat-ready physique.","If they have their own environmental advantages, then I will make my own environmental advantage too. Use terrain to limit their options.","The fireflies adapted immediately, one diving high while the other approached low. Their assault was designed to overwhelm single-target defences.","Here they come.","\"Prioritise! Choose your target and commit!\" Lola’s instruction cut through the buzzing noise.","\"Don’t try to fight both simultaneously. Focus fire.\"","Noah targeted the lower firefly with concentrated wind magic, launching compressed air balls while closing the distance. His aura-enhanced speed carried him forward faster than the creature expected.","I will conduct an aggressive approach. Force them to react to my timing.","The targeted firefly attempted defensive manoeuvres, but Noah was able to track its movements. His blade, enhanced by both aura and wind magic, carved deep gashes across its natural armour.","First blood. But the second one—","Bzzt!","The second firefly’s flame breath forced Noah into a desperate evasion, his jacket smoking from the near miss. But Lola’s voice provided guidance even as he rolled for cover.","\"Use the wounded one as a shield! Make them interfere with each other!\"","That’s smart. How did I not think of that?","Noah manoeuvred so the wounded firefly was between him and its companion. When the second creature attempted another flame attack, it had to adjust its aim to avoid friendly fire.","Perfect. Their team play is limiting their options.","The wounded firefly attempted a desperate pincer strike, but Noah’s aura-enhanced reflexes allowed perfect timing. His counter-attack removed one wing completely, grounding the creature permanently.","One down, one to go.","Bzzt! Bzzt!","The remaining firefly increased aggression, diving repeatedly while maintaining flame breath pressure. But fighting solo removed its tactical advantages.","Back to single combat. I can handle this.","\"You are not executing to finish, your combinations should end their lives! Don’t just wound, eliminate the threats completely!\" Lola instructed.","Noah’s final assault combined everything he’d learned. Aura flowed through enhanced muscles while wind magic concentrated around his blade. The Zealous Quickblade carved through the firefly’s defences with devastating power.","Noah had achieved victory.","Two fireflies were defeated through Lola’s guidance.","[You killed a tier 1 beast, firefly]","[You killed a tier 1 beast, firefly]","Silence settled over the thermal vents as the last buzzing faded. Two more firefly corpses joined the battlefield’s growing collection.","Multiple opponent combat is significantly different from solo encounters.","Clap! Clap! Clap!","Noah turned to find Lola applauding him with genuine approval on her face.","\"Excellent adaptation. You learned positioning, targeting priority, and tactical use of terrain.\"","\"Thank you for your help,\" Noah said, taking a few deep breaths. He was breathless from the fight.","Her guidance made the difference.","\"Group combat is about controlling chaos. Individual skill matters less than battlefield awareness,\" she continued, approaching him.","Noah felt the difference in his understanding. Multiple opponents required completely different mental frameworks than single target elimination.","This kind of instruction is invaluable.","...","After the successful two-firefly encounter, Noah felt satisfied.","Although he was exhausted, he was still happy with the results. His aura manipulation had stabilised during the fight, becoming more intuitive.","That’s enough training for tonight. Time to celebrate progress with some magical food.","\"I think that’s sufficient for today. Want to join me for some bread and tea back at the shop?\" Noah announced, wiping sweat from his forehead.","Lola’s ruby eyes sparkled with obvious interest. \"I thought you’d never ask.\"","The Ed brothers exchanged uncertain glances as the group prepared to depart. Their expressions showed their confusion, unsure of what they were meant to do next.","They don’t know if they’re supposed to follow us or not.","Lola noticed their hesitation immediately, turning toward them.","\"What are you doing standing there like statues? You’re his guards. You protect him from when he opens the shop until he’s finished for the day.\" Her tone carried enough pressure to make them straighten.","She’s establishing their duties. Good. I wasn’t sure how this arrangement worked.","\"If he tells me you’re not doing your job properly...\" Lola slowly muttered, glaring at them.","The death glare she delivered made all three brothers visibly shiver. Despite being bound by a magical oath that would destroy them once broken, the additional threat made it worse.","\"We will! We will!\" they chorused immediately.","The message was received, either protect him at all times, or suffer her wrath. And the Ed brothers didn’t want to suffer a master-level succubus’s wrath.","They could only blame themselves as they walked back to the shop alongside Noah and Lola.","The walk back to Sin City passed in comfortable silence, Noah’s thoughts processing the evening’s developments while Lola moved beside him with a satisfied smile.","The Ed brothers maintained their formation around them, clearly taking their duties seriously after Lola’s clarification.","From robbers to professional security. Some career transitions happen too quickly.","Inside his shop, Noah settled into his ergonomic chair with relief that transcended mere physical comfort.","He retrieved food for himself and Lola, then considered his new employees with genuine appreciation. Despite their criminal origins, they’d be his bodyguards from now on, and he wanted to treat them well."]},{"number":117,"title":"Chapter 117: Another Protein Bar.","paragraphs":["\"Here, enjoy these refreshments with us.\" Noah offered bread and tea to the Ed brothers.","Treat employees well, and they perform better. It was a simple rule in life.","Ed accepted the offerings with surprised gratitude. \"Thank you. We weren’t expecting...\"","\"Compensation includes meals when appropriate, don’t worry, I won’t make you work like slaves,\" Noah replied, a smile on his face.","Noah was setting an unprecedented behaviour, as someone who has power over their life and death, he was extremely generous and merciful.","The Ed brothers exchanged glances, clearly regretting the fact that they wanted to rob such a good person.","As they settled into an impromptu meal, Lola’s attention turned toward the display shelves as she spotted something that shouldn’t be there.","Her expression changed from casual contentment to something approaching shock.","She spotted something interesting.","\"Y-You have another one already?\" Her voice carried disbelief mixed with excitement.","Noah followed her gaze to the protein bar display, where a fresh specimen sat in pristine packaging. The auto-maker had completed its two-hour production cycle while they’d been training.","Right on schedule. Automated production never disappoints.","\"I told you before, I’ve got some more coming, so I will naturally have another one,\" Noah replied with satisfaction at her amazement.","Lola turned toward him with desperate eagerness. \"I want it. How much do you want for this one?\"","She’s practically vibrating with anticipation. Permanent attribute enhancement does that to people.","Noah shook his head with gentle firmness. \"This one isn’t for sale. But come back tomorrow—I’ll give you one then.\"","Noah decided to keep the one on the shelf for his father. Increasing his father’s strength would improve his body condition, even if it wasn’t necessarily vitality, it would still be a good boost.","\"Really?\" Her voice climbed several octaves with excitement.","\"Yes, really. But you’ll have to pay me five hundred golden coins. I won’t ask much from you, you are my first customer after all,\"","Five hundred instead of the thousand-plus auction price. Friends discount.","\"It’s done! Absolutely done!\" Lola nodded with enthusiasm that made her hair bounce.","Before Noah could respond, Lola lunged forward from her chair with supernatural speed.","What is she—","Noah’s eyes widened as the succubus launched herself at him. Her movements were so fast that his reflexes couldn’t react in time.","Suddenly, she was in his embrace, arms wrapped around him in a hug that felt both grateful and possessive.","\"Thank you,\" Lola whispered directly into his ear, her breath warm against his skin.","This is different. This isn’t her usual teasing.","Heat flooded Noah’s cheeks as genuine emotion replaced her typical seduction. He’d built immunity against her casual flirtation, but this level of sincere gratitude hit completely different emotional targets.","She means it. She’s actually grateful.","The Ed brothers politely averted their gazes while continuing to eat their magical bread, clearly recognising a moment that transcended simple business relationships.","...","Inside his house, Noah carefully retrieved a protein bar alongside two loaves of healing bread from his storage ring, placing them into a simple plastic bag.","These are for Dad.","The sky was darkening as the sun began setting. He’d spent most of his time in the demon kingdom, but visiting hours still allowed enough time for meaningful conversation.","The GT-R’s engine purred to life as Noah settled into the driver’s seat. The hospital was only twenty minutes away, but anticipation made every moment stretch longer.","Dad’s going to feel better than he has in months.","...","The familiar corridors of the medical facility welcomed him. Evening shift nurses moved around, helping to manage the chaos that defined hospital care.","Room 412. Time to deliver some miracles disguised as bakery goods.","Noah knocked gently before entering, finding his father propped against pillows with a book resting forgotten on his lap. Alan’s face brightened with joy at the sight of his son.","\"Noah! Two visits and the week just started? I’m really spoiled.\"","\"Brought you more of those speciality items, the kind that help with recovery,\" Noah replied, settling into the visitor’s chair while placing the plastic bag on the bedside table.","Plus, something that’ll permanently improve his strength. Can’t wait to see his reaction.","Alan’s eyes lit up with recognition as Noah began unpacking the contents. The healing bread’s warmth, but also something new—a wrapped bar.","\"Where did you get this from? I’ve never seen such a protein bar before,\" his father observed, studying the protein bar’s unusual packaging.","\"It’s a special one, one of my close business friends gave it to me, and it’s made from many beneficial herbs. It’s supposed to provide significant strength enhancement. Permanent improvement to overall physical condition. Although I’m not sure if they are exaggerating or not,\" Noah explained carefully.","Alan accepted the explanation with the trust that came from seeing previous results. The last healing bread had provided noticeable improvement that no traditional medicine had matched.","\"You’ve been taking good care of yourself,\" his father said, noting Noah’s improved posture and obvious confidence.","\"You look stronger. More... capable.\"","\"Business has been good for my health; having money reduces stress, improves everything else,\" Noah replied.","They shared the healing bread together, father and son connected through simple food that carried extraordinary properties. Alan’s colour improved with each bite, vitality returning to features that had been worn down by illness.","\"This feels like a celebration,\" Alan said, his voice carrying strength that had been missing for months.","\"Thanks for the amazing stuff son, I will eat this protein bar another time,\" He said, placing the protein bar back in the plastic bag.","Noah’s face dropped. he had wanted his dad to eat the protein bar first, but his dad clearly enjoyed the loaf.","\"Bu-\"","Before he could finish, the nurse came in and interrupted him.","\"Visiting time is over, please start heading out of the ward,\" The nurse said, glancing at him before continuing her job.","Noah sighed and nodded.","\"Dad, make sure you eat this. You can’t give this thing to anyone else, understood? This is more important than the loaf of bread, it’s many times more important. Okay?\"","\"Okay, son. Don’t worry, I won’t give it to anyone else.\""]},{"number":118,"title":"Chapter 118: Strength boost","paragraphs":["The next day, Alan woke up from his sleep feeling remarkably refreshed. The healing bread from yesterday had worked its magic throughout the night, leaving him with energy levels he hadn’t experienced in months.","Noah wasn’t exaggerating about these specialty foods.","He sat up in bed with ease that surprised him, his usual morning stiffness notably absent. The protein bar sat on his bedside shelf where he’d carefully placed it the evening before.","He said this was more important than the bread. Let’s see what makes it so special.","Alan unwrapped the protein bar with careful attention, noting its unusual packaging. The hospital’s morning coffee sat cooling beside him.","Here goes nothing.","The first bite sent shockwaves through his system that had nothing to do with caffeine. Power flooded through his muscles like liquid lightning, making every fiber feel supercharged with potential energy.","What in the world—","Alan gripped the bed rail with his free hand, watching in amazement as his knuckles whitened from pressure that should have been impossible. The metal frame groaned under the force his weakened body shouldn’t have been able to generate.","I feel like I could lift a car.","The transformation was immediate and overwhelming. Muscles that had been wasted by months of illness suddenly felt dense with strength that defied medical explanation. His grip strength had multiplied beyond anything he’d experienced even in his athletic youth.","This isn’t normal nutrition. This is something else entirely.","He flexed his arm experimentally. The functional strength he was experiencing made his entire body feel like an instrument designed for power.","Noah...just what in the world did you give me?","The protein bar’s effects continued building with each bite. Alan felt energy coursing through his frame that transcended mere physical enhancement—this was fundamental improvement to his body’s capabilities.","I could probably arm-wrestle men half my age and win.","When he attempted to stand, the movement carried none of his usual careful positioning to avoid strain. His legs supported his weight with confidence that made walking feel effortless.","This is incredible. I feel twenty years younger.","A passing nurse noticed his improved posture immediately. \"Mr. Carter? You look... different this morning. Stronger.\"","\"Feeling much better,\" Alan replied.","The protein bar’s wrapper lay empty beside his coffee cup, but the effects continued building throughout his enhanced musculature. Alan felt like he could take on the world.","Half an hour passed and the temporary increase had left, Alan still felt that he was much stronger than before, but he had gotten weaker since the time he ate the protein bar.","...","[Daily income stream has been rewarded!]","[Wind Orb(Tier 5), Demonica Moonburgh]","Inside his store, Noah surveyed the multiple protein bars on his shelf alongside the full stock of bread and tea. His auto-makers had worked through the night, ensuring complete inventory despite yesterday’s sales.","Perfect timing. Everything’s restocked for today’s business.","But before opening for customers, Noah approached the protein bar display with anticipation that had been building since he’d first discovered the product’s effects.","Time to claim that permanent enhancement for myself.","He grabbed one of the bars with care. Despite its insane effects, Noah felt no mana or anything to indicate that.","My strength will fly through the roof.","Unlike others who would only consume such a treasure near the end of their potential, Noah had no such thoughts. The shop was only level 2, and he would continuously get new items. So he didn’t even bother worrying about bottlenecks like others did.","Noah peeled the wrapper slowly, savouring the moment before taking his first bite. The taste was incredible—rich, complex flavours that made him smile in contentment.","The effects began immediately. Power flooded through his muscles like molten steel, making every fibre feel supercharged.","Oh...this is intense.","His enhanced strength multiplied dramatically.","Noah clenched his fist, and the sound it made almost terrified him. He felt like the wind was being compressed by him.","The transformation continued building with each swallow.","This changes everything about combat effectiveness.","When the last bite finished, Noah immediately accessed his status screen to confirm the reality of his improvement.","—","Host: Noah Carter","Age: 28","Shop Level: 2","Daily Revenue: $135,000","Current Assets: $315,240.21","Shop Points: 1010","Attributes: Strength: 30 (+15), Vitality: 4, Intelligence: 20, Agility: 20","Skills: Swordsmanship(Level 6), Mana Control (Level 5), Aura (Level 1), Wind Manipulation (Level 4), Surviving on Ramen (Level 3), Cooking (Level 2), Programming (Level 2), Gaming (Level 2), Finance (Level 1)","—","My strength is currently at 30. I’ve gained ten points from the protein bar, and the 15 in brackets should be from the temporary 50% enhancement.","After eating the protein bar, Noah decided to start his day as a shopkeeper.","Noah opened his shop door, flipping the sign to indicate business hours had begun.","The succubus didn’t give him a chance to settle in—as if she’d been waiting for the exact second he opened to barge through the entrance.","\"Where is it?\" Lola looked like a hungry wolf as her ruby eyes immediately landed on the shelf. \"T-There are so many! Where are you getting so many from?\"","She spotted all eleven protein bars.","Noah smiled mysteriously. \"Secret.\"","\"Five hundred golden coins,\" she said, immediately producing payment without negotiation.","Unlike Noah had expected, she didn’t unwrap the bar immediately. Instead, she carefully stored it in her personal space.","She’s saving it for when the 50% temporary boost will matter most. She is definitely planning something...","Lola sat down and spoke with him for a while before purchasing two pieces of bread and some iced tea. After that, she left.","Noah stared at her departing figure. There was a day left before his stay at the demonic kingdom came to an end. And with that, he would no longer see the succubus that always tested him, at least until he came back the next time.","Of course, Noah planned to let her and everyone in the kingdom know about his departure. But he planned to leave it until the day of the departure.","His next destination was the first one he had been to, the human kingdom. He had decided to sort out the issue between the two kingdoms, because it was sad to see so many people die because of the extremists."]},{"number":119,"title":"Chapter 119: Mysterious Egg","paragraphs":["Time passed in steady shop activity.","Customer after customer entered his shop, each displaying identical reactions when they spotted the legendary protein bars displayed in abundance.","Noah had established pricing tiers based on magical rank rather than uniform costs. The system he created encouraged broader access while acknowledging different economic capabilities.","Novices paid one hundred golden coins.","Apprentices faced three hundred coin prices.","Adept-level practitioners and above were charged six hundred coins.","Of course, they were all required to have in-store consumption to prevent resale across all ranks.","Rank-based pricing plus consumption requirements. Covers security concerns while maximising accessibility.","Additional restrictions limited novice and apprentice purchases to one per day each, preserving inventory for higher-paying adept customers.","This meant that once a novice dropped by and bought it, another novice would have to wait for the next day before they could buy it. Of course, this rule would be implemented by him when he wanted. If the end of his shift arrived and he still had stock left, he would sell it to a novice despite the previous rule.","Rules were sometimes meant to be broken.","With twelve bars of daily production, minus his personal consumption and Lola’s purchase, ten units remained currently for sale.","The morning continued with steady sales that validated his pricing strategy.","The familiar sound of theatrical cape-billowing announced Viscount Vex’s arrival before he became visible. His entrance carried the same dramatic energy that made him Noah’s most entertaining regular customer.","Precious perched behind his ear with obvious excitement, her needle-sharp teeth clicking in anticipation of their usual shopping routine.","Right on schedule.","But his usual confidence evaporated the moment his eyes landed on the protein bar display. Five identical units sat in elegant presentation, representing the legendary enhancement that had dominated yesterday’s auction.","\"Impossible. I thought it was unique. A singular treasure that I will never see again,\" he breathed, his voice carrying genuine shock.","Vex approached the display with reverent steps, his expression cycling through disbelief, wonder, and growing excitement. Precious leaned forward with obvious interest, apparently sharing her master’s amazement.","\"We thought it was finished,\" he murmured to his carnivorous companion. \"That we’d missed our only opportunity.\"","They assumed the auction represented singular availability. Natural conclusion given the bidding intensity.","\"Are these... for sale?\" Vex asked with hope plastered all over his face.","Noah nodded. \"Six hundred golden coins or equivalent trade value.\"","Vex’s face fell as financial reality intruded on his enthusiasm. His shoulders sagged with the weight of someone whose resources couldn’t match their desires.","\"I don’t have six hundred coins with me personally right now,\" he admitted with obvious disappointment. \"And I fear returning home might mean missing this opportunity entirely.\"","Noah watched as Vex calculated his options.","He really wants permanent strength improvement. Not just social bragging rights.","Most people would buy such things to brag about them. After all, having an expensive item that anyone could buy gave them status and airs that others couldn’t have.","\"Let me check my storage ring,\" Vex said with desperate hope. \"Perhaps I have something of equivalent value.\"","Trade goods instead of currency. Always interesting to see what people carry.","Vex began examining his dimensional storage, muttering assessments as various items appeared and disappeared. Precious offered commentary through tooth-clicking that seemed genuinely helpful to Vex’s decisions.","His plant provides advice on most things. Their partnership is remarkably thorough.","\"Oh, this one! I almost forgot about it!\"","His excitement peaked as he withdrew something that made both man and plant vibrate with anticipation. The object that emerged was clearly valuable beyond mere monetary consideration.","Mystery item. This should be interesting.","What Vex produced was an egg roughly the size of a basketball, its surface covered in golden scales. The shell seemed to glow with internal energy that suggested its extraordinary contents.","That’s not a normal chicken egg.","\"This is an egg I found during an exploration expedition with Precious, while I don’t know its exact value, several experts I consulted estimated at least five hundred golden coins,\" Vex explained with obvious pride.","Five hundred minimum. Close to the required price range.","Precious clicked her teeth with what sounded like confirmatory agreement, apparently having participated in the original discovery.","\"What do you think?\" Vex asked with hopeful anticipation.","Noah did not give Vex an immediate response.","Noah focused his inspection ability on the mysterious egg.","[Lion Egg]","[Description: An egg containing a juvenile Golden Mane Lion, a magical creature renowned for incredible strength, fierce loyalty, and protective instincts. When hatched, the creature will bond permanently with the first being it encounters. Golden Mane Lions mature into formidable companions capable of matching adept-level magical practitioners in combat effectiveness.]","[Estimated Price: 700 Golden Coins]","Seven hundred coins. That’s good. But the egg...I will have a beast companion, a Lion at that, too. Noah thought, a huge smile breaking out on his face.","The description revealed something extraordinary—not just valuable trade goods, but a potential permanent companion with combat capabilities.","A magical lion that bonds with its first contact. That must be incredibly rare. It can also reach an adept level.","\"Deal,\" Noah said without hesitation.","Vex’s face transformed with relief and gratitude that transcended simple commercial satisfaction. His hands trembled slightly as he placed the precious egg on Noah’s counter.","\"Thank you,\" he said with genuine emotion. \"This means more than you realize.\"","Permanent enhancement versus future companion. Different types of power improvement.","Precious extended tiny vine-tendrils toward the protein bar with obvious approval, apparently recognising the wisdom of trading future potential for immediate advancement.","Even his plant agrees with the exchange.","The transaction completed smoothly, leaving Vex with his coveted enhancement and Noah with a mysterious egg that promised interesting developments ahead.","As Vex departed with his protein bar, carefully wrapped for strategic consumption, Noah contemplated the golden egg now resting on his table.","\"System, how do I make it hatch?\"","[Host, the lion egg you have is in its final phases of development. You can accelerate the process by feeding it iced tea. The magical enhancement will absorb into the developing creature, strengthening its natural abilities and creating a more powerful bond with its first contact.]"]},{"number":120,"title":"Chapter 120: Lion Companion","paragraphs":["Iced tea works on unborn magical creatures too. The applications keep expanding.","[The Golden Mane Lion will emerge within hours of receiving mana enhancement. Be prepared for immediate bonding - the creature will imprint on the first being it sees upon hatching. This bond becomes permanent and unbreakable.]","Permanent bonding. That’s both reassuring and terrifying.","[Additionally, the lion’s loyalty will be absolute. It will defend you with its life and grow stronger alongside your own development. Adult Golden Mane Lions can match adept-level practitioners in combat effectiveness.]","Adept-level combat companion. That’s like having a permanent bodyguard who actually wants to protect me.","Noah retrieved a bottle of iced tea from his shelf, noting how the egg seemed to pulse with anticipation as the magical liquid approached.","Even unhatched, it can sense mana enhancement.","He poured the peach-colored tea over the golden shell, watching as the liquid was absorbed instantly. The egg’s internal glow intensified dramatically, and hairline cracks began spreading across its surface.","It’s working. The hatching process is accelerating.","The shell continued fracturing as whatever was inside pushed against its confines with growing strength. Noah positioned himself directly in front of the egg, ensuring he would be the first thing the creature saw.","First contact determines permanent loyalty. Can’t mess this up.","Golden light began seeping through the expanding cracks, and the sound of something moving within grew steadily louder.","Here we go.","Crack!","The first fracture split the shell completely, releasing a burst of magical energy that made the air shimmer with golden particles.","Crack! Crack!","More pieces fell away as tiny paws pushed against the confines of what had been home for months. Noah positioned himself carefully, ready to ensure proper first contact bonding.","Crack!","The final section of shell crumbled away, revealing the creature within. But instead of facing Noah as expected, the newly hatched lion turned toward his display shelves with obvious curiosity.","No! Wrong direction!","Noah immediately sprinted around his counter, nearly tripping over his own feet in desperation to position himself correctly. The bonding moment was crucial—permanent loyalty depended on proper first visual contact.","Please don’t bond with my iced tea!","He slid into position just as tiny blue eyes opened for the first time, blinking in the shop’s gentle lighting. What looked back at him was the most adorable creature Noah had ever encountered.","Oh my god. It’s incredibly cute.","The lion was roughly the size of a house cat, covered in fluffy golden fur that seemed to glow with inner light. Its mane was barely visible—tiny tufts of slightly darker gold that would eventually grow into the magnificent crown that gave the species its name.","It looks like a living stuffed animal.","Enormous blue eyes blinked up at Noah with innocent wonder, taking in their first sight of the world. The little creature’s proportions were endearingly kitten-like. The little one had oversized paws, a round face, and ears that seemed too big for its head.","This is the combat companion that matches adept-level practitioners? It looks like it belongs in a children’s toy store.","The lion opened its tiny mouth and spoke its first word with crystal clarity that somehow bypassed language barriers entirely.","\"Mama!\"","It can talk! And it thinks I’m its mother!","\"No, not mama! I’m your... papa!\" Noah replied quickly, his voice climbing several octaves with panic.","Papa. That works better than master or owner. Less weird since it’s treating me like a parent anyway.","The little lion tilted its head with curiosity, processing this correction with obvious intelligence. Its tail—barely more than a golden tuft—wiggled with excitement.","\"Papa!\" it repeated with enthusiasm that made Noah’s heart melt completely.","The lion attempted its first steps on unsteady legs, wobbling like a newborn kitten discovering gravity. Each movement was accompanied by tiny chirping sounds that somehow conveyed both determination and confusion.","It’s learning to walk. Like watching a baby take its first steps.","\"Papa, what is this place?\" the lion asked, its voice carrying childlike wonder as it surveyed the shop.","It can form a comprehensive phrase already. Golden Mane Lions are clearly more intelligent than I gave them credit for.","\"This is my shop,\" Noah explained, settling onto the floor to meet the creature at eye level. \"I sell magical food to customers.\"","\"Food?\" The lion’s ears perked up with immediate interest. \"I’m hungry, Papa!\"","Of course it’s hungry. Just hatched from an egg after absorbing magical tea.","Noah retrieved a small piece of healing bread, breaking it into manageable portions. The lion sniffed the offering with obvious appreciation before taking delicate bites.","\"It tastes like sunshine!\" the creature declared with innocent joy.","Like sunshine. That’s actually a perfect description.","As the lion ate, its movements became more coordinated. The magical bread was clearly providing nutrition that accelerated its development beyond normal biological processes.","\"Papa, what am I called?\" the lion asked between bites, its blue eyes fixed on Noah with complete trust.","Names. I need to give it a name.","Noah considered various options while watching the adorable creature demolish bread crumbs with kitten-like behaviour. Traditional names felt too formal, human names seemed inappropriate, but something meaningful would create better bonding.","Golden fur, magical nature, loyal companion...","\"How about Leo?\" Noah suggested. \"It means brave and strong.\"","The lion’s entire body wiggled with excitement. \"Leo! I like Leo! Papa named me Leo!\"","Leo finished eating and immediately began exploring his new environment with typical feline curiosity. He sniffed everything within reach, his tiny nose twitching as magical scents provided information about his surroundings.","\"Papa, this place smells like magic and happiness,\" Leo observed with innocent wisdom.","The bond between them was already strengthening, creating connection that transcended normal pet relationships. Leo wasn’t just a creature—he was family, complete with personality and opinions.","Permanent magical companion who thinks I’m his parent. Some responsibilities arrive unexpectedly.","Leo discovered his reflection in the display case glass and immediately pounced, tiny paws scrabbling against smooth surface in confusion about why the other lion wouldn’t play."]},{"number":121,"title":"Chapter 121: Leo","paragraphs":["Still very much a kitten despite his terrifying potential.","\"Papa, why won’t the other Leo play with me?\" he asked with adorable frustration.","\"That’s your reflection, like seeing yourself in water,\" Noah explained gently.","Leo studied his reflection with newfound understanding, then deliberately made faces to watch the image copy his expressions.","Smart enough to understand mirrors immediately. Definitely more intelligent than regular cats.","Looking at his new companion, Noah thought of inspecting him.","’Maybe he also has a status, just like me.’","---","[Pet no.1] Leo","[Growth] Cub","[Rank] Novice","[Potential] Adept","[Skills]","[Size Manipulation (Locked)] – Leo has the latent ability to shift his physical size, ranging from a small kitten to a full-grown lion with a majestic mane. (This skill remains locked; Leo must reach adolescent growth.)","[Claw Sweep] – Leo unleashes a powerful sweeping strike with his claws, dealing heavy damage to anything in his path.","---","Size manipulation?","Noah had been worrying about the cub’s size. Once he grows up, it would be difficult to keep him in the roleplay as a ’domestic cat’, which meant Leo would be unable to stay on earth with him, except in the house.","However, with the size manipulation skill, the issue had been resolved.","Noah’s eyes widened with interest as he processed Leo’s incredible potential. The cub stage was clearly just the beginning—his companion would eventually possess abilities that could rival Valeria.","Adept-level potential with size-changing abilities. That’s incredible.","The locked skill suggested Leo’s development would unlock increasingly powerful capabilities as he matured. Even his current ability, Claw Sweep, indicated combat effectiveness that belied his adorable appearance.","He’s going to become formidable. He’s already as strong as I, and he was just born.","\"System, how does Leo grow and develop his abilities?\"","[Golden Mane Lions develop through feeding and hunting experiences. As natural predators, they must engage in combat to unlock their full potential. Magical enhancement also accelerates this process significantly.]","Hunting and feeding. He needs actual combat experience to grow stronger.","Noah nodded with understanding. Leo wasn’t just a pet—he was a warrior in training who required proper nutrition and combat experience to reach his potential.","Time to give him the best possible start.","Staring at his cute companion, who was now attempting to catch his own tail with typical kitten enthusiasm, Noah made a decision that felt both generous and practical.","I’m not going to be selfish. He deserves the best enhancement I can provide.","Noah retrieved one of his remaining protein bars, unwrapping it with the same care he’d used for his own consumption. Leo’s nose immediately twitched with interest as magical scents filled the air.","\"Leo, try this,\" Noah offered, breaking the bar into manageable pieces.","If it can permanently enhance humans, imagine what it might do for a magical creature.","Leo approached the protein bar with cautious curiosity, sniffing each piece before taking delicate bites. His reaction was immediate and intense, purring like a contented house cat while his eyes closed in obvious pleasure.","\"Papa, this tastes like...so good!\" Leo declared between satisfied purrs.","He can taste the magical enhancement. Fascinating.","The purring continued as Leo consumed every piece, his tiny body vibrating with contentment. But as the final bite disappeared, something unexpected began happening.","Wait. Something’s changing about him.","Leo’s golden fur started glowing brighter, and his body began expanding with visible growth that defied normal growth means. Within minutes, the kitten-sized creature had grown to puppy proportions.","He’s getting bigger. Much bigger.","\"Papa! I feel stronger! And bigger!\" Leo’s voice carried excitement rather than alarm.","The protein bar somehow triggered accelerated growth. He’s advanced to the next development stage.","Confused by the rapid transformation, Noah immediately consulted the system for an explanation.","\"System, what just happened to Leo?\"","[The protein bar contained sufficient concentrated energy to advance Leo from cub to juvenile growth stage. Golden Mane Lions can absorb enhancement more efficiently than other species due to their magical nature.]","Juvenile stage already. That protein bar was incredibly effective.","Noah focused his inspection ability on Leo again, curious about his enhanced status.","—","[Pet No.1] Leo","[Growth] Juvenile","[Rank] Apprentice","[Potential] Adept","[Skills]","[Size Manipulation (Locked)] – Leo has the latent ability to shift his physical size, ranging from a small kitten to a full-grown lion with a majestic mane. (This skill remains locked; Leo must reach adolescent growth.)","[Claw Sweep] – Leo unleashes a powerful sweeping strike with his claws, dealing heavy damage to anything in his path.","[Roar] – Leo can produce an intimidating roar that may cause fear or hesitation in weaker opponents.","—","Apprentice rank and a new skill. The growth acceleration is incredible.","Leo’s transformation was remarkable. His golden fur had developed richer colour, and his movements were clearly more coordinated.","The consumption of the protein bar made his growth look like a timeskip.","He went from newborn kitten to juvenile lion in minutes. That’s development on an unprecedented scale.","\"Papa, I feel so much stronger!\" Leo announced, demonstrating his enhanced agility by leaping onto Noah’s counter with perfect agility.","His physical capabilities multiplied dramatically. That protein bar investment paid incredible dividends.","The new Roar ability suggested Leo was developing the intimidation factors that would make him effective in actual combat situations. Even his Claw Sweep would carry more force at his increased size.","Combat-ready companion in record time. Some investments exceed all expectations.","Leo explored his expanded body with obvious delight, testing his enhanced strength by playfully swatting at empty air with movements that generated visible force.","Still playful like a kitten, but now with actual combat potential.","\"Papa, can we go hunting? I want to try my new powers! Please, please?\" Leo asked with eager anticipation. The lion was clearly sound in the way he was acting.","\"Spoken like a true lion, Leo. We shall go hunting together,\" Noah smiled at the little lion, stroking his soft, golden fur.","Leo rubbed his head against Noah’s hand in happiness.","He’s ready for real combat experience. Time to see what juvenile Golden Mane Lions can accomplish."]},{"number":122,"title":"Chapter 122: Going on a hunt","paragraphs":["—","Host: Noah Carter","Age: 28","Shop Level: 2","Daily Revenue: $135,000","Current Assets: $549,240.21","Shop Points: 1990","Attributes: Strength: 30, Vitality: 4, Intelligence: 20, Agility: 20","Skills: Swordsmanship(Level 6), Mana Control (Level 5), Aura (Level 5), Wind Manipulation (Level 4), Surviving on Ramen (Level 3), Cooking (Level 2), Programming (Level 2), Gaming (Level 2), Finance (Level 2)","—","[Auto-IceTea Maker]","Level: 3","Production Rate: 2 Iced teas every hour","Max Stock: 48","Progress: 100/200","—","[Auto-Baker]","Level: 3","Production Rate: 4 Loaves every hour","Max Stock: 48","Progress: 101/200","—","[Auto-ProteinBar]","Level: 1","Production Rate: 1 bar every 2 hours","Max Stock: 12","Progress: 4/100","—","Checking his status, Noah’s current assets had broken through half a million dollars.","Seeing his substantial wealth that would keep increasing day by day, Noah smiled.","He had sold his stocks for the day, although the protein bar was more difficult to sell due to the restrictions he had placed.","Noah had managed to sell four; one had been sold to Lola, the other to Vex, and the last two were for an apprentice rank individual and a Novice rank individual.","From the sales, Noah was able to amass Leo’s egg and a whopping 900 golden coins.","’Whilst I want to save up for the idle room, I think getting the energy drink would help me in the long term. I can amass money from the energy drink to help me gain it faster for the idle room.’","With his choice made, Noah decided to buy it.","[Item 2] Energy Drink","[Price] $300,000","[Effect] Increases Agility attribute by 50% for twenty minutes. Permanently increases Agility attribute by 10 upon first consumption.","Although it hurt him to part with his money so quickly, it had to be done.","[You have successfully purchased the item <Energy Drink>]","The energy drink appeared on the shelf in the drinks section alongside the iced tea.","With the energy drink bought, Noah checked his new balance before heading out on a hunt with the eager Leo.","Current Assets: $249,240.21","\"That’s not too bad, two hundred grand is still some decent money,\" Noah consoled himself. He knew that it was an investment. Buying another item was an investment, and he had to get used to that feeling. After all, he was bound to keep repeating it.","Noah and Leo stepped out of the store into Sin City’s afternoon bustle. The Ed brothers stood at the door like professional bodyguards, immediately standing at attention when they spotted Noah.","They looked dedicated to their job; clearly, the oath had done its magic.","Noah smiled and continued toward the city gates with Leo bounding beside him. The juvenile lion’s excitement was infectious, his golden fur catching sunlight as he moved, making him look more majestic.","Time to test Leo’s combat capabilities properly.","The Crimson Mountains welcomed them with a familiar red-tinged landscape and the presence of monsters that would help Leo’s body development.","I will make him start with the basics, then work up to real threats. Even if he was an apprentice-rank monster.","\"Papa, where are we going?\" Leo asked, his blue eyes bright with anticipation.","\"Hunting grounds. Time to test your new strength.\"","Blop! Blop! Blop!","The first slimes appeared near the entrance, their innocent bouncing providing perfect introductory targets for Leo’s combat debut.","\"These are slimes,\" Noah explained. \"Good practice for beginners.\"","Leo studied the blue creatures with predatory focus that transformed his cute appearance into something approaching dangerous.","He’s analysing them like a natural hunter.","\"They look weak, Papa.\"","Without warning, Leo pounced. His Claw Sweep carved through the first slime with devastating efficiency, cutting the core cleanly in half.","Blop—splat.","The creature dissolved instantly.","\"Too easy!\" Leo declared with obvious disappointment. \"I want stronger opponents!\"","Already bored with Tier 0 creatures. Well, that was too be expected, he is current at tier 2 after all.","They progressed to the beetle territory, where chitinous shapes moved with more aggressive intent.","Bzzt! Bzzt!","\"These look better,\" Leo observed, his tail lashing with excitement.","The first beetle attempted a pincer attack, but Leo’s enhanced reflexes made the creature seem sluggish. Another Claw Sweep removed its head completely.","One strike, one kill. Apprentice-rank power in action.","\"Still too weak, Papa! I want real challenges!\"","He’s outgrown beginner monsters despite being just born. I wanted to test his instincts, but it seems that he’s really better than I thought. Time for Tier 1 opponents.","The firefly territory stretched ahead with thermal vents promising more formidable opposition.","Bzzt! Bzzt! Bzzt!","Three fireflies rose with coordinated aggression, their wings creating that familiar maddening buzz.","\"Now we’re talking!\" Leo’s excitement peaked as he faced genuinely dangerous opponents.","But instead of engaging physically, Leo drew himself up to his full juvenile height and released his new ability.","\"ROAR!\"","The sound that emerged wasn’t cute kitten noise—it was primal predator dominance that echoed off the air.","Bzzt—","The fireflies’ wings faltered as fear overwhelmed their combat instincts. All three creatures dropped from the air, trembling on the ground like leaves in a hurricane.","His roar ability is incredibly effective. Fear-based crowd control.","\"Papa, they’re scared of me!\" Leo said with obvious pride.","Noah’s mouth twitched as he processed what had just occurred. The roar hadn’t been directed at him, but even as a bystander, the sound had made his reflexes jump with instinctive alarm.","Luckily, the roar wasn’t directed at me, otherwise I probably would’ve dropped too. That roar was genuinely terrifying.","Noah turned toward his bodyguards to check their reactions, finding all three Ed brothers visibly shivering despite their normal composure. Their hands trembled on their weapon hilts, and their eyes carried the wide-eyed look of people who’d just confronted something far beyond their comfort zone.","They’re apprentice-rank practitioners, same as Leo’s current classification. But clearly, Leo isn’t a normal apprentice-rank beast.","Ed’s scarred face had gone pale, while Edd clutched his staff with white knuckles. Even Eddie, who specialised in stealth, looked like he’d rather be anywhere else.","\"Boss,\" Ed managed through chattering teeth, \"your... companion is quite powerful.\"","Quite powerful...huh?"]},{"number":123,"title":"Chapter 123: Kitten","paragraphs":["\"He’s just getting started,\" Noah replied, watching Leo prance around the paralysed fireflies with kitten-like satisfaction.","And he’s only juvenile stage. What happens when he reaches adolescent growth?","Leo approached the trembling fireflies with curiosity, his head tilted as he studied their fear response.","\"Papa, why are they shaking so much? \"","\"Your roar is very... impressive, Leo. Maybe use it more carefully around friends?\"","Need to establish rules before he accidentally terrorises allies.","Leo nodded with earnest understanding. \"I’ll be gentle with Papa’s friends!\"","The Ed brothers began recovering their composure, though they maintained noticeably more distance from Leo than before. Professional bodyguards or not, instinctive fear was hard to override.","One of the paralyzed fireflies attempted to crawl away, its wings still too unsteady for flight. Leo watched with interest but didn’t pursue.","\"Should I catch them, Papa?\"","\"If you want to, go ahead.\" Noah smiled, curious to see his companion’s hunting instincts in action.","Time to see what juvenile Golden Mane Lions do to finish opponents.","Leo’s demeanour shifted immediately from playful kitten to focused predator. His movements became fluid and purposeful as he stalked the trembling fireflies with natural hunting grace.","Bzzt... bzzt...","The weakened sounds of their wings made pathetic attempts at escape, but Leo’s enhanced speed made evasion impossible. His Claw Sweep finished each creature with no effort, targeting vital points with instinctive knowledge.","Three dead fireflies in under ten seconds.","With the hunt completed, Leo bounded back toward Noah with obvious satisfaction. The juvenile lion launched himself through the air with perfect confidence that his Papa would catch him.","Here he comes.","Noah’s arms caught Leo, feeling the warm weight of magical creature settling into his arms. The lion’s purring vibrated through his chest as he stroked the impossibly soft golden fur.","Still acts like a kitten despite being a lethal predator.","\"Did you enjoy yourself, Leo?\" Noah asked, scratching behind ears that flicked with contentment.","\"Yes! Thank you, Papa!\" Leo’s blue eyes sparkled with happiness. \"That was fun! The flying bugs were scared of my voice!\"","Flying bugs. His innocent description of Tier 1 magical creatures.","Noah set Leo gently back on the ground, watching his companion immediately begin exploring the thermal vents with curiosity.","\"Alright, it’s time for me to show you my skills,\" Noah announced, drawing the Zealous Quickblade with fluid motion.","My turn to demonstrate.","Leo’s ears perked up with immediate attention. \"Show me, Papa! Show me your hunting!\"","Three fresh fireflies emerged from deeper thermal vents, their buzzing announcing their hostile intent as they spotted the intruders in their territory.","Bzzt! Bzzt! Bzzt!","\"Watch carefully, Leo. This is how humans fight.\"","Time to combine all my skills into coordinated combat.","Noah activated his aura immediately, feeling mana flow through his enhanced musculature like liquid fire. He could feel his mana spread through his body, amplifying his strength and various attributes, increasing his combat effectiveness.","Wind began swirling around his blade as elemental manipulation joined the enhancement matrix. The Zealous Quickblade hummed with contained atmospheric force that made the air itself seem more responsive.","The first firefly dove with a pincer attack aimed at his head, but Noah’s combined enhancements made its assault seem sluggish. He sidestepped while launching a wind blade that carved deep gashes across chitinous armour.","\"Papa is fast!\" Leo called from his observation position.","The second firefly attempted flame breath while its companion attacked from the flank. Noah’s eyes tracked both threats simultaneously, his consciousness expanded to encompass multiple danger sources.","They are performing a coordinated assault. This is the perfect opportunity to practise my new techniques.","He rolled beneath the flame stream while channelling wind magic into a defensive barrier that dispersed the magical fire harmlessly. His counter-attack came in the form of an aura-enhanced leap that carried him within striking range.","His blade, empowered by both aura and wind manipulation, carved through the firefly’s wing structure with no resistance. The creature crashed to the ground, its flight capabilities permanently disabled.","With one opponent grounded, Noah gained an advantage against the fireflies.","\"Papa fights like the wind!\" Leo’s commentary carried genuine admiration.","The final firefly attempted a desperate charge, its pincers spread wide for a crushing assault. But Noah’s reflexes and speed made perfect timing possible.","[Your Mana Control skill has levelled up to Level 6!]","The notification blazed across his vision as his magical integration reached new heights. The sensation was immediate, and he felt his mana purity increase alongside his control over its effects.","Level 6 Mana Control. Another threshold crossed.","But the advancement wasn’t finished. As Noah’s wind manipulation reached peak coordination with his other abilities, another breakthrough occurred.","[Your Wind Manipulation skill has levelled up to Level 5!]","Level 5. Major milestone for elemental magic.","The moment the skill advanced, Noah felt new knowledge flooding his consciousness. Not just improved control over existing techniques, but entirely new applications that had been locked behind the level barrier.","Inherent skill unlocked. Something new to work with.","Following instinctive understanding, Noah extended his hand toward the charging firefly and released a concentrated burst of wind that he somehow knew how to create.","Gust. That’s what this technique is called.","The wind burst struck the firefly with perfect timing, interrupting its charge and sending it tumbling through the air. The creature’s momentum was completely negated, leaving it vulnerable to Noah’s finishing strike.","Short-range wind burst that knocks back enemies and interrupts attacks. Incredibly useful for combat control.","His aura-enhanced blade completed the encounter, carving through the disoriented creature with devastating effectiveness.","Victory. Three fireflies defeated through coordinated skill application.","\"Papa is amazing!\" Leo bounded around the battlefield with obvious excitement. \"You move like the wind and strike like thunder!\"","Wind and thunder. He’s developing quite the poetic vocabulary.","Noah sheathed his weapon with satisfaction that transcended mere victory. The combat had demonstrated how his various skills were beginning to work in harmony rather than as separate abilities.","Aura, wind magic, and swordsmanship integrating into a unified combat style.","The Ed brothers approached with respect for their employer’s personal capabilities.","\"The Gust technique,\" Noah murmured, testing the name while feeling its potential applications. \"Perfect for controlling enemy positioning.\""]},{"number":124,"title":"Chapter 124: An unexpected guest.","paragraphs":["—","Host: Noah Carter","Age: 28","Shop Level: 2","Daily Revenue: $135,000","Current Assets: $249,240.21","Shop Points: 1990","Attributes: Strength: 30, Vitality: 4, Intelligence: 20, Agility: 20","Skills: Swordsmanship(Level 6), Mana Control (Level 6), Aura (Level 5), Wind Manipulation (Level 5), Surviving on Ramen (Level 3), Cooking (Level 2), Programming (Level 2), Gaming (Level 2), Finance (Level 2)","—","\"Alright, Leo. Let’s go back,\" Noah stroked the little lion’s golden fur and began their journey back to the shop.","Successful training session. Leo’s combat capabilities are insane; two of my skills have advanced, and everything is proceeding perfectly.","On their way back, Noah glanced toward the familiar grass spot where Lola had been lounging earlier. Part of him hoped to find the succubus there again—he needed her help organising another auction for the energy drink.","No sign of her. She must be dealing with whatever mysterious business keeps master-level demons busy.","Not dwelling on Lola’s absence, Noah continued toward Sin City with Leo bounding beside him and the Ed brothers maintaining their professional formation.","Back to business. I will work for two or so hours before returning to Earth.","But as they approached the shop’s location, Noah’s vision caught sight of something that made his eyes widen. A familiar figure stood before his entrance with an entourage.","Oh no.","Noah’s eyes widened as recognition hit him like a physical blow. Prince Malphas waited outside his shop with several royal guards positioned in formation.","They were clearly there for his shop.","The prince is here. Outside my shop, with his guards. This can’t be good.","The Ed brothers immediately straightened, their faces draining of colour as they processed the implications.","Royal displeasure could end their lives regardless of the magical oath protection. For the prince to wait outside the shop either meant that he was dissatisfied or satisfied with something; otherwise, he would simply send one of his guards to deal with it.","What if the prince wants to fight our employer? We would be dead either way—from the prince or from oath violation of not protecting our employer.","The Ed brothers began praying silently that whatever brought Prince Malphas here could be resolved without violence.","Please don’t let this escalate. Please don’t let this escalate.","Leo sensed the tension immediately, his playful demeanour shifting to something approaching protective alertness. The juvenile lion’s instincts recognised a potential threat to his Papa.","Noah approached with careful steps, his mind racing through possible reasons for royal attention. Had the protein bar not met his expectations? Was there some violation of demon commercial law he wasn’t aware of?","Stay calm. Professional courtesy. Don’t give him any reason to escalate whatever this is about. I also need to lead whatever this is inside my store, inside I’m invincible, he won’t be able to do anything to me, no matter what his issue is.","\"Prince Malphas, it’s a pleasure to meet you outside my store,\" Noah said with a respectful nod.","Prince Malphas turned toward him with a smile on his face. His expression seemed friendly enough, but something underneath suggested there were some hidden complications.","\"Likewise, Mr. Noah. Although I must admit, I’m slightly upset,\" the prince replied with royal bearing that made every word feel significant.","A demon prince being upset with a human...That’s never a good thing.","\"Why, Your Highness?\" Noah asked, although he had a hunch.","The prince’s expression shifted to something approaching disappointment mixed with calculation.","\"I paid a Wind Orb worth thirteen hundred golden coins for a product I believed to be extinct. Imagine my surprise when I discovered the same item available in abundance at your shop.\"","I was right...he thinks I scammed him at the auction.","The royal guards’ hands drifted toward their weapons with subtle movements that suggested readiness for immediate violence.","The Ed brothers noticed this shift and began positioning themselves defensively, although they were crying inwardly. we’re...dead.","\"Furthermore, the pricing structure you’ve established makes the auction price almost seem artificially inflated.\" Prince Malphas continued, his voice surprisingly gentle.","He’s not wrong. But I can’t admit it.","Noah nodded with understanding rather than defensiveness. \"I see the misunderstanding, Your Highness.\"","Noah immediately acknowledged the prince’s concerns without admitting any wrongdoing. He was finding a middle ground.","\"The auction price wasn’t predetermined,\" Noah explained, carefully walking towards his store to open it. \"The final cost resulted from competitive bidding between you and Lady Lola. I never anticipated prices reaching those levels.\"","The auction exceeded everyone’s expectations. Even I didn’t think it would reach such numbers, and I was the one who told Lola to artificially raise the price.","Prince Malphas studied Noah’s expression with the calculating gaze of someone accustomed to detecting deception in political contexts. \"Yet you had multiple units available immediately afterwards.\"","Fair point. From his perspective, it looks like deliberate scarcity manipulation.","\"The auction price included exclusivity and first purchase rights,\" Noah continued with a diplomatic response. \"","You received the first protein bar available through public sale, along with the prestige of winning a competitive auction.","Your highness, it’s known that auctions are mostly used to raise prestige, not that you need a prestige boost. But that’s one of the main reasons for auctions, alongside rare items.","I’ve never claimed that the item was a one-off.\"","Frame it as a premium service rather than price gouging.","The prince’s expression suggested he was processing this explanation with consideration rather than immediate dismissal. But his next words carried warning that made the royal guards tense.","\"While that explanation has merit, the perception remains problematic. Royal dignity was involved in that auction.\"","Royal dignity. The most dangerous currency in any monarchy.","Leo moved closer to Noah’s leg, his juvenile instincts recognising escalating threat levels. The little lion’s presence was comforting but also concerning—protecting him might require combat against opponents far beyond Leo’s current capabilities.","If this turns violent, Leo could get hurt trying to defend me. And he isn’t immortal.","\"Your Highness,\" Noah said with genuine respect, \"I understand your concerns completely. Since you feel this way, I want to ensure you’re satisfied with our business relationship.\""]},{"number":125,"title":"Chapter 125: Solution","paragraphs":["The prince’s eyebrows rose with interest rather than suspicion. \"How do you propose to address this... situation?\"","He’s willing to negotiate rather than simply demanding satisfaction. Good sign.","\"Allow me to demonstrate my commitment to customer satisfaction,\" Noah replied, gesturing toward his shop entrance. \"If you would honour me with your presence inside?\"","Move the conversation into my territory. Whether he is satisfied or not, he will have to follow my rules then.","Prince Malphas considered this invitation while his guards maintained ready positions. The Ed brothers watched every movement with alertness, prepared for violence but hoping for a peaceful resolution.","\"Very well,\" the prince decided. \"Let’s see what you propose.\"","Inside the shop, Noah gestured toward his transformed establishment with professional pride. The elegant display cases and spacious layout created an atmosphere that spoke to serious magical commerce rather than simple street vendor operations.","Time to demonstrate the full scope of my business. Show him this isn’t some fly-by-night operation, although it lowkey is.","\"Your Highness, allow me to properly introduce my product line,\" Noah began, moving toward the bread display with showmanship.","Prince Malphas followed with interest that seemed genuine rather than merely polite. His royal guards positioned themselves strategically while maintaining respectful distance from the commercial presentation.","He’s actually curious about my inventory. Good sign.","\"This is our healing bread,\" Noah explained, indicating the golden loaves that seemed to glow with internal warmth. \"Accelerates natural recovery by thirty percent while providing superior taste.\"","Start with the foundation products. Build appreciation before revealing the premium items. Although he probably knows them.","The prince studied the bread with interest. \"The enhancement rate remains constant regardless of consumer rank?\"","\"Completely consistent across all magical levels. Lasts for ten minutes.\"","No diminishing returns. Always a selling point that impresses practitioners .","Noah moved to the iced tea display, where the drink inside the glass bottles caught the shop’s lighting with prismatic beauty. \"Mana enhancement beverages. Thirty percent increase to reserves and regeneration rate for ten minutes.\"","\"Impressive consistency with your other products,\" Prince Malphas observed.","He’s recognizing the pattern. Uniform effectiveness across all items.","\"The protein bar you’re familiar with,\" Noah continued, gesturing toward the display case where several units remained from the day’s production.","The prince’s expression tightened slightly at the reminder of auction complications, but his attention remained focused on the presentation.","Still sensitive about the pricing. Need to address that through superior customer service.","\"And finally,\" Noah paused dramatically, \"something exclusive that hasn’t appeared at any auction.\"","He approached the energy drink display with ceremony befitting legendary reveals. The container pulsed with contained power that made the air shimmer with potential.","This is my bargaining chip. Time to see if agility enhancement creates the same excitement as strength improvement.","\"The Energy Drink,\" Noah announced with satisfaction. \"Increases Agility attribute by fifty percent for twenty minutes, plus permanent enhancement of ten attribute points upon first consumption.\"","Same effect profile as the protein bar, different attribute focus. Perfect complement for combat effectiveness.","Prince Malphas’s eyes widened with genuine shock as the implications registered. His royal composure cracked slightly as excitement overrode diplomatic restraint.","Got his attention. Agility enhancement is just as valuable as strength improvement.","\"Is this the only one?\" the prince asked with barely contained eagerness.","\"Currently? Yes. My stocks are always on display,\" Noah replied with calculated honesty.","It’s the truth. What he can see is what’s available right now.","The prince studied the energy drink with the intensity of someone evaluating his advantages. Enhanced agility would complement his protein bar’s strength improvement perfectly.","\"I want it. How much do you want for it, shopkeeper Noah?\"","Noah paused , allowing anticipation to build while his mind calculated optimal pricing strategies.","This is the moment. I need to price it right and resolve the auction complications permanently.","\"Prince Malphas, unlike the protein bar, this will not be sold easily,\" Noah began with careful emphasis.","Creating scarcity perception through future availability rather than current supply.","The prince’s expression sharpened with understanding. Exclusive access to permanent enhancement carried value beyond simple monetary consideration.","He recognizes the implications. First access to new products before they reach market.","\"The next time this appears in the market could be weeks, months, or years,\" Noah continued, watching royal interest intensify with each word.","Building value through uncertainty. Classic sales psychology.","\"The price will be similar to the protein bar’s auction value. What do you think?\"","Same price range as his previous purchase. Consistency in premium pricing.","\"That’s fair,\" Prince Malphas agreed with satisfaction that suggested the pricing met royal expectations.","But Noah caught subtle signs that complete satisfaction hadn’t been achieved. The prince’s posture remained slightly tense, suggesting unresolved concerns about their business relationship.","Almost there. Need one more gesture to cement customer loyalty.","\"Don’t worry, Prince. The price will be thirty percent off for the earlier misunderstanding,\" Noah added with generous magnanimity.","Customer service recovery through meaningful discount. Turn complaint into loyalty.","\"This will cost one thousand golden coins or something equivalent.\"","Thousand coins instead of thirteen hundred. Significant savings that demonstrate good faith.","The prince’s expression transformed completely, tension evaporating as satisfaction replaced concern. His smile carried genuine warmth rather than politeness.","\"Excellent,\" Prince Malphas declared with obvious pleasure. \"This arrangement addresses my concerns perfectly.\"","The royal guards relaxed visibly as their leader’s mood shifted from potential confrontation to successful negotiation. The Ed brothers released breath they hadn’t realized they’d been holding.","Leo emerged from behind Noah’s leg, his juvenile instincts recognizing that the threat level had decreased significantly. The little lion’s tail wagged with relief.","\"Shall we complete the transaction?\" Noah asked with courtesy.","The prince nodded with a smile that carried genuine satisfaction rather than diplomatic courtesy.","Crisis resolved. Royal customer converted to satisfied buyer.","He motioned to one of his guards, a stern-faced demon whose armor gleamed with enchantments. The guard stepped forward, producing a leather pouch that clinked with the unmistakable sound of serious wealth.","A thousand golden coins..A hundred thousand dollars."]},{"number":126,"title":"Chapter 126: The Black Visage","paragraphs":["The pouch landed on Noah’s counter with satisfying weight, its contents representing both successful crisis resolution and substantial profit margin.","Payment in full. No haggling, no complications, just royal resources backing royal decisions.","Noah retrieved the energy drink with ceremonial care, handling the container like the legendary artifact it essentially was. The liquid inside pulsed with contained power that made the air itself seem more responsive.","Prince Malphas accepted the energy drink with obvious appreciation, immediately transferring it to his personal storage ring rather than consuming it immediately. The magical container vanished into dimensional space.","The moment the transaction completed, Noah’s system responded with immediate recognition of another major business milestone.","[Level 1 Auto-EnergyDrink is now in effect]","[New daily income stream: $235,000 (or equivalent)]","Two hundred thirty-five thousand dollars daily. My passive income just doubled.","The notification blazed across Noah’s consciousness with numbers that redefined his understanding of wealth accumulation. Between the protein bar and energy drink production, his daily passive income was approaching half a million dollars.","\"A pleasure doing business with you, Mr. Noah,\" Prince Malphas declared with royal satisfaction. \"This arrangement resolves all previous concerns.\"","\"Likewise, Your Highness. Thank you for your understanding.\"","The prince’s entourage prepared to depart with the coordinated movements of people accustomed to royal schedules.","As the royal entourage left his door, Noah checked on his new auto-maker capabilities.","Just like the protein bar, the auto-maker had a production rate of one energy drink every two hours, with a maximum of twelve per day.","\"Not bad, this is pretty good,\" Noah muttered with satisfaction.","BOOM!","A thunderous explosion erupted outside his shop, the sound so powerful it felt like it would puncture his eardrums. The entire building shook from the magical impact.","\"What the hell is going on?\" Noah whispered to himself.","Leo’s golden fur stood completely upright, his juvenile instincts screaming danger warnings. The little lion’s blue eyes darted toward the door with obvious alarm.","Even Leo knows something’s seriously wrong.","Noah immediately rushed to his window, peering through the glass to identify the source of magical violence erupting in his peaceful plaza.","The scene that greeted him defied comprehension.","A figure draped in oversized black cloth engaged Prince Malphas and his four royal guards in furious combat. The mysterious attacker’s identity was completely concealed, but something about their mask made Noah’s blood run cold.","\"This mask...\"","Prince Malphas’s voice cut through the chaos with royal authority tinged by genuine concern.","\"Black Visage... you have been quite active recently, I must say.\"","Black Visage. That’s not a random street criminal.","The cloaked figure laughed with a hoarse voice that carried disturbing amusement. \"Have I, Your Highness? I just missed your company.\"","Clang! Clang!","Steel met steel as the figure engaged all four guards simultaneously. Each royal bodyguard was a pseudo master-level warrior whose combined strength should have overwhelmed any single opponent.","Yet Black Visage moved between them like deadly smoke.","Whoosh!","Fire erupted from the figure’s free hand while a short dagger danced through the guard’s defensive formations. The combination of magical and physical assault created chaos that even those royal guards struggled to contain.","Four pseudo-masters versus one opponent. And they’re losing.","Clang! Sizzle!","The dagger parried sword strikes while flames forced constant repositioning. Black Visage’s combat style was brutally efficient—every movement served multiple purposes.","Lola...What are you doing...","Prince Malphas watched his bodyguards falter with royal frustration that overcame tactical wisdom. His pride demanded action despite obvious personal risk.","\"Your Highness, escape while we hold them!\" one guard shouted through gritted teeth.","Crash!","Another fire explosion sent two guards stumbling backwards, their formations completely disrupted. Black Visage pressed the advantage with relentless aggression.","The prince’s guards are outmatched.","But instead of retreating, Prince Malphas reached for his storage ring with determination. Royal dignity was at stake—he couldn’t flee forever. His royal family had been constantly targeted by this black visage.","He’s going for the energy drink. He’s actually going to consume it mid-combat.","The container materialized in his hands, and without hesitation, the prince drained its contents in a single gulp.","The transformation was immediate and dramatic.","His agility increased rapidly as the content of the energy drink flooded through his physique like liquid lightning, multiplying his speed and reflexes beyond his normal capabilities. The fifty percent boost stacked atop his already formidable base attributes.","Black Visage’s eyes widened with obvious surprise as they sensed the prince’s dramatic power increase. For the first time since combat began, the mysterious attacker seemed genuinely shocked.","Lola clearly didn’t expect the agility enhancement. The prince just gained a significant advantage.","Those hidden eyes swept toward Noah’s shop with unmistakable recognition before snapping back to the enhanced prince.","Damn it, Lola! I didn’t know you were going to attack him, right after he buys my energy drink!","\"Interesting development,\" Black Visage murmured with that disturbing hoarse voice.","Whoosh! Clang!","The prince joined combat with supernatural speed. Enhanced agility allowed him to match Black Visage’s previously overwhelming tempo alongside his guards.","Noah pressed against his window, torn between fascination and terror. The battle raged directly outside his shop, with magical forces that could easily destroy his entire establishment.","Should I help her? But...how? How am I meant to help this succubus?","Leo whimpered beside him, clearly sensing his Papa’s distress while struggling with his own protective instincts.","Sizzle! Clang! Boom!","The battle intensified as enhanced royal forces pressed their temporary advantage. But Black Visage adapted quickly, their tactics shifting to account for improved opposition.","Noah watched in growing horror as the battle escalated beyond anything his current abilities could handle. This was completely above his pay grade; even if he wanted to help Lola, it would be suicide. He’d basically be asking to get himself killed.","Four pseudo-masters plus an enhanced prince versus one opponent. I’d last about a millisecond in that chaos.","People began fleeing the plaza in panic, their screams adding to the cacophony of magical combat. In the distance, more guards could be seen approaching at a run, their armor glinting as reinforcements rushed toward the battle."]},{"number":127,"title":"Chapter 127: Lola against the Prince","paragraphs":["She’s going to be overwhelmed. Even Lola can’t handle those odds indefinitely.","Noah gritted his teeth and made a decision that defied every survival instinct he possessed. His hand moved to the shop door.","This is the only way I could help her.","’Don’t be stupid, Lola! Come in!’ he shouted in his mind.","If she gets inside, I can close the door. No one can enter my shop regardless of their rank. I’m invincible in here.","But even as he opened the door, Noah knew the complications this would create. Helping Lola meant directly opposing Prince Malphas—the royal customer he’d just successfully appeased.","Royal customer versus friend in mortal danger. Some choices have no good options.","Clang! Whoosh!","Lola’s dagger intercepted another strike while flames erupted from her free hand, forcing the nearest guard backwards. Her enhanced senses caught Noah’s intention of opening the door despite the chaos around her.","Her mouth curved upward under the mask, and she was smiling.","This foolish human...he wants to protect me, even if that means his involvement with rebellion against the royal family of Sin City.","\"Still playing with fire, Black Visage?\" Prince Malphas taunted, his enhanced speed allowing him to appear at her flank in the blink of an eye as the guards took on Lola from the front.","Sizzle!","Lola twisted away from his thrust, her robes smoking where his blade had passed. \"Your Highness seems... energetic today.\"","\"Indeed, I am, I’ve just been taking care of my food intake lately,\" the prince replied, pressing his attack with renewed vigour. \"Perhaps you should invest in better nutrition.\"","Clang! Clang! Clang!","Steel rang against steel as Lola parried a flurry of strikes that would have overwhelmed her without the protein bar’s temporary strength enhancement.","It’s good that I’ve taken the protein bar, initiating the fight...Although Noah’s new item wasn’t part of the plan..","But even enhanced muscles were beginning to fatigue against sustained assault.","Five opponents. Enhanced prince. Limited mana reserves. This wasn’t the plan.","\"Growing tired already?\" Prince Malphas observed as another guard’s sword found its mark, opening a gash across her arms.","Crimson bloomed through black fabric.","\"Just... getting started,\" Lola gasped, launching a fireball that scattered the converging formation.","Lies. She’s dying by inches. Noah thought with growing worry.","The mysterious Black Visage—who Noah knew was Lola in disguise—was accumulating damage at an alarming rate. Her black robes showed multiple tears from near-miss attacks, and crimson stains were beginning to seep through the fabric.","She’s bleeding quite a bit. The disguise is hiding serious injuries.","Whoosh! Crash!","Another coordinated attack drove her backwards, magical barriers straining against the cumulative assault of the prince and his guards. Prince Malphas’s agility had completely disrupted whatever plan she’d originally conceived.","\"You made one critical error,\" the prince declared, his blade moving at speeds too fast for normal eyes to follow.","What error? Planning this at all?","\"Enlighten me,\" Lola snarled, her dagger catching his thrust by millimetres.","\"You attacked me right after I gained some valuable treasure.\" His smile carried satisfaction. \"Poor timing, wouldn’t you say?\"","Sizzle! Clang!","Fire met steel as Lola’s magic clashed with the prince’s sword attacks. Each exchange cost her more than she could afford, while the prince seemed to grow stronger with each passing moment. But in reality, she was just growing weaker.","The protein bar gave me enhanced strength, but he’s matching it with enhanced speed and his guards. The combination is devastating.","\"Last chance to surrender,\" Prince Malphas offered with false magnanimity. \"My mercy has its limits.\"","\"How generous. I’ll pass.\" Lola’s voice dripped sarcasm despite her deteriorating position.","Never surrender. Never give them the satisfaction.","Clang! Slash!","Another guard’s blade found its mark, opening a deep cut across her sword arm. Lola’s dagger work became noticeably less precise as blood loss began affecting her coordination.","Losing too much blood. Function degrading rapidly.","Fire erupted from her hands in waves, forcing a temporary space between herself and the converging royal forces. But each spell depleted her mana reserves while her opponents seemed to have unlimited stamina.","Five against one. Even master-level power has limits.","\"Your flames are growing weaker, Black Visage...\" one of the guards observed with a mocking tone.","\"Still hot enough to burn you to ashes,\" Lola retorted, though her flames did indeed seem less intense.","I can’t maintain this much longer.","Clang! Thud!","Her dagger parried another assault, but the impact sent jarring pain through her injured sword arm. The disguise concealed the wound, but functionality was compromised rapidly.","Coordination failing. Reaction time slowing.","Prince Malphas pressed his advantage with fury that transcended. \"You won’t be leaving this place today, Black Visage. The last time you got lucky, not anymore.\"","\"Lucky?\" Lola laughed bitterly. \"I call it incompetence from your side.\"","\"Then demonstrate this skill,\" the prince challenged, his enhanced speed creating afterimages as he attacked from multiple angles simultaneously.","Impossible speed. The energy drink’s effects are incredible.","Clang! Clang! Slash!","Another coordinated assault forced Lola backwards toward Noah’s shop. Her defensive perimeter was shrinking as enhanced opposition overwhelmed her tactical options.","Surrounded on all sides. The shop is my only refuge.","\"Retreating already?\" Prince Malphas taunted. \"How disappointing. Based on your earlier words, I would have thought you would stay for a little longer.\"","\"You talk a lot for a nonchalant prince,\" Lola smirked, though her voice carried exhaustion that belied her defiant words.","Whoosh! Crash!","Another spell barrage forced her to dive aside, her landing awkward as injured muscles protested violent movement. Blood seeped through multiple tears in her disguise.","She had no options but Noah’s shop. But entering the shop meant dragging Noah into a conflict with royal authority. Her mind gave her multiple warning signals as magical attacks intensified around her diminishing defensive space.","If I enter, Noah becomes an enemy of the crown. If I don’t, I die here.","\"Nowhere left to run,\" Prince Malphas declared with satisfaction.","\"Who said anything about running?\" Lola snarled, though her stance betrayed her desperation.","Blood seeped through multiple tears in her disguise as accumulated damage reached critical levels. Her robes hung in tatters that barely concealed the extent of her injuries.","The approaching reinforcements would arrive within seconds, sealing her fate permanently. Prince Malphas and his guards left no room for escape through conventional means."]},{"number":128,"title":"Chapter 128: Lola’s end","paragraphs":["Another sword strike opened a gash across her shoulder, spinning her toward Noah’s doorway with desperate momentum.","She gave a quick sideglance at Noah who stood there, his face etched with concern and terror. Their eyes met for a fraction of a second.","I can’t. I won’t destroy his life for mine.","Lola shook her head with firm determination, even as blood dripped steadily from her wounds. The gesture was subtle but unmistakable—she was refusing his sanctuary.","He doesn’t deserve to become a target because of my choices. Even if he is the one in the prophecy, he is still too weak, I should be able to survive and meet him in the future",", when he is strong enough.","\"You are dead, Black Visage.\"","The declaration was like a royal decree that made the surrounding air seem heavier. Prince Malphas raised his blade, preparing to deliver a killing blow to the wounded figure before him.","This ends now.","Lola’s legs trembled as exhaustion and blood loss took their toll. Her dagger wavered in her weak fingers while magical energy flickered like dying flames around her injured body.","I have no more strength. No more options.","The royal guards closed their distance, creating an impenetrable circle that eliminated any possibility of escape. Their weapons shone with anticipation of victory.","Lola was surrounded, bleeding out and ultimately defeated.","\"Any last words?\" Prince Malphas inquired with courtesy that made the mockery even more cutting.","Lola straightened as much as her injuries allowed, mustering what dignity remained to someone facing execution.","\"Go to hell.\"","The prince’s enhanced speed made his final attack a blur of motion that human eyes couldn’t track. His blade descended with supernatural force aimed directly at her heart.","This is it. This is how it ends.","Time seemed to slow as Lola watched death approach with crystalclarity. The sword’s edge caught afternoon light, reflecting her own face.","Damn it. Maybe I should’ve listened to that idiot. I guess this is how it ends...Sorry, mother, father.","But just as the blade reached its target, strong hands seized her injured body with desperate strength.","What—","Noah’s attribures allowed him to move faster than normal human reflexes should have permitted. His arms wrapped around Lola’s robe, pulling her backward with force that sent both of them tumbling through his shop’s entrance.","Luckily, lola was barely a meter close to his shop door.","Boom!","The floor that Lola was on cracked, as the strike landed on stone rather than Lola’s body.","He saved me. This fool actually saved me.","SLAM!","The shop door crashed shut behind them without delay. The moment it closed, an invisible barrier activated that made the air itself seem more solid.","Safe. We’re actually safe.","Seeing Noah pulling his worst enemy inside, the prince was outraged. His calm demeanour was no longer present.","Without waiting, his blade struck the door with enough power to shatter large boulders. But the mystical protection held without even a scratch appearing on its surface.","\"What sorcery is this?\" the prince demanded, his enhanced strength failing to budge the entrance even slightly.","The shop’s protection. No one can enter without permission. Noah thought","Outside, the royal guards tested every possible angle of attack. Swords, spells, and enhanced strength all proved equally useless against whatever force protected Noah’s establishment.","Inside, Noah cradled Lola’s injured body while removing her cloaks to check her injuries. Black fabric faded to reveal familiar midnight hair and ruby eyes clouded with pain.","She’s hurt worse than I thought.","Blood seeped through multiple wounds while her breathing came in shallow gasps. The protein bar’s enhancement had kept her fighting far longer than should have been possible, but even magical strength had limits.","She has critical injuries. She needs healing immediately.","\"You idiot,\" Lola whispered weakly. \"You’ve made yourself an enemy of the crown.\"","She’s worried about me even while dying. What a silly succubus.","\"Shut up and let me help you,\" Noah replied, already reaching for healing bread with urgency.","The bread should be able to help her.","Leo whimpered from his corner, the juvenile lion’s instincts recognizing that his Papa’s friend was badly hurt.","Outside, Prince Malphas’s voice carried royal fury that penetrated even the shop’s mystical barriers.","\"This isn’t over, Black Visage! You cannot hide forever!","Shopkeeper Noah, you are committing treason by helping the crown enemy survive. Return me Black Visagr, and I will overlook your act.\"","The royal guards began establishing a perimeter around the shop, their formation suggesting a siege rather than a simple arrest attempt.","They’re not leaving. We’re trapped. Well, who cares? It’s not like I need food from the outside or anything.","Lola’s eyes fluttered as consciousness wavered from blood loss and magical exhaustion. Her grip on Noah’s hand weakened with each passing moment.","She’s fading. Time is running out.","\"Stay with me,\" Noah urged, breaking the healing bread into manageable pieces. \"You’re going to be fine.\"","\"I-it’s too late... the healing bread won’t be enough. I’ve lost too much blood. You idiot... you shouldn’t have gotten involved.\" Lola smiled weakly before coughing up more crimson that stained her lips.","Her face was growing paler by the second, and so was Noah’s as panic set in.","She’s dying. Actually dying in my arms.","\"Shut up! I will save you,\" he declared with a grim look on his face, his mind racing through every possible option.","Current items won’t work. Healing bread is not for critical injuries like the one she is suffering from. Iced tea enhances mana, not life force. Protein bar and energy drink are useless here.","His mind processed the crisis with crystalline clarity. Only one avenue remained—the shop slot system that had provided his premium products.","The next item. Please let it be something that can save her.","Noah’s consciousness dove into the system interface with desperate urgency.","[Item 3: Beef Jerky]","[Description: Increases Vitality attribute by 50% for twenty minutes. Permanently increases Vitality attribute by 10 upon first consumption.]","[Price: $300,000]"]},{"number":129,"title":"Chapter 129: A bond, Beef Jerky","paragraphs":["Vitality enhancement. That’s exactly what she needs!","Noah’s eyes widened with relief so intense it felt like a cold shower in the middle of summer. Without a moment’s hesitation, he activated the purchase.","[You have successfully purchased the item <Beef Jerky>]","The package materialized on his shelf instantly. Noah lunged for it with speed, tearing open the wrapper with his hands.","But as he turned back to Lola, another crisis became apparent. Her consciousness was flickering in and out like a dying flame. Her jaw had gone slack, and swallowing reflexes were failing.","She can’t chew. She’s too weak to process solid food.","Lola’s breathing grew shallower with each passing second. Blood continued seeping from her wounds despite the healing bread’s efforts.","With no time for alternatives. Noah made a decision that broke the barriers between him and the succubus. He bit off a piece of the beef jerky and began chewing with determination. Just like the protein bar, the effects would only take place once the item was swallowed, unlike the iced tea and energy drink, which were instantly absorbed.","I’m about to feed a succubus mouth-to-mouth.","The jerky softened under his persistent chewing until it reached a consistency that could be swallowed safely. Noah positioned himself over Lola’s barely conscious body.","Here goes everything.","He pressed his lips against hers, transferring the processed beef jerky along with whatever enhancement it contained. The contact was intimate despite its real urgency. He knew that it was only for saving her, but the contact was intimate, regardless.","Please work. Please save her.","Lola’s eyes fluttered open as the vitality enhancement hit her system like lightning. Colour began returning to her pale features as the beef jerky restored her health.","But Noah felt the transfer’s cost immediately. Energy drained from his body as Lola’s succubus nature responded to intimate contact with instinctive feeding.","She’s pulling life force. Can’t help her nature during physical contact.","The irony wasn’t lost on him—saving her life was literally costing him his own vitality. But watching colour return to her cheeks made the sacrifice feel worthwhile.","Noah immediately withdrew from the exchange. Had he not done so, the succubus might’ve sucked his life force to death.","Lola’s breathing stabilized as the beef jerky’s permanent and temporary effects took hold. Her wounds began closing at accelerated rates while enhanced vitality restored what blood loss had taken.","Twenty minutes of enhancement plus ten permanent vitality points. She’s going to survive.","\"Noah...\" Lola whispered, her voice carrying strength that hadn’t been there moments before.","\"Don’t talk, just focus on healing,\" Noah replied softly.","Noah knew that he had lost the auto-maker for the item. He had not sold the item and made Lola use it without paying. This meant that he would need to purchase the item a second time to have the opportunity of getting the auto-maker.","But seeing her get better was worth it. Money could come and go, but Lola’s life couldn’t. As much as he hated to admit, he had a soft spot for the succubus, just like Alissa, Kip and the others in Esta.","She’s alive. That’s all that matters.","Outside, Prince Malphas continued his furious assault on the shop’s mystical barriers, but Noah barely noticed the noise.","...","Five minutes passed before Lola stirred back to consciousness, her ruby eyes snapping open with startled disbelief. The wounds that should have killed her were merely fading scars now, and strength flowed through her body where weakness had dominated moments before.","I’m alive. How am I alive?","Her enhanced senses immediately detected something that made her breath catch. Noah bore the unmistakable mark that only succubi could perceive—the subtle energy signature left behind when her kind drained life force through intimate contact.","The mark. I can see it on his lips.","\"Y-you... kissed me?\" Lola’s voice carried shock that transcended her usual playful confidence.","Noah’s face flushed crimson for a split second before he fought to regain his composure. \"It’s not the way you think it is! I had to feed you something that was chewy and you were unconscious, so I had to transfer the food... you know, more directly.\"","He saved my life through mouth-to-mouth feeding. And I accidentally drained his energy in return.","Lola stared at him with growing understanding, her own cheeks coloring as the implications settled. The mark wasn’t just evidence of energy transfer—it represented something far more significant in succubus culture.","\"You have to take responsibility for me now,\" she whispered in a tone so shy it seemed to belong to a different person entirely.","First energy drain creates a bond. He doesn’t understand what that means.","Noah paused, his enhanced intelligence processing her words with growing alarm. \"Lola! It’s not the time for your teasing. The prince is trying to break in outside.\"","He thinks this is another one of my games.","But Lola’s playful demeanor evaporated as reality reasserted itself. Her gaze shifted toward the window, where the situation had escalated far beyond their initial confrontation.","Prince Malphas no longer stood with just his four royal guards. Dozens of armored figures surrounded the shop in formation that spoke to serious siege tactics rather than simple arrest attempts.","\"This shop of yours is a treasure. Even the prince and all his guards can’t break in.\"","\"It’s good enough. But there is still a problem, you can’t leave this place. They’re surrounding it completely.\" Noah responded.","Lola nodded with acceptance that carried no trace of her usual restlessness. \"It’s okay. As long as I’ve got you as my company, I’m fine.\"","Noah rolled his eyes, thinking that she was still teasing him.","Outside, Prince Malphas’s voice carried royal authority that penetrated even the shop’s mystical barriers.","\"This siege will continue until Black Visage surrenders! No one enters or leaves!\"","Leo walked closer to them, the juvenile lion’s instincts recognising that immediate danger had passed. His golden fur remained slightly bristled, but curiosity was overcoming his caution.","\"Papa, is the scary lady safe now?\" Leo asked with innocent concern.","\"She’s safe,\" Noah confirmed, watching Lola’s expression soften as she noticed Leo’s obvious worry."]},{"number":130,"title":"Chapter 130: A Contract","paragraphs":["\"She’s safe,\" Noah confirmed, watching Lola’s expression soften as she noticed Leo’s obvious worry.","\"Where did you get this Golden Mane? They’re nearly extinct.\" Lola’s expert gaze assessed Leo with appreciation. \"He’s already at apprentice rank too. Based on my knowledge, he should reach adept rank with enough nutrition and hunting.\"","She recognizes Leo’s species and potential. Makes sense for someone with her experience.","\"From Vex,\" Noah explained simply.","Lola nodded with understanding. \"That explains it. That viscount has many rare things.’","\"How did you save me?\" Lola asked, her mind processing the impossibility of her survival. \"The healing bread wasn’t enough for that level of blood loss.\"","\"Beef jerky,\" Noah replied, gesturing toward the empty wrapper. \"Vitality enhancement instead of healing acceleration.\"","Different approaches to the same problem. Enhance the body’s life force rather than just repair damage.","Lola scanned her restored body, testing responses and energy levels. Her eyes widened with recognition as the enhancement’s effects became clear.","\"The effects... they’re identical to the protein bar’s pattern.\" Her voice carried growing amazement. \"This must have been expensive. How much do you want for it?\"","She’s calculating debt.","Noah stopped looking at her, his attention shifting to the window where royal guards maintained their siege positions. \"It’s fine, don’t worry about it. I’ve used it to save your life. I wasn’t expecting anything.\"","Her life was worth more than money. Simple equation.","But Lola shook her head with stubborn determination. \"I refuse to accept charity. Especially not something that valuable.\"","Succubus pride. She won’t accept gifts without reciprocation.","Noah thought about it before sighing. \"Just give me whatever you want.\"","If it makes her feel better about being saved, fine.","Lola checked her dimensional storage with careful consideration. \"You’re a swordsman, aren’t you? I’ve seen you fighting those fireflies.","I have a swordsmanship manual. After comprehending the full techniques, you should be able to become an adept swordsman. Price should be around six hundred golden coins.\"","Adept-level swordsmanship knowledge. That could accelerate my development significantly.","\"Sure,\" Noah agreed.","Lola materialised a tome bound in midnight leather, its pages emanating subtle power. The moment she handed it over, Noah’s system responded immediately.","[Congratulations on your first sale of <Beef Jerky>]","’What? That counts? I thought my chance of receiving the automaker was gone alongside the daily income...that’s pretty good.’","[Level 1 Auto-BeefJerky is now in effect]","[Beef Jerky Income: Tier 4 Swordsmanship Manual]","The daily income is a swordsmanship manual. That’s... not particularly useful. System, change it to dollars. I don’t want a swordsmanship manual every day.","[Done!]","[Beef Jerky Daily Income: $60,000]","Much better. I need more money, I still have to save for my next items, including that Idle Room.","System, can you give me each item’s income separately?","—","[Bread & Iced Tea Daily Income: Demonica Moonburgh ($5,000)]","[Protein Bar Daily Income: Tier 5 Wind Orb ($130,000)]","[Energy Drink Daily Income: $100,000]","[Beef Jerky Daily Income: $60,000]","—","Noah studied the breakdown with a growing understanding of his wealth accumulation. The Demonica plants were multiplying beyond usefulness—he already had five specimens providing enhancement.","Too many plants had diminishing returns on cultivation benefits. System, change the Demonica income to dollars.","With that done, I have three items that give me money daily.","[Energy Drink Daily Income: $100,000]","[Bread & Iced Tea Daily Income: $5,000]","[Beef Jerky Daily Income: $60,000]","Perfect. Now I’m earning $165,000 plus a wind orb daily.","The second wind orb from today’s income waited in his dimensional storage, unused due to the crisis that had consumed his afternoon. Two tier 5 orbs representing accelerated magical development.","Two orbs. Enough to push wind manipulation towards higher levels.","Leo padded closer to Lola, his juvenile curiosity overcoming wariness. \"He’s adorable,\" Lola observed, offering her hand for Leo’s inspection.","\"He’s adorable,\" Lola observed, offering her hand for Leo’s careful inspection.","\"Isn’t he? named him Leo.\"","\"Leo... that’s a nice name.\"","Noah’s expression grew serious as he studied the siege formations outside his window. \"So what’s your plan with those people?\"","Lola’s usual confidence wavered as she considered her options. \"I don’t know, to be honest. I don’t think I can leave.\"","Prince Malphas’s voice suddenly boomed through the mystical barriers, cutting through their conversation with a tone that made the shop’s walls seem thinner.","\"Shopkeeper Noah! Return Black Visage to the royal family immediately! Otherwise, we will bring a Grandmaster to destroy this place. We promise not to hold this act against you, and we’ll provide magical items as a reward for helping with the capture!\"","Grandmaster. That’s an escalation beyond anything I expected.","Lola turned toward Noah with a smile that carried dangerous amusement despite their circumstances. \"They’re planning to bring a Grandmaster here. That means the current king himself. He really isn’t playing around.\"","Her ruby eyes sparkled with mischief that seemed inappropriate given the gravity of their situation.","\"What’s your plan? Are you going to sell me?\"","Noah rolled his eyes with exasperation. \"Don’t be stupid. I wouldn’t have brought you here and saved you if I had the thought of betraying you.\"","Noah approached the window and shouted toward the royal entourage with a volume that carried across the plaza.","\"Shut up! I don’t want to hear your voice! It’s irritating me! You keep barking like a dog—what kind of prince are you? Bring whatever fart you want, I’m not returning anyone!\"","Lola’s eyes widened with genuine shock as the implications hit her like a physical blow. \"You...What you just said...there’s no return from this.\"","He just declared war on the royal family. For me. Lola thought with growing shock.","Noah shrugged with indifference that belied the magnitude of his decision. \"So be it. I’m leaving this place.\"","Time to reveal my exit strategy.","\"Look, do you want to come with me? I’m not staying in this kingdom.\"","Lola’s confusion was immediate and obvious. \"How are you planning to leave?\"","\"I’ve got my ways. Do you want to come? But if you do, you have to sign a contract with me.\""]},{"number":131,"title":"Chapter 131: Lola’s past.","paragraphs":["\"I need you to become an employee. You’ll work in this store with me. You’ll have your own bedroom upstairs. You’ll also be given a daily salary as products from the store—I’m broke, so I can’t give you golden coins.\"","Employee offer to a master-level succubus. This is insane.","Lola’s eyes widened with a shock that transcended her usual composure. The offer wasn’t just employment—it was a partnership, sanctuary, and something approaching permanent alliance.","He’s offering me everything.","Noah continued. \"Once you sign the contract, you’ll stay with me inside the shop and help sell items at certain times based on the agreement. We can keep it part-time—you can pick flexible hours that work for you.","I don’t want you to stay inside the shop and have no life. Of course, you will have time to do whatever master-level mages do.\"","Part-time employment with a master-level succubus. Some job descriptions defy conventional categories.","Noah’s mind reached toward his system interface with growing excitement. ’System, create an employee contract with part-time conditions. Flexible hours. What’s the reasonable payment?’","[You are hiring a master-level mage. Appropriate compensation from your shop inventory would be one unit of each product daily, including future introductions. In return, the employee must work the hours and follow commands within professional boundaries.]","One of each product daily. That’s... generous, but it makes sense.","’Alright, create it.’","The contract materialized in Noah’s hands, its pages glowing with binding magic that spoke to serious supernatural enforcement. He extended the document toward Lola with ceremony befitting life-changing decisions.","\"Read it carefully. This isn’t just a job—it’s a partnership.\"","An employment contract that could reshape her entire existence.","Lola accepted the pages with hands that trembled slightly, her enhanced senses immediately detecting the magical binding woven through every clause. Her ruby eyes scanned each line with growing amazement.","Daily payment: One healing bread, one iced tea, one protein bar, one energy drink, one beef jerky, plus any future products introduced to inventory.","\"This is...\" she breathed, her voice barely a whisper.","Insane. This payment package is absolutely insane.","The numbers blazed through her consciousness with staggering implications. Daily access to permanent enhancement items, healing provisions, and mana restoration. This compensation was something that nobody could give her, only Noah.","He’s offering me wealth beyond every demon’s dreams. As daily salary.","Her eyes continued down the contract, discovering terms that made her breath catch. No fixed duration. Termination requiring only one day’s notice. Work hours completely flexible based on mutual agreement.","He’s not trying to trap me. He’s offering a genuine partnership.","\"The contract doesn’t bind you permanently,\" Noah explained, watching her process the generous terms. \"Just requires fair notice before leaving. I’m not trying to control your life.\"","Professional courtesy rather than supernatural slavery.","Lola’s hands shook as the full scope of his offer crystallized. This wasn’t desperate recruitment—it was someone genuinely trying to help her without expectation of excessive return.","He saved my life, and now he’s offering me safety. Without strings attached.","\"Noah, this payment structure...\" She looked up from the contract with eyes that glistened with unshed tears. \"This is more than generous. This is life-changing.\"","One protein bar alone costs hundreds of coins. Daily access to all products represents thousands in value.","\"You’re worth it,\" Noah replied simply. \"Master-level magical expertise doesn’t come cheap.\"","He values my abilities rather than just seeing me as a charity case.","Lola studied his face, searching for hidden motives or ulterior plans that would explain such extraordinary generosity. She found only genuine concern mixed with practical business sense.","He actually means it. Every word.","\"The shop, the contract says it doesn’t stay in one place,\" she said with growing understanding.","Noah nodded with confirmation that carried weight beyond simple acknowledgement. \"The location changes every ten days, unless I lock the place.\"","\"Where would it go exactly?\" Lola pressed, her mind demanding specifics for such a momentous decision.","Noah shrugged with honest uncertainty. \"I’m not sure myself. Depends on business opportunities and safety considerations.\"","Truth. The system determines locations based on factors I don’t fully understand.","Lola’s ruby eyes flickered with something approaching vulnerability—an emotion rarely seen from someone of her usual confidence.","\"Can we ever return to the demon kingdom? I have... things unsettled here.\"","Things unsettled. That phrase carries more than just casual unfinished business.","Noah studied her face for several seconds, noting the subtle tension that suggested personal stakes beyond simple preference. Whatever kept her tied to this realm ran deeper than normal obligations.","\"We can return later, but that comes with a price to pay,\" he replied carefully. \"If it’s really urgent, we can come back.\"","Dimensional travel isn’t free. I need to spend 2000 shop points to return.","Lola’s expression crumbled slightly as the weight of his offer registered fully. The casual tone couldn’t disguise the expense such accommodation would represent.","He’s willing to pay interdimensional travel costs for my personal business. That level of commitment deserves honesty.","\"You deserve to know why I’m asking for this,\" she said quietly, her usual playful demeanor replaced by something approaching solemnity.","Here it comes. The truth behind her mysterious conflicts with royalty.","\"My name isn’t just Lola,\" she began, her voice carrying the cadence of someone revealing long-held secrets. \"I’m Princess Loliana Lillin, rightful heir to the demon throne.\"","She is a princess? Actual royalty. That explains her conflicts with Prince Malphas.","Noah’s mind processed this revelation with growing understanding of the political complexities that had shaped their relationship.","\"Hundreds of years ago, my family ruled this kingdom with wisdom and justice,\" Lola continued, her eyes distant with memory. \"The Lilin dynasty had maintained peace for centuries.\"","Peaceful rule was overthrown. A political tragedy.","\"But one of the heads of the strongest noble families, King Maltheon—Malphas’s father—orchestrated a coup through betrayal and assassination.\" Her voice hardened with controlled fury. \"He murdered my parents during a supposed peace negotiation with the elves.\"","\"I was twelve years old, hidden in the palace’s secret passages when the slaughter began,\" Lola whispered, her usual confidence replaced by haunting vulnerability."]},{"number":132,"title":"Chapter 132: Contract Signed","paragraphs":["Twelve years old. A child witnessing her family’s destruction.","\"The loyal guards smuggled me out while the palace burned,\" she continued, crimson tears gathering in her eyes. \"I’ve spent years in exile, building strength to reclaim what was stolen.\"","Years of preparation. That explains her master-level abilities and knowledge.","\"Every attack on the current royal family is an attempt to weaken their hold on my family’s throne,\" Lola explained, her voice carrying the weight of generational conflict. \"But I’m not strong enough yet to face King Maltheon directly.\"","She’s been conducting a one-woman war against superior forces. Incredible dedication.","\"When I first approached you, it was because of a prophecy that the bearer would help restore the rightful heir; that’s why I’ve tested you initially.\" She admitted with growing emotion. I hoped you might be the one foretold to help me reclaim my birthright.\"","There is a prophecy?","\"But seeing your weak power and kindness...\" Lola’s voice broke slightly. \"I realised I didn’t want to use you for my vendetta. You deserve better than being dragged into a war that isn’t yours.\"","Noah’s mouth twitched. ’Weakness...that’s rude, but true.’","The weight of her revelation settled between them like a bridge toward understanding. Noah finally comprehended the true scope of what he’d stumbled into—not just random criminal activity, but the last princess of a fallen dynasty fighting to reclaim her heritage.","Royal exile seeking restoration. Her attacks on Prince Malphas weren’t terrorism—they were legitimate attempts to weaken a usurper’s hold on stolen power.","\"I accept,\" Lola whispered, her voice carrying emotion that transcended mere employment agreement.","Without hesitation, she bit her finger and allowed crimson drops to fall onto the contract’s signature line. Her mana flowed into the parchment as a magical binding activated with golden light that filled the shop with warm radiance.","Blood and mana sealing. This becomes a permanent magical law.","[Congratulations! First employee has been signed: Lola!]","[The second floor has been adjusted for enhanced privacy for employee accommodation. Daily payment will be automatically distributed upon completion of work hours. Manual payment management is unnecessary.]","The contract dissolved into particles of light that settled into both their consciousness, creating a permanent connection that transcended simple business arrangements.","Bonded. Permanently bonded through magical employment law.","Outside, Prince Malphas’s voice carried renewed fury that penetrated their sanctuary with threats of escalating the response.","But inside the shop, Princess Loliana Lilin had chosen a new path that led away from endless war toward something approaching hope.","After finalising the contract with Lola, Noah gestured toward the staircase leading to the shop’s second level. \"Come on, let me show you the upstairs. It’s going to be your residence after all.\"","They climbed the stairs together, Leo bounding ahead with excitement at exploring new territory. The second floor had transformed dramatically since Noah’s last visit, evolving beyond simple living quarters into something approaching luxurious accommodation.","The system really did make it privacy-friendly.","Loliana’s designated room featured its own private bathroom, complete with amenities that seemed impossibly advanced for a medieval magical society. The design aesthetic blended comfort with functionality in ways that defied conventional architecture.","Modern conveniences in a demon kingdom.","The rest of the floor had been configured as a comfortable lounge area, with the idle room positioned strategically to one side, the design allowed privacy to Lola while allowing access to the Idle room without disturbing her. Everything felt spacious despite the building’s modest external dimensions.","Dimensional expansion at work. Bigger inside than outside.","Loliana examined her new quarters with obvious surprise, her ruby eyes taking in details that seemed to fascinate rather than merely impress her.","\"This design... I’ve never seen anything like it,\" she murmured, running her fingers along surfaces that were smoother than anything medieval craftsmanship typically produced.","The succubus approached her bed with curious appreciation, settling onto the mattress to test its comfort. Her expression transformed as premium materials provided support that exceeded royal accommodations.","\"This is incredibly comfortable,\" she declared with obvious satisfaction.","Then her ruby eyes fixed on Noah with familiar mischief returning to her expression. \"Want to join me and test it properly?\"","There’s the teasing. Back to normal, Lola’s behaviour.","Noah coughed awkwardly before retreating toward the staircase. \"I’ll leave you to get settled.\"","Loliana’s chuckle followed him down the stairs, carrying amusement at his predictable reaction to her flirtation.","Some things never change. Crisis or not, she can’t resist teasing.","Back on the main floor, Noah began preparations for departure. Although one day remained before the system’s forced relocation, current circumstances demanded immediate action.","Royal siege plus a grandmaster on the way equals time to leave.","But as he arrived down at the first floor, movement outside the window caught his attention. Familiar faces had joined the crowd of spectators surrounding the royal cordon.","Vex. And several other regular customers.","Viscount Vex stood among the gathered demons, his expression carrying genuine concern rather than mere curiosity. Precious perched behind his ear, her needle-sharp teeth clicking with obvious agitation.","They’re worried about me. Actual concern from customers who’ve become something approaching friends.","Other familiar faces dotted the crowd—demons who’d purchased his products regularly, building relationships that transcended simple commercial transactions.","Time for farewells. But careful ones that don’t implicate them in my escape.","Noah opened his shop window just enough to project his voice toward the gathered crowd.","\"Thank you all for your patronage!\" he called out, deliberately avoiding specific names. \"Business circumstances require immediate relocation, but your support has been appreciated!\"","Generic farewell that doesn’t associate anyone with helping me escape.","Vex’s expression showed understanding rather than confusion. The viscount recognized diplomatic language when he heard it.","He knows I’m protecting them from royal retribution.","Other customers nodded with similar comprehension, their faces carrying disappointment mixed with relief that their shopkeeper had found escape routes.","They understand. Good customers who won’t face consequences for my actions.","But as Noah prepared to activate the system’s relocation function, new commotion erupted outside. The royal guards snapped to attention suggesting someone of ultimate authority had arrived."]},{"number":133,"title":"Chapter 133: Grandmaster’s arrival","paragraphs":["A figure emerged from the dispersing crowd with a presence that dominated the whole crowd. Power radiated from his body like heat from a furnace, and every demon in the vicinity lowered their heads in respect immediately.","The only demon grandmaster. King of the demon realm.","The ruler of the entire demon kingdom had arrived personally, his expression carrying fury that transcended mere royal displeasure. This was an existential threat to his authority.","No negotiations. No diplomatic solutions. He’s here to end this permanently.","Without a preamble or royal pronouncement, the Grandmaster raised his hand. Magical energy began coalescing around his fingers with density that made the air itself groan under pressure.","He’s not talking. He’s attacking immediately.","\"System!\" Noah shouted with desperate urgency. \"Transport us to Esta! Now!\"","Although he had faith in the system’s power and his safety. He knew that the surrounding area would be affected. Noah didn’t want that to happen.","Two thousand shop points. Get us out of here!","[Emergency Relocation Activated] [Destination: Esta Kingdom] [Cost: 2000 Shop Points] [Initiating Transport...]","The world dissolved into swirling energy as dimensional barriers collapsed around them. Noah felt the familiar sensation of portal travel, but amplified beyond anything he’d experienced before.","Lola walked beside him as the transport effect encompassed the shop’s entire interior. Leo bounded between them with excited confusion at the sudden spatial displacement.","Everyone accounted for. We’re actually escaping.","The king’s eyes spotted the change. He immediately deactivated his attack, making it disappear.","The shop building remained physically present, but its magical essence had departed entirely. What was left appeared to be ordinary architecture rather than Noah’s shop.","Empty shell. The real shop travelled with us.","The Grandmaster frowned, to teleport with so many things, this required either a legendary treasure never seen before or power that he didn’t dare imagine.","\"Malphas...tell me everything about this shop, I want no details left.\" The king looked at his son with a frown that made Malphas gulp.","\"Yes, your highness.\" Malphas nodded before relaying everything.","...","[Transport Complete] [Welcome to Esta Kingdom] [Shop Relocation Successful]","Inside Esta, Noah found himself in the same abandoned alleyway where he’d first established his shop—the exact location where he’d met Valeria nine days ago.","Same buildings, same architectural style. But something’s completely different.","Surprisingly, the area was no longer abandoned. The narrow alleyway that had once been a forgotten corner of the city now bustled with commercial activity that transformed the entire atmosphere.","In the nine days I was gone, this place became a thriving marketplace.","Shops lined both sides of what had been empty space, their signs and busy entrances creating a vibrant commercial district. The distinctive architectural style of the original buildings remained unchanged, but their lower floors had been completely renovated into various retail establishments.","The upper floors maintained their original appearance—weathered stone and traditional Esta craftsmanship that spoke to centuries of history. But ground level had been transformed into bakeries, weapon shops, food vendors, and general merchants that catered to the city’s growing population.","Someone invested serious money in developing this area. I wonder why they chose this specific location.","Lola looked around with obvious curiosity, her ruby eyes taking in the human kingdom’s architectural differences compared to Sin City’s demonic aesthetics.","\"You’ve taken me to the human kingdom, huh?\" she asked with interest rather than concern. \"Is this where you come from?\"","Noah shook his head while continuing to survey the transformed alleyway. \"This is the city of Esta, capital of the Kingdom of Durenholde.\"","Not my original home, but the first place my shop landed in.","\"No, it’s not where I come from. But you are indeed right, this is the human kingdom.\" Noah responded.","Lola nodded with understanding, her attention shifting between human merchants and customers. The cultural differences were immediately apparent to her.","Whether it was their clothing or the way they interacted, it was different.","’System,’ Noah thought with growing confusion, ’are we really in the same location? This looks completely different.’","[Yes, Host. The exact coordinates match your previous shop location. Development occurred during your absence, hence your confusion.]","’Nine days. They transformed an abandoned alleyway into a commercial district in nine days. That’s incredible construction speed, although it makes sense considering that magic is a thing in this world. Plus, they didn’t fully renovate the place, they just adjusted what was already there.’","Noah approached his shop’s entrance with growing anticipation. The familiar door stood ready to welcome customers, but the surrounding environment had changed beyond his recognition.","Time to see how Esta reacts to my return.","He opened the door, and immediately dozens of eyes turned toward him with expressions that cycled through recognition, shock, and growing excitement.","They know me. That’s... unexpected. I don’t remember serving any of them.","\"That’s the mysterious shopkeeper!\" one merchant called out with obvious enthusiasm. \"The one who freed the genius mage Kip and his sister, the legendary swordsman Alissa!\"","I freed them? How do they know that I freed Kip and Alissa from slavery?","The news spread through the crowd like wildfire. Several people immediately broke away from their shopping activities, running toward a section of the city with urgent purpose.","\"It’s really him!\" another voice confirmed. \"The magical bread seller!\"","Magical bread seller. That’s my reputation in human territory, I wonder what they will call me with all of the different items in store now, Noah thought with a wry smile.","Noah stood frozen with confusion as recognition washed over the assembled crowd. His brief interaction with Kip and Alissa had apparently become a legendary story during his absence.","What exactly happened after I left?","But the crowd’s reaction shifted quickly from amazement to commercial opportunity. Human merchants and customers began approaching with eager expressions.","\"Do you have the healing bread?\" one adventurer asked with desperate hope.","\"What about the mana enhancement drinks?\" a mage added, his robes indicating guild affiliation.","They know about my old products. Word spread far beyond my original customers. It seems like business is going to thrive in Esta."]},{"number":134,"title":"Chapter 134: Giving back.","paragraphs":["A woman with obvious injuries on her body emerged from the crowd. \"Please, sir, my husband needs healing that normal potions can’t provide. Our household has been affected by the growing attacks of demons, please...\"","Noah’s mind raced through the implications as more people gathered around his shop entrance. His reputation had apparently grown during his absence, creating a customer base he hadn’t expected.","Lola watched the human crowd with fascination. Her expression suggested amusement at the cultural differences in shopping enthusiasm.","\"I do have healing bread and iced tea available,\" Noah announced, his voice carrying over the growing crowd.","Noah walked back into his shop and emerged with a loaf of bread.","The woman’s face brightened in happiness; she knew that the bread was by no means cheap. \"Thank you, thank you so much! We will never forget this favour of yours!\"","Noah nodded.","\"Do you have anything you can give me for this bread?\" He asked, although he wasn’t sure if she did.","The woman’s hands stopped moving towards the bread. She had thought it was an act of kindness from his side, but after asking for golden coins, she realised it wasn’t.","Her shoulders drooped visibly. \"I-I don’t have any golden coins, sir.\"","Noah shook his head at her response. \"I never asked for golden coins, I’m asking for anything. Anything you can give, even if it’s a pebble on the street.\"","I want to gain shop points whilst also helping her. A transaction is considered a transaction, no matter the price.","The woman nodded excessively, rummaging through her pockets with trembling hands.","After a few seconds, she found a small button she had found on the floor the other day.","\"Does this work?\" She asked, extending her hands with the button on her palm.","\"Yes, that works,\" Noah smiled, taking the button from her hand and exchanging it with the loaf.","\"Thank you, sir! I will never forget your kindness.\" She smiled before leaving the place and heading to her injured husband.","...","Others began approaching with desperate steps, hope written across their faces. Word had spread through the human settlements about a shopkeeper whose products could heal injuries that conventional medicine couldn’t touch. And with him finally back, they rushed towards him like flies when they see food out in the open.","An elderly man hobbled forward on a wooden stick that he used as a crutch, his leg bearing obvious signs of poorly healed wounds. \"Sir, please. The demon attacks left me unable to work. My family is starving because I can’t provide for them.\"","Noah studied the man’s condition with perception that revealed malnutrition alongside his injuries. The bread would help both problems simultaneously.","He needs healing and nutrition. Two problems, one solution.","\"What can you offer?\" Noah asked gently.","The old man’s face fell with embarrassment. \"I... I have this.\" He produced a worn leather cord from his pocket, the kind used to tie simple bundles.","\"It’s not much, but it’s all I have.\"","\"That works perfectly,\" Noah smiled, accepting the cord and handing over a golden loaf. \"Thank you for your business.\"","Noah had no issue doing so. He gained shop points whilst providing help to those in need. In his eyes, it was a win-win transaction.","The man’s eyes filled with tears as he clutched the healing bread like sacred treasure. \"Bless you, sir. Truly bless you.\"","A young mother approached next, carrying a child whose arm hung at an unnatural angle. \"Please, my daughter fell during the evacuation. The bone won’t set properly.\"","A broken bone that healed incorrectly. The bread should be able to correct that.","\"What do you have to trade?\" Noah asked, already knowing he’d accept whatever she offered.","The woman reached into her bag and produced a handful of wildflowers her daughter had picked before the injury. \"She wanted to give these to someone kind. Will they work?\"","Flowers from an injured child. How could I refuse?","\"Absolutely.\" Noah accepted the small bouquet with a ceremony befitting their emotional value.","He took a small sniff of the makeshift bouquet before smiling. \"These are beautiful, they smell really good.\"","The pattern continued as more desperate families approached. Noah established prices based on each person’s circumstances rather than arbitrary monetary values. A farmer’s handful of seeds bought healing for infected wounds. A seamstress’s spare thread purchased recovery from demon-inflicted burns.","I’ve made incredible money in the demon kingdom. The daily income of hundreds of thousands. I can afford generosity.","Each transaction generated shop points while providing genuine aid to people who’d been caught in conflicts beyond their control. The shop points gained satisfied his business instincts while the humanitarian results fed his conscience.","It’s not like I’m going to do this forever. And I don’t have much stock anyway.","Noah glanced at his remaining inventory—roughly ten loaves left after his generosity spree. Enough to help the most desperate cases without depleting his entire production.","Limited supply means careful selection. Help those who need it most.","Inside the shop, Lola watched the proceedings with fascination that transcended her usual amusement at human behaviour. Her expression was that of genuine respect for Noah’s approach to business ethics.","The succubus had concealed herself with subtle magic that made human eyes slide past her presence without conscious recognition. Against ordinary humans with no magical sensitivity, the illusion was flawless.","Lola knew that humans and demons had complicated relationships due to the extremists’ attacks. In her eyes, it was better to avoid unnecessary conflicts for Noah.","Her ruby eyes tracked each transaction with interest, noting how Noah evaluated each customer’s needs and resources before establishing fair exchange rates.","He’s not just giving things away randomly. There’s a method to his generosity. She thought with a smile on her face.","A blacksmith approached, his arms covered in blistered burns, red, cracked skin marred by the signature scorch of fire. The damage was fresh, the kind of injury that lingered and ruined the coordination.","For a blacksmith, that meant losing their job."]},{"number":135,"title":"Chapter 135: Alissa and Kipp","paragraphs":["\"Sir,\" the man said quietly, \"these wounds... they’re not healing right. They’re affecting my ability to work.\"","Noah studied him without expression. \"What can you trade?\"","The blacksmith reached into a small pouch and pulled out a single iron nail. It was rough, simple, but well-forged.","\"It’s just practice work,\" he said, offering it with both hands. \"But it’s made with honest skill.\"","Noah’s brows lowered. His voice turned sharp.","\"You’re telling me you’re a blacksmith and you’re offering a nail ? Unless you have a very good reason for why that’s the best you can provide, I won’t just reject your offer, I’ll make sure you never buy from me again.\"","He folded his arms, his frown deepening.","\"I help those who need it, not those who try to take advantage. A previously working blacksmith should have more than this. You’ve likely crafted dozens of weapons. Where are they?\"","The blacksmith’s eyes widened in alarm.","\"Sir, please. Let me explain. This is a misunderstanding.\"","He bowed his head respectfully, voice low but steady.","\"I’m just an apprentice. I’ve never made anything beyond Tier 1 weapons, and those I sell the moment they’re finished. My earnings go straight to rent, tools, and food. I don’t keep a stockpile. I barely keep anything at all. This nail was the only piece I had left. It was the first thing I’ve ever made. Whilst its monetary value is low, its value to me is high.","A few nearby people who had overheard nodded and stepped forward.","\"He’s telling the truth,\" one of them said. \"We’ve seen him work. He’s not a fraud.\"","\"He sells everything he makes,\" added another. \"Never seen him with more than scraps in his pockets.\"","Noah’s expression shifted. The hard edge in his eyes softened.","He gave a slight nod, exhaling slowly.","\"I see. I thought you were trying to scam me. I’m sorry for the accusation.\"","The blacksmith shook his head at once, clearly taken aback.","\"No need to apologise, sir. You have every right to be cautious. I’m indebted to your generosity, not entitled to it.\"","Noah nodded once more, this time with a hint of respect in his gaze.","\"In that case, I’ll give you what you need. We’ve got to take care of those wounds. There’s no point in reforging blades if your own hands are breaking.\"","Noah provided the blacksmith with his loaf and moved on to the next customer.","But as Noah prepared to help the next customer, two familiar figures emerged from the crowd in the distance. His hand stopped midway to providing another loaf as recognition hit him like a physical blow.","Alissa. Kip.","The cat-girl and cat-boy looked exactly as he remembered, but much more powerful. Alissa’s silver ears twitched with alertness while her lean frame carried the confident bearing of someone whose swordsmanship had reached high levels.","Kip walked beside her with mana swimming around his body, power that hadn’t been there during their last meeting.","They’ve grown stronger. Much stronger.","Their expressions shifted from casual observation to complete shock as their enhanced senses identified the familiar human distributing magical healing.","\"Noah?\" Alissa’s voice carried disbelief mixed with joy that made her entire face light up.","\"Is that really you?\" Kip added, his young voice climbing several octaves with excitement.","The crowd around Noah noticed the reunion developing, stepping back to provide space for what was clearly a significant personal moment.","\"Alissa! Kip!\" Noah’s professional demeanour cracked completely as genuine emotion emerged.","Alissa bounded forward with feline grace, her enhanced agility carrying her through the crowd faster than human eyes could track. But she stopped just short of actual contact, uncertainty flickering across her features.","She wants to hug me but doesn’t know if it’s appropriate. Still the same thoughtful girl.","\"We placed some people here, just in case you came back, to inform us about your return. We gave them details on what you look like, your shop and what you sell,\" she explained.","That’s... touching and terrifying.","Noah will give the last loaf before ending the charity giveaway.","The remaining crowd watched with anticipation as Noah reached for his final healing loaf. A young woman with a bandaged leg stepped forward, her hopeful expression mixed with the resignation of someone accustomed to disappointment.","\"Last one,\" Noah announced, handing her the golden bread with the same care he’d shown every previous recipient. \"Make sure to eat it all.\"","End of charity supplies. Time to focus on the reunion with my old friends.","The woman accepted the loaf with gratitude that transcended mere words, clutching the magical healing like the treasure it essentially was. Around them, the crowd began dispersing with satisfied murmurs about witnessing genuine generosity.","\"That’s all for today,\" Noah called to the remaining hopefuls. \"I’ll be back tomorrow with more supplies.\"","Noah gestured toward his shop entrance, noting how Alissa and Kip’s enhanced senses were already scanning the building because of its new changes.","\"Come inside. We have a lot to catch up on.\"","Alissa and Kip followed him through the entrance, their movements those of experienced adventurers who’d learned to watch each other’s backs. The transformation from worried children to capable warriors was remarkable.","What’s more shocking to Noah was that it had happened in nine days. In those nine days that he was gone, Alissa and Kip had grown even more terrifying than him.","They’ve grown into proper fighters. It seems like Valeira’s training alongside the academy has paid off.","But the moment the door closed behind them, both cat-siblings froze with battle-ready tension. Their senses had detected something that triggered immediate combat instincts.","Alissa’s hand moved to her sword hilt with fluid grace while mana began crackling around Kip’s fingers. Both had achieved adept rank capabilities that made them genuinely formidable opponents.","In the corner of the shop, Lola remained seated with that familiar predatory smile that suggested she found their reaction entertaining rather than threatening.","\"Demon,\" Alissa hissed, her silver ears flattened against her skull in aggressive display."]},{"number":136,"title":"Chapter 136: Catching up with the twins.","paragraphs":["\"Master-level aura,\" Kip added, his young voice carrying deadly serious analysis. \"Very dangerous.\"","Both siblings shifted into combat stances with synchronized precision that spoke to countless hours of joint training. Alissa’s blade emerged from its sheath while Kip’s magic intensified into visible energy patterns.","\"Wait!\" Noah stepped between them immediately, his speed allowing him to intercept their assault preparations. \"Stop! She’s with me!\"","Alissa’s eyes widened with confusion rather than compliance. \"Noah, that’s a demon! A powerful one!\"","\"Master-level succubus,\" Kip corrected, despite knowing her power. That didn’t reduce his readiness. \"She is extremely dangerous to humans.\"","\"I know what she is,\" Noah replied with calm authority. \"Her name is Lola, and she’s... It’s complicated.\"","Lola’s smile widened with obvious amusement at the description. \"Complicated. I like that.\"","\"Lola, you are not helping defuse the situation. Stop.\" Noah rolled his eyes at her remarks.","\"Noah,\" Alissa said carefully, her sword remaining drawn but not actively threatening. \"What do you mean she’s with you?\"","How do I explain succubus politics, royal conflicts, and the extremists?","\"It’s a long story,\" Noah began diplomatically.","Kip’s magical aura flickered with uncertainty.","After explaining everything, such as his visit to the demon kingdom, Lola’s help with his shop and his growing power, the twins sort of understood.","\"Long story short,\" Noah continued. \"The important thing is that Lola isn’t a threat. She’s been... protective, actually.\"","Lola’s expression softened slightly at the description, though her predatory smile remained firmly in place.","\"You trust her?\" Alissa asked with the directness that had always characterized her approach to complicated situations.","Noah glanced toward Lola, remembering her refusal to enter his shop until forced by mortal injury and his action of bringing her inside, her concern about involving him in royal politics, and her willingness to die rather than compromise his safety.","Do I trust her? That’s... actually a good question.","\"Yes,\" he said simply. \"I trust her.\"","...","\"I can’t believe this. The demons are not our enemies? There are extremists among them and they attack both of our kingdoms. Also, I can’t believe that there are people with power inside Esta who are benefiting from this—despicable people!\"","Alissa’s voice carried genuine anger that went beyond her usual composed demeanour. The revelation that their kingdom’s war was built on manipulation rather than genuine demon aggression had shaken her worldview completely.","Noah nodded in agreement. \"The problem is that I still don’t know who is behind them. All I know is that they must be people of power.\"","Political corruption at the highest levels. There are always people who benefit from perpetual war between kingdoms.","Kip’s young face twisted with disgust. \"Using innocent deaths for profit. That’s evil beyond anything.\"","\"I’ve tried to gather more information, but it was difficult, \" Noah promised. \"For now, we need to focus on what we can control here.\"","Lola had remained unusually quiet during the political discussion, her ruby eyes tracking the conversation with interest rather than her typical amusement.","She’s evaluating them. Probably deciding whether they’re trustworthy allies.","\"Enough politics for now,\" Noah decided, shifting to lighter topics. \"Tell me about your training. How have you both progressed?\"","Alissa’s expression brightened with pride mixed with determination. \"I’ve reached the adept level in swordsmanship and been accepted as a core member in Valeria’s guild.\"","Adept-rank. She’s advanced significantly since I left.","\"And I’ve achieved Adept rank in elemental magic,\" Kip added with obvious satisfaction. \"My fire magic can now create sustained flame constructs.\"","Both siblings advancing rapidly. Their potential was always extraordinary.","\"That’s incredible progress,\" Noah said with genuine admiration. \"You’re both becoming formidable.\"","A golden blur suddenly emerged from behind Noah’s legs, drawing startled gasps from both siblings. Leo bounded forward with typical enthusiasm, his small size making him appear harmless despite his nature.","\"Papa, who are these people?\" Leo asked with innocent curiosity.","\"Leo, meet Alissa and Kip,\" Noah explained. \"They’re dear friends of mine.\"","Both siblings stared at the talking lion with expressions that cycled through shock, amazement, and growing delight.","\"He’s adorable!\" Alissa exclaimed, her warrior composure cracking completely.","\"I’ve seen one of his species in the academy before! That’s Golden Mane Lion cub,\" Kip breathed with excitement. \"I’ve read about them but never seen one in person. They are extremely good at hunting, whilst having an immense potential of reaching the adept or master rank under good conditions. \"","They recognize his species. Impressive education at the magical academy.","Leo preened under their attention, his tail wiggling with pleasure. \"I like them, Papa!\"","\"Can I pet him?\" Alissa asked with the enthusiasm of someone encountering legendary cuteness.","\"Leo decides that,\" Noah replied diplomatically.","The juvenile lion bounded toward Alissa with obvious approval, allowing her to scratch behind his ears while purring like an oversized house cat.","\"His magical aura is incredible,\" Kip observed with analytical fascination. \"He’s only juvenile stage but already carries apprentice-level power.\"","\"Leo’s special,\" Noah agreed, watching his companion bask in the attention.","Alissa and Kipp nodded in agreement.","Alissa looked around the transformed space with obvious amazement, her eyes tracking the elegant display cases, expanded floor area, and professional lighting that made Noah’s shop feel like a legitimate magical establishment.","\"This place looks incredible!\" she exclaimed. \"It’s completely different from when we last visited. You must’ve expanded a lot.\"","\"Business growth required improvements,\" Noah replied with satisfaction at her reaction.","He moved toward his premium product displays, retrieving two protein bars.","\"Here, take these. They’re nutritional supplements that will help with your training. You guys are still young and growing, you need all the good stuff you can take,\" Noah offered one bar to each sibling with a smile on his face.","Lola’s ruby eyes widened with genuine shock as she watched him distribute legendary-tier enhancement items like casual snacks. Her expression carried disbelief that someone would give away items worth tier 5 treasure status, for free.","He’s giving them protein bars worth tier 5 artefacts like they’re cabbage. This man’s generosity defies all logic, insane."]},{"number":137,"title":"Chapter 137: Protein Bar","paragraphs":["\"Thank you,\" Alissa said politely, unwrapping her bar.","Kip followed suit, examining the unusual texture and subtle glow before taking his first bite.","The effects hit both siblings as they simultaneously gulped down the bites.","Their eyes widened in shock as power flooded through their systems like liquid lightning. The strength stored inside the bar multiplied their existing strength. Their attributes increased, adjusting to accommodate the improvement.","The protein bars are working exactly as intended.","\"What... what is this?\" Alissa gasped, staring at her hands as if they belonged to someone else.","\"I feel incredible,\" Kip breathed, his young voice carrying awe.","Lola stepped forward with a soft, satisfied smile on her face, clearly enjoying their shocked expressions. \"Those are protein bars that provide permanent strength enhancement plus temporary fifty percent improvement. Each one is worth approximately one thousand golden coins.\"","Here comes the price reveal. This should be entertaining. Lola thought, a soft smile on her face.","Both siblings froze as the astronomical figure registered. Kip’s face went pale while Alissa’s mouth fell open with horror.","\"A THOUSAND GOLDEN COINS?\" Kip shrieked, immediately sticking his finger down his throat. \"I need to vomit this up! There’s a fortune in my stomach!\"","Noah stepped forward with gentle laughter, stopping Kip’s desperate attempts at regurgitation. \"It’s fine! Don’t worry about the cost. I have more coming. Besides, if you vomit it out, it will only mess up the store floor. It’s not like I will be able to sell it after that, haha.\"","Both siblings stared at him with expressions that cycled through gratitude and amazement.","\"Noah,\" Alissa whispered, her usual confidence replaced by shy appreciation. \"We... we can’t accept gifts this valuable.\"","Everything they’ve achieved could be attributed to Noah’s help.","Kip nodded frantically. \"You saved our lives, introduced us to Princess Elara and Valeria, gave us opportunities we never could have earned alone, and now this...\"","Recognition of compound generosity. Some friendships involve serious investment.","\"You’ve changed our entire lives,\" Alissa continued, her voice carrying emotion that made her composure crack completely. \"We owe you everything.\"","\"Thank you,\" she said shyly, the words carrying weight that transcended simple gratitude.","Noah nodded with a soft smile before walking to the twins and rubbing their heads with each hand. \"You guys deserve that much, you’ve suffered a lot.\"","Alissa and Kipp lowered their heads, fighting back tears. Noah was right, they had suffered a lot since they were young.","Some investments pay dividends in human development rather than monetary returns.","Lola observed this exchange with a growing understanding of Noah’s character. His generosity toward allies revealed principles that transcended simple profit maximization.","...","Suddenly the shop door opened with familiar energy that made Noah’s face brighten with genuine joy. Valeria and Princess Elara entered together, their expressions carrying urgency mixed with relief.","\"Noah! You’re back!\" Elara’s voice carried the excitement of someone who’d missed a valued friend.","Noah smiled warmly at their arrival. \"Good to see you both again.\"","My first friends in this world. It feels good to have them here.","But their expressions shifted immediately as they noticed Lola’s presence. The succubus sat casually beside Noah, her ruby eyes sparkling with amusement at the humans’ obvious discomfort.","Here we go again.","Valeria’s hand drifted toward her sword hilt with wariness. \"Noah, who is—\"","\"It’s complicated,\" Noah interrupted gently.","Lola sighed at the predictable encounter, her usual confidence dimmed by recognition of the problems her presence created.","\"I’m causing you a lot of trouble, aren’t I?\" She glanced toward Noah. \"Maybe I should’ve stayed on the second floor.\"","Noah shook his head firmly. \"It’s fine. This is a misunderstanding that needs clearing up anyway.\"","Time to explain everything. Hope they can handle the truth.","\"This is Lola,\" Noah began carefully. \"She’s a master-level succubus who’s been helping me in the demon kingdom. She taught many things about magic, combat, and the conflict between our kingdoms. It isn’t what we think it is.\"","Elara kept her expression neutral despite obvious shock. \"What do you mean? Can you explain?\"","\"The demons aren’t our true enemies,\" Noah continued, watching their faces carefully.","\"How can they not be our enemies? They are literally attacking our kingdom as we speak.\" Elara frowned.","Noah nodded. \"I haven’t finished explaining. What I wanted to say is, there is a radical faction called extremists attacking both sides to maintain permanent warfare. Someone’s profiting from the conflict while both kingdoms suffer.\"","Princess Elara’s composure cracked as the implications hit her. As heir to the throne, she’d witnessed her father’s frustrated peace attempts and growing desperation to end the bloodshed.","\"Extremists manipulating both sides,\" Elara repeated slowly. \"That would explain why every peace initiative fails. But how do you know this?\"","\"I’ve encountered them personally. They attacked me and Lola during a trip outside the city. They’re powerful, organised, and completely hostile to both humans and demons that do not follow their ideals.","They think that humans are a lesser species and that they should be enslaved or killed. Fortunately, the demons didn’t agree with their ideologies. This led to their banishment from the demon kingdom, and ever since then, they’ve been attacking both sides.\"","Valeria’s mind immediately grasped the truth behind Noah’s words. \"If this is accurate, it means some of our noble families might be benefiting from continued warfare.\"","\"Precisely what I’m thinking,\" Noah confirmed. \"Someone’s making money while people die needlessly.\"","Elara nodded in understanding, although she was still curious about something. \"How come she speaks the human tongue? Demons were known to be unable to learn our language.\"","Good question. Language barriers were supposed to be absolute.","\"She’s a master-level mage,\" Noah explained with a casual shrug. \"She learned from listening to me speak. Something about mana signatures making language comprehension possible.\"","Elara nodded with acceptance. Master-level practitioners operated beyond normal limitations in most areas.","But her attention shifted as she spotted the abundant iced tea display. Her expression brightened with obvious recognition and anticipation.","Her favourite product. Some things never change."]},{"number":138,"title":"Chapter 138: Back to business.","paragraphs":["\"I want to buy those. All of them,\" Elara smiled with royal decisiveness.","Before Noah could respond, Valeria interrupted with competitive urgency. \"Sorry, Princess, but I need to buy some too. My guild needs those enhancement effects too, we’ve been venturing out lately.\"","\"Calm down, both of you,\" Noah intervened with diplomatic authority. \"Each of you can have twenty-four pieces. You can have bread as well, but this can’t be hoarded. These resources must go toward protecting people.\"","\"Of course!\" both women replied simultaneously, their competitive tension dissolving into a shared purpose.","They settled into comfortable conversation as the shop’s atmosphere relaxed into familiar patterns. But Elara’s enhanced magical perception immediately detected the unusual energy emanating from Noah’s corner displays.","\"These are incredible,\" she breathed, studying Moon and Star with obvious fascination. \"I’ve never seen anything like these plants. The mana ambient they’re producing is extraordinary.\"","Noah’s memory sparked with sudden recollection. His storage ring contained gifts he’d been saving for exactly this reunion.","Perfect timing. I kept some Demonica Moonburghs specifically for them.","\"I got you both something,\" Noah announced, reaching into his dimensional storage with anticipation.","He withdrew two perfectly cultivated Demonica Moonburghs, their silvery leaves shimmering with contained mana that made both women’s magical senses tingle with recognition.","He had kept the demonica’s as his daily income stream instead of the $5,000 for this moment, he knew that they were going to like the gift.","\"These are for you,\" Noah said, presenting one plant to each woman. \"They’ll enhance your magical development slightly. You guys are already at the adept rank, so they will barely help you.\"","Elara accepted her gift with a large smile on her face. \"Thank you for the gift!\"","Valeria studied her plant with personal gratitude. \"This will be an amazing addition to the guild’s headquarters. Thanks again.\"","After handing the girls their two gifts, Noah turned back to the twin cats.","\"Here you go, take this. It will help you,\" Noah said casually, withdrawing the Wind Orb from his storage ring as if he were offering candy rather than legendary treasure.","The orb itself was modest in size, no larger than a child’s fist, but the energy contained within made the air itself seem more alive. Even after Noah’s extensive use for training, the concentration of wind essence remained staggering.","The amount of wind concentration in that orb was astounding.","Kip’s young face went completely pale as he recognised the item that Noah was handing him. His hands trembled as they accepted the small orb, his magical senses screaming warnings about the sheer power he now held.","A Tier 5 orb. They only have two at the academy.","Elara’s royal composure cracked entirely, her mouth falling open in undisguised shock. As someone with access to the kingdom’s greatest treasures, she understood exactly what Noah had just casually given away.","\"Noah...That’s... that’s a Tier 5 elemental orb,\" she whispered, her voice carrying the tone of someone witnessing the impossible.","Her shock was reasonable, the item that Noah was casually giving away was a treasure that the academy of Esta treated like precious pearls that appeared once every millennium.","Valeria’s instincts recognised legendary equipment when she saw it, her experienced eyes tracking the wind swirling within the sphere. Her guild had attempted to acquire such artefacts for years without success.","\"Those are worth their amount in blood,\" she breathed, her usual confident demeanour replaced by genuine awe.","...","Alissa’s reaction was the most dramatic. The young swordswoman lunged forward with a desperate, urgent look on her face, her hands reaching for the orb as panic overwhelmed her rational thought.","\"M-Master N-Noah, this is too much!\" she fumbled, trying to take the artefact from Kip’s trembling grasp. \"You can’t just give away something this valuable!\"","But Noah shook his head with gentle firmness, his expression carrying the patience of someone who’d grown accustomed to such reactions.","\"This is his belonging now. I gave it to him,\" Noah stated with a tone that brooked no argument. \"He told me he’s an elemental mage with wind affinity. He’ll need this more than anyone else here.\"","Kip’s young voice cracked with emotion as he struggled to process the magnitude of the gift. \"But Master Noah, at the academy, only the top students get to use these for five minutes. Just five minutes, and that’s considered the highest honour, that very few have gotten in the past century!\"","Lola observed the scene from her position near the counter, her ruby eyes sparkling with amusement at everyone’s reactions. Having witnessed Noah’s casual use of legendary artifacts for basic training, she found their shock both understandable and entertaining.","If those two girls knew about the protein bar that he had fed the twin-cats earlier, they’d probably faint.","\"The Academy of Sina hoards their two orbs like religious relics,\" Elara added, her royal education providing context for the artifact’s true rarity. \"Students compete for years just to touch one briefly.\"","Valeria nodded with grim understanding. \"My guild’s been trying to acquire even a damaged orb that’s a tier 3 for twenty years. The waiting lists span decades.\"","Twenty years of effort just to buy one lower-tier orb.","Noah’s response sent another shockwave through the assembled group. \"It’s really fine, I have another one for myself too.\"","Without ceremony, he withdrew a second Wind Orb from his storage ring, its energy signature higher than the first. The casual revelation that he possessed multiple Tier 5 artifacts made the room fall into stunned silence.","Two Tier 5 orbs. He has two of them.","\"Don’t worry about it,\" Noah continued with the same nonchalant tone he might use to discuss the weather. \"Use it well. When you need another one, come and ask me. I’ll give you one.\"","He’s offering unlimited access to artifacts that kingdoms fight wars over.","He patted Kip’s head with gentle affection, the gesture so normal it created surreal contrast with the legendary treasure the boy still clutched.","Elara stood there shocked, unable to utter a word.","The training she had gotten as a royal had prepared her for many diplomatic situations, but the casual distribution of priceless artefacts wasn’t covered. Her magical senses confirmed these weren’t replicas or inferior copies—they were genuine Tier 5 elemental orbs of the highest quality."]},{"number":139,"title":"Chapter 139: Power","paragraphs":["Alissa continued staring at the orb in her brother’s hands with an expression that mixed joy for his opportunity with terror about the responsibility.","Kip himself remained frozen, his young mind struggling to process the magnitude of what had just occurred. The artefact in his hands represented advancement opportunities that could reshape his entire development.","\"Use them for training,\" Noah added casually, \"The essence will help you understand wind magic at the deepest levels.\"","...","Seeing Noah’s gifting power and the way he was casually handing out legendary artefacts, Valeria looked at him with renewed curiosity.","\"How has your sword training been?\" she asked, her green eyes studying him.","Her gaze recognised the significant changes in Noah. Just a few days ago, he was unable to use magic, unable to hold a sword, and only had bread in his store. Now? He was someone else entirely.","Noah smiled with satisfaction that transcended mere confidence. \"It’s been alright.\"","\"Why don’t we test it?\" Valeria suggested, her expression carrying the enthusiasm of a master eager to evaluate her student’s progress.","\"Sure,\" Noah nodded without hesitation. \"Help from an adept swordsman is always appreciated.\"","Time to see how far I’ve actually come.","Before they could leave for training, Noah’s gaze shifted toward Lola, who stood quietly observing their preparations. The succubus’s presence created obvious complications for visiting the human kingdom.","\"What about her?\" Noah asked, gesturing toward Lola while addressing Valeria and Elara. \"How can we hide her identity as a demon?\"","Horns and a tail make the demon identification pretty obvious.","Lola simply smiled with her usual confidence. \"Don’t worry about me. You can go enjoy yourself, and catch up with your friends. I’ll stay upstairs,\"","Noah shook his head with immediate rejection of that plan. \"No. You should come with us. Check out the human kingdom, you might like it.\"","Lola felt something shift in her chest as his words registered. The human standing before her didn’t want her to be lonely. He’d brought her to another place, akin to another world. And was ensuring she felt included rather than abandoned.","Furthermore... that kiss.","The memory of their intimate contact, even born from medical necessity, carried a meaning that transcended simple saving. The bond between them made her senses tingle.","He’s treating me like someone who matters rather than a convenient ally. Lola thought. She had never felt this way in her long years of living.","As a master-level mage who had breathtaking beauty, she knew that had she been acting the way she had with anyone other than Noah, they would have already made a move against her.","But Noah didn’t.","Valeria and Elara exchanged glances before nodding with understanding. \"We can provide a cloak,\" Valeria offered, producing a hooded garment from her storage space.","\"This should cover the horns and tail,\" Elara added. \"Keep the hood up and avoid drawing attention.\"","A simple solution for obvious problems.","The cloak settled over Lola’s distinctive features with concealing effectiveness. Her horns disappeared beneath the fabric while her tail remained hidden under the garment’s length.","\"Perfect disguise,\" Noah declared with satisfaction.","They departed for Valeria’s guild with Leo bounding alongside Noah’s group, the juvenile lion’s excitement infectious as he explored new territory. The Silver Wolf guild’s headquarters appeared ahead.","Time to test my actual combat development.","The guild’s training area featured spacious sparring grounds equipped with various practice weapons and enchantments. Other guild members paused their activities to watch as Valeria led Noah toward the central duelling circle.","\"Standard rules,\" Valeria announced, drawing her blade with fluid precision. \"First to land three decisive strikes or force surrender wins.\"","Noah drew the Zealous Quickblade, feeling its familiar weight enhanced by his improved attributes and magical development. The Tier 2 weapon was no longer the wooden weapon.","Valeria had rejected his choice of wooden swords, saying that they were now past that point. They both knew when a strike was lethal or not.","Time to see how far I’ve actually progressed.","The initial exchanges revealed immediate changes in Noah’s combat effectiveness. His footwork carried the confidence that hadn’t existed during their previous training sessions, while his blade work demonstrated accuracy that surprised even Valeria.","Clang! Clang!","Steel met steel with percussion as they tested each other’s capabilities. But within minutes, Valeria’s experienced eye-detected advancement that defied normal progression timelines.","His form has improved dramatically. And that’s not just technique.","\"You’ve progressed beyond novice rank,\" Valeria observed between strikes, her tone carrying genuine amazement. \"Your power output suggests near apprentice-level capability.\"","\"I’ve been practising,\" Noah replied while parrying another assault.","Understatement. Magical enhancement changes everything.","But what truly shocked Valeria was the subtle energy flowing through Noah’s movements. His strikes carried power that exceeded purely physical enhancement; he was channelling aura with competency that typically required months of dedicated training.","He’s using aura manipulation. How did he learn that so quickly?","\"Furthermore,\" Valeria continued, her attacks intensifying as she probed his defensive capabilities, \"you’re channelling aura effectively. That’s an advanced technique for someone at your experience level.\"","After several more exchanges, Valeria stepped back with an expression that mixed respect and curiosity. \"Use all of your power. I want to see your complete combat potential.\"","All my power. Does she mean...","Noah paused, his enhanced intelligence processing the implications. \"My magic, you mean?\"","Valeria nodded with obvious anticipation. \"Everything. Magic, aura, techniques, show me what you’re really capable of.\"","\"Alright,\" He nodded.","Noah’s stance changed as he activated wind manipulation alongside his aura enhancement. The air around his blade began moving with visible currents while his entire combat presence transformed.","Clang! Whoosh!","The difference was immediate. Noah’s attacks carried elemental force that made Valeria’s eyes widen with genuine shock. His speed increased through wind-enhanced movement while his strikes generated atmospheric pressure.","This is apprentice-rank combat effectiveness. From someone who is only at the novice rank.","\"Incredible, you’re competing at apprentice level while being a novice.\" Valeria breathed as she defended against Noah’s sword work and elemental magic."]},{"number":140,"title":"Chapter 140: Lola’s exploring the human kingdom.","paragraphs":["The sparring match concluded with mutual respect rather than a decisive victory.","\"Your progress is remarkable,\" Valeria declared with professional admiration. \"Most practitioners require years to develop what you’ve achieved in weeks.\"","Noah was crossing ranks.","He was fighting at a level above his own. Even Alissa and Kipp weren’t able to do that at the novice stage. Despite their incredibly fast progress and domination of those at their level. They were unable to cross-rank fight as exaggeratedly as Noah.","Lola watched from the sidelines, her ruby eyes tracking every movement with obvious approval. The human who’d saved her life was proving himself capable of surviving the dangers their partnership might bring.","...","After the training ended, Noah showed Lola around the human kingdom with the enthusiasm of someone sharing his homeland with a valued guest.","The group moved through Durenholde’s streets like an unlikely diplomatic mission. A succubus master-mage, a princess, a guild captain, two cat siblings, and an interdimensional merchant exploring human culture together.","This is probably the strangest tour group this kingdom has ever seen.","\"Try this,\" Noah encouraged, offering Lola a pastry from a local bakery whose reputation had survived generations of taste tests.","Lola bit into the human delicacy with careful curiosity, her ruby eyes widening as unexpected flavours registered. \"This is... remarkably good. Human cuisine tastes really good, although it’s not as good as your loaf of bread.\"","Elara and Valeria had initially maintained a careful distance from the succubus, their instincts warning against casual interaction with master-level demons. But Lola’s genuine interest in human culture, combined with her obvious care for Noah’s interests and recommendations, had gradually worn down their suspicions.","\"The spices are fascinating,\" Lola continued, examining the pastry with appreciation. \"Humans combine flavours in ways that demons rarely consider.\"","They progressed through the kingdom’s highlights.","Beautiful fountains where clear water danced in patterns that delighted children and adults alike, entertainment districts where bards performed stories that had echoed through generations, markets where vendors hawked everything from practical goods to exotic trinkets.","\"Water manipulation for purely aesthetic purposes,\" Lola observed as they paused beside an elaborate fountain. \"Demons use magic for power or survival. This is... beautiful without being functional.\"","Different perspectives on magical application. Demons focus on utility, and humans create art.","Valeria found herself genuinely enjoying the succubus’s company despite every warrior instinct screaming caution. \"You’re not what I expected from a master-level demon.\"","\"What did you expect?\" Lola asked with genuine curiosity.","\"More arrogance,\" Valeria replied honestly. \"Someone who viewed humans as insects.\"","Lola’s laugh carried surprising warmth. \"Power without purpose is just destruction.\"","Elara studied their demon guest with royal fascination that transcended diplomatic protocol. \"Your magical control is remarkable. I can sense the power that could level districts, yet you move through crowds without affecting anyone.\"","\"Control is the difference between a master and a disaster,\" Lola replied with obvious pride. \"Most can unleash destruction. Few can contain it perfectly.\"","She’s demonstrating restraint as a form of showing off. Classic master-level behavior.","As they walked through the market district, Lola suddenly nudged Noah with a subtle touch that immediately caught his attention.","\"Huh?\" He turned to see what she wanted. \"Something wrong?\"","His voice dropped to a whisper as he noticed the tension in her posture.","She nodded discretely. \"That man over there... he has demonic energy around him. He’s been near demons before.\"","Demonic energy. That’s concerning on multiple levels.","Noah followed her gaze toward a well-dressed noble examining silk fabrics. Immediately, he recognised the man in front of him.","Baron Richard. The man who enslaved Kip and Alissa.","Noah’s mind immediately began calculating implications while fighting the urge to jump to immediate conclusions.","\"What if he’s been fighting against them? He could use that excuse, and we’d never be able to prove otherwise. He’ll become more cautious if he knows we’re suspicious.\"","Need evidence, not assumptions. Accusations against nobility require proof.","Lola shook her head with certainty that suggested deeper knowledge than simple energy detection. \"I’m not talking about fighting demons. The energy signature is different... let’s just say he’s been having intimate relations with some demons.\"","Noah’s eyes widened. Intimate contact with demons suggested collaboration rather than conflict, especially given the baron’s history with slavery and exploitation.","That almost confirms his connection to the extremists. But I still can’t accuse a noble without solid evidence.","\"Someone needs to keep an eye on him,\" Noah murmured, his mind already formulating surveillance strategies.","\"I can’t accuse a noble family without concrete proof. And I certainly can’t use you as a valid source of information.\" He smiled wryly.","A succubus’s testimony against human nobility. That would create more problems than solutions.","His smile carried wry acknowledgment of political realities that complicated even obvious conclusions.","Rather than attempting direct confrontation that could alert their target, Noah turned toward the one person present with both authority and resources to handle noble investigations properly.","Time to let royalty handle what requires royal power.","\"Elara...\"","After explaining the situation to Elara, she frowned with the expression of someone whose worst suspicions were being confirmed.","It was true, somebody had indeed been working with the extremists. She didn’t doubt Noah’s words, why would he lie after all. Furthermore, he was telling her to investigate; he wasn’t outright telling her to kill him.","Which ruled out the reason of revenge for enslaving the twin-cats from her mind. Besides, she knew Noah wouldn’t resort to that. He could simply wipe out the baron with his own power. With a master-level demon next to him, there were very few that could stop him, and they wouldn’t be there to.","Her royal training had prepared her to recognise threats to the kingdom, and collaboration between nobility and demon extremists represented exactly the kind of internal corruption that could destroy them from within.","\"I’ll definitely investigate this matter,\" she declared.","Her eyes tracked Baron Richard’s movements with scrutiny, cataloguing every gesture and interaction for future analysis. The casual way he moved through the market, his expensive clothing, his obvious comfort with public visibility—all of it would be noted and investigated.","\"We’ll need to be subtle,\" Elara continued, her voice dropping to ensure their conversation remained private. \"If he’s truly working with extremists, alerting him could compromise ongoing operations.\"","Noah nodded with appreciation for her measured response. \"Exactly my concern. Better to gather evidence quietly than force him underground.\""]},{"number":141,"title":"Chapter 141: Finalising Contract","paragraphs":["After their day together, the sun began to set over Durenholde’s peaceful skyline, painting the kingdom in warm colours that signalled the end of their cultural exchange. The group prepared to part ways with the contentment that came from time well spent among friends.","Noah bid farewell to everyone, including Kip and Aliss, who now had their own house—a modest dwelling that represented their freedom from Baron Richard’s cruelty and their growing independence.","\"Take care of yourselves,\" Noah told the cat siblings with genuine affection. \"And practice with those gifts.\"","\"We will, Master Noah!\" Kip replied with youthful enthusiasm, still clutching the wind orb like a precious treasure.","Alissa nodded with her characteristic seriousness. \"Thank you again for everything.\"","As the others departed to their respective homes, Lola fell into step beside Noah for their return journey. Her cloaked form moved with graceful silence until curiosity prompted conversation.","\"You really like those people, huh?\" she asked, her voice carrying genuine interest rather than teasing.","Noah nodded without hesitation. \"Yeah, they’re cool people. Don’t you think?\"","Lola’s smile remained hidden beneath her hood, but warmth colored her response. \"Indeed, they are.\"","The acknowledgment carried weight beyond simple agreement. For a master-level demon to express approval of humans suggested their group had impressed her with qualities that transcended normal boundaries.","Back at the shop, they settled into discussing practical arrangements for Lola’s employment. The human kingdom presented unique challenges for a succubus seeking legitimate work.","\"Since you can’t show yourself publicly here, and to align with my schedule, I think night shifts would work best,\" Noah suggested. \"Random customers might visit, but it wouldn’t be crowded.\"","Lola considered this proposal with a quick assessment.","\"Let’s change the part-time clause to full-time. The salary doesn’t have to change; I don’t have much else occupying my time anyway. I’ll take the full night shift every day.\"","\"Are you sure? That’s a significant commitment.\"","\"I’m sure,\" she replied with a soft nod.","Noah communicated the arrangement to the system, which promptly updated their employment contract to reflect the new terms. Both parties had agreed to the modification, making the change official and binding.","With employment details settled, Noah retrieved his wind orb from storage and settled into his meditation position. He’d taken most of the day off for socialising, but training couldn’t be neglected entirely.","The orbs’ contained essence responded to his touch with familiar warmth, ready to enhance his magical development through concentrated practice. Two skills demanded attention—mana control and wind manipulation, both required advancement to keep pace with his rapidly increasing swordsmanship talent.","Noah closed his eyes and began the breathing exercises that had become second nature. His consciousness expanded to encompass the orb’s swirling energies while his mana channels opened to receive enhanced instruction.","The training session progressed with satisfying intensity. Each technique felt more natural, each application of power more controlled. The orb’s concentrated wisdom flowed through his magical pathways like liquid knowledge, accelerating development beyond what conventional practice could achieve.","Wind manipulation responded to his will with increasing comprehension. What had once required conscious effort now occurred through instinctive understanding. Breezes obeyed his intentions while air currents formed according to his desires.","Mana control evolved alongside elemental mastery. The raw magical energy that powered all his abilities became more responsive, more efficient. Spells that had previously strained his reserves now felt easier to maintain.","Time passed unnoticed as Noah lost himself in the rhythm of advancement. The orb’s essence gradually dimmed as its stored power transferred to his developing abilities, each absorbed fragment bringing him closer to genuine mastery.","Two hours later, Noah opened his eyes with satisfaction radiating through his enhanced consciousness. The training had yielded excellent results—both targeted skills had advanced significantly.","[Your Mana Control skill has levelled up to level 7!]","[Your Wind Manipulation skill has levelled up to level 6!]","Mana Control had reached Level 7, bringing finer control over mana. Wind Manipulation had achieved Level 6, unlocking new techniques and improving existing applications.","Noah’s eyebrows raised in surprise. His mana control skill has levelled up faster than usual.","\"Lola, why did my mana control increase rapidly? It usually takes longer.\"","Lola smiled before explaining his concerns. \"This is because you are doing twice the work. You are practising control over your mana normally, but you are also practising your wind manipulation, which is also related to having control over your mana. Essentially, you are working on your control twice as much as before, hence the faster improvement.\"","The advancement represented substantial progress toward his long-term goals. Each level brought him closer to the kind of power necessary for protecting himself and building his shop.","Noah didn’t want to simply remain powerful inside the shop. He wanted to go out, explore all kinds of places in the different worlds that he would visit. He didn’t want to just make money, whilst that had been his initial aim. After experiencing the culture of both kingdoms, he wanted to have enough power to protect himself.","Lola observed his training completion with obvious approval. \"Your development rate continues to impress. Most practitioners would require months to achieve what you accomplished in one evening.\"","\"The orbs make all the difference,\" Noah replied honestly. \"Concentrated elemental essence accelerates everything.\"","\"True, but you still need the talent to absorb and apply that knowledge effectively. Not everyone could progress at your rate, even with legendary artefacts.\"","Leo roared cutely in agreement. He agreed with Lola’s words.","Noah laughed and stroked the young lion’s fur.","The compliment carried genuine respect rather than mere flattery. Coming from a master-level practitioner, such acknowledgement held its considerable weight.","Noah stored the slightly depleted orb and prepared for evening routines. Tomorrow would bring new challenges and opportunities, but tonight brought the satisfaction of measurable advancement.","His magical capabilities continued expanding at rates that defied conventional wisdom, supported by artefacts most practitioners could only dream of accessing. The combination of talent, resources, and determination was reshaping him into something beyond normal human limitations.","The iced teas had been sold to Valeria and Lola at a price of five golden coins per bottle. He knew that, unlike the demon kingdom, the humans weren’t as rich and taking so many golden coins from them wasn’t a good idea.","His plan for the human kingdom was simple, gather decent profit whilst focusing on getting the most shop points he could.","Naturally that plan only fell for the bread and iced tea.","As for the other items, there would be a price that needs to be paid."]},{"number":142,"title":"Chapter 142: Progression, Curing illness.","paragraphs":["—","Host: Noah Carter","Age: 28","Shop Level: 2","Daily Revenue: $295,000 (or equivalent)","Current Assets: $73,640.21","Shop Points: 710","Attributes: Strength: 30, Vitality: 4, Intelligence: 20, Agility: 20","Skills: Swordsmanship(Level 7), Mana Control (Level 6), Aura (Level 5), Wind Manipulation (Level 5), Surviving on Ramen (Level 3), Cooking (Level 2), Programming (Level 2), Gaming (Level 2), Finance (Level 2)","—","Inside his house, Noah sat on his sofa, having already wished Lola goodnight before returning to Earth. \"Everything has been going well so far. My progression is advancing, my daily revenue has increased exponentially in just a few days... having more product lines is definitely worth the investment.\"","Two hundred ninety-five thousand daily income.","\"Although one problem still remains,\" he continued, his frown deepening as he considered his status screen. \"My vitality is still pathetically low, and that’s not good. I need to figure out how to improve it. I can’t just have power and speed while getting killed in one hit against something equally powerful.\"","Four vitality points. Everyone else has been progressing while this stays stagnant.","After worrying for a few more seconds, Noah forced himself to let go of the issue. He couldn’t do anything about it currently, and obsessing over uncontrollable factors wasn’t productive.","Focus on what I can influence. Check the auto-maker progress.","—","[Auto-IceTea Maker]","Level: 3","Production Rate: 2 Iced teas every hour","Max Stock: 48","Progress: 148/200","—","[Auto-Baker]","Level: 3","Production Rate: 4 Loaves every hour","Max Stock: 48","Progress: 122/200","—","[Auto-ProteinBar]","Level: 1","Production Rate: 1 bar every 2 hours","Max Stock: 12","Progress: 4/100","—","[Auto-EnergyDrink]","Level: 1","Production Rate: 1 Energy Drink every 2 hours","Max Stock: 12","Progress: 0/100","—","[Auto-BeefJerky]","Level: 1","Production Rate: 1 Beef Jerky every 2 hours","Max Stock: 12","Progress: 0/100","—","The iced tea and bread makers were approaching Level 4 steadily, their progress reflecting consistent sales over time. But the newer products presented a different challenge entirely.","The protein bars, energy drinks, and beef jerky remained at minimal progress levels because their astronomical prices limited the customer base to royalty and master-level practitioners. Most simply couldn’t afford permanent attribute enhancement, regardless of its value.","...","After checking his status and confirming his daily progression, Noah closed the interface with satisfaction. He withdrew the beef jerky from his storage ring, examining the package that held his father’s future wellbeing.","\" With this, Dad’s health problems should finally be resolved permanently.\"","Unfortunately, the hospital had long since closed for visiting hours. The medical facility operated on strict schedules that didn’t accommodate for his own convenient timing.","First thing tomorrow morning. I can’t wait any longer than that. Just in case things go wrong.","\"You will get better, Dad... Tomorrow will be the day when you are finally free,\" Noah whispered to the empty room, his voice quivering softly.","...","The next morning arrived with clarity that made Noah’s mission feel inevitable. He stood outside the hospital’s familiar entrance.","Today changes everything for him.","Taking a deep breath to steady his nerves, Noah entered the medical facility. Room 412 waited ahead, containing the most important conversation.","His father was already awake, sitting upright in bed with energy that had been missing for months. The protein bar’s effects were clearly still providing enhanced strength that transformed his entire demeanor.","\"Noah!\" Alan’s voice carried vigor that made his son’s heart sing. \"You won’t believe what happened with that protein bar you brought me.\"","He’s excited. That’s wonderful to see.","\"Tell me,\" Noah encouraged, settling into the visitor’s chair with anticipation.","\"I’ve been arm wrestling the younger staff,\" Alan said with obvious pride. \"Men half my age, and I’m beating them easily. The nurses are calling it miraculous power, but I know it’s whatever you gave me.\"","The permanent strength enhancement is working perfectly.","Noah laughed with genuine joy at his father’s enthusiasm. \"That’s amazing, Dad. But wait until you try this.\"","He produced the beef jerky with ceremonial care, its packaging emanating subtle warmth that spoke to contained magical properties.","\"This is going to make the protein bar seem like a warm-up,\" Noah promised.","Vitality enhancement on top of strength improvement. He’s going to feel twenty years younger, heck even younger! His vitality will become double mine.","Alan accepted the package without hesitation, his recent experiences having accustomed him to his son’s miraculous nutrition supplements. The wrapper opened easily, revealing jerky that seemed to glow with internal energy.","He trusts me completely now. No questions, just faith in the results.","\"Here goes nothing,\" Alan said, taking his first bite.","The transformation was immediate and overwhelming. Color flooded his features as vitality enhancement coursed through his system like liquid revival. The chronic headache that had plagued him for weeks simply vanished. Bone-deep weakness evaporated as enhanced constitution restored what illness had taken.","His entire body is responding. This is more incredible to witness when a normal human is the one who experiences it. Noah thought, a smile on his face.","\"My vision,\" Alan gasped, blinking with obvious amazement. \"It’s completely clear. The blurriness is gone.\"","Even his eyesight is improving. Vitality enhancement affects everything.","His posture straightened as enhanced constitution eliminated the subtle aches that had become his constant companions. Years seemed to melt away as magical restoration worked through every system.","\"I feel... incredible,\" Alan breathed, flexing his hands with wonder. \"Like my body remembered how to function properly.\"","Perfect response. The beef jerky is working exactly as intended.","Noah’s satisfaction transcended mere filial duty as he watched his father’s transformation.","This wasn’t just healing, it was restoration to a vitality level that exceeded his pre-illness baseline.","Time to make this official.","\"Dad, I need to get the nurses,\" Noah announced, standing up from his seat. \"You should be scanned for everything. If you’re feeling this much better, the medical staff needs to document it.\"","Alan nodded before frowning and grabbing Noah’s hand midway.","\"Son...these things, they might get you in trouble. Don’t tell any of the doctors about it, neither will i.\"","Noah turned to look back at his dad before laughing.","\"Alright, dad.\""]},{"number":143,"title":"Chapter 143: Alan is Healed","paragraphs":["Medical confirmation will validate what we both know happened. It will also make sure that the beef jerky had fully healed his dad from his illnesses.","Noah approached the nurses’ station calmly. He didn’t show the confidence he felt about his father’s health.","The shift supervisor, was nurse Martinez.","\"Nurse Martinez, my father in room 412 is feeling significantly better. I think he should be examined comprehensively.\"","Nurse Martinez’s eyebrows rose with interest.","Patients always came up to the nurses in charge to let them know about the improvement of their health. They always had the hope of cure, when in reality it was merely a placebo effect.","\"Better how? What kind of improvements are we talking about?\"","It was the standard medical skepticism. They’ve seen too many false hopes after all.","\"His headaches are gone, vision has cleared completely, and his energy levels have increased dramatically,\" Noah explained. \"He feels like a different person.\"","The nurse’s expression shifted from polite attention to genuine concern. \"Those are significant changes. When did this improvement begin?\"","\"Within the last few days, he has just kept it to himself for verification,\"Noah replied.","Had he said the improvement began minutes ago, the nurse would just casually dismiss him. After all, such illnesses don’t clear overnight, or at all.","Nurse Martinez stood, her medical training overriding skepticism when faced with reported symptom changes. \"I’ll get Dr. Thompson immediately. Rapid improvement can sometimes indicate...\" She paused, clearly reluctant to voice concerning possibilities.","The nurse didn’t have the thought of cure in her mind. In fact, she was worried about false improvement before crash.","\"We’ll want to run a full battery of tests,\" she continued, already moving toward his father’s room. \"Blood work, neurological assessment, cardiovascular function—everything.\"","\"Of course,\" Noah agreed. \"Whatever’s needed to confirm his improvement.\"","Dr. Thompson arrived within minutes, his expression carrying the focused attention of someone responding to unusual patient developments. The examinations that followed was thorough, methodical, and increasingly amazed.","They were discovering that everything has actually improved.","Some healing happened gradually through medicine and therapy.","Other restoration arrived through magical enhancement that defied every medical expectation.","Today had definitely delivered the latter.​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​","...","The doctors completed their examinations with expressions that cycled through amazement, confusion, and professional bewilderment. Dr. Thompson reviewed the test results multiple times, as if expecting the numbers to change when he wasn’t looking.","\"Everything looks... remarkably good,\" he announced with shock. \"Better than good, actually. Your test results are showing improvements across every major health indicator.\"","\"However,\" Dr. Thompson continued with appropriate caution, \"given the rapid nature of these changes, I’d recommend keeping you here for another day or two. We want to run additional tests to ensure this improvement is stable.\"","It was standard medical protocol. They need to verify that there was no issues such as equipment failure or simply human error.","Alan nodded silently at Noah, his expression conveying complete understanding of the medical team’s concerns. The improvements felt permanent to him, but professional confirmation would benefit everyone involved.","\"Of course, Doctor,\" Alan replied with cooperation. \"Whatever you think is necessary.\"","Noah spent another hour with his father, discussing everything except the true source of his miraculous recovery. Their conversation covered family matters, future plans, and the simple joy of seeing genuine health restored after such a long period f decline.","Finally, Noah departed, he still had many things to do. He left the hospital with relief flooding through his body like warm sunlight after endless storm clouds.","...","Back home, Noah’s excitement about his father’s recovery had suppressed his appetite all morning. But with crisis resolved and adrenaline fading, hunger finally reasserted itself with growing insistence.","Time for actual breakfast. My body needs fuel after all.","He prepared a simple meal while his mind processed the morning’s success. Eggs, toast, coffee—normal food that provided ordinary nutrition rather than magical enhancement.","As he ate, Noah retrieved the items he’d saved from yesterday’s shop inventory. The beef jerky and energy drink sat on his kitchen table like concentrated potential waiting to be unlocked.","Time to claim some enhancement for myself.","Without hesitation, he opened the energy drink and consumed its contents in steady swallows.","The effect was immediate and exhilarating, agility enhancement flooding through his system like lightning through copper wire.","Forty-five agility points total. This is incredible.","His reflexes felt supernatural, reaction time approaching inhuman levels that made every movement feel effortless.","The temporary fifty percent boost stacked atop his permanent improvement made such a number possible.","Twenty minutes of peak enhancement. I should test this properly.","Noah stood and moved through his kitchen with fluid grace that would have impressed Master Tanaka. Every gesture carried perfect timing, every step landed with optimal positioning.","This is what forty-five agility feels like. It’s incredible.","But he knew the effect would fade to thirty points within twenty minutes, leaving only the permanent improvement from his first energy drink consumption.","Still incredible. Thirty permanent agility is superhuman by any measure.","The beef jerky remained on the table, its wrapper emanating subtle warmth that promised vitality enhancement. But Noah’s strategic thinking overrode immediate gratificatio usage.","Keep it for later. I want to increase my base vitality to twenty before consuming permanent enhancement.","His current vitality of four represented a glaring weakness in his otherwise high attribute spread. Bringing it to twenty through other means before claiming the beef jerky’s ten-point bonus would maximize his long-term development.","Noah carefully stored the beef jerky in his dimensional ring, saving it for when the enhancement would provide maximum benefit rather than partial improvement, that would keep his vitality behind.","—","Host: Noah Carter","Age: 28","Shop Level: 2","Daily Revenue: $295,000 (or equivalent)","Current Assets: $238,640.21","Shop Points: 710","Attributes: Strength: 30, Vitality: 4, Intelligence: 20, Agility: 30 (+15)","Skills: Swordsmanship(Level 7), Mana Control (Level 7), Wind Manipulation (Level 6),Aura (Level 5), Surviving on Ramen (Level 3), Cooking (Level 2), Programming (Level 2), Gaming (Level 2), Finance (Level 2)"]},{"number":144,"title":"Chapter 144: Dojo","paragraphs":["After eating breakfast and drinking the energy drink, Noah headed to the dojo. Musashi’s dojo, where Master Tanaka was still teaching him swordsmanship.","Arriving there in his GT-R after a thirty-minute drive, Noah got off and walked in. He spotted Master Tanaka sitting there in a cultivating position, clearly relaxing whilst the other students were practicing.","Spotting him, the other students all gave him a nod before continuing their practice.","Naturally, Noah was now considered the second-highest position in the dojo despite his short tenure. He’d only been there for a few days, but he was still the second-best after Master Tanaka.","Noah was now considered the golden disciple.","Tanaka opened his eyes and stood up with a smile to continue their session.","\"Ready for today’s lesson?\" the master asked, his dark eyes studying Noah’s posture with assessment.","\"Always,\" Noah replied as he prepared to do his physical warmup.","As they began their warm-up exchanges, Tanaka’s eyebrows rose with growing amazement. Noah’s swordsmanship had indeed improved slightly, but his physical prowess was something that approached his own!","Whoosh!","Noah’s first strike cut through the air with a velocity that made several students pause their own training. The wooden blade moved faster than most eyes could track, creating a sharp whistle as it displaced the atmosphere.","Crack!","Tanaka’s counter-strike met Noah’s attack with precision, but the master’s expression betrayed surprise at the sheer force behind the blow. The impact reverberated through both practice swords, sending vibrations up their arms.","\"Your speed...\" Tanaka murmured, adjusting his grip as they circled each other. \"It’s increased dramatically since yesterday.\"","Swish! Clang!","Their blades met in a rapid exchange, Noah’s enhanced agility allowing him to press attacks that would have been impossible just days before. Each strike flowed seamlessly into the next, creating a blur of motion that captivated everyone watching.","\"Look at him move,\" whispered one of the intermediate students, his own wooden sword forgotten in his hands. \"It’s like he’s dancing.\"","\"Dancing with death,\" corrected a senior practitioner, her eyes wide with admiration. \"Master Tanaka’s actually having to try now.\"","Whoosh! Thwack!","The master’s counterattack came with decades of refined technique, but Noah’s supernatural reflexes allowed him to not only block but transition into an aggressive combination that pushed Tanaka backwards.","\"Incredible,\" breathed another student. \"He’s making the master retreat!\"","Clang! Swish! Crack!","The wooden swords collided in rapid succession, each impact producing sharp reports that echoed through the dojo. Noah’s enhanced strength made every strike carry weight that forced Tanaka to adjust his defensive positioning.","\"Your power output,\" the master observed between strikes, his voice carrying genuine amazement.","\"It rivals my own in my prime. How is this possible? You’ve just started your journey, I already knew that you had terrifying physical prowess since we met, but your growth is meant to stagnate, you...you are just getting even better without any sign of stopping.\"","Whoosh!","Noah’s diagonal cut sliced through the air with such force that the displaced air created a visible disturbance. Tanaka barely managed to intercept the strike, the impact making his grip strain against the wooden handle.","Crack! Clang!","\"He’s keeping up with Master Tanaka!\" exclaimed a young woman near the weapons rack. \"I’ve been training here for years, and I’ve never seen anyone match the master’s casual speed, let alone his maximum speed!\"","The sparring intensified as both fighters found their rhythm. Noah’s supernatural capabilities allowed him to keep pace with decades of refined skill, while Tanaka’s experience provided lessons that challenged every aspect of Noah’s developing technique.","Swish! Whoosh! Thwack!","Their blades met in a complex sequence that had the watching students holding their breath. Noah’s enhanced agility let him flow between offensive and defensive positions with fluid grace, each movement perfectly timed to complement the last.","\"Look at his footwork...Every step is perfectly placed. No wasted motion,\" observed a senior student with fascination.","Clang! Swish!","Tanaka’s approval was evident in his smile as Noah executed a perfect riposte that nearly broke through the master’s guard. \"Excellent, Noah! You’re integrating power with technique beautifully! You are not just using your sheer power to break through my defences, but you are enhancing your technique.\"","Whoosh! Crack!","The pace accelerated dramatically as both fighters pushed their capabilities. Noah’s wooden sword moved with a velocity that created sharp whistles, while Tanaka’s decades of experience allowed him to predict and counter attacks that should have been impossible to see coming.","\"They’re moving so fast I can barely follow,\" whispered one student, his voice filled with awe at the sight before him.","\"This is what real mastery looks like...Something that many of us will probably never achieve in our lives,\" added another, watching the display with rapt attention.","Swish! Clang! Thwack!","Noah’s combination attack came in three flowing strikes.","High, middle, and low strikes, each transition seamless and perfectly timed.","The enhanced agility from his energy drink consumption made movements that typically required years to master feel natural and effortless. His agility not only increased his speed, but also his reflexes, his flexibility, his dexterity, everything that required years of training and honing.","Crack!","Tanaka’s defensive sequence met each strike of Noah’s with a strike of his own. Despite keeping up with Noah, the master’s expression showed genuine strain for the first time in years.","Noah’s powerful physical prowess and skill were forcing him to access skills he hadn’t needed since his competitive prime.","\"Master Tanaka’s actually being challenged!\" gasped a student who’d been training at the dojo for over a decade. \"I haven’t seen him move like this ever! Noah is really pushing him to his limits!\"","Whoosh! Swish!","Their wooden blades created a rhythm of collision and separation, each exchange flowing into the next.","Noah’s reflexes allowed him to respond to Tanaka’s legendary technique, while his improved strength let him match the master’s legendary power.","Clang! Crack!","\"Your development defies explanation,\" Tanaka admitted between rapid strikes, his breathing showing the first signs of exertion.","Thwack! Whoosh!","Noah’s response came in the form of a spinning attack that utilised his full agility enhancement, the wooden sword creating a complete circle that forced Tanaka to step back and reassess his defensive strategy."]},{"number":145,"title":"Chapter 145: Golden disciple","paragraphs":["\"Did you see that technique? That spinning strike was flawless, it looks like it came out of a damn movie!\" exclaimed one of the watching students, his jaw nearly touching the floor.","\"He made it look effortless,\" added another voice filled with admiration. \"I’ve been trying to master a much simpler version of that move for years!\"","Swish! Clang! Crack!","The final exchange came in a burst of motion that showcased both fighters at their peak. Noah’s supernatural capabilities met Tanaka’s lifetime of refined skill in a display that left every watching student speechless with admiration.","Whoosh!","Both wooden swords stopped simultaneously, their tips mere inches from each other’s throats in perfect mutual finish.","The dojo fell into awed silence as master and student regarded each other with mutual respect born from genuine challenge and skilful response.","\"Magnificent,\" Tanaka declared, lowering his practice sword with obvious satisfaction at the fight. \"You’ve achieved something remarkable today, Noah. You’ve made an old master remember why he fell in love with the sword.\"","The assembled students burst into spontaneous applause, their voices carrying admiration for a display of swordsmanship that few would ever witness again.","They all wish they had the same talent as Noah.","Each student watched the dojo’s golden disciple with expressions that mixed inspiration with honest envy for abilities that seemed to transcend normal humans.","...","After the training, Noah smiled at the notification he had received. After training his swordsmanship so much, he had increased its level once again. It has become level 8!","He was approaching apprentice rank in swordsmanship, only two levels left, or so he could feel.","[Your Swordsmanship skill has levelled up to Level 8!]","Finally. All that intensive sparring with Master Tanaka, Valeria and fighting those tier 1 fireflies has paid off.","The improvement felt substantial; his muscle memory had evolved to incorporate techniques that previously required conscious effort. Every stance felt more natural, every strike carried improved precision.","Two more levels until apprentice rank. At this rate, I might reach it within the week.","—","Host: Noah Carter","Age: 28","Shop Level: 2","Daily Revenue: $295,000 (or equivalent) C","urrent Assets: $258,640.21","Shop Points: 1110","Attributes: Strength: 30, Vitality: 4, Intelligence: 20, Agility: 30","Skills: Swordsmanship(Level 8), Mana Control (Level 7), Wind Manipulation (Level 6), Aura (Level 5), Surviving on Ramen (Level 3), Cooking (Level 2), Programming (Level 2), Gaming (Level 2), Finance (Level 2)","—","[Auto-IceTea Maker]","Level: 3","Production Rate: 2 Iced teas every hour","Max Stock: 48","Progress: 168/200","—","[Auto-Baker]","Level: 3","Production Rate: 4 Loaves every hour","Max Stock: 48","Progress: 142/200","—","[Auto-ProteinBar]","Level: 1","Progress: 4/100","—","[Auto-EnergyDrink]","Level: 1","Progress: 0/100","—","[Auto-BeefJerky]","Level: 1","Progress: 0/100","—","Arriving back home, Noah checked his status with growing satisfaction. His money had increased to its current amount because of the daily income of $295,000 that came from his various product streams.","Let’s see... $5,000 from the bread and iced tea, $100,000 from the energy drink, $60,000 from the beef jerky, and $130,000 from the protein bar. The numbers are incredible. He had also received the third wind orb, which was stored in his storage ring.","The daily revenue represented more money than most people earned in years, all flowing passively while he focused on personal development.","Furthermore, it seemed like Lola had managed to sell twenty items each from both the tea and bread during her night shift. This increased his shop points by 400 overnight! He had placed both the bread and iced tea at 5 golden coins each—a reasonable price that balanced accessibility with profitability in the human kingdom.","Twenty bread loaves and twenty iced teas at 5 coins each. That’s 200 golden coins total, worth about $20,000. Not bad for a single night.","Noah couldn’t help but smile at Lola’s sales performance. The succubus had proven herself an excellent employee, managing to move significant inventory despite working the typically slower night hours.","Unfortunately, she was unable to sell the energy drink and beef jerky. But the lack of sales for the premium items made perfect sense when Noah considered the economics involved.","The prices are astronomical for average citizens.","The beef jerky, energy drink, and protein bar represented luxury items that only royalty, wealthy merchants, or master-level practitioners could afford. Rarely did people in the human kingdom possess such disposable wealth, and they certainly wouldn’t be shopping for magical enhancement items during nighttime hours.","Humans mostly conduct business during morning and afternoon hours in the Kingdom of Esta. The fact that Lola sold twenty bread and iced tea during the night shift is actually shocking and excellent news.","The sales pattern revealed something important about his customer base. People desperately needed healing and mana restoration—basic survival necessities that justified spending their limited resources even during unconventional hours.","Bread and tea serve immediate practical needs. The premium items are aspirational purchases that require planning and significant financial commitment.","Noah’s shop points had swelled to 1,110, putting him closer to his goal of upgrading to Shop Level 3, which required 10,000 points total. The steady accumulation meant he was making real progress toward expanding his business capabilities.","At this rate, I’ll reach 10,000 shop points within a week or so. Maybe sooner if I can maintain these sales volumes.","The auto-maker’s progress showed his bread and iced tea production approaching Level 4, which would significantly increase their output rates and maximum storage capacity. More production meant more potential sales, creating a positive feedback loop for his business growth.","Level 4 auto-makers will double my production capacity. Perfect timing as demand continues increasing.","Meanwhile, his premium products remained at Level 1 due to their limited customer base, but Noah wasn’t concerned. The profit margins on those items more than compensated for lower sales volumes.","Quality over quantity.","The financial security brought by his shop allowed Noah to focus on personal development without constantly worrying about debt collectors or medical bills, or any worries on earth. His father’s health has improved dramatically, his own combat capabilities were advancing rapidly, and his daily income exceeded most corporate executives.","Life has definitely taken a turn for the better."]},{"number":146,"title":"Chapter 146: Overnight, Solving the low vitality.","paragraphs":["Noah used the portal and arrived back at the shop when Lola’s shift was nearly meant to end.","He spotted her behind the counter wearing what seemed like an apron—a crisp white garment that gave the shop a distinctly more professional appearance.","Noah chuckled before saying, \"Where did you get this from?\"","She looked incredibly cute in the uniform. Furthermore, she was no longer hiding herself under a cloak. She’d decided to wear a head scarf that simply covered her horns, while her tail remained concealed beneath her carefully arranged clothing.","\"Why are you laughing at me?\" Lola’s ruby eyes flashed with indignation mixed with embarrassment.","\"I personally left to commission this apron from one of those human craftsmen, to make your shop more professional. I saw many ladies wearing these at their stalls yesterday, so I decided to wear one. I shall remove it since you don’t wan—\"","She pouted as she attempted to untie the apron strings, her expression carrying wounded pride at his apparent disapproval.","\"No, no, it looks really good on you. Keep it, thanks for taking care of the shop.\" Noah raised his hands to stop her from removing it.","She nodded with a smile that brightened her entire face, clearly pleased by his approval.","\"Your shop is really magical,\" Lola began after tying her apron back. \"The items just randomly appear on the shelves. I can’t even track where they come from. They just materialise out of thin air. Also, I’ve sold twenty loaves of bread and twenty bottles of iced tea throughout the night.\"","She launched into a detailed account of her evening’s work, describing each customer interaction with obvious enthusiasm. A guild member seeking healing supplies, a late-night mage needing mana restoration, several guards purchasing provisions for extended patrols, and various other nocturnal customers who’d discovered the shop’s unusual operating hours.","\"The healing bread was particularly popular,\" she continued, her voice carrying satisfaction. \"Word seems to be spreading about its effectiveness. Three different customers mentioned hearing about it from friends or neighbours.\"","Noah smiled through her report, not wanting to interrupt despite already knowing the sales figures from his system interface. Her genuine excitement about contributing to the business was endearing, and her insights about customer behaviour proved valuable for understanding market dynamics.","She’s really taking this job seriously. More than just going through the motions...she is cute.","His shelves were at full stock for everything—bread, iced tea, protein bars, energy drinks, and beef jerky, all displayed in neat arrangements. Clearly, the sales hadn’t come all at once, but at intervals that allowed the auto-makers to restock continuously throughout the night.","Perfect timing. The production systems kept pace with demand exactly as intended.","\"And the energy drinks?\" Noah asked, though he already knew the answer.","Lola’s expression dimmed slightly. \"No sales on those, or the beef jerky and protein bars. The prices are simply beyond what those night customers can afford. But several people asked about them with obvious interest—they just lacked the necessary funds.\"","As expected. Premium items require premium customers.","Noah then told her that her shift was over and she could do whatever she liked for the rest of the day.","She nodded with understanding, then surprised him by settling into one of the customer chairs rather than heading upstairs or leaving the shop entirely.","Noah raised an eyebrow. \"Don’t you want to go out or do something? Explore the human kingdom, maybe visit those craftsmen again?\"","\"Do what?\" Lola’s smile carried familiar mischief as she leaned forward in her chair. \"I would rather be next to you~\"","She winked with the charm of a beauty who knew exactly how her flirtation affected people.","Noah rolled his eyes with exaggerated exasperation.","This succubus never stops teasing.","Despite his mock annoyance, Noah couldn’t deny that having Lola’s company had become surprisingly comfortable. Her presence added warmth to the shop that went beyond a simple business partnership.","At least she’s taking this seriously. And the apron really does make her look adorable.","\"Whatever pleases you, you are free to leave whenever you want. But if you’re staying, I need your help with something.\"","Lola’s grin widened with obvious satisfaction at achieving her goal of remaining close to him. \"Of course, boss. Whatever you need.\"","Noah’s heart sped up for a moment before he forced himself to calm down. The way Lola said ’boss’ with that particular tone made his pulse quicken in sinful ways.","\"I need your help regarding my vitality. It’s extremely low compared to my other aspects, such as my mana, strength, or speed. How can I improve it?\" He said, immediately trying to cloud those thoughts with his current problem.","Lola’s expression shifted from playful to genuinely interested as she processed his request. Her ruby eyes studied him with the gaze of someone assessing a serious problem rather than engaging in casual flirtation.","\"I see, this is quite a common issue among people who focus heavily on offensive capabilities,\" she nodded with understanding. \"The fix is pretty simple—you just need to temper your body.\"","Body tempering. That sounds... intense.","\"What exactly does that involve?\" Noah asked, settling into the chair across from her.","Lola leaned forward, explaining. \"Body tempering is the process of conditioning your physical form to withstand greater stress and recover more efficiently. It’s different from simply building strength or speed.\"","She gestured toward his torso with her slender fingers. \"Your current vitality means your body lacks the resilience to handle sustained damage or recover from serious injuries. Even with your impressive strength and agility, a well-placed strike could still prove fatal.\"","Exactly what I was afraid of..the glass cannon syndrome.","\"The tempering process involves exposing your body to controlled stress, not enough to cause permanent damage, but sufficient to trigger adaptive responses,\" Lola continued. \"Think of it like building calluses, but for your entire constitution.\"","Noah nodded in understanding. The theory of constantly putting your body under stress, in order to evolve, made sense in his mind. \"What kind of controlled stress are we talking about?\""]},{"number":147,"title":"Chapter 147: Body Tempering","paragraphs":["\"What kind of controlled stress are we talking about?\"","\"Several methods exist,\" Lola replied, counting on her fingers. \"Extreme temperature exposure, sustained physical exertion beyond normal limits, controlled magical energy circulation through your meridians, and certain activities that naturally stress the cardiovascular system.\"","I’m not going to ask about that last one.","\"The magical energy circulation sounds most appealing,\" Noah said quickly. \"How does that work?\"","Lola’s laugh carried genuine amusement rather than her usual seductive undertones. \"Practical choice. Magical tempering involves channelling your mana through pathways that normally wouldn’t handle such energy flow. It’s safer than the physical methods but requires precise control.\"","She stood and moved closer, her presence radiating the confident authority of someone explaining their area of expertise. \"With your current mana control level, you should be able to attempt basic tempering exercises without risking serious injury.\"","Level 7 mana control should provide sufficient precision for safe practice.","\"The process is simple in concept but requires discipline in execution,\" Lola continued. \"You circulate mana through places that mana doesn’t usually flow through your body, but at intensity levels that stress your constitution without overwhelming it.\"","Noah nodded with growing interest. \"How long does it typically take to see results?\"","\"That depends on your natural resilience, how consistently you practice, and your talent,\" she replied. \"However, given your talent in everything. You will probably learn it within a few hours and see results within a few days. \"","\"However, improper technique can cause internal damage that’s difficult to heal. You’ll need guidance until you develop proper instincts.\" Lola’s tone carried an appropriate warning.","Noah’s eyes brightened with realisation of what she was offering. \"You’re volunteering to supervise my training?\"","\"Consider it part of my employee duties,\" she replied with a smile.","\"Besides, I have years of experience with magical body tempering. I’d rather keep my boss alive and healthy~\"","\"When can we start?\" Noah asked, his eagerness to address his vitality weakness overriding any concerns.","Lola’s ruby eyes sparkled with approval at his immediate commitment to improvement. \"Right now, if you’re ready. The first lesson involves understanding your current energy pathways.\"","She gestured toward the shop’s back area, where they could practice without interruption from potential customers. \"We need to close the shop for a while. Otherwise, if you were interpreted randomly, it might give you a backlash. It’s not worth the risk.\"","Noah nodded in understanding, immediately heading to the door, before turning the open sign to closed. He decided to delay selling for an hour, based on his knowledge of his talent, it wouldn’t take him more than an hour to learn the skill, maybe even less.","\"We’ll start with basic circulation exercises, nothing dangerous, just mapping your natural mana flow patterns.\"","Noah stood, following her toward the designated training space. \"What should I expect to feel during the process?\"","\"Initially, just warmth as mana moves through unfamiliar channels,\" Lola explained, settling into a meditation pose. \"As we increase intensity, you’ll experience something like internal stretching, not painful, but definitely noticeable.\"","Internal stretching. That doesn’t sound too intimidating.","\"The key is maintaining steady circulation without forcing the process,\" she continued. \"Think of it like learning to swim—you work with natural currents rather than fighting against them.\"","Noah settled into his own meditation position, focusing on the familiar sensation of mana responding to his will. \"Ready when you are.\"","Lola’s voice took on the authoritative tone of an experienced instructor. \"Close your eyes and begin normal mana circulation. I’ll guide you through the modifications that will start tempering your constitution.\"","...","Noah settled into his meditation position, legs crossed and spine straight, following Lola’s instructions. The feeling of mana cultivation felt surprisingly comfortable; he sensed that it would be different from his usual practice sessions.","\"Begin with your standard mana circulation,\" Lola instructed, her voice soothing to his ears to avoid disturbing him. \"Feel the energy flowing through your established pathways—the routes you’ve used for wind manipulation and spell casting.\"","Noah closed his eyes and reached inward, sensing the gentle current of magical energy that had become second nature. His mana moved in its predestined pathway through his body, following the channels he’d developed to use through countless hours of training.","The circulation of mana through those pathways felt warm, controlled and steady to Noah.","\"Good,\" Lola observed, her senses allowing her to perceive his energy flow with X-ray-like clarity. \"Now I want you to imagine expanding those pathways. Not forcing new channels, but gently widening the existing ones.\"","Expand the pathways. Like opening a valve slightly wider.","Noah focused on the sensation of mana movement, visualising his internal energy channels as rivers that could accommodate greater flow. The adjustment required delicate control; too little change would produce no effect, while too much could cause dangerous internal pressure and might rupture those channels, injuring him severely.","Whilst he wasn’t worried since he had the beef jerky and the bread, he still didn’t want to experience such an injury. Because he knew not only would it hurt his body, but also his potential, as he might need to use the beef jerky too early on.","\"Do you feel that resistance?\" Lola asked as Noah encountered the first obstacle that made him frown.","Noah gave a soft, almost imperceptible nod.","\"You don’t have to respond to me, it’s more of a rhetorical question. Just focus on what you are doing,\" She immediately reprimanded him.","\"Back to what I was saying, the resistance is your body’s natural protection against energy overload. We’re going to work with that resistance, not against it.","This is one of the rules that are almost universal. Always work with your body, never against it. Once you go against your body, you are going against your nature. You will progress much slower, or any progress at all.\"","The moment Noah began expanding his mana circulation, a subtle tingling sensation spread through his torso. It felt like gentle electricity dancing beneath his skin, neither painful nor pleasant, just distinctly noticeable to him."]},{"number":148,"title":"Chapter 148: Body Tempering Skill","paragraphs":["The tingling feeling was definitely a first for Noah. Normal meditation never gave such side effects, but that made him somewhat happy. Such a feeling meant that he was definitely doing something right.","Noah wasn’t worried that he was doing something wrong, because Lola would have already told him to stop by now. She was watching over him after all.","\"At this point, you will be feeling some kind of tingling sensation; this sensation indicates your constitution is currently responding to the increased energy flow,\" Lola explained, monitoring his progress.","\"Your body is adapting to handle greater magical stress. This is exactly what we want.\"","The sensation intensified gradually as Noah maintained the expanded circulation. What had started as gentle tingling evolved into something more pronounced—like carbonated water flowing through his veins instead of blood.","It’s spreading. Arms, legs, even my fingertips are starting to tingle.","\"Excellent progress,\" Lola encouraged. \"Now increase the flow slightly. Imagine turning up the intensity just one notch higher.\"","Noah complied, adjusting his mana circulation with the precision his Level 7 control allowed. The expanded pathways began carrying energy at volumes that stressed his untrained constitution, pushing his body beyond its comfort zone without crossing into dangerous territory.","The tingling sensation transformed into something more intense. Heat began building throughout his body as his magical channels worked to accommodate the increased flow. It wasn’t the comfortable warmth of normal mana circulation anymore; this was deeper.","...","I can feel the internal heat. It’s like my blood is getting warmer from the inside out.","\"Perfect, keep up the good work. Your constitution is responding beautifully. The heat indicates your body is beginning to adapt and strengthen itself, even your blood is strengthening,\" Lola said with obvious satisfaction.","The warmth continued building as Noah maintained the challenging circulation pattern. His skin began feeling flushed despite the shop’s comfortable, cool temperature.","Noah’s internal heat started radiating outward, and even Lola was able to feel it. Noah had become something akin to a heater, as his magical pathways stressed his physical body in ways he didn’t imagine possible.","It’s getting quite warm. Almost like having a mild fever, but without the weakness that comes with it.","\"Maintain steady breathing,\" Lola instructed, noting the subtle changes in his posture that came from the uncomfortable sensation. \"Don’t let the new sensations distract you from proper mana control. Consistency is more important than intensity.\"","Noah focused on his breathing rhythm while managing the increasingly demanding energy circulation. The heat continued building up, making his clothing feel uncomfortably warm.","Definitely heating up. I can feel sweat starting to form all over my body . Noah thought internally, whilst keeping his focus on the temperament of his body.","\"Increase the flow one more level,\" Lola commanded with the confidence that suggested Noah would be able to do it.","\"This is where real tempering begins. The previous steps were all to prepare your body for the new conditions that it will need to get used to.\"","The adjustment pushed Noah’s circulation beyond anything he’d previously experienced. The internal heat intensified dramatically as his magical pathways worked at capacity to handle the enhanced energy flow. His constitution strained against the magical pressure, forcing adaptive responses throughout his system.","Now it’s getting serious. This feels like intense exercise from the inside.","Sweat began beading on Noah’s forehead as his body responded to the magical stress. The perspiration wasn’t from external temperature but from the internal work his constitution was performing to adapt to increased energy demands.","Definitely sweating now. This is harder than it looked.","\"Don’t wipe the sweat,\" Lola advised, observing his unconscious movement toward his face. \"Physical manifestations are signs of successful tempering. Your body is working exactly as intended.\"","The sweat increased as Noah maintained the challenging circulation. Droplets formed along his hairline and trickled down his temples, evidence of the intensive internal work being performed by his expanding magical pathways.","\"Feel that burning sensation in your muscles?\" Lola asked as new sensations joined the heat and tingling. \"That’s your constitution strengthening itself in real-time. You’re literally becoming more resilient with each moment of sustained circulation.\"","Noah could indeed feel a deep burn throughout his body—not the surface burn of exhausted muscles, but something else. His very constitution was straining to accommodate the magical stress, forcing growth in areas that had never been challenged before.","Internal burning. Like my entire body is doing strength training from the inside out.","\"This is the critical phase,\" Lola explained, her voice carrying appropriate gravity. \"Maintain this circulation for another ten minutes, and your body will lock in permanent improvements. Push through the discomfort, it’s temporary, but the benefits last forever.\"","The next ten minutes tested Noah’s discipline more than any previous training. The sweat increased to the point where droplets fell from his chin onto his crossed legs. The internal heat made him feel like he was sitting in an overcrowded sauna, while the burning sensation in his muscles demanded constant mental effort to ignore.","This is definitely not easy. No wonder most people avoid this method of body tempering, even if it’s the most efficient.","\"Five more minutes,\" Lola encouraged, noting his obvious struggle. \"Your circulation is perfect. Don’t let discomfort break your concentration now.\"","Noah gritted his teeth and maintained the demanding energy flow despite his body’s protests. Sweat soaked through his shirt as the stress pushed his constitution to its limits, forcing adaptations that would serve him well in the future.","Just hold on. Permanent improvement is worth temporary discomfort.","\"It’s time, slowly reduce the circulation back to normal levels. Don’t stop abruptly—that could cause energy backlash.\" Lola announced exactly thirty minutes after they’d begun.","Noah gradually decreased his mana flow, allowing his stressed pathways to return to comfortable levels. The relief was immediate and overwhelming as the internal heat and burning sensations faded to manageable levels.","[You have learnt the Level 1 Body Tempering skill.]","The system notification appeared as Noah opened his eyes, confirming that his first tempering session had successfully established the foundation for ongoing constitutional improvement.","\"Congratulations,\" Lola smiled with genuine pride.","\"You’ve just taken the first step toward making your vitality match your other capabilities.\""]},{"number":149,"title":"Chapter 149: Stock sold","paragraphs":["Lola then explained to him that after the foundation was now created, he didn’t need any more direct guidance and could simply practice the same technique until reaching apprentice rank in body tempering.","\"The circulation pattern you’ve learned is sufficient for novice-level development. Practice the same intensity daily, your body will gradually adapt and strengthen, as for duration, you can decide based on how fast you want your progress to be.\" she said, settling back into her chair with obvious satisfaction at his successful first session","\"But you must know that your body needs time to rest, that’s also a part of the training. If you keep beating your body up without letting it rest, then you will not help, but infact you will ruin your body.\" She continued before giving him a solution to the earlier problem. \"If you really want to progress really fast, you can use the bread to increase your natural healing, which will help you practise more without having a negative side effect.\"","Noah nodded in understanding; her words made sense.","\"You said that I can do this till Apprentice rank, I would need to do a different approach after reaching it?\" Noah asked, wiping the remaining sweat from his forehead with a towel.","\"Yes, but it’s still too early to worry about that since you haven’t even reached novice rank yet,\" Lola replied with a dismissive wave. \"Apprentice-level tempering involves more advanced techniques that you have no business knowing now. It’s far too complex for your current foundation.\"","Noah nodded, thanking her for the comprehensive introduction to body tempering. \"I appreciate the guidance. This skill could make all the difference in dangerous situations.\"","She smiled and winked with her otherworldly charm. \"Anything for my boss~\"","Even in this world, Lola still managed to be one of the most beautiful beings he had ever encountered. She was simply too gorgeous for anybody to come close to her, but after thinking about it, it made sense. Lola was a succubus, and what kind of succubus didn’t have the charm that destroyed all others? especially if the succubus in question was a princess.","The familiar flutter in Noah’s chest returned at her tone, but he forced himself to focus on business rather than the succubus’s charm.","Noah immediately stood up and opened the door to the shop, officially resuming business operations after their training session. \"Back to work. Time to see what the day brings.\"","The familiar bell above the entrance chimed as the first customers arrived shortly after opening. Two men entered together, their bearing and equipment immediately identifying them as representatives from different organisations.","One glance and Noah knew that they weren’t ordinary people.","The first wore the blue and gold livery of the royal guard, his armour polished to mirror brightness and bearing the crown insignia that marked him as serving the royal family directly. His companion displayed the silver wolf emblem of Valeria’s guild.","Both men approached the counter with a respectful tone, clearly aware of Noah’s reputation and important connections within the kingdom.","\"Master Noah,\" the royal guard said with a formal bow. \"I’ve been sent to purchase supplies for our front-line division. We require twenty-four healing loaves and twenty-four mana restoration teas.\"","The guild representative stepped forward with similar courtesy. \"Guild Master Valeria has requested the same quantities for our active expedition teams.\"","Noah smiled at the orders; he knew that those orders were coming today. After all, he had already agreed with Valeria and Elara the day before. \"Absolutely. I have exactly what you need.\"","He moved through his shop, gathering the requested items. Forty-eight golden loaves disappeared from his bread display while forty-eight crystal bottles of iced tea followed suit, completely depleting his current inventory.","Unlike the regulated rationing system he’d maintained in the Demon Kingdom, where no individual was permitted more than a single item per visit to ensure fair distribution, here in Esta, he allowed bulk purchases. But that privilege came with an unspoken clause; it wasn’t available to everyone.","Only two people had earned that trust: Valeria and Elara.","If anyone else attempted to place such a request, he would deny them without a second thought.","Because trust wasn’t given lightly. Not when it came to items that could boost mana, suppress exhaustion, and aid in recovery. Not when such goods could be easily hoarded or resold at extortionate prices on the black market.","But Valeria and Elara weren’t driven by greed. He knew that. They weren’t merchants looking for mere personal profit.","The financial transaction proceeded smoothly, both representatives paying without hesitation at five golden coins per item","Before they left, the royal guard paused at the door with additional information. \"Her Highness wishes me to inform you that she will visit shortly. She’s currently occupied with urgent kingdom matters but expressed a strong desire to visit you soon.\"","Elara wants to visit. That could be about the Baron Richard investigation.","The guild representative nodded in agreement. \"Guild Master Valeria conveyed similar intentions. She’ll arrive once her current expedition planning concludes.\"","Noah acknowledged both messages with courtesy. \"Tell them they’re welcome whenever they choose to visit.\"","Both men departed with satisfied expressions, their organisations’ immediate supply needs met through Noah’s convenient service. The shop fell quiet once again, leaving Noah alone with Lola and completely empty shelves.","Forty-eight loaves and forty-eight iced teas sold. That represents serious progress toward my auto-maker upgrades.","Noah approached his system interface with growing excitement, eager to check whether the substantial sales had triggered the advancement he’d been anticipating.","After selling his entire stock of both items, Noah felt confident that significant progress had been made toward his production system upgrades.","—","Host: Noah Carter","Age: 28","Shop Level: 2","Daily Revenue: $295,000 (or equivalent)","Current Assets: $306,640.21","Shop Points: 2070","Attributes: Strength: 30, Vitality: 4, Intelligence: 20, Agility: 30","Skills: Swordsmanship(Level 8), Mana Control (Level 7), Wind Manipulation (Level 6), Aura (Level 5), Surviving on Ramen (Level 3), Cooking (Level 2), Programming (Level 2), Gaming (Level 2), Finance (Level 2), Body Tempering (Level 1),","—"]},{"number":150,"title":"Chapter 150: Level 4 Auto-maker","paragraphs":["His money had increased, although not by as much as sales in the demon kingdom would have generated. He had sold each loaf and each iced tea for 5 golden coins—a reasonable price that balanced accessibility with profitability in the human kingdom’s economy.","480 golden coins total from today’s bulk sale. That’s $48,000, which isn’t nearly as much as demon kingdom prices, but I don’t mind.","The reduced profit margins served multiple purposes beyond simple revenue generation. He was helping improve the human kingdom’s defence capabilities against extremist attacks while earning a decent profit and building crucial political relationships.","With a strategic investment in the kingdom’s defence. The royal family and guilds were becoming his loyal customers who would always be there to buy his items, no matter how many there were.","His shop points had increased by a whopping 960 points, bringing his total to 2,070, a significant advancement toward the 10,000 points required for a Level 3 Shop.","Nearly a quarter way into the next shop level. These bulk sales are exactly what I needed.","’Time to see the auto-makers,’ he thought, a smile forming on his face as he anticipated the improvements his sales volume should have triggered.","—","[Auto-Baker]","Level: 3","Production Rate: 4 Loaves every hour","Max Stock: 48","Progress: 190/200","—","[Auto-IceTea Maker]","Level: 4","Production Rate: 4 Iced teas every hour","Max Stock: 96","Progress: 16/400","—","The iced tea automaker reached Level 4! Perfect!","The upgrade had doubled both his maximum stock capacity and production rate for iced tea. Instead of producing 2 bottles per hour with a 48-bottle limit, the enhanced maker could now generate 4 bottles hourly while storing up to 96 bottles total.","A doubled production rate means a doubled potential sales volume. This is exactly the scaling I needed.","His auto-baker remained at Level 3 but had advanced to 190/200 progress, just 10 more sales away from its own upgrade to Level 4. Given the consistent demand he was experiencing, that threshold should be reached within hours rather than days.","Ten more bread sales for the Level 4 baker. I should easily achieve that today.","The systematic progression excited Noah more than individual sales could. Each auto-maker upgrade represented an exponential improvement in everything, whether it was his wealth or shop upgrades.","Level 4 auto-maker could start producing enough inventory to supply both royal orders and individual customers simultaneously.","Seeing the obvious satisfaction on his face, Lola raised an eyebrow before looking at him with a deliberately shy expression that contrasted sharply with her usual bold confidence.","\"Why are you grinning so much whilst looking at me...\" she said, her voice taking on an unexpectedly vulnerable tone. \"Do you perhaps want to~\"","Her ruby eyes carried a suggestion that made Noah’s pulse quicken despite his attempts at having pure thoughts.","\"NO!\" Noah immediately interrupted her attempted seduction, his voice climbing several octaves in his haste to redirect the conversation. \"I was just thinking about the body tempering skill!\"","Naturally, that was a white lie. Noah was checking system status while she happened to be in his line of sight.","The excuse sounded weak even to his own ears, but Lola’s knowing smile suggested she understood exactly what had actually captured his attention. Her expression changed from seduction to amused understanding.","\"Of course you were,\" she replied with obvious scepticism mixed with entertainment.","\"The body tempering skill is certainly... stimulating.\"","\"...\"","The awkward moment dissolved as Noah forced himself to focus on business concerns rather than Lola’s deliberate charm offensive or his own embarrassing social missteps.","Luckily, Noah was saved by a customer walking in.","\"Welcom—\" His words died midway as he realised who had entered.","The person who entered the shop made Noah frown. The reason Noah frowned was because he knew the person in front of him, and he didn’t like him, to say the least.","It was Baron Richard, his substantial belly entering the store a full minute before he did, the man’s corpulent frame filling the doorway with unpleasant arrogance. The baron’s expensive silk clothing strained against his considerable belly girth, while gold rings adorned fingers that had never known honest labour.","He walked with the same air of arrogance that Noah remembered from their previous encounter.","The same entitled swagger of someone accustomed to taking whatever he wanted without consequence. Behind him stood two large bodyguards, their faces expressionless masks.","The man who entered his shop had enslaved Kip and Alissa. The one Lola detected with demonic energy signatures, which was proof that he was working with the extremists.","Had it been someone else, Noah might’ve thought that the person was simply in love with a demon girl, but the man in front of him was known to be a bad person, and it wasn’t out of the question for him to do such things.","Baron Richard’s small, piggy eyes swept the shop’s interior with obvious calculation before settling on Noah before widening in recognition. His expression moved from interest to satisfaction as memory supplied the context of their previous meeting.","\"Well, well, well, if it isn’t the generous young man who paid double price for a pair of worthless beast-kin slaves.\" The baron started off, and he didn’t even give Noah any sort of respect.","Noah’s jaw tightened as he recalled that transaction, his attempt to free Kip and Alissa from slavery, hampered by his own inexperience with negotiation and the baron’s ruthless exploitation of that weakness.","\"Baron,\" Noah replied with a carefully neutral tone, fighting to keep his voice level despite the anger building in his chest.","Behind the counter, Lola’s demeanour shifted subtly as she sensed the tension in the air. Her ruby eyes studied the newcomer with intensity, her senses immediately detecting the demonic energy signature she’d identified from a distance yesterday.","\"So you’re the mysterious shopkeeper everyone’s talking about,\" Baron Richard continued, his smile widening.","\"Selling magical bread and potions to the royal family itself. Quite the rise in fortune since our last encounter.\""]},{"number":151,"title":"Chapter 151: Baron Richard","paragraphs":["\"I’ve heard fascinating stories about your products,\" the baron continued, his small eyes scanning the shop’s displays with obvious shock. He had never seen this style of shop before; it was the first time he had seen such a thing.","One of his bodyguards stepped forward slightly, the movement carrying a threat despite its apparent casualness. The man’s hand rested near his sword hilt as if threatening Noah indirectly.","\"What can I help you with today?\" Noah asked.","Whilst he could have simply kicked the baron out, he didn’t want to. He wanted to know what this man was looking for specifically. Besides, based on the baron’s answers, Noah might be able to discern his plans.","Baron Richard’s laugh was an unpleasant sound that filled the small shop. \"Oh, I think you know exactly what I want, my dear shopkeeper.\"","The baron approached the counter slowly. \"You see, I’ve been thinking about our previous business relationship. How generous you were with your payment. How... accommodating you proved to be.\"","The baron’s words were clear. He was going to extort Noah once again, whether he liked it or not. Or that’s what the baron thought, at least.","\"I find myself in need of certain... supplies,\" the baron continued, his tone becoming more openly threatening. \"Healing items, enhancement potions, you know, whatever you have here in your shop.\"","Lola’s position behind the counter allowed her to observe the baron’s bodyguards while her demon features remained concealed.","\"And I believe,\" Baron Richard said, his voice dropping to an oily whisper, \"that a generous businessman like yourself would be happy to provide those supplies at a... substantial discount. Considering our previous successful negotiation.\"","Noah’s experience in the world and combat training had fundamentally changed him since their last encounter, but the baron remained unaware of those developments. To Richard’s eyes, Noah was still the same soft target who could be manipulated through aggression and intimidation.","The threat was barely veiled now. The baron clearly believed he could intimidate Noah into providing magical supplies at whatever price he demanded, using the same psychological pressure that had worked during the slave transaction.","\"What kind of discount did you have in mind?\" Noah asked, a smile on his face.","The baron’s smile widened with predatory satisfaction. \"Oh, I think we can work out very reasonable terms. Perhaps we should discuss this privately?\"","His eyes flicked toward Lola with obvious dismissal. \"Send your serving girl away. This is business between men of substance.\"","Serving girl. He has no idea what he’s dealing with.","Lola’s expression didn’t change, but Noah caught the subtle shift in her posture that suggested the succubus was prepared for violence.","\"Excuse me baron, please mind your words. This isn’t a serving girl, this is my...wife.\" He said, a frown on his face.","Noah had wanted to say that Lola was his sister, but they looked nothing alike. There was no resemblance at all, not even a single percent. Hence, he was left with nothing but saying she was his wife.","Lola’s expression remained the same despite the inward feeling of shock. For a reason only she knew, she found her heart beating even faster than when she was fighting for her life, her hands clenched softly, and her tail threatened to whip around in happiness.","The baron raised his eyebrow, before nodding. \"I see, we can do it out in the open.\"","Seeing Noah’s frown, the baron knew when to retreat. The conversation has been going great, and he would be foolish if he crossed the boundary of honour. He knew that men valued their honour, and if somebody crossed certain boundaries, they would not back down.","\"Now then,\" the baron continued, returning to his original agenda.","The baron began walking around the shop with the casual arrogance of someone conducting an inspection rather than shopping. His small eyes surveyed every display case and shelf with assessment, clearly searching for more products.","His gaze swept past the bread and iced tea displays without particular interest—those products aligned with the stories he’d heard about Noah’s supposed healing capabilities. But as he moved deeper into the shop, his attention was caught by items that made his expression shift dramatically.","The protein bars sat in their elegant display case, their subtle golden glow and professional packaging immediately standing out as something extraordinary. The baron’s eyes widened with shock as he read the descriptive placard that accompanied the display.","\"Permanent strength enhancement plus temporary amplification.\"","This can’t be real.","His shock deepened as he spotted the energy drinks in their containers, each bottle seeming to contain liquid lightning that sparkled with contained power. The beef jerky display completed his circuit of discovery, its rich aroma and obvious magical properties defying everything he thought he knew about Noah’s modest operation.","These items... if they actually worked as advertised, they’d be worth fortunes. Literally priceless to the right buyers.","But instead of awe or desire, the baron’s expression changed into something far more calculating. A slow smirk spread across his features as pieces of what he believed to be an elaborate puzzle fell into place in his mind.","He’s running a scam. Has to be. How could a small-time shopkeeper in an abandoned alleyway possibly have access to such legendary enhancement items?","The baron’s reasoning followed a logical path based on his own criminal experience. Clearly, Noah was advertising impossible products to lure in desperate customers, then taking their money for items that provided no actual benefits. It was exactly the kind of confidence scheme that Richard himself might have devised.","Fake magical items sold to gullible adventurers and desperate soldiers. Brilliant, if unoriginal.","The proof, in the baron’s mind, lay in the obvious fact that nobody was buying these miraculous products. If permanent strength enhancement or magical energy drinks actually existed and worked as advertised, every warrior and mage in the kingdom would be beating down Noah’s door with bags of gold.","The fact that he still has stock proves they’re worthless fakes. Real enhancement items would sell instantly at any price."]},{"number":152,"title":"Chapter 152: A scam","paragraphs":["What the baron failed to consider was the simple economic reality that most people in Esta couldn’t afford items priced in the hundreds of golden coins. His own wealth, accumulated through decades of illegal activities including slavery, extortion, and collaboration with extremists, had distorted his perception of normal purchasing power.","...","Even the residents inside the demon academy are unable to purchase such items despite their abundance of golden coins. So, residents in Esta can never afford an item that costs a thousand coins","But Richard’s criminal mind had latched onto what he saw as a perfect opportunity for additional leverage. Catching Noah in an obvious scam provided exactly the kind of ammunition he needed to ensure complete compliance with his demands.","I’ve got him now. Fraud accusations against nobility would mean prison or worse. Richard thought, a smirk on his face.","Noah watched the baron’s expressions change with careful attention, noting the shift from shock to calculation to satisfaction. He could practically see the criminal’s thought process playing out across his features.","He thinks I’m running a scam. Perfect. Let him believe whatever keeps him talking.","Noah chose not to explain or defend his premium products. The baron’s assumptions revealed more about his intentions than any direct questioning could accomplish. Besides, since he believed that these items were a scam, he wouldn’t resort to buy them.","Noah was never going to give such an item to the baron, no matter what plans he was thinking of. The only items he would give to the baron in order to reveal his hidden plans were the bread and iced tea, as for the other items, those were simply too precious to waste on such a small-time baron that was bound to be caught.","Talking with the baron, Noah naturally knew that he wasn’t merely buying for himself. He could tell that the baron was purchasing a bulk supply to resell. As for which customers, it was obvious. He would most likely sell to the extremists who, after raiding so many places and killing so many innocents, would have a large wealth to splurge.","The conclusion was inevitable once Noah considered the broader context. If the baron was indeed collaborating with extremist factions, he would need impressive products to trade for their continued support.","Magical enhancement items would be perfect currency for buying extremist loyalty and gaining immense profit.","\"Well, well,\" the baron said as he returned to the counter. \"I think we need to discuss your... business practices... more thoroughly.\"","Noah simply stared at the baron. His expression hinting at nothing, he knew that the baron was going to start his roleplaying of a powerful villain, when he was nothing but a third-rate villain.","His smirk widened as he gestured toward the premium displays. \"Those are quite impressive claims you’re making about permanent enhancement and magical amplification. I’m sure the royal investigative authority would be very interested in examining such... extraordinary... products.\"","The baron immediately started with the fraud accusations. Threatening to report Noah to royalty was something so foolish, especially considering his link to the princess. But Noah didn’t say anything, he wanted to see this to the end.","\"I’m a reasonable man,\" Richard continued, his tone becoming openly threatening. \"I’m willing to overlook certain... irregularities... in exchange for fair prices on your legitimate inventory.\"","The baron’s next words confirmed Noah’s worst suspicions about his intentions. \"I’ll pay you ten silver coins total for all your bread and iced tea. You should consider yourself lucky that I’m paying anything at all.\"","Ten silver coins for my stock...That’s morally illegal even by criminal standards. Noah thought with amusement.","Noah contorted his face, clearly showing that he was very upset about the price that the baron was giving, when in reality, he didn’t care.","Noah knew that once the baron was caught, he was not only going to gain back all the money from the items, but he was also going to gain a certain percentage of the baron’s wealth. After all, he had also contributed heavily to the investigation.","The princess had already promised him that the reward for his contribution, if the accusation was indeed correct, would be immense.","\"After all, I am a baron, and I could report your obvious scam operation to the royal authorities at any time. Prison sentences for fraud against nobility tend to be quite... permanent.\" Richard spoke proudly as he pointed at himself in arrogance.","Noah forced himself to appear conflicted, as if wrestling with the decision between compliance and resistance. A legitimate shopkeeper faced with such accusations would naturally try to negotiate for better terms before capitulating to superior authority.","\"Ten silver coins?\" Noah said, his voice carrying exactly the right note of desperate protest. \"Baron, please, that’s barely enough to cover my costs. Could we perhaps discuss fifteen silver? Twenty at most?\"","Despite negotiating with the baron, Noah didn’t go overboard to break character. He had to act the role of a scared shopkeeper.","The baron’s laugh was harsh and dismissive. \"Ten silver coins, final offer. Be grateful I’m not simply confiscating everything as evidence of fraudulent business practices.\"","Noah let his shoulders slump with apparent defeat, sighing heavily as if accepting inevitable doom. \"Very well, Baron. Ten silver coins. But I’ll need time to prepare your order properly.\"","\"Excellent decision,\" Richard replied with obvious satisfaction. \"When will the stock be ready? I assume you don’t keep such large quantities on hand.\"","He’s asking about restocking times. Definitely planning bulk purchases for external buyers.","\"Within two hours, I should have good stock available,\" Noah answered, maintaining his defeated shopkeeper persona.","The baron turned toward his bodyguards with a confident smile. In his eyes, his plans had gone smooth like butter; after all, he had found a criminal undercover.","\"Marcus, you stay here for the next two hours. Wait outside the shop and monitor the situation.\"","The chosen bodyguard nodded with professional understanding, his hand automatically checking his weapon positions in preparation for an extended surveillance mission."]},{"number":153,"title":"Chapter 153: Noah’s plan, and Richard’s demise.","paragraphs":["\"Once the two hours are completed, bring me the items. I’ll be at the Gilded Swan tavern conducting other business.\" Richard continued.","But then the baron’s expression shifted to something far more threatening as he addressed both his guard and Noah simultaneously.","\"If the stock is not ready as promised...\" His voice dropped to a menacing whisper. \"You know what to do.\"","The baron was now giving direct threats; he was no longer trying to hide it.","The implicit message was crystal clear: Noah’s failure to comply would result in consequences far more severe than the financial loss. The baron was prepared to use violence to enforce his extortion demands.","To Noah, the reason why he had left the guard was clear. The baron feared that he would escape the area with his items, hence leaving a guard outside the store safeguarded that issue. It was also more efficient in terms of transporting the items.","Richard departed with his second bodyguard, their footsteps echoing down the alley as they headed toward whatever \"other business\" required their attention. The remaining guard took up position outside the shop, his presence serving as both surveillance and intimidation.","Noah watched through his window as the guard settled into a waiting position that provided clear sight lines to both the shop entrance and the alley approaches.","...","With the baron departed and the door closed, Lola looked at Noah with genuine surprise etched across her features. Her ruby eyes carried the confusion of someone who had witnessed what appeared to be unnecessary restraint in the face of obvious provocation.","\"You know that you could’ve killed him easily. No—I could’ve done it for you. I would have turned him into ashes before his so-called bodyguards could blink. Why are you entertaining him?\" she said, her voice surprisingly calm despite what she was uttering.","Noah smiled as he observed her expression, recognizing the look of someone who wanted nothing more than to deflate the baron’s pompous arrogance like a punctured balloon. Her tail twitched beneath her clothing with obvious agitation at having been forced to endure Richard’s condescending behaviour.","\"Lola,\" Noah began carefully, settling into the chair across from her with the patient demeanour of someone explaining something complex.","\"In this kingdom, nobles—no matter their rank, whether they were baron, viscounts or higher. They all have protection from the crown. While the crown can definitely deal with problematic nobility when they do something wrong, they need evidence.","Otherwise, when the other nobles find out about summary executions or mysterious disappearances, they’ll create a political crisis. Those who want the crown’s position will use any excuse to challenge royal authority.\"","Political stability requires following established procedures.","Lola’s frown deepened as she processed this information, her centuries of combat experience providing little preparation for the intricacies of human political systems.","\"How would the other nobles know that it was the crown that dealt with him if we kill that man on the sly, they would never know. I will simply remove all traces of his existence; they could never figure out who did it.\"","\"They probably won’t know for certain,\" Noah admitted with a slight shrug. \"But even uncertainty serves their purposes. Ambitious nobles will use that very uncertainty as an excuse to demand more resources and protections from the crown.\"","He leaned forward slightly, warming to his explanation of the political dynamics that constrained even royal authority. Noah’s understanding of the political dynamic had come from his study at university, one of his close friends back then had chosen history as their major.","Talks about royalty, history, wars for power, all of it was spoken about. His old friend used to really enjoy such medieval cultures.","Thinking about that friend, Noah paused for a second. He then shook his head as if trying to remove her picture from his head before explaining to Lola.","\"They’ll argue that if the crown isn’t protecting nobles from mysterious threats, then obviously they need larger personal guards, more castle fortifications, and increased tax exemptions to fund their security measures.\"","Every crisis becomes an opportunity for the ambitious to extract concessions.","\"The crown ends up spending more resources managing noble paranoia than they would have gained by eliminating one corrupt baron,\" Noah concluded. \"It’s a losing proposition politically.\"","Short-term solutions creating long-term problems.","Lola nodded slowly as the explanation penetrated her warrior’s mindset, though her expression suggested someone grappling with concepts that felt fundamentally foreign to her nature. While she had been a princess, her understanding of political subtleties was severely limited by circumstances beyond her control.","She was a princess for such a short period of time that it made sense why she had no understanding of such social dynamics. After all, even in the demon kingdom, there were royalty and nobles.","Her royal status had lasted only until her twelfth birthday, when her parents’ assassination had transformed her from sheltered princess into desperate exile. The intervening years had been spent focused on survival, combat mastery, and planning revenge rather than studying the delicate art of politics.","\"I’m only good at things related to fighting, magic, and killing,\" Lola admitted. \"Deep politics was never something I had time to entertain.\"","Noah nodded in understanding.","The confession revealed aspects of her character that her usual playful demeanour kept hidden. Beneath the master-level succubus who could eliminate threats with a casual swipe of her hand, lay someone who had been denied the comprehensive education that should have prepared her for eventual rule.","\"Your situation was completely different,\" Noah said gently, recognising the implied regret in her admission. \"You were forced to focus on immediate survival rather than long-term governance. Anyone in your position would have made the same choices.","Besides, politics is easier to get into. You won’t have to worry, after all...power rules. The royal family isn’t the governing family for no reason; it’s because they are the strongest. So when met with overwhelming power, politics becomes nothing but a children’s game.\"","Noah was trying to validate her choice; he wasn’t trying to criticise her. He was reassuring her that her priorities back then were correct."]},{"number":154,"title":"Chapter 154: Following Richard’s Guard.","paragraphs":["\"But that’s exactly why Baron Richard needs to be handled through proper channels,\" he continued, returning to the practical implications of their current situation. \"If we eliminate him through direct action, we create more problems than we solve.\"","Lola’s expression showed growing understanding of the constraints that governed Noah’s approach to the baron’s criminal behaviour. Her warrior instincts still favoured immediate solutions, but her intelligence recognised the wisdom in his approaches.","\"So we gather evidence of his extremist connections,\" she said, her voice carrying new comprehension of their strategic objectives. \"Provide the crown with justification for legitimate action against him.\"","Exactly. Work within the system to achieve justice rather than creating chaos through unauthorised violence.","\"Precisely,\" Noah confirmed with obvious satisfaction at her quick grasp of the political dynamics. \"Let him reveal his connections to the extremists, document his criminal activities, then present everything to the royals.\"","\"The crown gets to demonstrate that they protect the kingdom from internal threats, other nobles see that proper procedures were followed, and justice is served without creating political instability,\" he explained.","Lola’s tail had stopped its agitated twitching as she absorbed the lesson.","\"I understand now,\" she said finally.","..","Elara was sitting across from her father in his private study, the seriousness of recent discoveries heavy in the air between them.","The king’s expression grew increasingly grave as she relayed everything Noah had told her about Baron Richard’s suspicious behavior and potential extremist connections.","\"This mysterious shopkeeper,\" the king said, his brow furrowing with concern, \"he wouldn’t go directly to Baron Richard and interrogate him, would he?\"","Direct confrontation could be disastrous if Richard is truly connected to extremists.","The king looked at his daughter with worry that their first lead might vanish before they caught it. \"The extremists aren’t so stupid as to let their collaborators roam around freely in the kingdom without safeguards. They would naturally place a death leech in his heart or force him to sign a life and death contract.\"","Life and death contracts were known in this world. They weren’t exactly rare, and extremists wouldn’t hesitate to use it.","\"The death leech seems more probable,\" he continued.","\"They wouldn’t want any possibility of information leaking, since even life and death contracts allow for a frame of time where secrets could be revealed before enforcement occurs.\"","In the king’s mind, immediate death versus delayed punishment. The extremists would choose the former for certainty.","The death leech represented one of the most insidious magical parasites known to exist—a creature that bonded with its host’s heart and could detect specific thoughts or intentions. The moment Baron Richard attempted to reveal extremist secrets or betray their operations, the leech would stop his heart instantly.","No opportunity for last-minute confessions or deathbed revelations. The person would die instantaneously, making sure that their secret was buried alongside them.","Elara nodded with understanding that carried both relief and disappointment. \"I told him, Dad. Noah understood the risks involved in direct confrontation.\"","\"Good,\" the king replied, his expression showing approval of his daughter’s handling of the situation. The crisis required careful maneuvering rather than bold action, and Elara had demonstrated appropriate caution.","But then the king’s demeanor changed as different considerations entered his mind. \"Take me to meet this mysterious man personally. I need to assess him myself.\"","\"As a wind mage, I’ve always wanted to examine such an orb. Perhaps I can offer him something valuable in return for access to it.","You said that he had a few with him, so it shouldn’t be a problem to get one if given the right prize.\" He continued, still somewhat shocked that the mysterious shopkeeper had access to things that even he didn’t.","The more he had heard from Elara, the more he wanted to meet the man.","\"More importantly,\" the king continued, his tone becoming more serious. \"I want to know what kind of person he truly is. Anyone with access to such artifacts and information deserves direct royal evaluation.\"","Elara nodded happily, clearly pleased by her father’s decision to meet Noah personally rather than delegating the interaction to subordinates. \"Alright, let me get ready. But dad, from my experience with Noah. He doesn’t like the spotlight, don’t put him on the spot and offer him to work under you, he won’t. It will also be slightly awkward, and he might get a negative impression.\"","The king smiled, before raising his eyebrow. \"You are teaching me how to act now?\"","\"No, I-\" Elara stanmered shaking her hands in the air.","\"Haha, i’m just joking. Don’t worry, I won’t take him from you.\" He laughed before patting his daughter’s head.","Elara blushed at his words before storming out to get ready.","Two Hours Later...","The guard outside Noah’s shop walked in like a robot following explicit orders. His expression remained neutral as he placed ten silver coins on the counter without saying a word.","Ten silver coins for forty-eight items. Highway robbery, but it’s okay. I will make sure to get the Baron’s whole wealth in return. I pay back grievances in multiples.","Noah retrieved the items, ten loaves of bread and ten bottles of iced tea, and placed them carefully in a sturdy carrying bag. The transaction proceeded without conversation, both parties understanding their respective roles.","The guard accepted the bag with a curt nod and departed immediately, his mission complete according to Baron Richard’s specific instructions.","As soon as the door closed behind the departing guard, Noah turned to Lola with an expression that carried both urgency and confidence in her capabilities.","\"Follow him silently,\" Noah said. \"You can do it, right?\"","Master-level succubus versus human guard. It wasn’t even a contest in terms of stealth capability.","Lola’s smirk carried a predator’s smile at being given a mission that utilised her abilities. \"Of course I can.\"","As she prepared to depart, moving toward the door, Noah called after her.","\"Thank you.\"","Noah was grateful that she was going beyond their employment requirements. This wasn’t part of her official job after all.","She paused at the threshold, turning back with an expression that mixed amusement with something warmer. Her chuckle carried genuine affection as she departed to begin her mission."]},{"number":155,"title":"Chapter 155: King Aldric","paragraphs":["Inside the shop, Noah waited exactly one minute before closing up and preparing for his own departure. The brief delay ensured Lola had sufficient time to establish surveillance on the guard without risk of compromising her mission through premature exposure.","He secured the shop’s entrance and turned the sign to closed. The building would remain safe while he attended to other business requirements.","Time to find Valeria and coordinate the next phase of this investigation.","On his way to locate the guild master, Noah spotted two familiar figures approaching from the direction of the royal quarter. Princess Elara walked alongside a man who appeared remarkably ordinary despite the subtle aura of power that clung to him like expensive cologne.","The man accompanying Elara stared at Noah with interest. His clothing was well-made but not ostentatious, his bearing powerful without being intimidating.","As they drew closer, Noah thought of something. He had never seen Elara going with a man before, and the man next to her seemed to be close enough to her.","It was clear to Noah that the person in front of him was the king, without having seen him ever before.","The realisation carried both opportunity and risk. Royal interest could provide powerful backing for their investigation into Baron Richard’s criminal activities, but it also meant Noah’s growing influence had attracted attention at the highest levels of government.","Elara’s expression brightened with obvious pleasure as she spotted Noah, her wave carrying the enthusiasm of someone introducing valued friends to family members.","The king’s eyes were still focused on Noah. His gaze filled with genuine curiosity about the mysterious shopkeeper who had attracted his daughter’s respect.","The convergence of surveillance operations, royal visits, and criminal investigations promised to transform what had begun as a simple day of business into something far more complex and potentially consequential.","It was just another normal day in the life of an interdimensional merchant. At least it’s never boring.","...","Seeing the princess approaching, the people in the alleyway immediately offered respectful greetings from their various stalls and shops. Merchants paused their haggling, craftsmen looked up from their work, and customers stepped aside to create a clear path for royalty.","\"Your Highness!\" called out a baker from across the street, bowing deeply while flour still dusted his apron.","\"Princess Elara!\" added a jewellery vendor, her voice carrying genuine warmth mixed with appropriate deference.","But despite their obvious pleasure at seeing the beloved princess, the merchants and customers maintained careful distance from the royal pair. Their eyes kept darting nervously toward the man walking beside Elara, clearly sensing something that made them deeply uncomfortable.","The stranger’s aura was visible even to those without magical training, the air around him that spoke of immense, contained force. The effect was like looking at someone through heat shimmer, except the temperature remained perfectly normal.","The common people weren’t sure exactly what they were sensing, but their instincts warned them to avoid drawing attention. Royal bodyguards were known to react aggressively to perceived threats, and approaching too closely might be interpreted as an assassination attempt.","Elara waved back at the gathered merchants with a genuine smile, her smile carrying the warmth of someone who truly cared about her people’s well-being. She had always maintained closer relationships with common citizens than most nobility considered appropriate.","As they arrived in front of Noah’s shop, he quickly reassessed his departure plans. With Princess Elara coming to visit—potentially accompanied by the king himself—there was no longer any need to seek out Valeria for coordination.","The meeting is coming to me instead. Much more convenient.","Noah reopened his shop door, stepping aside to allow the royal visitors entry. \"Your Highness, please come in. You’re always welcome here.\"","He gestured for both Elara and her mysterious companion to enter.","Once both visitors had crossed the threshold, Noah immediately turned the shop sign to \"CLOSED\" and secured the door behind them. Having royalty inside his establishment meant normal business operations would have to wait.","It was mainly for privacy for the high-level discussion he was about to participate in. He can’t have random customers wandering in during such conversations.","The shop’s interior felt different with such powerful individuals present.","Noah turned to face his visitors.","\"Your Highness,\" Noah said, addressing Elara while maintaining awareness of her companion, \"would you please introduce your friend? I’d like to welcome him properly to my shop.\"","Elara’s expression brightened with obvious pleasure at the opportunity to make formal introductions between two people she valued highly. Her smile carried the excitement of someone bringing together respected friends.","\"Of course!\" she replied with enthusiasm that seemed to fill the small shop with warmth.","As she spoke the next words, her companion’s face began changing dramatically. The subtle magical concealment that had hidden his true features dissolved completely, revealing the authoritative countenance that appeared on official portraits throughout the kingdom.","\"Noah,\" Elara said with obvious pride, \"meet my father, King Aldric of Durenholde.\"","I was right. The actual king, standing in my shop.","King Aldric’s transformation from unremarkable stranger to unmistakable sovereign was complete. His features now carried the distinctive combination of wisdom, authority, and magical power that had made him one of the most respected rulers in recent history.","The king’s eyes immediately focused on Noah with intensity, his assessment shifting from casual curiosity to formal evaluation of someone who had attracted significant royal attention.","\"Your Majesty,\" Noah said, offering a respectful nod that balanced courtesy with his position as an independent merchant. \"It’s an honour to have you visit my humble establishment.\"","The king smiled at Noah’s greeting before saying. \"Shopkeeper Noah, it’s an honour for me to visit your shop. It’s anything but a humble establishment, I dare say that this place not only has the best products in terms of quality and looks.","But, it also has extremely attractive decor. This place, the shelves, the glass, everything about it is special. I’ve never seen anything like it in my life, and I’ve travelled a lot.\""]},{"number":156,"title":"Chapter 156: Shock of the king","paragraphs":["Noah simply smiled and accepted the compliments with gracious humility, understanding that excessive modesty might actually offend someone offering genuine praise.","\"Thank you, Your Majesty. I appreciate your kind words,\" Noah replied before moving to the shelves to offer the king some hospitality. \"Please, have some iced tea. It’s been pretty hot outside recently. This should help you cool off.\"","As a salesman, Noah naturally knew that he had to be hospitable to the king. Besides, he was no longer the cheapskate who worried about every iced tea. Things have changed now, and not only was he rich, he was also producing nearly a hundred of those.","He retrieved two crystal bottles from his display, their contents shimmering with the magical properties that made them far more than simple refreshments.","Elara accepted her drink with obvious happiness, her face lighting up with the genuine pleasure of someone receiving her favourite treat. \"Thank you! This is exactly what I was hoping for.\"","The king accepted his bottle without false politeness, his expression showing someone who had already experienced the iced tea’s remarkable properties. \"I appreciate this more than you might realise. I’ve tried this beverage before, and to say it’s anything short of miraculous would be a lie.\"","He’s had it before. Must have sampled Elara’s previous purchases.","King Aldric took a thoughtful sip, his taste palate allowing him to appreciate the drink’s complexity on multiple levels. \"Whether taste, appearance, refreshing qualities, or magical effects—everything is absolutely amazing.\"","As they enjoyed their drinks, both royals began surveying the shop’s full inventory with their eyes, as if discovering new possibilities. The king’s eyes fell upon displays he had just noticed.","King Aldric’s expression changed dramatically as he spotted the protein bars, energy drinks, and beef jerky arranged in their elegant cases. His eyes widened with genuine shock as he read the descriptive placards that accompanied each display.","\"These items...\" he breathed, his voice carrying the awe of someone confronting the impossible. \"The effects they promise are nothing short of miraculous.\"","Elara followed her father’s gaze, her own eyes widening as she spotted the premium products for the first time. During her previous visits, the shop had been out of stock for these particular items.","\"Permanent attribute enhancement?\" she whispered, her voice carrying disbelief at the things in front of her. These things were theoretically impossible. \"Regardless of existing rank or capability?\"","The king stepped closer to examine the displays more carefully, but his senses didn’t allow him to detect whether the properties were elaborate fakes or not. This shocked him even more! As an archmage, he should be able to check, but the inability to check made it even more amazing!","\"The energy drink promises permanent agility improvement plus temporary amplification,\" he murmured, reading each description with growing amazement. \"The protein bar offers permanent strength enhancement. The beef jerky provides permanent vitality increase.\"","\"Each effect states it works regardless of the consumer’s current rank or magical development,\" King Aldric continued, his voice rising as if grasping revolutionary items. \"That’s... that’s completely unprecedented in magical theory.\"","Elara moved to stand beside her father, both royals staring at the premium products with expressions that mixed desire, disbelief, and growing understanding of their strategic value.","\"If these items truly work as advertised, they would represent the most significant advancement in magical enhancement since the discovery of mana crystals.\" The king said slowly, with growing shock.","Noah watched their reactions with satisfaction, noting how quickly both royals had grasped the true significance of his premium inventory.","They understand quality when they see it. This could lead to very profitable long-term arrangements.","...","The king studied the premium displays with careful attention, clearly recognising unprecedented value. His expression carried both admiration and growing concern as he processed the implications of such powerful items existing in a relatively unprotected shop.","\"Noah,\" he said slowly, his voice taking on a concerned tone. As the king, he was accustomed to managing kingdom-level security concerns, \"these items... they aren’t simple merchandise. Based on what my daughter told me about you, and seeing you in person, I know you aren’t a person to lie; therefore, I totally believe in your authenticity.\"","The king’s expression grew more serious as he continued. \"But what if somebody tries to steal these items from your store? Do you need me to send royal bodyguards for protection?\"","The king was worried that if those items were stolen by the extremists or people who have ill intentions, they might gain immense power.","Noah smiled with confidence, his demeanour suggesting that he had already thought of and resolved such practical concerns. \"You don’t have to worry, Your Majesty. I have a few measures set in place for such contingencies.\"","The king raised an eyebrow at Noah’s casual dismissal of what should have been overwhelming security challenges, but he nodded with acceptance. If Noah claimed to have adequate protection, then he probably possessed capabilities that weren’t immediately visible.","King Aldric turned his full attention back to the displays, his composure barely containing obvious desire for items that could enhance his already considerable magical abilities.","\"How much are these?\" he asked.","\"It depends, Your Majesty,\" Noah replied diplomatically. \"Those at adept rank or above need to pay in equivalent. If you can provide an item of equal value, we can arrange an exchange rather than a monetary payment.\"","\"For example,\" Noah continued, reaching into his storage ring, \"somebody once gave me this in exchange for a protein bar.\"","The wind orb emerged from dimensional storage, its concentrated essence immediately visible to the king.","King Aldric’s eyes widened dramatically as he recognised the legendary artefact that had drawn him to Noah’s shop in the first place. The Tier 5 wind orb represented exactly the kind of treasure he had hoped to get, yet now it served merely as an example of standard pricing.","He had come for the orb, but after seeing the other things, he was simply shocked beyond belief.","Elara watched her father’s face change with a smile on her face.","That’s called the...Noah effect."]},{"number":157,"title":"Chapter 157: Generous.","paragraphs":["For the first time in decades, King Aldric felt the unfamiliar sensation of wanting multiple expensive items simultaneously. As ruler of a kingdom, he had grown accustomed to acquiring whatever he desired without considering cost or availability.","But standing in Noah’s shop, surrounded by items that could enhance every aspect of his magical and physical capabilities, the king found himself calculating costs like a common merchant worried about overextending his resources.","Everything in the shop was powerful; it made him want to buy everything. He was like a child who entered a candy shop and wanted everything he could get.","\"So this costs around a thousand golden coins for adepts or above?\" the king asked, gesturing toward the protein bar display while his mind processed the staggering expense of acquiring multiple items.","A thousand coins per item. Even royal treasuries feel that.","\"Usually, yes, that would be the case,\" Noah replied with diplomatic smoothness. \"However, since we are both humans, and the princess has helped me significantly during my early development, and I consider us friends...\"","Noah’s soft smile encompassed both royals as he continued. \"The price will be 600 golden coins.\"","Elara’s eyes brightened with obvious pleasure at being acknowledged as a valued friend rather than simply a customer. The recognition carried personal meaning that made her feel...happy.","\"As for those below adept rank,\" Noah continued, establishing the complete pricing structure, \"apprentice practitioners pay 300 golden coins for first purchases. Novice rank pays 100 golden coins initially. All second purchases are standardised at 50 golden coins regardless of rank.\"","The king nodded absently, his mind already calculating which combinations of items would provide maximum enhancement while remaining within reasonable fiscal boundaries.","The revolutionary pricing structure meant that even novice practitioners could eventually afford permanent enhancement, while master-level individuals paid prices commensurate with the strategic value such improvements represented.","Democratic access to advancement. Revolutionary concept in magical societies.","King Aldric found himself in the unusual position of wanting everything while having to choose carefully—a distinctly non-royal experience that proved both humbling and oddly refreshing.","...","The king reached into his own storage space with ease, withdrawing an orb that immediately caught Noah’s attention. The sphere pulsed with contained fire essence, its crimson core seeming to burn without generating heat.","A Tier 5 fire orb. Noah thought.","\"Okay, before we start with those premium items,\" King Aldric said, holding the fire orb with obvious care, \"I would first like to exchange one of my treasures. A Tier 5 orb for your wind orb—what do you say?\"","Noah accepted happily in his mind before nodding with a casual gesture.","\"No problem, we can do that,\" he replied smoothly, retrieving a wind orb from his storage ring and extending it toward the king.","It was a perfect exchange. Both parties get exactly what they need, and both orbs were worth the same price.","The trade proceeded smoothly, each orb changing hands with the careful respect such powerful artefacts deserved. King Aldric’s smile reflected genuine satisfaction as he stored his new wind orb in his dimensional space.","The king’s strategic thinking became clear as he explained his reasoning. \"I’m a wind mage—the fire orb didn’t really help my personal development. I had kept it as a treasure for occasions like this, or perhaps for my daughter when she was younger.\"","\"But she didn’t unlock a fire talent,\" he continued, glancing toward Elara with paternal pride. \"She developed elemental affinity instead. While she could use a fire orb, she can also benefit from a wind orb. Hence, I opted for the wind orb that both she and I can use effectively.\"","Elara nodded with understanding, clearly appreciating her father’s thoughtful consideration of their combined advancement needs.","With the orb exchange completed, King Aldric turned his attention to the premium enhancement items with a calculating expression.","\"I’ve decided,\" he announced. \"I’ll take a beef jerky and an energy drink for myself.\"","Vitality and agility enhancement. They are great for a ruler like himself. The agility would perhaps fix one of his weaknesses or strengthen one of his strengths, and the vitality was to ensure he stayed healthy.","Then he turned toward his daughter with the indulgent expression of a father prepared to spoil his child. \"Which one do you want? You can pick one.\"","Elara’s face lit up with happiness at being included in the premium purchase opportunity. \"I want the strength one,\" she said immediately, her tactical thinking evident in her quick decision.","The protein bar. Strategic choice.","\"My physical strength has always been somewhat low,\" she explained, \"and with permanent enhancement, I can strengthen my close combat power as a mage. Better balance between magical and physical abilities.\"","The king nodded with obvious approval of his daughter’s thinking. \"Excellent choice. Physical enhancement complements magical abilities perfectly.\"","King Aldric then retrieved a storage ring from his dimensional space, its surface glowing with contained wealth. \"Eighteen hundred golden coins,\" he announced, presenting the ring to Noah.","Royal payment in premium storage. That ring alone is worth fifty golden coins.","Noah accepted the payment ring while noting its obvious quality and value. Storage rings weren’t cheap accessories—this particular one probably cost around fifty golden coins, making it a generous gesture beyond the required payment.","The king was being deliberately generous, or perhaps that was his personality.","Seeing such royal generosity, Noah’s business instincts kicked in with corresponding magnanimity. As the shopkeeper, he naturally couldn’t allow himself to be outdone in gift-giving by his customers.","Noah moved to his shelves with a purposeful stride, gathering the requested items.","Beef jerky, energy drink, and protein bar.","But then he retrieved a second protein bar from the display, adding it to the king’s purchase with a casual move.","Instead of the three items that the king had purchased, Noah took four.","King Aldric stared in bewilderment at the unexpected addition to his order. \"I didn’t ask for two protein bars?\" His voice carried genuine confusion mixed with growing amazement.","He thought that Noah had grabbed it by accident."]},{"number":158,"title":"Chapter 158: A Gift","paragraphs":["\"It’s a gift,\" Noah replied simply, as if gifting items that could be stored as kingdom treasures was normal.","The king stared at Noah for several long moments. Even as a royal himself, he had a bit of trouble comprehending that he was receiving a gift worth six hundred golden coins.","Then King Aldric laughed.","A genuine laugh of delight filled the shop with warmth. \"You are a very interesting person.\"","Naturally, the king couldn’t reject such a valuable and thoughtfully given gift. The gesture clearly demonstrated Noah’s desire to boost the king’s personal capabilities by providing all three types of enhancement rather than just the two he’d purchased.","\"Then I shall thank you graciously,\" King Aldric replied with dignity appropriate to receiving such significant generosity. \"If you ever need anything, the crown will assist you. Don’t hesitate to ask.\"","Noah nodded. \"I won’t.\"","Elara looked at Noah with obvious happiness on her face.","...","After the transaction was completed, King Aldric’s demeanour shifted abruptly from satisfied customer to alert sovereign. His magical senses had detected something that immediately grabbed his attention, causing him to turn his gaze toward the shop door with a sharp glare.","\"There is a master-level demon outside. Is that your friend?\" the king stated calmly, his voice carrying no alarm but unmistakable awareness.","The king’s question suggested Elara had already briefed him about Noah’s unusual associations, which explained his measured tone rather than an immediate defensive response. Still, his posture indicated someone prepared for potential threats while hoping for a peaceful resolution.","Good preparation from Elara. This could’ve gone badly. Noah thought, giving her a mental thumbs up.","Noah immediately nodded with confirming certainty. \"Yes, it’s my friend. Her name is Lola, and I’ve sent her on something important that I would also like you to know about.\"","Noah moved toward the shop door. He had locked it to avoid any disturbance.","Lola’s timing is perfect. She must have gotten enough information.","Opening the door, Noah gestured for his returning employee to enter. Lola stepped through the threshold, her eyes immediately landing on the new figure.","Her ruby eyes locked onto King Aldric with instant recognition of his power level. The aura that had made common merchants nervous was more visible to her perception; this was no mere human noble, but an archmage.","Lola’s expression changed to wary as she assessed the potential threat level represented by an unknown archmage in Noah’s shop. Her posture indicated someone prepared for immediate combat if the situation demanded it.","Sensing the tension building between two supremely powerful individuals, Noah quickly provided introductory context to defuse any misunderstanding.","\"Lola, this is King Aldric of the human kingdom, Elara’s father. Your Majesty, this is Lola, my trusted friend and colleague in this shop.\"","Lola glanced at Noah. He had not only introduced her as a trusted friend but as a colleague instead of an employee.","King Aldric nodded in greeting with royal courtesy that acknowledged Lola’s obvious power while maintaining appropriate dignity. His gesture carried respect rather than suspicion, suggesting Elara’s briefing had prepared him well for this encounter.","Lola returned the gesture with corresponding politeness, her initial wariness fading as she recognised the lack of hostile intent from the archmage king.","With introductions complete and crisis averted, Noah immediately shifted focus to the critical intelligence Lola had gathered during her surveillance mission.","\"What did you discover about the guard?\" he asked, his voice carrying urgency that indicated significant stakes involved in her reconnaissance.","Lola’s expression grew serious as she prepared to deliver information that would likely have a significant effect on those present.","\"Our guess was right, the guard is definitely working with the extremists,\" she stated, certain, as someone who had witnessed events firsthand.","The guard working with the extremist confirmed that Richard was definitely working with them too, and that was direct evidence. Richard’s death for treason was basically set in stone.","Her ruby eyes flicked between Noah and the royal family as she continued with details that made the implications clear.","\"I followed him to a meeting point outside the city walls. Several demons were waiting; they are most definitely extremists, they were hiding and trying to keep their presence unnoticed,\" Lola explained.","\"I also heard the demons tell the guard to bring Richard,\" she added, her hearing having captured conversations from a considerable distance. \"They were discussing something that sounded like coordination for a larger operation.\"","The intelligence painted a clear picture of an organised conspiracy involving both human nobles and demon extremists, exactly the kind of internal threat that could destabilise the entire kingdom.","Noah nodded with grim satisfaction at having his suspicions confirmed through direct observation rather than speculation.","\"Your Majesty,\" he said, turning to address King Aldric with appropriate formality, \"this confirms what Princess Elara and I discussed regarding Baron Richard’s suspicious activities.\"","Noah began to brief the king on the full scope of what had happened before his appearance.","Noah’s explanation was comprehensive and carefully structured to provide maximum clarity for the king to make a decision.","\"Baron Richard has been extorting citizens and collaborating with demon extremists,\" he began. \"The evidence suggests he’s been trading human kingdom resources. Possibly including military intelligence, in exchange for extremist support for his illegal activities.\"","\"The extremists aren’t representative of the demon kingdom’s government,\" Noah continued, drawing crucial distinctions that could prevent a broader diplomatic crisis. \"They’re rogue elements that both kingdoms should consider mutual enemies.\"","\"Lola’s surveillance of one of the close guards that was working under Baron Richard’s commands has provided direct evidence of coordination between Baron Richard’s agents and extremist operatives,\" he concluded. \"This represents clear treason against the crown that demands immediate intervention.\"","\"I’ve sacrificed tens of my products to bring him to light and gain the evidence. Based on Lola’s words, the baron should have a meeting with the extremists shortly. We can use this information to catch him in the act, immediately!\"","King Aldric’s expression grew increasingly grave as the full scope of the conspiracy became clear. As the king of a kingdom, he knew how to recognize threats to kingdom stability, and this represented exactly the kind of internal corruption that could destroy legitimate government from within."]},{"number":159,"title":"Chapter 159: Confrontation","paragraphs":["After hearing the report from Noah, King Aldric’s expression hardened with the decisive authority of someone confronting a clear threat to his kingdom’s security. The evidence of treason demanded immediate action rather than delays.","He turned toward Lola with the respectful tone of someone addressing a capable ally rather than a subordinate. \"Would you mind leading us to where they will conduct their meeting?\"","The king’s tone was appropriate in weight. His willingness to personally investigate rather than delegating to subordinates demonstrated the seriousness with which he viewed the threat.","Lola glanced toward Noah, seeking confirmation before committing to assist in what could become a dangerous confrontation. Her loyalty lay with her employer rather than the crown, making Noah’s approval essential for her participation.","The king spotted the exchange and his eyes flickered softly. The fact that a master-level demon was this loyal to Noah was baffling, but after seeing the items in his hands, it made sense.","The man in front of him wasn’t simple at all!","Noah signalled his approval with a slight nod, understanding that this represented exactly the kind of evidence-gathering opportunity they’d been hoping to achieve.","\"Let’s all go together,\" Noah announced with obvious satisfaction, his smile reflecting confidence in their ability to handle whatever they might encounter.","With a master-level demon, adept-level princess and an archmage? Noah doubted that the so-called extremists would be able to do anything.","The prospect of personally witnessing extremist-noble collaboration while backed by royal authority represented the ideal scenario for exposing Baron Richard’s criminal network and taking his assets.","Noah moved toward the counter where Leo had been quietly observing the adult conversations. The young lion’s senses had undoubtedly detected the tension in the room, but his trust in Noah kept him calm despite the obvious preparation for potentially dangerous activity.","\"Come on, Leo,\" Noah said gently, scooping up the golden-maned cub with affection. \"Time for a field trip.\"","Leo purred with contentment at being included in the group’s activities, his enthusiasm undiminished by any understanding of the serious nature of their mission.","King Aldric observed the interaction with obvious interest. He knew that specific species of golden mane lions, and that specific species were powerful and very loyal.","Princess Elara’s expression reflected growing anticipation mixed with appropriate concern about personally investigating treasonous activities.","Lola took point position as they prepared to depart.","\"The meeting location is approximately five minutes from here. We’ll need to maintain concealment once we approach the area; they have two adept-level mages on watch duty,\" she informed the group.","...","As they left the kingdom through the gate whilst concealed by a spell that King Aldric had conjured, their party had moved through the kingdom quietly and efficiently.","The royal concealment magic wrapped around them like invisible silk, rendering them completely undetectable to even the powerful mages inside the kingdom, except for a few mages whom they passed by, once they realised it was the king, simply ignored it and didn’t ask.","Lola gestured ahead with her slender fingers.","\"It’s about two minutes away. Over there,\" she said, pointing toward a seemingly ordinary section of countryside that appeared unremarkable to casual observation.","Two minutes of careful movement brought them to their destination. The location was actually hidden yet visible, a perfect example of concealment through misdirection rather than just magical invisibility.","\"These demons were incredibly courageous, picking a place in plain sight,\" Noah observed with grudging admiration for their boldness.","Lola pointed toward what appeared to be an abandoned water well, its stone construction weathered by time. \"Over there,\" she said simply.","The king nodded and extended his senses to scan the area thoroughly. His magical perception confirmed Lola’s assessment; the demons had established a complete operational base beneath the well structure.","The location was brilliant in its simplicity. Hidden in plain sight, where nobody would think to conduct revealing spells, the well provided perfect cover for clandestine operations.","King Aldric’s magical senses also detected sophisticated protective measures layered throughout the underground facility. The defensive enchantments were subtle but powerful, designed to deflect casual magical investigation while maintaining the appearance of an ordinary well.","\"Only master-level mages or above could detect these protections, which means at least one of the demons inside that place has master-level capabilities,\" he murmured with a frown on his face from the magical expertise involved.","The implications were clear—this wasn’t a simple meeting between Baron Richard’s guard and low-level extremist operatives. The presence of master-level demons suggested a significant conspiracy with resources and expertise that posed genuine threats to the kingdom’s security.","\"We’re dealing with powerful enemies, they might have a master-level threat or perhaps higher, be careful. But still, they shouldn’t have more than one. Otherwise, the measures against finding them would have been stronger and harder to find,\" King Aldric concluded.","The hidden base represented exactly the kind of sophisticated enemy installation that could coordinate complex operations against both human and legitimate demon territories.","...","The king’s magical perception continued scanning the well structure, revealing additional layers of security that confirmed the sophistication of the extremist operation.","\"There are two adept-rank extremists positioned as lookouts, just like your friend had said,\" King Aldric whispered, his voice barely audible. \"They’re actually hidden within the well itself, but unlike the others who are deep underground, these two are stationed near the actual water level.\"","His magical senses allowed him to analyse the defensive positioning of the enemies as if he were able to see them with his naked eyes. The placement of guards at different depths created overlapping security zones that would detect threats approaching from multiple angles.","Noah raised an eyebrow. \"Smart positioning. The water naturally muffles sound while offering a clear line of sight to the surface. Anyone approaching the well would be detected instantly through their magical senses.","It’s a built-in early warning system. If anything feels off, they can alert those deeper inside before an ambush even begins. Normal Awakeners wouldn’t stand a chance sneaking in; it would take at least a master-level mage to pull that off. Luckily, we don’t only have one but two.\""]},{"number":160,"title":"Chapter 160: Set in stone.","paragraphs":["The king’s expression hardened with decisiveness as he processed the situation. \"Let’s go and deal with them,\" he declared, his voice carrying the confidence of someone accustomed to resolving the threat before him.","They moved forward while still concealed within the spell that King Aldric had conjured earlier, their party approaching the well unseen.","Once they were positioned directly above the opening, the king raised his hand and cast another magical spell.","\"Aerial Grace,\" The king muttered silently, as the spell activated.","Noah felt the familiar sensation of wind magic as they all began floating in the air. Hovering above the floor as if they were truly capable of flight.","Noah looked with amazement at the effortless display of such an advanced wind manipulation technique. He could sense the precise control required to levitate multiple people simultaneously while maintaining their concealment spell. His smile reflected both admiration and anticipation. Someday, he would achieve similar mastery of wind magic.","He wanted to ask at what rank such techniques became possible, but he restrained himself from speaking. They were in enemy territory where even whispered conversations could compromise their mission.","They descended slowly into the well, the king’s wind magic allowing perfect control of their movement speed. The stone walls passed by silently as they approached the water level where the extremist guards were stationed.","As they drew closer, Noah began hearing voices echoing from below. The two guards were engaged in casual conversation, their relaxed tone suggesting they felt completely secure in their hidden position.","\"That bread is really good,\" one guard was saying with obvious satisfaction. \"Richard really brought some good stuff. He’s one of the few somewhat likeable humans.\"","The demons were naturally speaking in their demon tongue, but Noah was able to understand it through the system’s translation.","Noah’s eyes widened with shock as he realised the extremists were discussing his magical bread. The items Baron Richard had extorted from his shop were being distributed among demon extremists as part of their operational supplies.","...","The king turned towards Lola and asked softly, \"Do you understand what they are saying?\"","Before Lola could respond, Noah was the one to answer his question. \"They are saying that the bread the baron had gotten them is really good, and that he is one of the few humans that are somewhat likeable.\"","The king raised an eyebrow but nodded with understanding. The fact that Noah could speak the demon tongue was another mystery surrounding the young merchant, but it made logical sense given his circumstances.","After all, having a master-level demon mage as a companion while being unable to communicate in her native language would be impractical. How else could they coordinate their business operations and develop their obvious partnership?","Arriving at the water level, Noah and the others could finally see the extremist guards positioned within the well’s depths.","Unlike the low-level extremists who usually attacked the kingdom’s walls with barely any intelligence or coordination, the ones in front of him were actually developed mentally and physically. These were powerful demons rather than mindless raiders.","The first guard stood roughly six feet tall with well-maintained armour. His horns were filed to sharp points, and his red eyes were alert despite the calm hour.","He was clearly someone trained in surveillance techniques. The scars running across his arms suggested that he had extensive combat experience.","The second guard appeared equally competent, his equipment clean and functional rather than crude or improvised. Both demons carried themselves with confidence.","Noah recognised that their equipment was a blend of human and demonic craftsmanship. As he had visited both kingdoms, he had seen how each kingdom had their own touches to equipment.","And the equipment that Noah spotted on both demons meant that Richard wasn’t only cooperating with them on the low, no. He was also arming them with items from inside Esta, which was even more cruel.","Using human equipment to kill humans, Richard was truly a cruel man.","\"They are at the adept rank for a reason,\" Noah whispered, noting the obvious intelligence in their positioning.","The guards continued their casual conversation, completely unaware of the concealed observers floating above them. Their relaxed but vigilant bodies confirmed they felt secure in their hidden position.","\"Richard’s connections have been useful,\" the first guard was saying as he bit into another piece of Noah’s magical bread. \"The healing properties are genuine, not like the fake potions most humans try to trade. Those barely give us any benefits.\"","\"Agreed, though I still don’t trust humans in general. Richard gets respect because he delivers what he promises,\" replied his companion.","King Aldric’s expression hardened as he listened to Noah’s translation of the casual discussion of treason and collaboration.","These demons were treating Baron Richard as a reliable business partner rather than a reluctant victim of extremist pressure.","With that coming out, the king had already issued a verdict internally. Richard’s execution for treason was set in stone, and no amount of begging could get him out of that.","Without warning, the king raised his hand and cast another spell. The water around the two guards suddenly formed into a massive bubble of air that completely enclosed their position.","The magical barrier materialised instantly, trapping both extremists within a sphere of breathable atmosphere while cutting them off from the outside world before they could realise they were ambushed. The water pressed against the bubble’s surface like a transparent wall, creating a perfect prison.","Both guards immediately realised something was catastrophically wrong. Their relaxed conversation died as they found themselves trapped within an impossible magical bubble of wind and water that had appeared without warning.","\"What in the—\" the first guard began, his hand immediately moving toward a communication crystal attached to his belt.","\"Alert spell!\" shouted the second guard, also reaching for his emergency signalling crystal.","Both demons activated their crystals simultaneously, expecting to send warning signals to their commander deeper in the underground facility. The crystals flared with energy as they attempted to transmit emergency alerts.","But to their horror...nothing happened."]},{"number":161,"title":"Chapter 161: First attack.","paragraphs":["The magical barrier that imprisoned them also blocked all forms of communication, creating complete isolation from their allies. Their warning signals simply dissipated against the king’s spell work without reaching any external recipients.","\"The signals aren’t getting through!\" the first guard said with growing panic, shaking his crystal desperately.","\"We’re completely cut off!\" confirmed his companion, his professional composure cracking as the the reality of them being imprisoned from the outside world became clear.","..","Both guards drew their weapons, but their blades felt useless against the magical imprisonment that offered no physical target to attack. They were trapped within an air pocket, surrounded by water and magical barriers that defied their resistance.","\"This is at least a master-level spell work,\" the first guard assessed grimly, his experience allowing him to recognise the sophistication of their prison.","\"Whoever’s doing this can easily kill us...We are in trouble.\"","\"More than serious,\" replied the second guard, testing the bubble’s boundaries with cautious sword strikes that accomplished nothing. \"This is archmage-level magic. We’re dealing with someone far beyond our ability to handle.\"","Their panic intensified as they realised the hopelessness of their situation. Professional extremist operatives were accustomed to having escape plans and backup options, but this magical imprisonment offered no solutions.","\"Show yourselves!\" the first guard shouted toward the water above them, hoping to negotiate with their captors. \"We demand to know who dares interfere with our operations!\"","\"Demand?\" came King Aldric’s voice as the concealment spell finally dissolved, revealing the floating party of investigators.","The extremist guards’ eyes widened with shock as they beheld their captors.","a human king whose aura marked him as incredibly powerful, a princess whose royal bearing was unmistakable, a master-level succubus whose presence made both guards instinctively step backwards, and a normal-looking human at the novice rank.","The human next to the three powerful individuals was like a small lamp next to the stars; they completely ignored him.","Unknownest to them, the seemingly ordinary young man in front of them was the main reason that they would all be dead tonight. The reason why one of the most powerful demon bases near the human kingdom would perish, and alongside it, would perish the traitors to the human kingdom.","\"The human...king,\" the first guard breathed, recognising the royal insignia and overwhelming presence.","The second guard’s weapon clattered to the ground as the full scope of their situation became clear. They hadn’t been captured by normal human adventurers or opportunistic bounty hunters; they were facing the legitimate ruler of the human kingdom, backed by forces that completely outclassed their defensive capabilities.","\"You will answer our questions,\" King Aldric stated with cold eyes that sent shivers done the spine of the demons in front of him.","...","The trapped extremists found themselves facing interrogation by the most powerful man in the human kingdom, with no escape route and no hope of rescue from their underground allies.","\"How many demons are there inside, and what’s their strength?\" the king demanded, his voice carrying the authority of absolute power.","The demons stared at him with obvious confusion, their expressions revealing they didn’t understand his words. After all, they didn’t speak the human tongue fluently enough to comprehend complex interrogation questions.","Seeing their confusion, Noah stepped forward to translate.","The first demon responded with forced bravado despite his trapped position. \"There are a few of us. With the strongest being near the master-class but still within adept shackles.\"","Upon hearing Noah’s translation, the king frowned deeply. His enhanced senses had already detected multiple master-level magical signatures deeper in the underground facility, marking the demon’s response an obvious lie.","Without warning, King Aldric gestured sharply and conjured a razor-thin wind blade that cut through the first demon’s arm with out any resistance. The limb separated cleanly, blood spattering against the magical barrier as the extremist screamed in agony.","\"You’re lying,\" the king stated with terrifying calm. \"For every lie you spout out of that filthy mouth, you will lose a limb.\"","The second demon, witnessing his companion’s mutilation, attempted another deception. \"We’re just scouts! The base is mostly empty!\"","Another wind blade flashed through the air, severing the lying demon’s leg at the knee. His agonised howl echoed within the magical bubble as he collapsed to the bottom of their prison.","Both extremists realised the futility of their situation. They couldn’t inform or help their team inside; they couldn’t escape, and their interrogator possessed both the power and ruthlessness to dismember them until they broke.","Rather than face continued torture and eventual betrayal of their cause, both demons made a final choice that demonstrated their fanatical dedication.","They glanced at each other for a second before subtly nodding.","The first demon’s eyes blazed with resolve.","\"For the true demon kingdom!\" he shouted, his hands moving to his chest where his mana core pulsed with contained energy.","The second demon echoed his companion’s declaration. \"Death before dishonour to humans!\"","Both extremists began expanding rapidly as they deliberately destabilised their own mana cores. Their bodies swelled like balloons as energy built toward a catastrophic level.","\"Boom!\"","They burst simultaneously inside the bubble, filling it with gore and blood. The barrier contained the explosion completely, preventing any damage to the surrounding area while trapping the extremists’ remains within their prison.","Lola observed the aftermath with detachment, her centuries of combat experience having shown her similar fanatical behaviour before.","To Noah, however, this was something entirely different. Witnessing beings willing to self-destruct for a cause. Seeing it firsthand was unprecedented.","He stood frozen, staring at the aftermath in stunned silence. As much as he despised the demons, he couldn’t help but feel some respect for their unwavering loyalty.","\"They destroyed their mana cores,\" she muttered with a mixture of disgust and respect. \"These extremists are loyal to their cause; they are truly delusional...it’s sad.\"","The self-destruction demonstrated the depth of extremist indoctrination, these demons preferred suicide over the possibility of revealing information that might compromise their operations or ideology."]},{"number":162,"title":"Chapter 162: Treason.","paragraphs":["King Aldric dispelled the bloody bubble with a wave of his hand, allowing the contaminated water to flow away and clear the area. His expression showed no satisfaction at the interrogation’s violent conclusion.","\"Fanatics,\" he said grimly. \"This confirms we’re dealing with true believers rather than mercenaries or opportunists.\"","The extremists’ willingness to die rather than risk betraying their cause meant the conspiracy ran deeper than simple criminal collaboration. These were ideologically committed enemies who would sacrifice everything for their twisted vision of demon supremacy.","\"The master-level demons deeper in the facility will be even more dangerous,\" Noah observed, understanding that their opponents’ fanatical dedication made them unpredictable and extremely hazardous.","...","They moved through the underground tunnel system with their concealment spell still active, their footsteps completely silent against the rough stone flooring. The passageway stretched deeper into the earth, branching into multiple directions that suggested a complex network of chambers and rooms.","As they progressed, they encountered several doorways leading to various chambers. King Aldric paused at each entrance, extending his enhanced magical senses to scan for occupants.","\"Empty bedrooms,\" he murmured after checking the third consecutive vacant room. \"The demons are either in a meeting or gathered somewhere else entirely.\"","The abandoned chambers showed signs of recent habitation—unmade beds, personal belongings scattered about, and the lingering scent of occupancy. But every room they passed stood empty, as if the entire underground facility had been evacuated except for essential personnel.","\"They’re all gathered in one location,\" Noah observed, noting the pattern of abandonment. \"Something important must be happening.\"","Their progress through the tunnel system eventually brought them to a much larger chamber, its massive wooden doors suggesting significant importance within the facility’s hierarchy. Unlike the modest entrances to sleeping quarters, this portal was reinforced with metal bands and magical wards that spoke to high-level security measures.","King Aldric paused before the imposing entrance, his expression growing more serious as his magical perception detected the energy signatures beyond.","\"Zephyra’s Eye,\" he muttered with articulation, his hands weaving complex gestures that called upon archmage-level magic.","Suddenly, a translucent orb appeared behind him, floating with gentle rotation as it absorbed ambient magical energy. The sphere pulsed with contained wind essence, its surface shimmering with recorded moments that seemed to dance within its structure.","Noah glanced at the floating artefact with obvious fascination, unable to contain his curiosity about such advanced magical techniques. \"What’s this?\"","\"This is a skill I’ve learned recently,\" Aldric explained patiently. \"It’s only available at the archmage level, a technique that allows me to do the seemingly impossible.\"","He gestured toward the floating orb with obvious appreciation for its sophisticated magical construction. \"It allows me to capture moments and store them using concentrated wind and mana manipulation. With this artefact, I can review whatever was recorded, like viewing events from the past.\"","Noah’s eyes widened with genuine amazement. An archmage spell that functioned like a camera represented the kind of advanced technique he could only dream of mastering at his current skill level.","\"That’s incredibly impressive,\" he breathed, his mind already imagining the strategic applications of such capability. \"Recording evidence that can’t be disputed or altered.\"","The implications were staggering. With Zephyra’s Eye, they could document whatever conspiracy lay beyond the chamber doors and present irrefutable proof to any authority that demanded evidence of treason.","King Aldric nodded with satisfaction at Noah’s appreciation for the spell’s sophistication. \"Evidence gathering at the highest level. Whatever we discover here will be preserved for royal justice.\"","With the recording spell activated and ready to document their findings, the king’s expression changed to serious. The time for stealth and scouting had ended. Now they needed direct confrontation with whatever conspiracy awaited beyond the reinforced doors.","\"There’s no need to hide anymore,\" he declared with the authority of someone prepared for open conflict. \"We have the evidence we need, and now we simply gather the traitors and enemies for punishment.\"","Before opening the door, the king positioned their group for optimal safety and advantage. \"Noah, Elara, behind us. Lady Lola and I will take point position.\"","The arrangement placed the two most magically powerful individuals at the front, where they could respond immediately to threats, while keeping the less combat-experienced members in protected positions where they could observe and document without becoming primary targets.","Noah moved behind the king as instructed, understanding that his swordsmanship skills, while advancing rapidly, weren’t yet sufficient for master-level magical combat. Princess Elara took position beside him, her own magical capabilities formidable but not quite matching her father’s archmage-level power.","Lola flowed into combat position beside King Aldric. Her master-level magical abilities combined with the king’s archmage power created a front line that could handle virtually any threat they might encounter.","With positions established and recording magic active, King Aldric placed his hand on the reinforced door and pushed it open with force.","The chamber beyond revealed itself as a vast underground meeting hall, its ceiling supported by carved stone pillars. Magical torches provided flickering illumination, which made the place visible but mysterious at the same time.","What they saw inside made Noah raise an eyebrow in interest.","Approximately fifty demons filled the chamber, their ranks clearly organised by magical power and status.","Most appeared to be apprentice-level demons, the backbone of any extremist organisation, while several adept-rank individuals occupied positions of obvious authority near the front of the gathering.","But dominating the entire assembly was a single master-level demon whose magical aura filled the chamber with menace. His presence got the king’s and Lola’s immediate attention, marking him as the clear leader of this underground conspiracy.","However, the demons weren’t the most shocking discovery within the treasonous gathering.","Baron Richard stood near the front of the assembly, his large alcohol belly unmistakable even in the flickering torchlight. But he wasn’t alone among the human collaborators; several other nobles of equivalent rank had joined his betrayal of the crown.","Most disturbing of all was the presence of a viscount whose higher noble rank suggested the conspiracy reached deeper into the kingdom’s aristocratic hierarchy than anyone had suspected."]},{"number":163,"title":"Chapter 163: Burning Life Force.","paragraphs":["The mixed gathering of demons and human nobles represented exactly the kind of cross-species collaboration that could not only destabilise but perhaps destroy the human kingdom if left unchecked. This wasn’t simple criminal activity; it was organised treason on a scale that threatened the very foundations of legitimate government.","The moment the door opened, every head in the chamber turned toward the unexpected intrusion. Fifty pairs of eyes, demonic and human alike, focused on the small group of investigators who had just shattered their secret meeting.","The silence that followed lasted only seconds before recognition dawned across multiple faces simultaneously.","\"King Aldric!\" Baron Richard’s voice cracked with terror as he recognised the royal figure standing in the doorway.","\"The human king!\" shouted one of the adept-rank demons, his mind immediately assessing the threat level represented by an archmage-level opponent.","\"We’re compromised!\" screamed the viscount, his instincts recognising that royal discovery of their conspiracy meant death sentences for everyone involved.","Panic erupted throughout the chamber as extremists and nobles alike realised their secret alliance had been exposed by the most powerful authority in the human kingdom. Shouts of alarm mixed with the sound of weapons being drawn and magical energy being summoned for combat.","The master-level demon leader’s eyes blazed with fury as he processed the human king’s presence. His aura intensified dramatically, filling the chamber with oppressive energy that made the air itself feel thick and hostile.","\"Kill them!\" he roared with the authority of someone accustomed to commanding absolute obedience.","\"None of them can leave here alive!\"","The chamber exploded into chaos as fifty extremists and their noble collaborators prepared for desperate battle against opponents they knew possessed superior magical capabilities.","But before the first spell could be cast or blade drawn, King Aldric’s voice cut through the pandemonium with the overwhelming authority of archmage-level power.","\"SILENCE!\"","The command froze every person under the adept rank in the chamber as royal authority backed by devastating magical power dominated the underground space. Even the master-level demon found himself momentarily stunned by the sheer force of the king’s presence.","Zephyra’s Eye continued recording every detail of the treasonous gathering, preserving evidence that would ensure justice for every conspirator present.","...","The master-level demon’s aura intensified dramatically as he focused every ounce of his considerable power on breaking King Aldric’s magical command. His muscles strained visibly as raw magical force battled against royal authority, the underground chamber filling with conflicting energies that made the very air crackle with tension.","Despite his obvious effort and the tremendous mana expenditure required, the demon leader managed to shatter the king’s spell through sheer determination and power. However, the victory came at a slight cost; beads of sweat formed on his forehead from exertion.","The master-level demon looked genuinely worried as he assessed their situation. He had used an enormous amount of mana to break the king’s monopolising spell, and things definitely weren’t looking good for his forces.","An archmage-level opponent backed by a master-level succubus represented overwhelming opposition that his mixed group of extremists and corrupt nobles couldn’t hope to match in direct combat.","Immediately recognising the desperate nature of their circumstances, the demon leader decided to play a defensive role that might give his forces a chance at survival.","His hands moved as he conjured magical energy, focusing his remaining power into a massive protective barrier. The shield materialised as a large red dome that encompassed the entire gathering, its surface rippling with contained energy.","\"Everyone!\" he shouted with a hurried tone. \"Prepare for a joint attack! Gather all your energy and focus it into one coordinated strike. I will protect you while you charge your spells!\"","The combined magical assault of fifty demons ranging from apprentice to adept rank wasn’t something to dismiss lightly. King Aldric’s expression grew serious as he calculated the potential threat such concentrated firepower might represent.","If properly coordinated and given sufficient time to charge, their combined attack might perhaps reach archmage-level power in terms of raw magical output. Naturally, that didn’t mean they could actually fight an archmage in sustained combat; factors like casting time, experience, and individual capability would prevent such coordination under normal circumstances.","Besides, it wasn’t like an archmage would let such a large group continue their casting; he would simply kill them as they charged their attacks.","But the master-level demon’s protective barrier was giving them exactly the time and security they needed to attempt such a desperate gambit.","King Aldric refused to allow the extremists to execute their plan unchallenged. He immediately began attacking the master-level demon’s barrier with concentrated wind magic, his archmage-level spells striking the red dome with tremendous force.","However, the demon leader was pouring all of his remaining mana into maintaining the protective shield, making it incredibly difficult to penetrate. The barrier absorbed each attack and redistributed the energy across its entire surface, creating a nearly impenetrable defence.","Time was passing, and the combined magical energy within the protective dome was growing larger and more dangerous with each passing moment. The apprentice and adept-rank demons chanted in unison, their individual magical capabilities merging into something far more threatening than the sum of their parts.","Seeing that things weren’t looking good, Noah reached into his storage ring and withdrew two bottles of iced tea.","He recognised the crisis developing before them. Whilst the king and Lola were attacking, their attacks weren’t to the max of their abilities. After all, they still needed to keep some mana to protect themselves in case things went wrong.","Besides, the master-level demons seemed to be burning through his life force as he increased his power tremendously for a short period of time.","\"Here!\" he called, offering the magical beverages to Lola and King Aldric, who were focusing their attacks on the barrier. \"This will help!\"","Both powerful mages accepted the bottles without hesitation, understanding that any advantage in a battle of this magnitude could prove decisive. They drank the iced tea quickly, feeling the immediate effects as their mana reserves expanded and their magical regeneration accelerated."]},{"number":164,"title":"Chapter 164: The death of the demons.","paragraphs":["The iced tea increased mana reserves, regeneration, and magical power by thirty percent, making King Aldric much less worried about his energy expenditure during the prolonged assault on the demon’s barrier.","Immediately after consuming the magical enhancement, both attackers’ spells became significantly more powerful. The barrier, which had been holding steady under their previous assault, began showing visible cracks as the enhanced magical attacks overwhelmed its defensive capabilities.","The red dome shattered with a sound like breaking crystal, its protective energy dissipating as the master-level demon’s mana finally proved insufficient to maintain the shield against archmage-level and master-level succubus assault, despite burning through his life-force.","At that moment, Baron Richard’s eyes fell upon Noah for the first time since the chamber doors had opened. His face contorted with rage and betrayal as realization crashed over him like a physical blow.","\"YOU!\" he screamed, pointing an accusatory finger at the young merchant.","\"You set me up! You knew the king personally. Otherwise, how could you bring him directly to our secret meeting? You followed me, you damn rat!\"","...","The baron’s political mind finally grasped the scope of Noah’s deception. The mysterious shopkeeper hadn’t been a helpless victim to extort; he had been a deliberate agent working to expose their conspiracy from the very beginning!","\"You played me like a fool! Everything was a trap!\" Richard continued raging, his voice breaking with fury and madness.","But his angry revelation came too late to change their hopeless situation. With their protective barrier destroyed and their coordinated attack interrupted, the extremists found themselves facing archmage-level opposition without adequate preparation.","The battle that followed was swift and brutal. King Aldric’s wind magic tore through the apprentice and adept-rank demons with devastating efficiency, while Lola’s master-level spells eliminated multiple targets simultaneously.","The corrupt nobles, lacking any significant magical power, could only watch in terror as their extremist allies fell around them like wheat before a scythe.","Within minutes, every adept-rank demon lay dead or dying, their blood pooling on the stone floor of the underground chamber. The few surviving apprentice-rank operatives cowered in corners, too terrified to continue fighting against such overwhelming opposition.","Seeing the complete destruction of his forces, the master-level demon leader made the same choice his guards had made earlier. His eyes blazed with fanatical determination as he refused to accept capture or interrogation by human authorities.","\"For the true demon kingdom!\" he roared, placing his hands over his mana core with desperate resolve. \"Death before submission to inferior humans!\"","The demon began expanding rapidly as he deliberately destabilised his own magical core, his body swelling grotesquely as contained energy built toward catastrophic release.","But unlike the smaller explosions from the adept-rank guards earlier, a master-level demon’s self-destruction represented exponentially greater destructive potential.","The explosion, when it came, was a hundred times more powerful than the adept-rank demons. The underground chamber was filled with blinding light and devastating force as the demon’s mana core detonated with the energy of a small magical bomb.","King Aldric and Lola immediately recognised the mortal danger such an explosion represented to their less-protected companions. Working together with urgency, they combined their magical abilities to create a defensive barrier around Noah, Princess Elara, and the surviving corrupt nobles.","The protective shield absorbed the worst of the blast, though the chamber walls cracked and debris rained down from the ceiling as the magical explosion tested the structural integrity of the entire underground facility.","When the light faded and the dust settled, they found themselves alive but shaken within their magical protection. The master-level demon had been completely obliterated by his own desperate gambit, leaving nothing but a crater where he had made his final stand.","The surviving corrupt nobles, Baron Richard, the viscount, and several others, cowered within the protective barrier, their faces pale with terror as they realised their extremist allies were all dead while they remained at the mercy of royal justice.","\"Don’t get any weird ideas, we protected you only to ensure proper execution later,\" King Aldric informed the trembling traitors with cold authority. \"You will all be executed publicly in the main streets, as befits those who commit treason against the kingdom.\"","The underground conspiracy had been shattered, its leaders dead and its human collaborators captured for public justice. But the fanatical dedication shown by the extremist demons served as a sobering reminder of the ideological threat that still faced both kingdoms.","The evidence recorded by Zephyra’s Eye would ensure that justice was swift and public, while the destruction of this particular cell would send a clear message to any other nobles contemplating collaboration with enemies of the human kingdom.","...","On their way back to the human kingdom, Noah glanced at the captured human nobles with undisguised disgust. The sight of Baron Richard and his fellow conspirators filled him with revulsion that transcended mere disappointment.","To sell your own people for mere profits was truly disgusting. These men had betrayed their oaths, their kingdom, and their fellow citizens for nothing more than personal gain and extremist gold.","Baron Richard and the other traitors all bore looks of complete despair on their faces. The reality of their situation had finally penetrated their shock; they were bound for public execution as convicted traitors, with no hope of escape or leniency.","Magic cuffs forged by the king himself ensured their compliance during the journey back to face royal justice. The enchanted restraints carried a deadly warning: if any prisoner dared to move outside the bounds of their magical prison, they would immediately lose a limb to precisely controlled wind magic.","The threat wasn’t idle intimidation. King Aldric’s reputation for following through on such promises meant every captured noble understood exactly what would happen if they attempted escape or resistance.","Their faces reflected the hopelessness of men who had gambled everything on a conspiracy that had been thoroughly exposed and decisively crushed.","As they approached the kingdom’s main gate, the scene that greeted the guards was so shocking that it left them momentarily speechless. Their beloved king was returning with a group of high-ranking nobles bound in magical restraints like common criminals."]},{"number":165,"title":"Chapter 165: Public Trial","paragraphs":["The sight was so unprecedented and stunning that the gate guards didn’t even notice Noah walking among the royal party. Their attention remained completely focused on the impossible vision of captured aristocrats being marched toward the capital for what could only be treason charges.","\"Your Majesty! What... what has happened?\" called the captain of the gate guard, who was at the adept rank, his voice carrying both relief at the king’s safe return and confusion about the prisoners.","\"Treason, these nobles have been caught collaborating with demon extremists against the kingdom; they have sold their kind for mere profit. They will face public trial and execution.\" King Aldric replied in a cold tone.","The announcement sent shockwaves through the assembled guards, whose training had never prepared them for witnessing the arrest of multiple noble families simultaneously by the king himself!","Meanwhile, Lola remained concealed through a subtle spell, her demonic features hidden from casual observation. The king had suggested it would be better to keep her presence secret until he could properly clarify the complex political issues surrounding demon allies and extremist enemies.","Noah had readily agreed with the proposal, understanding that introducing a master-level succubus to the general population required careful preparation and official royal backing.","...","The public trial followed with unprecedented swiftness, demonstrating King Aldric’s determination to address treason with immediate and decisive action. He refused to allow time for political manoeuvring or behind-the-scenes negotiations that might compromise the integrity of justice.","The king summoned one of his master-level royal guards, a formidable warrior whose loyalty to the crown had been proven through decades of faithful service.","\"Gather every noble family in the kingdom. Send official summons that brooks no refusal or delay. This is a matter of kingdom security that demands their immediate presence.\" King Aldric commanded.","The royal guard bowed deeply, understanding the gravity of such a comprehensive summoning. \"It shall be done, Your Majesty. When do you require their attendance?\"","\"In an hour,\" the king replied firmly. \"And issue a public announcement throughout the capital. I want every citizen who can possibly attend to witness what transpires. This trial will serve as both justice and warning.\"","The master-level guard departed immediately to execute his sovereign’s commands, knowing that such urgent royal orders indicated events of extraordinary significance.","Within minutes, royal messengers had spread throughout the kingdom carrying official summons to every noble house, regardless of rank or current political standing. The messages carried the unmistakable seal of royal authority that made attendance mandatory rather than optional.","Simultaneously, town criers filled the streets with announcements that drew crowds of curious citizens eager to understand what momentous event would require such unprecedented public gathering.","\"Hear ye! Hear ye!\" the criers called from every major intersection. \"By royal decree, all citizens are invited to witness a trial of utmost importance to the kingdom! In an hour, in the Grand Plaza!\"","The announcement created a buzz of speculation throughout the capital as people wondered what crime could possibly warrant such public attention and comprehensive noble attendance.","An hour passed, the sky was clear and bright, as if the weather itself recognised the significance of the proceedings about to unfold. The Grand Plaza had filled with an enormous crowd that represented every level of society, whether poor or rich, powerful or weak, everyone as gathered.","Noble families occupied designated seating areas, their expressions ranging from curiosity to growing unease as they noticed several familiar faces missing from their usual social circles. The absence of Baron Richard and his associates had been noted, but no one could have predicted the true reason for their disappearance.","Common citizens filled every available space, their voices creating a low murmur of anticipation that reflected the kingdom’s collective desire to understand what had prompted such an extraordinary gathering.","King Aldric appeared on the raised platform that had been constructed for the trial, his royal regalia gleaming. His presence got immediate silence from the assembled thousands, his absolute authority settling over the plaza like a force of nature.","\"Citizens of Durenholde, you have been summoned to witness justice being served against those who would betray everything we hold sacred,\" his voice rang out with mana amplification that carried his words to every corner of the vast gathering.","A collective intake of breath rippled through the crowd. Betrayal suggested treason, the most serious crime possible against the crown and the kingdom.","\"Before you stand those who have sold their oaths, their honour, and their fellow citizens for mere gold,\" the king continued, gesturing toward the platform where Baron Richard and his fellow conspirators had been brought in magical restraints.","Gasps of shock echoed throughout the plaza as noble families recognised members of their own social circle among the accused traitors. The sight of high-ranking aristocrats bound like common criminals sent waves of disbelief through the assembled nobility.","\"You will witness the evidence of their crimes through magical means that cannot be falsified or disputed,\" King Aldric declared, raising his hand to summon the floating orb that had recorded their underground meeting.","\"Zephyra’s Eye, reveal truth,\" he commanded.","The magical recording began playing above the platform, projecting images and sound with crystal clarity that left no room for denial or interpretation. The crowd watched in stunned silence as the conspiracy unfolded before their eyes.","The underground meeting chamber appeared in the air above them, showing the gathering of demon extremists and human nobles in treasonous collaboration. Voices carried clearly across the plaza as the recorded conversations revealed the depth of their betrayal.","The crowd erupted in angry murmurs as they witnessed Baron Richard distributing kingdom resources to enemies who openly despised their people.","The recording continued, showing the planning sessions where extremist attacks were coordinated with noble assistance, the exchange of military intelligence for personal profit, and the discussion of treating human citizens as expendable resources.","When the magical projection finally ended, the silence in the Grand Plaza was deafening. Thousands of citizens stared at the accused nobles with expressions of betrayal, rage, and disgust that needed no verbal expression."]},{"number":166,"title":"Chapter 166: Receiving a Title","paragraphs":["King Aldric allowed the evidence to settle in the people’s minds before pronouncing judgment with an iron fist.","\"The evidence is undeniable. These men have committed high treason against the crown, collaborated with enemies of the kingdom, and sold the lives of their fellow citizens for personal gain,\" he declared, his voice carrying across the plaza.","He raised his hand, and executioner’s blocks appeared on the platform, their appearance sending a clear message about the fate awaiting the convicted traitors.","\"By the authority vested in me as sovereign of this realm, I pronounce sentence of death upon all who participated in this conspiracy; they shall be beheaded immediately, as befits those who have severed their loyalty to the kingdom they swore to protect,\" the king announced.","The crowd roared its approval as justice was pronounced. They were incredibly satisfied with the way the king went about the issue, he didn’t grant them any excuses just because of their noble heritage. This made those in the crowds satisfied that traitors would face appropriate consequences for their crimes.","But King Aldric wasn’t finished with his pronouncements.","\"All businesses, properties, and assets belonging to these traitors now belong to the kingdom,\" he continued.","\"Their wealth, gained through betrayal and corruption, will be redistributed to serve the people they wronged.\"","This announcement drew even louder approval from the assembled citizens, many of whom had suffered under the corrupt practices of these same nobles.","The king raised his hand for silence before making his final offer.","\"Any citizen who has been wronged by these convicted traitors may present evidence of their grievances to royal magistrates,\" he declared. \"Provide proof of theft, extortion, or other crimes, and you will be compensated from their seized assets.\"","The promise of restitution sent waves of excitement through the crowd, particularly among those who had suffered under Baron Richard’s notorious practices.","The executions proceeded swiftly, the headsman’s blade falling upon each convicted traitor. The crowd watched with satisfaction as justice was served publicly and thoroughly.","As the last head fell, King Aldric addressed his people one final time.","\"Let this serve as a warning to any who would consider betraying their oaths for foreign gold. reason against the kingdom will be met with swift and final justice, regardless of rank or station,\" he proclaimed.","The king’s words were clear; this wasn’t just for show. He had sent a message to every single person in the kingdom. Especially those at the top of the chain, if you dare to betray the kingdom, you will be publicly executed and will lose everything.","Some of the nobles watched with a grim look, whilst others watched without any expression.","As the first part of the public trial was done, the king called for silence once again.","...","As the first part of the public trial concluded with the final execution, King Aldric raised his hand to command silence from the still-buzzing crowd. The plaza, which had been filled with satisfied murmurs about justice served, fell quiet once again as their sovereign prepared to make another announcement.","\"Now that justice has been delivered. It is time to address matters of recognition and reward for those who serve the kingdom with honour.\"","The crowd’s attention increased with curiosity. After witnessing the punishment of traitors, they were eager to see virtue acknowledged and celebrated.","\"It is time to assign a new viscount,\" King Aldric declared, his words carrying across the vast gathering.","\"Someone whose help to the kingdom has been invaluable and whose character stands in clear contrast to those we have just executed.\"","Excited whispers rippled through the assembled citizens as they speculated about who might receive such a significant honour. The rank of viscount carried a powerful political authority and social standing within the kingdom’s hierarchy.","\"Many of you may know him for his generosity in helping the poor,\" the king continued, building anticipation with each word. \"He was also the one who discovered and freed two remarkable talents who have since become treasures of our kingdom, Alissa and Kip.\"","The crowd began looking around, trying to identify who among them had performed such notable service. Some had already recognised who that was, but some didn’t.","In the designated seating area, both Alissa and Kip sat forward with surprise; they naturally knew whom the king was talking about.","\"Shopkeeper Noah, please step forward to receive your title.\"","Noah stood frozen in shock, his mind struggling to process what he had just heard. He had never been told of this development and certainly hadn’t expected to become a viscount. The honour came completely without warning, leaving him momentarily speechless.","A viscount? Me? When did the king decide this?","The crowd’s eyes searched for the named individual, many craning their necks to catch sight of the mysterious Noah Carter, who had apparently earned such royal favour.","\"Noah. Go, you’ve earned this,\" Princess Elara whispered from beside him, her smile indicating she had been aware of her father’s intentions.","Still stunned, Noah made his way through the crowd toward the platform where King Aldric waited with obvious satisfaction. Each step felt surreal as thousands of eyes tracked his movement toward what would be a life-changing moment.","As he climbed the steps to the royal platform, the crowd began recognising him. The mysterious shopkeeper with powerful items that healed the sick, and more!","King Aldric smiled warmly as Noah approached, his expression carrying genuine pleasure at being able to reward someone whose service had proved invaluable to the kingdom’s security.","But instead of commanding Noah to kneel as tradition demanded for anyone receiving a noble title, the king did something that sent shockwaves through the entire crowd, whether noble or not.","King Aldric stood up from his throne and extended his hand toward Noah in greeting.","The gesture struck the crowd like a physical blow. A collective gasp rose from thousands of throats as they witnessed something that made them gasp.","It was a known tradition in the kingdom, when the king offered his hand as an equal rather than demanding submission, it meant he saw the person before him not as someone inferior, but as someone he genuinely respected and saw as an equal."]},{"number":167,"title":"Chapter 167: Noah the Viscount","paragraphs":["Shock rippled through the noble families like waves across a disturbed pond. Aristocratic houses whose bloodlines stretched back centuries stared in disbelief at the unprecedented honour being bestowed upon a merchant.","\"Impossible, I’ve served the crown for forty years and never received such recognition,\" whispered the Duchess of Westmarch, her voice barely audible in murmurs of the crowd.","Count Alderton’s face had gone pale as he witnessed honour that exceeded anything granted to his family’s generations of loyal service. \"No one receives the king’s hand. No one.\"","But there it was, happening before the eyes of the entire kingdom, their sovereign treating a shopkeeper with the respect typically reserved for foreign royalty or legendary heroes.","Noah, still processing the magnitude of the moment, reached out and clasped the king’s offered hand.","The simple gesture established a relationship of mutual respect that elevated him far beyond his new noble rank.","\"Viscount Noah,\" King Aldric announced to the stunned assembly, his voice carrying pride as he maintained their handshake. \"A man whose service to the kingdom has earned not just our gratitude, but our respect.\"","The crowd erupted in thunderous applause, their voices reflecting awe at witnessing history being made. This wasn’t just the creation of a new viscount; it was the establishment of a relationship between the king and a person whose help wouldn’t only save the kingdom, but elevate it to places that they never dreamed of before.","In the designated seating area, other noble families struggled to process what they had witnessed.","The handshake between the king and the new viscount continued for several long moments, each second emphasising the extraordinary nature of the honour being bestowed. When they finally released their grip, the message had been delivered clearly to every witness present.","Viscount Noah Carter stood not as a subject who had been elevated, but as an ally who had been acknowledged, and standing in his path was like going against the crown.","After that handshake, even the dukes or duchesses didn’t dare to try and disrespect or treat him like a subordinate.","...","After the ceremony ended, King Aldric approached Noah with the practical details that would follow his elevation to nobility.","\"I’ll finalise the bestowment by tomorrow. You’ll receive the previous viscount’s estate, it’s a large property with good farmland and a respectable manor house,\" the king informed him.","Noah nodded, still processing that he was going to suddenly own some noble lands and property.","The property and noble land were by no means cheap; it was definitely worth its price in the thousands of golden coins.","\"You’ll also receive a portion of Baron Richard’s net worth,\" the king continued, \"after most people have claimed their rightful compensation for his crimes. There should still be a considerable sum remaining.\"","Noah acknowledged the king’s words with appropriate gratitude before the crowd began dispersing. The momentous day was ending, but its significance would reshape his future in ways he was only beginning to understand.","As he made his way back through the city streets, Lola walked beside him, her invisibility spell still active. Her ruby eyes carried an expression of interest as they walked together.","\"Are you okay with it?\" she asked, her voice carrying genuine curiosity about his feelings regarding such a dramatic change in circumstances.","\"Okay with what?\" Noah responded, though his tone suggested he understood exactly what she meant. They continued walking toward his shop, the familiar route providing comfort after such an overwhelming day.","\"You know what I mean,\" Lola replied with a knowing smile. \"Why are you acting oblivious? The king has clearly tied you down to this kingdom. This means that when danger comes, you will also have to act. You have responsibilities here now.\"","Her observation was accurate. Noble titles came with obligations that extended far beyond mere social status. As a viscount, he would be expected to serve the kingdom during times of crisis.","Noah nodded thoughtfully. \"You’re correct that when danger comes, I will act, but that’s not because I’m tied down to this kingdom by the title. To be honest, I couldn’t care less about noble obligations.\"","The title is useful, but not binding in the way she thinks.","\"The reason I would act is because this kingdom has become somewhat dear to me. It has people I’ve met here and become friends with. That personal connection matters more than the so-called viscount duty.\"","Lola listened with growing understanding as he explained his perspective on the unexpected honour.","\"Also, the viscount title is beneficial to me in practical ways,\" Noah added with obvious satisfaction. \"It will save me from noble problems; they won’t create difficulties for me after the king’s clear display of respect.\"","\"Furthermore, I have more credibility now, so my shop will definitely increase in reputation,\" he concluded with a slight smile. \"This will boost my sales in the long term when I develop more products.\"","Lola nodded, a soft smile gracing her beautiful face as she understood Noah’s perspective on his sudden promotion to nobility.","Noah smiled before adding with obvious satisfaction, \"Besides, how can I be tied down when I have a shop that can change places?\"","The observation struck Lola as particularly astute. His shop provided freedom that no earthbound noble could ever possess, making traditional concepts of territorial obligation largely irrelevant.","Lola chuckled at his words, amused by his unique circumstances and approach to his new life. \"That’s true. Not many viscounts can relocate their entire domain to another world when politics become inconvenient.\"","Inside the store, Noah decided to focus on practical development rather than dwelling on political changes. The day’s events had reminded him how important personal power remained, regardless of social status.","\"Time to practice,\" he announced, settling into his familiar training position. \"I want to work on wind manipulation, mana control, and especially body tempering. I need to raise that skill to level 5 as soon as possible.\"","Body tempering remains my biggest weakness. My vitality remains at 4 for now."]},{"number":168,"title":"Chapter 168: Body Tempering level 5","paragraphs":["[Your Body Tempering skill has reached level 2]","[Your Body Tempering skill has reached level 3]","Seeing the rapid improvement, Noah’s determination intensified. He refused to stop until he reached his target level, pushing through the increasingly demanding training to reach his goal of improving his constitution and breaking his limits.","The body tempering process had become more challenging for his body as his skill advanced, requiring greater mana expenditure and more focus to achieve meaningful progress. But Noah pressed forward with relentless focus.","He paused briefly to eat a loaf of bread when his body began showing signs of exhaustion, the magical healing properties restoring his energy and allowing him to continue the intensive training session.","Hours passed in dedicated practice, his mana flowing through increasingly refined pathways as his constitution adapted to handle greater magical stress. Finally, the notification he’d been waiting for appeared.","[Your Body Tempering skill has reached level 5!]","—","Host: Noah Carter","Age: 28","Shop Level: 2","Daily Revenue: $295,000 (or equivalent)","Current Assets: $306,640.21","S hop Points: 2070","Attributes: Strength: 30, Vitality: 20, Intelligence: 20, Agility: 30","Skills: Swordsmanship(Level 8), Mana Control (Level 7), Wind Manipulation (Level 6), Aura (Level 5), Body Tempering (Level 5), Surviving on Ramen (Level 3), Cooking (Level 2), Programming (Level 2), Gaming (Level 2), Finance (Level 2)","—","Checking his status, Noah smiled with obvious delight at the dramatic improvement in his capabilities.","His vitality had finally increased to 20 points, and he could feel the immense difference his body had undergone during the intensive training session. The constitutional enhancement had transformed him on a fundamental level.","His joints felt much more resilient, capable of handling stress that would have injured him previously. His muscle density had increased significantly, providing strength that complemented his existing attributes perfectly.","Most importantly, he could sense that his bones had become more durable, creating resilience that would allow him to survive serious combat without suffering crippling injuries.","Everything about his physical constitution had received massive improvement, which balanced his previously lopsided attribute distribution.","\"Congratulations!\" multiple voices erupted beside him simultaneously.","Noah raised an eyebrow in surprise and turned to discover that Lola wasn’t the only one present. Kip and Alissa were there too, apparently having entered while he was completely absorbed in his training.","\"Why didn’t you inform me?\" he asked, looking at Lola. She had a huge smile plastered on her face. She was satisfied with his achievement.","Lola maintained her delighted expression before explaining with amusement. \"You were too engrossed in your training, and they didn’t want to interrupt you either, so we simply waited for you to finish.\"","\"How long have I been training? I lost track of time,\" Noah said, running his fingers through his hair as he processed the gap in his awareness.","\"It’s been about two hours since you started. I must say, that’s the fastest I’ve ever seen someone reach novice rank in body tempering.\"","Noah nodded with understanding. \"I think it’s due to the bread. I ate it when I felt my body was starting to give up during the more intense circulation exercises.\"","Lola nodded in agreement; she naturally understood that part. She was the only one who told him about the shortcut after all.","Turning toward Alissa and Kip, Noah moved his attention to his young friends. \"Are you guys done for the day? Don’t you have any training or academy responsibilities?\"","Both cat siblings shook their heads in unison. \"No, Master Noah,\" they replied with obvious respect.","Noah sighed with mild exasperation. \"Stop calling me Master Noah.\"","Before he could finish his protest, Lola chuckled mischievously. \"He’s now a viscount! You should call him Noble Viscount Noah~\"","Her teasing tone carried obvious amusement at Noah’s discomfort with formal titles and excessive respect.","Noah immediately glared at Lola. \"No! Stop giving them ideas, Lola. They might actually do it!\"","\"Hehe~\"","Hearing her giggle, Noah rolled his eyes.","\"Just call me Noah. Okay? We’re friends, not lord and servants,\" he said, addressing the cat siblings gently but firmly.","The cat siblings nodded, but he could tell from the look in their eyes that his request was a difficult one.","Grumble!","Suddenly, a stomach’s grumbling filled the small shop with unmistakable demand for food.","Noah glanced down at his own stomach before a wry smile appeared on his face. \"The training really took its toll. I’m hungry, do you guys want to eat?\"","The intensive body tempering session had consumed significant energy, leaving him with an appetite that reflected the strain his constitution had endured during advancement.","Lola nodded with obvious interest. \"Why not? I can eat some of the human food. It might be interesting to try more of your kingdom’s cuisine.\"","Alissa looked at Noah shyly before offering with genuine eagerness. \"Ma— Noah, I will go get us some meat. Do you want me to cook for you again?\"","Her hesitation over his name showed she was still adjusting to his request for informal address, while her cooking offer carried the enthusiasm she felt by wanting to contribute meaningfully.","Noah looked at Alissa with a gentle eyebrow raise. \"Are you sure? You don’t have to. I was just thinking about eating some bread and drinking some iced tea, nothing too excessive.\"","Simple meal after training. Don’t want to impose on her generosity.","Alissa nodded her head eagerly, her silver ears perking up with obvious determination. \"Yes, I’m sure. I want to cook for you.\"","She turned toward her brother with the authority of an older sister, making plans. \"Kip, let’s go get some ingredients to cook something good.\"","Kip nodded, standing up to accompany his sister on their shopping journey. Both cat siblings moved towards the door.","In a few seconds, they were out of the shop, leaving Noah alone with Lola and the subtle tension that always seemed to accompany their private conversations.","After they left, Lola turned to face Noah with a mischievous look brewing in her ruby eyes.","\"Alissa is really cute, isn’t she?\" she said in a deceptively normal tone."]},{"number":169,"title":"Chapter 169: Aura Level 7","paragraphs":["Noah nodded in agreement without considering the meaning behind her words. The cat girl really did have an adorable personality that made her a genuinely endearing company.","She’s sweet and thoughtful. Obviously cute in a friendly way.","Lola’s smirk widened as she realised he’d walked directly into the trap she’d carefully set. \"Master Noah...Do you perhaps like the cute Alissa? I didn’t know you had a thing for cat girls.\"","\"Huh? What!\" Noah suddenly realised the trap the succubus had set for him, understanding exactly what she was implying, he immediately responded. \"I didn’t mean cute that way!\"","He glared at her with indignation. \"Don’t say that in front of her. Things would become awkward.\"","Lola nodded with a mischievous smile, then stood up and walked toward him slowly.","\"It seems like Master Noah is interested in something other than cat girls...\"","She whispered seductively into his ear, her breath warm against his skin. \"I wonder who the lucky girl is~\"","Noah gulped involuntarily, her proximity and tone making his pulse quicken despite his attempts to maintain composure.","\"I need to practice my aura skill,\" he said immediately, trying to distract himself from the succubus’s deliberate charm offensive.","His aura skill was directly linked to his mana control, and it remained two levels behind his other magical abilities. He knew that levelling it up would be relatively easy; he simply needed to circulate the energy a few times with proper focus.","Lola chuckled with obvious amusement at his transparent attempt to escape her teasing, then returned to her seat with a satisfied smile.","As she watched him settle into practice position, trying to focus on aura circulation rather than her previous comments, she couldn’t help but mutter softly with genuine affection.","\"Cute...\"","Noah pretended not to hear her comment while beginning his aura exercises.","...","[Your skill Aura has reached level 6!]","[Your skill Aura has reached level 7!]","The skill advancement came swiftly, catching up to his mana control level before ceasing to advance further. It took him only about ten minutes to increase the skill’s levels, all he had to do was simply adapt to his improved mana control by learning to cover his body more effectively and manipulate the energy with greater control.","The aura skill’s rapid advancement made sense given its direct connection to mana control. With his current mana control, channelling mana around his body had become significantly easier and more intuitive.","Two skill levels in five minutes. Sometimes, having a solid foundation makes everything else fall into place.","He glanced at the shelf to check his current inventory levels, noting that his stock had increased to decent quantities during the day’s various activities.","Nearly six hours had passed since the morning’s events, and the automated production had steadily refilled his supplies. The bread and iced tea quantities had reached thirty-six units each, while the premium items, beef jerky, energy drinks, and protein bars, had also reached their maximum capacity of six units since restocking after the king’s purchases.","Noah stood up with a sudden realisation that he’d neglected an important responsibility. He hadn’t fed Leo today besides a single loaf of bread, and the young golden mane lion deserved proper nutrition after patiently waiting through all the day’s excitement.","Poor Leo. He’s been so patient while I dealt with third-rate villains.","The golden mane followed Noah eagerly toward the shelf, his tail swishing with obvious anticipation. Leo clearly expected his usual treats of bread and iced tea, which had become a comfortable routine between them.","But his expectations were completely shattered as he spotted his master retrieving different items from the premium displays. Noah had decided to go all out for his faithful companion, taking beef jerky, an energy drink, and a protein bar from his most valuable inventory.","The Items were worth at least 1,800 golden coins for just one meal. Leo was eating better than the king himself!","Lola watched the extravagant feeding session without surprise anymore. Noah had demonstrated such generous treatment of his friends for the past two days, making this latest display of affection entirely predictable.","Despite not being surprised by his actions, she still couldn’t believe how easily he distributed legendary-tier enhancement items like casual snacks.","Most people would guard a single protein bar with their lives, even against their own family. He’s feeding them to a juvenile lion.","Leo’s reaction to the premium feast was a sight to behold. His golden eyes widened with shock as the first bite of beef jerky flooded his system with vitality enhancement that made his entire body tingle with energy.","The young lion let out a small roar of pure pleasure, his tail whipping back and forth with uncontrollable excitement as permanent constitution improvement coursed through his developing frame.","Purr-roar-purr!","The energy drink followed, its properties sending the agility boost through Leo’s nervous system like liquid lightning. His movements would become more graceful, his reflexes sharper, as the permanent improvement would integrate with his body.","Finally, the protein bar completed the transformation. The strength boost that came flooded through Leo’s muscles, making him feel more powerful than he’d ever experienced in his short but happy life.","Roooooar!","The young golden mane attempted a mighty roar of triumph, though his vocal cords produced something closer to an adorable roar that made both Noah and Lola smile with affection.","But the overwhelming surge of enhancement proved too much for Leo’s small body to process. The combination of permanent attribute improvements and simple overeating created an irresistible urge to sleep.","Leo’s eyelids grew heavy as his body demanded rest to properly integrate the extraordinary improvements he’d just received. His legs wobbled slightly before he simply lay down on the shop floor, curling into a comfortable ball.","Within moments, soft purring filled the shop as Leo fell into the deep, restorative sleep that would allow his body to fully absorb the legendary enhancements his master had so casually provided.","Noah wasn’t worried after Lola had told him the young lion was going something called growth sleep.","His body simply needed time to adapt to all those permanent improvements before he woke up much more powerful than before.","Noah smiled with satisfaction as he watched his companion’s peaceful slumber, knowing that Leo would awaken significantly stronger, faster, and more resilient than before.","After he finished ensuring Leo was comfortable, the shop door opened with its familiar chime. Alissa and Kip had returned from their ingredient-gathering expedition.","Surprisingly, the cat siblings hadn’t just purchased raw materials; Alissa seemed to have already prepared a complete meal! The delicious aroma that preceded their entrance made Noah’s mouth water immediately.","\"I bought the ingredients and went to our house to cook,\" Alissa explained, seeing his surprised expression. \"It’s nearby, so it didn’t take long to prepare everything properly.\"","The meal she’d prepared featured tier 1 magical beast meat, its quality immediately visible from both appearance and scent. The cooking had been expertly done, bringing out flavours that normal meat could never achieve.","Noah was excited to eat the food prepared by Alissa, after all. He had tried her food once before alongside the young goblin, and it was simply amazing. The way the food looked, the way it tasted and smelt. Everything was simply too good.","Tier 1 beast meat prepared by Alissa is going to be special.","After finishing the excellent meal, Noah looked at Alissa with gratitude. \"Thank you for the food, Alissa. That was amazing, much better than anything I could have prepared myself.\"","Her silver ears twitched with pleasure at the compliment, a soft smile brightening her entire expression as she basked in acknowledgment of her cooking skills."]},{"number":170,"title":"Chapter 170: Yamamoto Kenji","paragraphs":["Inside his house, Noah glanced at the time on his phone and felt his stomach drop.","\"Shit! I’m going to miss the dojo session, Master Tanaka is going to kill me!\" he muttered in a hurry, frantically packing his gym bag with training clothes and some necessities.","Noah had returned home as Lola’s shift began, feeling somewhat tired from everything that had happened—the underground conspiracy, public trial, noble investiture, and body tempering training had made for an exhausting day.","But missing his scheduled session with Master Tanaka wasn’t an option. The old swordmaster valued punctuality almost as much as technique, and Noah had no desire to face disappointed lectures about commitment and discipline.","Noah grabbed his keys and sprinted to his GTR, the engine roaring to life as he reversed out of his driveway with perhaps more speed than necessary.","He zoomed through the highway, weaving between slower traffic with the enhanced reflexes his agility allowed for. The sports car’s performance capabilities matched his urgency perfectly as he raced against time.","Of course, his actions were completely safe. He didn’t put anyone’s life at risk.","To his immense relief, he arrived at Musashi’s dojo with minutes to spare, sliding into the parking lot just as other students were beginning their evening routines.","Warm-Up and Preparation","Noah entered the familiar wooden building, taking his shoes off respectfully before moving to the equipment area to retrieve his practice sword.","He began with basic warm-ups that had become second nature over the weeks of his training. Quick strikes cut through the air, and each movement was designed to activate muscle memory and prepare his body for the upcoming intensive work.","Swish! Swish! Swish!","The practice blade traced the air as Noah worked through the fundamental sequences.","Soft flowing strikes that focused on control over power, low sweeping cuts that engaged his core muscles, and high overhead strikes that stretched his shoulders and back.","His high attributes made the warm-up exercises feel almost effortless, but Noah maintained proper form rather than rushing through the preparation. Master Tanaka had drilled into him that foundation work remained essential regardless of his power.","Whoosh! Snap!","The final warm-up sequences focused on cardiovascular preparation, quick combination strikes that elevated his heart rate and circulated blood through muscles that would soon face some serious testing.","Around the dojo, other students paused their own preparation to observe Noah’s warm-up routine. His movements had evolved significantly since his first appearance around a week ago.","His strikes were now much more deadly, much more precise. It was as if he had been training with the sword since he was in his mother’s womb.","As he finished his training, master Tanaka approached with his slow strides, the practice sword already in hand.","\"Ready?\" the master asked simply, settling into his opening stance.","Noah nodded, drawing his own blade and assuming the defensive position that had become his preferred starting point for their sparring sessions.","It had become routine that once Noah and Master Tanaka began sparring, every other student in the dojo stopped their individual training to watch. The matches had become legendary among the student body. It was an opportunity to witness techniques that they would never witness during normal training.","Clang!","Their blades met in the opening exchange, Master Tanaka testing Noah’s defensive capabilities with accurate strikes that asked for his immediate response. The impact sent vibrations through both weapons as they clashed.","Swish! Whoosh!","Noah flowed into a counterattack sequence, his blade cutting through the air with speed that made several watching students gasp with amazement. No matter how many times they’ve seen him move, they were shocked every single time.","Despite the attack’s insane speed, Master Tanaka’s experience and own agility allowed him to read the incoming strikes, his defensive positioning negating Noah’s strike.","Naturally, the negation came at a cost; Noah’s strike sent vibrations that made his arm numb for a second before he regained control.","Crack! Clang!","\"Your footwork is getting better! You are no longer relying on your speed alone,\" Tanaka called between exchanges, his blade work never slowing as he provided instruction through demonstration.","Whoosh! Swish!","The pace accelerated as both fighters found their own rhythm. Noah’s agility allowed him to match movements that should have been beyond his experience level, while Tanaka’s mastery provided lessons that made every strike purposeful.","Clang! Swish! Crack!","Their wooden swords created a rhythm that filled the dojo, each impact demonstrating the evolution of Noah’s capabilities since their training began. What had started as a new swordsman wanting to learn from the master had become much more than that.","Whoosh!","Master Tanaka’s combination attack came in three flowing strikes.","Low, Middle, then high. Completely contradicting his previous strike patterns during other spars.","Noah was momentarily caught off guard; he didn’t expect it. But he quickly regained his stance and defended it successfully at the last second.","Master Tanaka smiled and nodded his head approvingly. \"Good job,\"","Each transition of attacks was seamless and perfectly timed. Noah’s reflexes allowed him to intercept each blow, his defensive work drawing impressed murmurs from the watching students.","Crack! Clang! Swish!","\"Excellent defence!\" Tanaka approved, immediately pressing into another assault that tested different aspects of Noah’s developing skill. \"Now counterattack!\"","Whoosh! Snap!","Noah’s response came as a spinning technique that utilised his full agility enhancement, the blade creating a complete circle that forced Tanaka to step back otherwise he would certainly be injured by the power and speed of the strike.","Whish!","The attack barely grazed him, causing some blood to drop down from his cheek.","\"Continue,\" He said, ignoring the little blood flowing from his cheek.","Noah nodded, respecting his master’s wish.","Swish! Clang!","\"That technique, where did you learn it?\" Tanaka asked with obvious interest, his blade intercepting Noah’s follow-up strikes while his analytical mind catalogued the unusual movement.","\"Instinct,\" Noah replied honestly, his level 8 swordsmanship skill allowing for combinations that felt natural despite limited formal training.","Crack! Whoosh!","The final exchange showcased both fighters at their peak capabilities. Master Tanaka’s experience met Noah’s supernatural enhancement in a display of swordwork that left every watching student mesmerised by the sheer skill on display.","Clang!","Both blades stopped simultaneously, their tips mere inches from each other’s vital points in a perfect mutual finish that demonstrated respect rather than victory.","\"Good job, that was much better than before,\" Master Tanaka complimented earnestly.","\"Thank you, master.\" Noah nodded a smile on his face, accepting the compliment.","As they lowered their weapons, Master Tanaka gestured toward a figure Noah hadn’t noticed before, an elderly Japanese man who had been sitting quietly in the corner, observing their sparring session with obvious interest.","\"Noah, I’d like you to meet Master Yamamoto Kenji. I’ve told him about your talent, progress and that very soon I would be unable to keep teaching you.","He didn’t believe me when I said that your talent is even better than my old bones. So, I’ve brought him here to watch, and from his expression alone, you can tell what he thinks.\"","Master Yamamoto rose from his position gracefully. Despite his old age, Noah could tell that he had the same power, if not more, than Tanka."]},{"number":171,"title":"Chapter 171: Tournament","paragraphs":["\"Student Noah, your talent is truly impressive,\" Yamamoto said simply, pausing for a second to evaluate Noah before continuing. \"Your student shows remarkable development, Tanaka-san.\"","\"He’s exceeded my every expectation, which brings us to why you’re here today,\" Tanaka replied with obvious pride.","Master Yamamoto studied Noah with a calculating gaze. \"Tell me, young man. How do you feel about testing your abilities against opponents beyond this dojo’s walls?\"","Noah raised an eyebrow, sensing something significant approaching. \"What kind of testing?\"","\"A tournament, but not the public competitions you might expect,\" Tanaka explained.","Master Yamamoto stepped forward, his expression growing more serious. \"We’re talking about a private tournament. Invitation only. The kind of event where extraordinary talent meets extraordinary people.\"","Noah paused for a second, evaluating the man in front of him carefully. The master’s bearing suggested someone connected to martial arts circles far beyond anything he’d previously encountered.","A private tournament with extraordinary people. It seems like Earth isn’t as...normal as I thought it was. It might have some hidden masters, although I doubt it’s anything above the apprentice rank at best.","Then he nodded after making his decision. He wanted to see what this tournament was about, and it would undoubtedly be beneficial for advancing his swordsmanship skills further.","\"Alright, I accept,\" Noah declared without hesitation.","Whatever this tournament involves, it represents an opportunity to test my abilities against serious opponents.","Master Yamamoto nodded with obvious satisfaction, his expression suggesting he’d expected exactly that response. \"Anyone with a true passion for swordsmanship would accept such an offer. Your enthusiasm confirms our assessment of your character.\"","\"You don’t have to worry about preparation details for now. When the tournament begins in about a few days, I will personally come to the dojo to find you. Then we will travel together to the area.\" Yamamoto explained.","Noah nodded casually, not thinking too deeply about the implications of such personalised attention from someone who was clearly a significant figure in martial arts circles.","A week from now. Perfect timing.","In his mind, Noah calculated his likely progression over the next seven days. With his current advancement rate and training schedule, his swordsmanship would most likely reach apprentice rank by tournament time.","Level 10 swordsmanship means apprentice rank. That should provide a solid foundation for whatever competition awaits.","After they concluded their discussion, Noah took advantage of the dojo’s facilities to clean up properly. The shower washed away the sweat from intensive sparring while giving him time to simply relax.","He changed into fresh clothes from his gym bag, feeling refreshed and ready for the evening’s remaining obligations.","As he prepared to leave the dojo, Noah remembered his dinner commitment. Aunt Mei had invited him for a family meal, and after the day’s excitement, spending time with relatives sounded like exactly the kind of normalcy he needed.","Family dinner. A chance to decompress and act like a regular person for a few hours.","He made his way to his GT-R, the sports car providing comfortable transportation as he drove through the city toward his aunt’s house.","...","After enjoying some time with his aunt, Ethan, and Uncle Smith, Noah headed home feeling refreshed from normal family interaction.","Tomorrow, he would be picking up his dad from the hospital. A moment he’d been anticipating since witnessing the miraculous effects of the bread in his shop.","Finally bringing Dad home healthy. That alone makes everything worthwhile.","The next day, Noah woke up to the familiar chime of his system’s daily notifications.","[Daily Income rewarded!]","[$165,000 & Tier 5 Wind Orb]","The wind orb materialised in his storage ring, bringing his total collection to four of the legendary artefacts.","Four Tier 5 wind orbs. I think it’s overkill at this point; I might have to switch back to dollars. I really want to get the idle room already.","Noah checked his status, curious to see how Lola’s night shift had performed, and was amazed by what he discovered.","—","Host: Noah Carter","Age: 28","Shop Level: 2","Daily Revenue: $295,000 (or equivalent)","Current Assets: $577,640.21","Shop Points: 4,190","Attributes: Strength: 30, Vitality: 20, Intelligence: 20, Agility: 30","Skills: Swordsmanship(Level 8), Mana Control (Level 7), Aura (Level 7), Wind Manipulation (Level 6), Body Tempering (Level 5), Surviving on Ramen (Level 3), Cooking (Level 2), Programming (Level 2), Gaming (Level 2), Finance (Level 2)","—","His shop points had increased by a whopping 2,400 points during the time he slept! Furthermore, his monetary assets had increased by $285,000, which included his daily income of $165,000 plus additional sales revenue.","Lola really worked hard during the night. These numbers are incredible.","—","[Auto-IceTea Maker]","Level: 3","Production Rate: 4 Iced teas every hour","Max Stock: 96","Progress: 84/400","—","[Auto-Baker]","Level: 4","Production Rate: 8 Loaves every hour","Max Stock: 96","Progress: 144/400","—","Checking his auto-makers revealed the scope of Lola’s successful night shift. She had nearly sold the entire iced tea inventory—68 bottles completely depleted during her shift.","Even more impressively, she had sold 144 loaves of bread, representing an extraordinary sales volume that exceeded anything he’d achieved during daytime operations.","144 bread sales in one night. That’s incredible productivity.","The massive sales numbers made perfect sense when Noah considered recent developments. His new fame as a viscount, combined with the public trial’s revelation of his role in exposing the conspiracy, had generated enormous public interest in his mysterious shop.","Furthermore, the increased production rate also played a massive role.","Word was spreading throughout the kingdom about the modest store that sold powerful magical enhancement items, and day by day, more people were learning about his nighttime operating hours.","Feeling excellent about how the day was beginning, Noah got up from his bed and made his way to the shower. The warm water helped him fully wake up while he planned his schedule around the important hospital visit.","After cleaning up, he decided to share a quick breakfast with Lola before picking up his father. A meal of bread and iced tea would provide both sustenance and an opportunity to thank her for the exceptional work she’d done overnight.","He arrived at the shop to find Lola looking satisfied during her productive shift. Her ruby eyes brightened as she spotted him appearing.","\"Good morning,\" she greeted with obvious pleasure at seeing him. \"I hope you don’t mind, but I got a bit aggressive with sales last night. Hehe~\"","Noah laughed as he retrieved breakfast items from his restocked inventory. \"Aggressive is an understatement. You sold almost everything we had in stock.\"","They shared the magical breakfast for about ten minutes, the enhanced bread and iced tea providing perfect nutrition while they discussed the night’s remarkable success.","\"The customers kept coming,\" Lola explained between bites. \"Word has definitely spread about your shop. Many people specifically asked about the ’viscount’s magical store.’\"","Noah nodded, listening to her relaying the things that had happened during the day.","He glanced at the stock and realised there was enough for the representative of Elara and Valeria when they arrive soon.","\"Make sure there is enough for them when they arrive. Like before, twenty-four of each for both of them. Also, tell them that the stock has increased for the bread. They can double their purchasing power for the bread only, the iced tea remains the same.\"","He allowed them to purchase more bread because it had a higher production rate, meaning he would still have some to sell to citizens. As for the iced tea, it had a slower production rate, hence he decided to keep half the stock for the citizens since there was more traffic now.","After eating, he excused himself and returned back to earth. Ready to take his father out of the hospital."]},{"number":172,"title":"Chapter 172: Alan is out of the hospital","paragraphs":["Inside the hospital, Noah entered the ward with excitement building in his chest. The white corridors that had become routine over recent weeks would soon be just a memory rather than a regular destination.","He found his dad sitting in the bedside chair, a calm, serene look on his face as he sipped coffee and read the morning news.","The transformation was remarkable. He was no longer the weakened man who had struggled with his daily basic activities. Rather, in his place sat someone who looked like he was in complete tranquility, radiating the health and vitality that the magical beef jerky had restored.","He looks twenty years younger. The beef jerky worked even better than I hoped.","Noah smiled at the peaceful scene, feeling deep satisfaction at witnessing his father’s complete recovery from illnesses that had seemed insurmountable just days ago.","\"Good morning, Dad. Are you ready to go home?\"","Alan Carter looked up from his newspaper, his face brightening with a smile that carried energy Noah hadn’t seen in months. He stood up with ease, no longer requiring the slow movements of someone managing chronic pain and weakness.","\"More than ready, I’ve been looking forward to this,\" Alan replied with obvious enthusiasm.","Noah and Alan made their way to the discharge department, walking through the hospital’s corridors.","As they walked, Alan provided updates on the final medical evaluations that had sealed his release.","\"The tests were all conducted yesterday after you left. This morning, early, the doctors came to tell me about the miraculous healing I’d undergone.\"","\"Dr. Thompson actually used the word ’unprecedented,’\" Alan continued with amusement. \"He kept asking what kind of treatment I’d been receiving, but I stuck to our agreement about keeping your... supplements... private.\"","\"Everything checked out perfectly,\" Alan concluded as they approached the discharge desk. \"Blood work normal, neurological function excellent, cardiovascular health much better than men half my age. I can leave after completing the checkout procedures.\"","Complete constitutional recovery. The beef jerky’s permanent vitality enhancement worked exactly as intended.","The discharge process proceeded smoothly, with medical staff expressing amazement at Alan’s remarkable recovery while processing the paperwork that would officially end his extended hospital stay.","Within thirty minutes, father and son walked out of the medical facility together, both satisfied.","...","The discharge department informed Noah that the remaining medical billing would arrive at his address within the next week or so. Despite his payments covering the past two weeks of treatment, the earlier months of on-and-off payments had accumulated charges that weren’t covered by him.","\"The balance should arrive by mail,\" the administrative clerk explained.","But Noah couldn’t care less about the financial burden; he estimated that the bill wouldn’t exceed $50,000 total. By the time the week rolled around and the invoice arrived, he wouldn’t be worrying about such meagre amounts at all.","The daily income of nearly three hundred thousand from being Idle alone makes hospital bills feel like pocket change.","After completing the discharge procedures, father and son naturally felt the need to celebrate this momentous recovery. But first, Alan expressed a desire to shower and change into his own clothes after weeks of hospital gowns and institutional routines.","\"I want to feel human again, real clothes, calm shower...you know, real life.\"","Simple pleasures that hospital stays make you appreciate differently.","The living situation had become complicated during Alan’s extended hospitalisation. After losing his job due to extended absence, Alan had also lost their family house when medical bills consumed their savings and rent payments became impossible.","During that crisis period, Noah had salvaged whatever he could from their family home—his father’s clothes, personal belongings, and sentimental items and stored everything in his small apartment.","When Noah had recently moved to his new house, he had carefully transferred those rescued possessions, ensuring his father would have familiar belongings when he finally came home healthy.","At least he’ll have his own things. Some continuity despite everything that’s changed.","Inside his new house, Noah prepared a quick but nutritious meal for his father’s first home-cooked food in weeks. The dish naturally incorporated healing bread from his storage ring, providing both flavor and continued magical enhancement to support his father’s recovery.","One more dose of healing properties can’t hurt. Might as well ensure his improvement continues.","In the living room, Alan discovered that his son had prepared an amazing meal that filled the house with appetising aromas. The bread was prominently featured alongside other carefully chosen ingredients.","Alan noticed the magical bread but didn’t ask questions about its unusual properties or obvious expense. Everyone had their own secrets, and if his son wanted to share details about his mysterious food sources, he would do so voluntarily.","He’s still the same person. That’s what matters. Alan thought.","Alan had learned not to pry into matters that didn’t affect their fundamental relationship. His son remained the caring young man he’d raised, and that consistency mattered more than unexplained luxuries or unusual things.","After they finished the welcome-home meal, Noah suggested they needed to celebrate the successful recovery properly.","\"This calls for a real celebration,\" Noah declared with a smile on his face.","Alan nodded enthusiastically. \"Indeed. You know what? I loved cooking back in the old days. Why don’t we prepare a meal together? And we should invite your aunt and her family over for dinner.\"","His face brightened with energy as he continued planning. \"This way we can celebrate here, as a family, rather than going somewhere impersonal.\"","Noah nodded immediately, accepting his dad’s proposal. \"That’s a perfect idea, Dad.\"","Family dinner at home. Much better than a restaurant celebration. And with my items, it would be healthier.","The suggestion offered multiple benefits: quality bonding time with his father in the kitchen, an opportunity to increase his cooking skill to level 3, and a chance to create new positive memories after months of medical crisis.","Time together doing something we both enjoy. Exactly what we need.","The duo headed out to a large supermarket to gather ingredients for their celebratory family feast.","They moved through the aisles with enthusiasm. Selecting ingredients without the budget constraints that had previously limited their choices.","Shopping without worrying about every dollar...it feels good.","Their cart was filled with high-quality beef, fresh chicken, seasonal vegetables, ripe fruits, beverages, and an array of spices.","The total price came to about $300, but the quantity and quality would provide meals for approximately a week while ensuring their celebration dinner would be truly impressive.","As they loaded their purchases into Noah’s car, both father and son felt satisfied about planning something positive together after so long.","Arriving back home, the duo called up Aunt Mei.","Aunt Mei who didn’t know about the changes that had occurred for the past two days immediately rejoiced at the news of Alan healing up. When she heard that they were also inviting them for dinner, she rejected saying that she should be inviting them over and that Alan should relax.","After some bickering, Aunt Mei surrendered to Alan’s plan and told them that she would be there for lunch. Uncle Smith and Ethan were off since it was a holiday, which made it a perfect time.","With that concluded, the son and father began cooking their meal."]},{"number":173,"title":"Chapter 173: Lunch time, Level 3 Cooking Skill","paragraphs":["Time passed by slowly, and lunchtime arrived with perfect timing. Noah had already sent Ethan the address of his new house, and his aunt’s family was making their way over for the celebratory meal.","Ring-Ring.","The doorbell chimed at exactly the right moment. Noah and Alan had just finished preparing their elaborate feast, the kitchen filled with aromatic evidence of their collaborative cooking efforts.","On his way to the door, Noah smiled at the notification that appeared before him a minute ago.","[Your Cooking skill has reached level 3!]","It seemed like his cooking for his dad earlier, and cooking with him had paid its dues not only in filial piety but also in evolving his skill.","Noah opened the door to find Aunt Mei’s family waiting with warm smiles and obvious curiosity about his new living situation.","\"Noah!\" Aunt Mei exclaimed, immediately stepping inside whilst checking the house with obvious approval. \"This place is beautiful! Congratulations on your business success!\"","Her eyes took in the spacious interior, quality furnishings, and general atmosphere of prosperity that marked such a dramatic change from his previous cramped apartment. She felt incredibly proud of her nephew and wished him even more success; he deserved it.","\"Thank you, Aunty,\" Noah replied with appreciation for her enthusiasm.","\"And thank you again for treating Ethan so well,\" she continued, her gratitude filled with mother-like warmth. \"That computer setup and everything else you bought him—it’s made such a difference in his life.\"","Small investments in family happiness. Always worth it.","Noah accepted her thanks graciously before leading them inside toward the dining area where the feast awaited.","He exchanged a fist bump with his cousin and a hug with his uncle.","Noah immediately noticed how much better Ethan looked compared to their meeting a week or so ago. The young man’s posture radiated confidence rather than the dejected slump that had been his post-breakup depression.","\"You look great, man,\" Noah observed with genuine approval. \"Much better than last time.\"","Ethan grinned with obvious pride. \"I’ve been focusing on my studies and my goal of becoming a pro esports player.\"","Adversity transformed into achievement. He’s got the potential to be something, good kid. Noah felt happy for his cousin; he just needed a little push to stabilise himself.","\"And check this out, one of the professional teams is actually thinking of recruiting me! They’ve been watching my gameplay and think I have potential.\" Ethan had a huge smile on his face as he spoke.","Noah’s eyebrows rose with impressed surprise. \"That’s incredible! Professional gaming recruitment?\"","\"Yeah, and I’ve also started streaming regularly. My skills have caught attention online, and I’m averaging about two hundred daily viewers on the streaming platform.\"","Two hundred daily viewers. That’s actually impressive for a new streamer.","\"The income isn’t available yet, but I should start earning after signing a contract with them, which they promised would arrive tomorrow,\" Ethan added with obvious satisfaction at his growing independence.","Uncle Smith and the rest of the family settled around the dining table as Noah and Alan presented their culinary masterpiece.","The main dishes featured perfectly prepared beef and chicken, seasoned with perfection.","Whilst cooking with his father, Noah noticed that Alan really had some good cooking experience. He reckoned that if his father had a system, it would evaluate him at level 3 in cooking, which Noah had just reached recently.","The beef and chicken might have appeared to be the main components of the meal, but in truth, they were not. The real star was the bread.","Noah had sneakily incorporated bread, allowing his family members to earn an attribute point in vitality and a short-term increase in their regeneration.","Family members are about to receive permanent attribute improvements without realising it.","Uncle Smith bit into the magical bread, and his eyes widened immediately. \"This bread... It’s extraordinary. The texture, the flavour, it’s like nothing from any bakery I know.\"","As the meal progressed, subtle changes became apparent in his family members’ demeanour and energy levels. Aunt Mei’s usual afternoon fatigue disappeared entirely, making her more energetic than she was normally.","Uncle Smith’s chronic back pain, which typically made him shift uncomfortably during extended sitting, seemed to vanish. He sat straighter and moved more freely.","The bread’s vitality enhancement is working exactly as intended.","\"I feel amazing,\" Aunt Mei declared as they finished the main course. \"Like I could run a marathon or clean the entire house without getting tired.\"","\"Same here,\" Uncle Smith agreed, rolling his shoulders experimentally. \"My back hasn’t felt this good in decades. Whatever you two did in that kitchen, it worked miracles. Thank you for the amazing meal, it’s been great.\"","Alan observed his family’s remarkable energy with knowing satisfaction, understanding exactly what his son had done without needing explanations. His own experience with magical enhancement made the effects obvious despite their subtle presentation.","\"This has been the best family dinner we’ve had in years,\" Aunt Mei declared with obvious emotion. \"Everyone feels so... alive.\"","The celebration had achieved every goal Noah had hoped for—his father’s successful homecoming, family bonding through shared cooking, and improving his close relatives’ health without them knowing.","...","After lunch finished, the family began making their gracious departures. Each member took time to express their heartfelt wishes to Alan for his continued health and recovery.","\"Take care of yourself, Alan, you look wonderful, but don’t overdo anything too soon.\" Aunt Mei said warmly.","Uncle Smith nodded in agreement. \"Rest is important, even when you’re feeling great. Hospital recovery takes time.\"","Ethan added his own wishes. \"Get plenty of rest, Uncle Alan. Thanks for the amazing meal!\"","They wanted to give Alan space to relax and adjust to being home again. Even though he felt remarkably well, they understood that transitioning from hospital life back to normal routine required time and patience.","They were a thoughtful family. They knew when to give someone space to recover properly.","With warm farewells and promises to visit again soon, Aunt Mei’s family departed, leaving father and son alone in their quiet house.","Noah turned toward his father with consideration. \"I’ll clean the dishes later, Dad. Don’t worry about them. I have some work to do in my room—I’ll probably be busy for a while. Do you need anything from me?\"","Give him time to rest while I handle my shop matters. Lola’s shift has already ended a few minutes ago.","His dad shook his head with a contented smile, the food enhancement still providing energy that made him feel decades younger. \"No, son. You can go do your thing. I’m perfectly fine.\"","Noah nodded with satisfaction and headed toward his room, ready to check on his shop operations and continue his training routine.","As Noah disappeared into his room, Alan looked around the kitchen with energy coursing through his body. Despite his son’s thoughtful offer to handle cleanup later, Alan felt too energetic to simply sit idle.","I feel better than I have in years. Might as well put this energy to good use.","He sneakily entered the kitchen and began washing the dishes. The simple domestic task felt satisfying after being bedridden in the hospital for so long.","Good to be useful again. Good to be home."]},{"number":174,"title":"Chapter 174: Level 8.","paragraphs":["Arriving at the shop, Noah immediately apologised to Lola for his lateness. He had been about ten minutes behind schedule, and instead of finding her relaxing after her shift ended, he discovered her still dutifully seated behind the counter.","\"I’m sorry for being late,\" Noah said with genuine regret. \"Some things ran longer than expected.\"","She’s been working extra time because of my poor scheduling.","He looked at her with sincere appreciation before adding, \"If something like this happens again, just close the store and don’t worry about it. Your shift time should be respected.\"","Lola shook her head with a dismissive smile, her ruby eyes carrying amusement at his concern. \"Don’t worry about it, it was merely a few minutes. Not a big deal at all.\"","Noah smiled in thanks and turned his attention to checking the current inventory levels, curious about sales performance during his absence.","Lola provided a comprehensive report on the day’s business activities. \"The representatives from both the royal guard and Valeria’s guild came for their daily orders. They took their usual twenty-four iced teas and twenty-four bread loaves each.\"","Noah nodded, expecting that much.","\"I also told them about the increased bread production capacity, like you’ve told me. They were both quite happy to hear about the expanded availability.\" She continued.","\"So starting with their next payment, they’ll be purchasing twenty-four iced teas and forty-eight bread loaves each,\" Lola concluded.","Noah nodded with approval. The increased order sizes would provide substantial revenue growth while maintaining the stable relationships he’d built with major customers.","Doubled bread orders from two major clients. Coupled with the regular customers, I can easily sell more than 96 bread daily.","The stock had been completely depleted during Lola’s shift. Both bread and iced tea inventories showed zero remaining units. With nothing available for immediate sale, Noah’s options were limited to practising his skills or waiting for wealthy customers interested in premium items.","Empty shelves mean successful sales, but they also mean there is nothing to do until production catches up.","—","Host: Noah Carter","Age: 28","Shop Level: 2","Daily Revenue: $295,000 (or equivalent)","Current Assets: $625,640.21","Shop Points: 5,030","Attributes: Strength: 30, Vitality: 20, Intelligence: 20, Agility: 30","S kills: Swordsmanship(Level 8), Mana Control (Level 7), Aura (Level 7), Wind Manipulation (Level 6), Body Tempering (Level 5), Surviving on Ramen (Level 3), Cooking (Level 3), Programming (Level 2), Gaming (Level 2), Finance (Level 2)","—","Checking his progress, Noah noted he had reached the halfway point toward the ten thousand shop points required for upgrading to Shop Level 3. Getting the remaining points would be easy given his current sales momentum, so he wasn’t worried about meeting that milestone.","5,030 out of 10,000 shop points. Halfway there already.","His monetary assets had skyrocketed to $625,640, a figure that was surely climbing towards the one million mark he’d been waiting for.","With no immediate business tasks demanding attention, Noah walked toward the premium item shelf and retrieved a package of beef jerky. It was time to consume his enhancement item and bring his vitality up to match his other attributes at the 30-point mark.","Time to balance my stats properly.","Without further hesitation, he unwrapped the magical jerky and consumed it, feeling the warmth of permanent vitality enhancement flooding through his entire body.","Leo remained surprisingly asleep near the counter, but the young golden mane looked completely relaxed and peaceful. Noah wasn’t worried about the extended nap; such magical enhancement often required recovery sleep for proper integration.","With his constitution now properly enhanced, Noah decided to maximise his available time through magical training. With multiple Tier 5 wind orbs in his possession, it would be wasteful not to utilise them for skill advancement.","Four wind orbs. Time to make serious progress.","An hour of focused practice with the concentrated wind essence yielded excellent results. The magical energy flowed through his enhanced pathways as his understanding of wind manipulation deepened.","[Your Wind Manipulation skill has reached level 7!]","The advancement brought him closer to the next milestone, each improvement making his magical combat effectiveness more formidable.","...","After he improved his wind manipulation to level 7, Noah found himself hesitant about what skill to focus on next. He was stuck between working on his swordsmanship and continuing to advance his wind manipulation abilities.","Both skills offered valuable benefits for his upcoming challenges. Swordsmanship would provide direct combat effectiveness for the mysterious tournament, while wind manipulation offered versatile magical capabilities that could complement his physical abilities.","Lola, who had been relaxing by watching him practice with obvious interest, decided to offer her perspective on his training dilemma.","\"You should keep practising your wind manipulation. It will be most useful for you in the long run,\" she advised as someone whose decades of experience provided valuable insight.","\"While you’ll be safe with me around, you want to build your own independent strength. Elemental manipulation of the wind attribute will help tremendously because it’s incredibly versatile,\" she continued with a slight smile.","She gestured toward the shop’s ceiling as if indicating the broader kingdom beyond. \"Look at the king of the human kingdom. You’ve seen what he was able to do with advanced wind magic.\"","King Aldric’s capabilities were impressive. Levitation, barriers, powerful attacks—all through wind manipulation.","Noah nodded with understanding. Her reasoning made perfect sense. Wind manipulation offered defensive capabilities, mobility options, utility applications, and offensive potential that could adapt to virtually any situation he might encounter.","\"You’re absolutely right,\" he acknowledged gratefully. \"Thank you for the guidance.\"","Noah settled back into his meditation position, retrieving a wind orb to continue his elemental training with focus and purpose.","Another hour and around ten minutes of concentrated practice yielded excellent results. The magical energy felt increasingly natural as it flowed through his pathways, responding to his will.","[Your Wind Manipulation skill has reached level 8!]","The difference between level 6 and level 8 was worth the hard work. Noah had learned a useful basic spell that expanded his magical repertoire significantly.","He had mastered a particularly practical technique called Featherfall.","The spell slowed descent by channelling wind currents underneath his feet. The ability used minimal mana while providing enormous utility for both combat and everyday situations.","Featherfall. Perfect for avoiding fall damage.","The spell would be incredibly useful even in normal Earth life, offering safety during any situation involving heights or unexpected drops.","After reaching level 8 with his wind manipulation skill, Noah decided to increase his mana control.","His mana control skill was at level 7, and increasing it to level 10 would increase his intelligence attribute by a significant amount that he did not know of yet.","Two hours passed, during which Noah kept the shop closed for a specific reason—he was waiting for his auto-makers to produce a sufficient stock before opening for sales. It was far more efficient to sell in bulk rather than reopen every hour just to move a few items.","Closing, practising his skills, then reopening repeatedly simply didn’t make sense.","In those two hours, he had levelled up his mana control to level 8.","Now, his three powerful skills had reached level 8. Wind Manipulation, Mana control and Swordsmanship."]},{"number":175,"title":"Chapter 175: Hunting with Alissa and Kip","paragraphs":["[Your Aura skill has reached level 8!]","Noah spent around five minutes allowing his aura skill to catch up with his mana control level. The energy flowed more smoothly around his body now, creating a protective layer that felt as natural as breathing.","With his daily magical practice nearly complete, Noah considered working on his swordsmanship but decided against it. Checking his inventory revealed that production had accumulated quite nicely during his extended training session.","He had been practising for about four hours, and during that time his premium enhancement items had returned to their official maximum of twelve units each. Meanwhile, his bread had accumulated 32 loaves and his iced tea had reached 16 bottles.","48 items from normal stock plus potentially some premium sales. Good opportunity to open the shop.","With sufficient inventory to serve customers, Noah decided to open his store to the public once again.","The poor people he had helped previously had been healed by his magical bread, but others in similar desperate circumstances had arrived to replace them. Noah decided to continue his charitable efforts, though he wouldn’t jeopardise his shop’s progress or his own advancement.","Noah decided to help people without compromising his business sustainability.","He established a daily policy of giving away five loaves of bread to those who needed healing most desperately. His judgment criteria came from asking the community within the alleyway marketplace.","After being under siege from demon attacks for so long, the poor people had developed remarkable solidarity. Even those who desperately needed healing would often insist that others receive help first if their conditions were more severe.","They represented true community spirit. They look out for each other despite their own needs.","Hence, Noah distributed five loaves of bread as a small charity. In the larger scope of his operations, it represented only 2.5% of his daily production, too insignificant to impact his business or self-improvement while providing meaningful help to those who needed it most.","The recipients proved remarkably understanding and grateful. They thanked him sincerely without demanding more or attempting to exploit his generosity. Once the five charitable loaves were distributed, they all departed quietly to continue their daily struggles as they always had.","They had dignified gratitude. They appreciate help without becoming dependent.","After completing his charitable distribution, Noah began serving paying customers who had arrived seeking his products’ remarkable effects.","He established a strict policy against bulk purchases for new customers. Common sense told him that allowing large quantities could lead to resale at inflated prices, undermining both his pricing structure and customer access.","Prevent price gouging while maintaining fair access for everyone.","The customers naturally couldn’t argue with a viscount’s business policies. Even before his noble elevation, few had dared challenge his shop rules, and his new royal recognition made resistance completely unthinkable.","They purchased their single loaves of bread and departed without complaint. If someone chose to resell their individual purchase at a higher prices, that became the buyer’s responsibility rather than Noah’s concern.","Market forces are beyond my control. I provide fair access—what happens after that isn’t my problem .","Clearly, his shop operated nearly twenty hours daily with consistent pricing. Anyone willing to pay inflated resale prices could simply visit his store directly and purchase at standard rates. It wasn’t like he had no supply; the supply was definitely there.","Availability and fairness eliminate most justification for price manipulation.","Shortly after the regular customers departed, familiar faces appeared at his shop entrance. Kip and Alissa arrived together, accompanied by Valeria.","The cat siblings plus the guild master. entered his shop and greeted him.","\"Noah!\" Alissa called with obvious enthusiasm. \"You are here. We were hoping to find you.\"","Kip nodded eagerly beside his sister. Both siblings had grown significantly stronger, and Noah was still getting used to the fact that the little cat-boy who was weak and frail was now stronger than him.","Valeria stepped forward. \"We’re planning a hunting expedition to keep our combat skills sharp. The demon attacks have decreased lately, but that means we need alternative training opportunities.\"","Practical training through real combat. Much more effective than simple practice.","\"Would you like to join us?\" Alissa asked hopefully. \"It would be a good experience for your swordsmanship development, and we could just hang out.\"","Then, as if realising something, she immediately stammered. \"O-Of course, if you are busy, you won’t have to worry about it. We can maybe hang out another time if you would like.\"","Noah considered the invitation carefully. He had sold most of his current stock, and real combat experience would complement his formal training perfectly. The upcoming tournament made practical fighting experience even more valuable.","It would be a good opportunity to go out and explore the human realm monsters.","After thinking it through, Noah realised he had sold enough inventory to justify closing early, and the hunting expedition offered exactly the kind of experience his development needed.","\"I’ll come,\" he decided with a soft nod.","He turned toward Lola, who had been observing the conversation with obvious interest. \"Do you want to come with us?\"","Lola’s smile carried familiar mischief as she leaned closer, her voice dropping to a whisper that somehow reached only his ears despite Valeria standing mere feet away.","\"Of course I want to stay close to my boss,\" she murmured with amusement. \"I couldn’t possibly let you venture out alone with two such beautiful and capable women. What if one of them decided to steal you away from me?\"","Her whispered words were most definitely carried with magic, so that even Valeria’s enhanced senses couldn’t detect the conversation, creating an intimate moment within the group setting.","Noah felt his cheeks warm slightly at her deliberately provocative statement, though he tried to maintain professional composure in front of their guests.","She never misses an opportunity to tease. At least she’s consistent.","\"Great,\" he managed, keeping his voice steady despite Lola’s proximity. \"Let’s go hunting.\"","The expedition promised combat experience, skill development, and a chance to hang out with friends."]},{"number":176,"title":"Chapter 176: Fighting Tier 1 Monster!","paragraphs":["As they walked towards the city gate, Noah noticed how peaceful the streets had become. The attacks on the human kingdom had almost completely ceased, a stark contrast to the constant threat that had defined daily life just weeks ago.","Clearly, the devastating raid that King Aldric had led against the underground base had dealt a massive blow to the extremist organisation. They had lost nearly fifty operatives of various ranks, plus a master-level demon commander.","They were casualties that represented a significant portion of their operational capability.","Fifty extremists plus a master-level leader. That’s probably half their local forces eliminated in one strike.","The king hadn’t been content with simply disrupting their immediate operations. After such a successful attack against the demon extremists, he had reinforced the city’s defences with unprecedented thoroughness.","Masters now stood guard at the east, west, south, and north directions of the city walls. The deployment of four master-level defenders represented an enormous commitment of the kingdom’s most valuable military assets.","With four masters guarding the walls. The king was taking no chances with the demons’ retaliation.","The guards at the gate greeted Valeria and her group with respect. When they spotted Noah among the party, their demeanour changed to the courtesy appropriate for addressing nobility.","\"Good afternoon, Viscount Noah. Safe travels on your expedition,\" the gate captain said with a respectful bow.","Noah returned the greeting politely before their group continued toward the hunting grounds outside the city’s protective walls.","Unlike the demon kingdom, where hunting areas were carefully guarded and regulated, the human kingdom couldn’t afford such extensive security measures. Once you ventured beyond the walls into monster territory, you were entirely responsible for your own safety.","They arrived at a region where Tier 1 monsters typically spawned, the landscape shifting from human-cultivated farmland to wild forest that harboured creatures drawn by concentrated mana.","The monsters in this area turned out to be wolves, though they differed significantly from ordinary animals. These were called Dark Wolves, named for their distinctive black fur.","Tier 1 magical beasts. Perfect for warm-up exercises.","Valeria surveyed the area, noting several wolf shapes moving through the wild forest ahead.","\"Warm up with these. They should get you in the mood for real combat. Then we’ll move up to the Tier 2 monsters further ahead.\" She instructed her companions.","Noah nodded, drawing his sword from his scabbard.","The Dark Wolves emerged from the forest shadows, having detected the approaching humans.","AWOO!","Three wolves separated from the pack, each selecting a different target as if they had coordinated their attack beforehand.","Noah and the two cat-siblings didn’t complain. That was better-suited for their warm-ups, anyway.","Alissa moved first with her incredibly graceful footwork and stance that had earned her recognition as a prodigy from Valeria.","Her sword emerged from its sheath in a single flowing motion.","The Dark Wolf lunging toward her never had a chance to complete its attack. Alissa’s swordsmanship had reached levels that made Tier 1 opponents seem almost comically slow in comparison.","Swish!","One slice was all it took to separate the wolf’s head from its body without any resistance. The magical beast collapsed instantly, its dark blood staining the forest floor as Alissa smoothly returned her blade to its sheath slowly.","Clack!","\"Well done, that’s what I expect,\" Valeria observed with obvious approval. \"Your foundational stance is simply perfection.\"","Adept-level swordsmanship against Tier 1 monsters was a complete mismatch.","Kip’s approach demonstrated why he had earned his status as an exceptional magical talent despite his young age. Instead of drawing a conventional weapon, he channelled wind magic through his hand, shaping concentrated air currents into a blade-like extension of his arm.","The technique required precise mana control and elemental mastery that most couldn’t achieve, but Kip executed it casually.","Whoosh!","His wind-enhanced hand cut through the attacking wolf’s body like a sword through silk, the blade slicing cleanly through muscle and bone. The Dark Wolf collapsed into two pieces, its magical core disrupted by the elemental attack.","\"Impressive spell work,\" Noah called, genuinely amazed by the young cat-boy’s creative application of wind magic. \"I might have to steal that technique from you, Kip.\"","Wind magic shaped into cutting weapons. I should learn that approach. It would be helpful in case my sword was broken or lost.","The wolf in front of Noah, realising that he was alone, was about to escape, but he found himself stuck as Kip and Alissa surrounded him. He was no longer able to escape, seeing the strength of the cat-siblings, the wolf decided to go after the human in front of him.","It was his only chance to survive this encounter.","Noah’s own opponent provided an opportunity to test his skills at their current limit without worrying about injuring anyone.","As the Dark Wolf leapt toward him with its snapping jaws and extended claws, Noah channelled wind magic through his blade while executing a diagonal cutting strike.","Swish! Crack!","The attack carried far more force than pure swordsmanship could provide. Wind-augmented steel cut through the wolf’s powerful hide and bone structure with devastating power, the creature’s momentum carrying it past Noah even as its life ended.","[You have killed the Tier 1 beast, Dark Wolf]","\"Excellent use of your skills,\" Lola observed with obvious pleasure at his development. \"You’re learning to find more ways to combine your abilities rather than treating them as separate skills.\"","Valeria nodded with satisfaction as she checked the three dead wolves. \"Well done, all of you. Noah, your power is increasing rapidly as usual, your wind manipulation, mana control and your swordsmanship are approaching apprentice-rank. Well done.\"","Noah accepted the compliments without being humble or shy.","The warm-up combat had served its purpose, confirming that each team member could handle basic threats while demonstrating how their various skills complemented each other in actual battle situations.","\"Ready for Tier 2 opponents?\" Valeria asked, gesturing toward the deeper forest where more dangerous creatures waited.","Noah checked his weapon and magical energy levels, feeling confident that his abilities would prove adequate for whatever challenges lay ahead.","...","Continuing ahead to their next destination, they encountered several more Dark Wolves that attempted to intercept their progress. The pack predators proved no more challenging than their initial opponents.","Each wolf fell quickly to quick strikes from the group.","Soon, they arrived at the territory where Tier 2 beasts made their home. The forest grew denser here, with older trees and thicker underbrush that provided better concealment for more dangerous predators.","Valeria surveyed the area with a soft nod before turning to address the members of their hunting party.","\"It’s still warm-up for both of you,\" she said, gesturing toward Alissa and Kip with obvious confidence in their abilities.","Her attention shifted to Noah with curiosity. \"You’ve never fought a Tier 2 beast before, have you?\"","Noah shook his head honestly. \"No, I haven’t.\"","My combat experience is limited to sparring and Tier 1 opponents.","Valeria nodded with understanding before outlining her training strategy. \"Alissa and Kip will fight first. After observing their techniques against this level of opponent, Noah will take his own turn.\"","\"I believe you have sufficient power to handle a Tier 2 beast, but understanding how a monster will fight beforehand is always better. We don’t want you to get injured from the first beast, even if you have healing bread with you.\"","Noah nodded. \"Alright, let’s see what this monster is.\""]},{"number":177,"title":"Chapter 177: Crimson Horn Bear","paragraphs":["The beast in question was a massive bear that immediately made Noah raise his eyebrow due to its sheer physical presence. Its muscular frame stood nearly eight feet tall, with claws that could shred steel and teeth designed for crushing bone.","Most distinctive was the crimson horn protruding from its forehead, giving the creature its name: Crimson Horn Bear. The horn served as both weapon and tool, used for impaling prey and gouging through defensive barriers that might stop its normal attacks.","That horn looks like it could punch through steel plate. Definitely not a Tier 1 opponent.","The bear’s magical aura radiated power that made the Dark Wolves seem like ordinary animals by comparison, confirming that Tier 2 beasts represented a significant escalation in danger and capability.","...","Valeria surveyed the massive Crimson Horn Bear before making her decision about the training sequence.","\"Kip, you can take this one,\" she announced, her voice carrying the authority of someone whose judgment had been proven through countless battles.","Kip nodded with a confident smirk spreading across his face as he stepped forward toward the bear. His aura flared slightly as he prepared for combat, alerting the massive beast to his presence.","The Crimson Horn Bear turned its attention toward the approaching cat-boy, its eyes recognising the threat despite Kip’s relatively small stature. The beast rose onto its hind legs, displaying its full eight-foot height while releasing a roar that ran through the forest.","Kip didn’t immediately launch into lethal spells, understanding that his role was demonstrating proper technique for Noah’s benefit. The young mage needed to show how Tier 2 beasts moved, attacked, and defended so Noah could prepare for his own encounter.","\"Watch carefully. Kip will show you how these bears utilise their horn and claws in their own combo attacks.\" Valeria murmured to Noah.","The Crimson Horn Bear charged forward with surprising speed for its massive size, leading with its distinctive horn while positioning its claws for follow-up strikes. But Kip was ready.","Whoosh!","The young mage channelled wind magic around his body, his agility allowing him to sidestep the bear’s initial assault while maintaining perfect positioning for a counterattack.","Swish!","Wind blades formed around Kip’s hands as he demonstrated his mastery of elemental magic. The cutting air struck the bear’s thick hide, drawing blood but not inflicting heavy damage.","The bear pivoted before swiping his massive claws toward where Kip had been standing. But the young mage was already gone, his wind magic providing mobility that kept him ahead of the beast’s attacks.","Splash!","Water magic followed his wind assault, Kip conjuring streams of liquid that struck the bear’s eyes and nose. The attack disrupted the creature’s senses while demonstrating the advantage of using multiple elements in sequence.","The bear shook its head violently, clearing its vision just in time to see Kip’s earth magic taking effect. Stone spikes erupted from the ground beneath the creature’s feet, forcing it to leap backwards.","Wind, water, earth. Noah thought as he watched the ongoing fight with focus.","\"See how he uses terrain control?\" Valeria pointed out to Noah. \"Earth magic shapes the battlefield while wind provides mobility and water offers damage and nuisance.\"","Swish! Crack!","Kip’s finishing combination utilised all three elements simultaneously.","He used his earth skill to close off the bear’s escape route before using water to slow it down and disrupt its senses. After his setup was ready, Kip used his wind blade to strike the bear’s vulnerable knees.","Thud!","The bear dropped to its knees, and Kip took advantage, finishing it off with a strike to the head that made it collapse","\"Excellent fight,\" Valeria approved.","Kip then opened the bear’s cavity and took a small crystal.","Noah raised an eyebrow. \"What’s that?\" He asked, curious.","\"This is a beast core, it has concentrated mana that mages could use to refine their own mana core. This is like a supplement to mages that help them progress faster, beast cores only exist in the bodies of beasts that are apprentice-rank or above.\" Lola explained, a small smile on her face.","A second Crimson Horn Bear emerged from deeper forest territory, drawn by the sounds of combat and the scent of blood from its fallen packmate.","\"Alissa, this one’s yours,\" Valeria announced.","Alissa stepped forward with slow steps, her sword by her side, ready to decimate her enemies.","Aura surrounded her body as she prepared to fight the bear.","Mages used their mana to cast out spells, whilst warriors like Alissa used it to enhance their natural talent in swordsmanship or any other combat.","The cat-girl’s stance embodied perfect balance between offence and defence, her blade positioned to respond instantly to threats while maintaining various striking angles. As the bear charged, Alissa flowed into her deadly dance.","The way she moved with the sword was nothing short of elegant and artistic. It was as if she were dancing with her sword like a partner.","Swish!","Her first strike came as a graceful diagonal cut that opened a wound along the bear’s shoulder.","ROAR!","The bear roared in pain as he tried to counterattack, but failed as Alissa immediately sidestepped away.","The attack demonstrated perfect timing and distance management, inflicting damage while avoiding the creature’s retaliatory swipes.","Alissa’s footwork carried her around the bear’s bulk with ease. Each step positioned her for maximum advantage while keeping vital areas protected from the creature’s dangerous horn and claws.","Crack! Swish!","Her blade work created a rhythm of strikes that built upon each other.","Shallow cuts that weakened the bear’s defences, followed by deeper wounds that targeted vital areas.","The sequence of strikes demonstrated Alissa’s understanding of combat and patience rather than mere aggression. She was a natural hunter, through and through.","The Crimson Horn Bear attempted to use its distinctive horn in a devastating impaling attack, but Alissa’s reflexes allowed her to pivot away while her blade found the creature’s neck.","Swish!","The final strike came with an artistic finish, her sword finding the exact angle needed to sever the main arteries.","The bear collapsed without struggling, its life ending as blood splashed across the forest floor."]},{"number":178,"title":"Chapter 178: Fighting the Crimson Horn Bear","paragraphs":["\"Beautiful technique. That was like watching a master artist at work.\" Noah observed with admiration. The way that Alissa fought that bear made it look effortless, as if she were merely playing with it.","Valeria nodded with obvious pride in her student’s development. \"Alissa has achieved what we call the flow. Few practitioners reach that level of artistic combat.\"","After both demonstrations concluded, a third Crimson Horn Bear appeared from the forest depths, as if the creatures were responding to the challenges from the hunting party.","Valeria turned toward Noah with an expectant gaze. \"It’s your turn.\"","Noah nodded with a grim expression, feeling the pressure of fighting something significantly above his current power level. The bears had demonstrated power and cunning that made them genuinely dangerous opponents rather than simple training exercises.","Unlike Alissa and Kip, who were Adepts fighting an apprentice-rank beast. He was a novice fighting an apprentice-rank beast, which made all the difference in the world.","But before he could take his first step toward combat, a familiar voice whispered directly into his ear with a teasing tone.","\"I will give you a very good present if you win, you will like it. Hehe~\"","Lola’s seductive whisper sent his heart rate climbing several beats per minute despite his attempts to ignore it. Her tone made his mind wander into places that were forbidden.","She never misses an opportunity to make things complicated.","Noah shook off the distraction, though the promise lingered in his mind as additional motivation beyond simple survival and training advancement.","\"Alright, let’s do this,\" he declared with determination, walking forward with his sword at his side.","Noah approached the Crimson Horn Bear with his sword drawn, feeling some pressure from his watching companions. The massive creature stood its ground with confidence.","No underestimating this opponent. Time to use everything I’ve got.","Without hesitation, Noah activated every enhancement at his disposal. His aura flared to life around his body, creating a protective outline of mana that made his silhouette shimmer with a blue hue.","\"Good job!\" Valeria called from the sidelines. \"Use all your abilities from the start! You can’t underestimate this thing.\"","Wind magic flowed through his mana channels and around his blade, enhancing both his mobility and striking power.","Niah was preparing to use everything at once. He had no intention holding back, only a fool would hold back against someone much stronger than him.","The Crimson Horn Bear charged with devastating speed, its massive body moving faster than something that size had any right to travel. The creature led with its crimson horn while positioning its claws for a follow-up attack in case it was needed.","Crash!","Noah barely managed to deflect the initial horn thrust with his aura-enhanced blade, the impact sending vibrations through his arms that would have shattered normal human bones.","Ugh, that’s powerful!","\"Dodge and counter! Don’t try to match its strength directly!\" Alissa shouted encouragement.","Noah nodded as he prepared for the bear’s next strike.","The bear’s claws swept toward Noah’s position, forcing him to leap backward while his wind magic provided additional mobility. But the creature anticipated his movement, positioning itself for a devastating follow-up attack.","It’s learning my patterns already. This thing is dangerous.","Swipe! Crash!","Another exchange of claw against aura-enhanced sword sent Noah skidding across the forest floor, his vitality absorbing impacts that would have killed him just a few days ago.","\"Noah’s adapting! He is not only blocking the attack, but he is also using alot of the bear’s momentum to help him deflect it! \" Kip called with obvious excitement at Noah’s great strategy.","Clang! Whoosh!","Noah began finding his rhythm as his combat instincts slowly adapted to the bear’s attacks. His wind manipulation allowed him to stay ahead of the creature’s devastating strikes by increasing his agility.","But the real breakthrough came when inspiration struck during a particularly dangerous exchange.","The inspiration came from his newly obtained skikl, feather fall.","As the Crimson Horn Bear prepared for another charging assault, Noah channeled wind magic through his legs and launched himself high into the air, soaring fifteen feet above the creature’s reach.","Seeing Noah high in the air, Lola raised an eyebrow before smiling brightly. \"Oh, that’s...quite creative.\"","The bear, having observed Noah’s previous ground-based movements, predicted he would fall straight down and positioned its horn for a devastating impaling strike.","Despite seeing the bear’s horn directly under him, Noah did not panic, instead he smiled softly.","I got you.","As he approached the horn, Noah activated Featherfall at the perfect moment. Wind currents flowed beneath his feet, dramatically slowing his descent while allowing him to hover in mid-air for crucial extra moments.","Whoosh!","\"He’s using wind to stop his descent!\" Kip shouted with admiration at the creativity of the attack set-up.","The Crimson Horn Bear’s upward thrust met only empty air as Noah remained suspended above its reach, wind magic providing the split-second advantage he needed.","Now!","Noah angled his descent to strike from an unexpected direction, his aura-enhanced blade channelling wind magic for maximum cutting power.","Noah channelled nearly all of his mana into one crucial attack.","The bear, committed to its upward attack, couldn’t adjust its positioning fast enough.","Swish! Crack!","His wind-enhanced sword struck the creature’s exposed neck with devastating power.","The combination of gravity, enhancement, and perfect timing created a strike that penetrated the bear’s natural armour.","\"That’s a critical hit!\" Alissa cheered with obvious excitement.","The Crimson Horn Bear roared in pain and surprise, dark blood flowing from the wound as it staggered backwards.","\"Excellent attack! You turned its intelligence against itself!\" Valeria called out.","Throughout the fight, the bear had been predicting where Noah would land on multiple occasions. This time, Noah used that ability of the bear to land a critical hit.","The bear circled warily now, no longer treating Noah as simple prey but recognising him as a threat to its life.","\"Finish it!\" Kip shouted encouragement. \"You’ve got the advantage now!\""]},{"number":179,"title":"Chapter 179: Alissa vs Minotaur","paragraphs":["Noah maintained his stance, aura flickering around his body while wind magic prepared for whatever combination attack the situation demanded. His confidence had grown with the successful attack, but it wasn’t to the point that he lowered his guard.","\"Use your reach advantage! Keep it at sword’s distance!\" Lola called out to him softly.","The wounded bear attempted a desperate charging attack, but Noah was ready this time. His experience with the bear, combined with his wind-assisted mobility, allowed him to sidestep while delivering a series of cuts that opened multiple wounds.","Swish! Crack! Slash!","\"Perfect combination! This is what makes you unique, swordsmanship and magic working together!\" Valeria shouted.","The Crimson Horn Bear’s movements grew sluggish as blood loss weakened it. But the creature’s final attack came so suddenly, so desperately, that it nearly caught Noah off guard.","Crash!","Only his agility and wind talent saved him from the bear’s last-ditch claw swipe, which would have injured him.","Swish!","Noah’s finishing strike combined everything he’d learned. His blade found the creature’s heart.","The Crimson Horn Bear collapsed with a final roar, its eyes losing their glint as life left its body","\"Well done!\" Multiple voices shouted simultaneously.","Noah stood over his defeated opponent, breathing heavily but satisfied at having successfully faced his first Tier 2 challenge.","\"Incredible fight!\" Valeria declared with obvious pride.","\"That aerial move was cool!\" Alissa added with admiration.","\"You outthought a creature known for tactical intelligence!\" Kip contributed with excitement.","Lola approached him, her ruby eyes sparkling. She moved her mouth without uttering anything. Yet Noah heard it loud and clear.","\"You definitely earned that present I mentioned.\"","...","[Your Swordsmanship skill has reached level 9!]","The notification brought immediate satisfaction to Noah.","His combat against the Crimson Horn Bear had pushed his swordsmanship to the very edge of novice rank. One more level would officially elevate him towards Apprentice status.","Level 9 swordsmanship. Almost at apprentice rank, just in time for the tournament.","After celebrating his victory, Noah didn’t miss the opportunity to harvest valuable materials from his defeated opponent. Beast cores from Tier 2 creatures seemed to be important.","Despite his wealth, Noah wouldn’t miss out on the free money that was earned from his fight.","He carefully extracted the core from the creature’s chest, feeling the concentrated mana inside it. The core went straight into his storage ring alongside his growing collection of valuable items.","Always harvest what you can. Beast cores might be worth some serious money.","Noah turned toward his companions with curiosity about their next plans. \"What are you guys planning to do now? Continue deeper?\"","Valeria nodded. \"This was just the beginning. Alissa and Kip will now head deeper into more dangerous territory to fight adept-rank beasts.\"","Adept-rank beasts. That’s a whole different level of danger.","Her eyes studied Noah’s expression as she continued. \"Would you like to come with us? The experience of observing high-level combat could be valuable for your development.\"","Noah thought carefully about the invitation. He had just levelled up his swordsmanship, which represented excellent progress toward his goals. Spending time understanding more powerful creatures while witnessing adept-level combat techniques would provide insights that training couldn’t match.","\"I’ll come,\" he decided.","His reasoning was simple. Watching adept-rank combat should teach him things he couldn’t learn anywhere else.","Plus, Lola’s here for protection if something goes catastrophically wrong.","They continued deeper into the forest, leaving behind the relatively safe territory where Tier 2 creatures represented the primary threats. The atmosphere grew heavier as they approached regions where genuinely dangerous predators made their homes.","Trees towered overhead, and the place was silent. It was unknown whether the place was simply void of life or whether something dangerous was lurking around.","The aura they eventually encountered proved to be exponentially more powerful than the Crimson Horn Bear he had struggled to defeat. The difference wasn’t small at all; in fact, it was extremely large.","That thing would kill me without breaking stride.","Noah frowned as he stared at the monstrosity blocking their path ahead. The beast was a minotaur, but not the relatively civilised version from classical mythology. This creature embodied savagery.","It stood nearly twelve feet tall, its humanoid torso covered in coarse fur and muscle. The bull’s head had jagged teeth that dripped saliva continuously, while its red eyes tracked Alissa’s approach.","It clutched a weapon in its massive hands, a makeshift club constructed from entire tree trunks bound together with sinew and metal. The basic but effective bludgeon could crush apprentice knights like insects.","That club weighs more than I do. One hit would paste me completely.","\"Alissa, this one’s yours,\" Valeria announced with confidence in her disciple’s capabilities.","She’s going to fight that thing alone?","\"Noah, stay well back. You might be caught in stray attacks that could seriously injure you. We also don’t want to block Alissa’s movement or distract her.\"","Noah and the others retreated to what was considered a safe distance—roughly a hundred yards from where the confrontation would occur. Even at that range, the minotaur’s aura made the air feel oppressive.","Alissa approached the massive creature with a calm expression, confident in her swordsmanship despite the size difference.","She looks so small compared to that thing. But she’s not afraid at all.","The minotaur roared a challenge that echoed through the forest, raising its tree-trunk club with the intent to crush the small cat-girl who dared to approach its territory.","Crash! Boom!","The battle began immediately.","The minotaur’s first strike created a crater where Alissa had been standing. But she was already gone, her agility keeping her ahead of attacks that would break boulders.","Swish! Clang!","Alissa’s blade work targeted the minotaur’s joints and weak points, each strike calculated to exploit the creature’s size disadvantages while avoiding its devastating counterattacks.","The combat continued for several intense minutes, with Alissa demonstrating that she was an adept swordsman who could hold her own against such a powerful monster. Her techniques flowed seamlessly between offence and defence.","Alissa used the minotaur’s brute force approach to create opportunities.","Crack! Slash!"]},{"number":180,"title":"Chapter 180: Pricing is an issue.","paragraphs":["The finishing sequence came when Alissa’s enhanced reflexes allowed her to slip inside the minotaur’s guard, her blade finding vital arteries.","Blood immediately erupted like a fountain, spraying the forest floor with deep, dark blood.","The massive creature collapsed with a final roar, its magical aura dissipating as life faded.","She made it look almost easy.","But the battle hadn’t been completely one-sided. A large scratch marred Alissa’s left arm where the minotaur’s claws had found their mark during one exchange.","She’s hurt. Not seriously, but she needs healing.","Noah immediately reached into his storage ring, withdrawing a loaf of magical bread. \"Here, this will help with the wound.\"","Alissa accepted the offering with obvious gratitude, understanding exactly what Noah was providing. \"Thank you.\"","...","After watching Alissa and Kip fighting additional minotaurs in the area, Noah had gained valuable combat experience. Observing what practitioners at higher ranks could accomplish provided insights that no amount of theoretical training could match.","The demonstrations had shown him techniques, timing, and approaches that would take time to discover through personal trial and error. Each battle revealed new combinations that expanded his understanding of what was truly possible.","It had been about two hours since he’d left his shop, and Noah decided it was time to return.","When he announced his intention to head back, surprisingly, Valeria and the others were also ready to conclude their hunting expedition. The timing worked perfectly for a group return to the city.","\"Good timing, we are heading back too,\" Valeria said as they began their journey back. \"I wanted to visit your shop anyway. Princess Elara mentioned you have some new items in stock.\"","Noah raised an eyebrow with curiosity about what exactly Elara had told the guild master.","\"She didn’t provide specifics, but if the princess says something is good, it must be exceptional.\" Valeria continued.","Noah smiled before replying. \"You’re welcome to take a look.\"","The return journey passed quickly. Valeria proved to be an excellent instructor, providing commentary that helped Noah understand the finer points of what he’d witnessed.","Arriving at the store, Noah unlocked the entrance and gestured for his companions to enter first.","Valeria stepped inside and immediately froze. Her expression moved from interest to complete shock as she read the descriptive placards.","\"These items...Permanent enhancement regardless of rank? That’s impossible,\" she breathed, her voice barely above a whisper.","Her eyes moved from one display to another—protein bars promising permanent strength increases, energy drinks offering permanent agility enhancement, and beef jerky providing permanent vitality improvement.","\"Noah, why didn’t you tell me about these?\" she demanded, her voice climbing several octaves. She was unable to contain her excitement; the items in front of her simply blew her mind.","Noah shrugged. \"There wasn’t really an occasion to mention them.\"","\"Occasion?\" Valeria’s voice rose with disbelief. \"What occasion? These are legendary artefacts! If I had missed the opportunity to acquire such items, I would regret it for the rest of my life!\"","Valeria had been so focused on the impossible item descriptions that she hadn’t yet noticed the pricing information. When her eyes finally found the cost details, her expression changed from excitement to devastation.","Her eyes began watering as if she was about to cry, the emotional whiplash of discovering perfect items only to realise they were completely beyond her financial reach.","\"One thousand golden coins,\" she whispered with the tone of someone reading her own death sentence. \"For a single protein bar.\"","The guild master’s shoulders slumped as the harsh reality crushed her dreams of advancing to master rank. Even as the leader of a successful mercenary organisation, she didn’t possess the kind of wealth required for permanent attribute improvement.","Well, she did have enough to purchase one item. But she was saving that money for her younger brother’s improvement. He had the potential to reach the adept rank by the next year, and she needed to have enough to fuel his development.","Furthermore, as the guild master, she treated those in the guild like her family. Even Alissa, her advancement had been paid by Valeria herself, she had treated Alissa like her younger sister, advancing her to the adept rank in such a short time. Most of her savings had been depleted to fuel Alissa’s development, and still, even after seeing this item before her, she didn’t regret fueling Alissa’s development.","Even if she had the chance to return in time, she would still do it again without hesitating. The cat-girl had become something akin to her younger sister.","...","\"I don’t have enough, not even close,\" she admitted quietly.","Noah watched her emotional journey with sympathy but without surprise. Premium enhancement items commanded prices that reflected their true value, making them accessible only to royalty, master-level practitioners, or extraordinarily wealthy merchants.","\"The pricing reflects their permanent effects,\" he explained gently. \"Items that provide lasting improvement naturally cost more than temporary benefits.\"","Despite his words, Noah was starting to rethink his strategy of selling these items. Initially, he had decided to implement the same pricing approach he had used in the demon kingdom inside the human kingdom. As time passed, Noah was beginning to realise that the strategy was fundamentally flawed.","Different kingdoms had different economic realities, different income distributions, and different capabilities. The humans in this kingdom had suffered for a very long time under the siege of extremist demons, their economy weakened by constant warfare and resource diversion toward defence.","Even buying his bread and iced tea represented a significant expense for most citizens. Only very few could afford his premium items, and the evidence was becoming undeniable.","Staring at the progress statistics for his premium auto-makers, Noah frowned with growing concern about his business approach.","—","[Auto-ProteinBar]","Level: 1","Production Rate: 1 bar every 2 hours","Max Stock: 12","Progress: 4/100","—","The protein bar had been sold to the king and a few other wealthy customers, yet even then, progress remained minimal at only 4/100. The slow advancement demonstrated that his target market was extremely limited."]},{"number":181,"title":"Chapter 181: Pricing change","paragraphs":["Keeping all those premium items on the shelf was proving wasteful when he could be selling them at lower prices to improve the capabilities of powerful individuals within the kingdom. Powerful practitioners would make the kingdom stronger overall.","Once the kingdom regained its strength and stability, it would naturally restore trading relationships with neighbouring kingdoms. Economic recovery would follow military security, creating wealth that could support higher pricing in the future.","By then, when he next returned to the human kingdom, he would have valid reasons to sell at the prices these items truly deserved. But for now, the kingdom needed strength more than he needed maximum profit per unit.","The thought of lowering prices hadn’t just occurred to Noah today. In fact, he had been considering this strategy adjustment for several days as evidence mounted about the economic limitations facing his customer base.","Seeing Valeria’s genuine distress at being unable to afford items that could transform her capabilities had cemented his decision. The guild master represented exactly the kind of person who would use permanent enhancement responsibly while contributing to kingdom defense.","Noah looked at Valeria with determination about implementing price adjustments that would serve both his long-term business interests and the kingdom’s immediate security needs.","The time had come to adapt his pricing strategy to match the economic reality of his current market rather than maintaining artificial scarcity that served no productive purpose.","...","As Valeria was about to leave, Noah made a decision that would reshape his business approach in the human kingdom.","\"Valeria, wait,\" he called, causing the guild master to pause at the door.","He smiled before asking, \"How much do you think would be a fair price that would help adept-rank practitioners without burdening them so heavily that they can’t afford enhancement?\"","Valeria’s eyes lit up with sudden hope, her expression transforming from resigned disappointment to excitement. \"Are you... planning to reduce the price?\" she asked, her voice trembling.","Noah nodded with certainty. \"I think it’s time the human kingdom regains its earlier prosperity. Strong practitioners make for a strong kingdom.\"","The strategic reasoning was sound—investing in the kingdom’s defensive capabilities now would pay dividends in future stability and economic growth that would support higher pricing later.","Valeria immediately became excited.","\"An item like this...\" she began thoughtfully, her mind already calculating. \"I think 100 golden coins would be accessible for most practitioners at adept rank or higher. Most have at least that much saved from successful missions.\"","Her enthusiasm built as she continued. \"Even 200 golden coins would work for serious practitioners. You’re not just doing us an incredible favour that we’ll never forget—you’re doing the entire kingdom a service that could change our defensive capabilities.\"","Noah considered her pricing suggestions carefully. Apprentice-rank practitioners wouldn’t have immediate need for such powerful enhancement, making adept and master-level individuals his primary target market.","150 golden coins. Right in the middle of her range. Fair for both parties.","\"Let’s make it 150 golden coins,\" Noah decided. \"That should be accessible to serious practitioners while still reflecting the items’ value.\"","Valeria’s face broke into a smile of pure joy. Without hesitation, she reached for her coin pouch with hands that shook slightly from excitement.","\"I’ll take an energy drink immediately,\" she declared, counting out the payment. \"I believe that with this item, I might truly hit the pseudo-master rank.\"","The transaction completed smoothly, with Valeria handling the bottle like precious treasure.","\"I’ll bring some of my guild members to purchase items as well,\" she promised with obvious gratitude. \"Word will spread quickly among serious practitioners.\"","Noah nodded before checking his remaining stock levels. \"There are only eleven energy drinks left, along with full stocks of the other premium items.\"","He turned toward Alissa and Kip, noting their obvious interest in the enhancement items despite their careful silence during the pricing discussion.","\"Do you two have enough saved to purchase anything?\" he asked gently.","Both cat siblings looked down with obvious embarrassment at their financial limitations. \"We have around 100 golden coins each,\" Alissa admitted quietly. \"Not quite enough for the new pricing.\"","They’re still building their savings from academy stipends and core sales. Makes sense.","Noah nodded with understanding before reaching for the premium display, retrieving two energy drinks without hesitation.","\"Here,\" he said simply, offering one bottle to each sibling.","Both Alissa and Kip stared at the gifts in shock, their senses confirming the genuine magical properties contained within each crystal bottle.","\"Master Noah, we can’t accept—\" Alissa began.","\"It’s fine, just give me twenty-five golden coins each. I won’t spoil you too much, just a little.\" He smiled.","The pair immediately retrieved the money before giving him a quarter of their wealth.","In Noah’s mind, this was an investment in friends who’ve proven their loyalty and capability. He would have given it for free, but he wanted to teach the younglings that their hard work had been paying off and they were starting to become independent, even if it meant that they were only paying a little.","Kip’s eyes filled with tears of gratitude as he accepted the energy drink with care. \"Thank you, Master Noah. This means more than you could know. You’ve already given us so much, whether it was the protein bar or the wind orb. Thank you...\"","Alissa nodded with similar emotion, her usual composed demeanour cracking as she processed the magnitude of his generosity.","Noah smiled before ruffling both of their heads. \"It’s okay, you will repay me once you reach the master rank and become powerhouses of this nation.\"","They both nodded.","Valeria stared at the scene with a soft smile. Noah was like the older brother that the cat-siblings never had.","With those transactions completed, Noah mentally catalogued his remaining premium inventory. Nine energy drinks remained available for sale, along with twelve beef jerky and twelve protein bars that would soon receive similar price adjustments.","The pricing strategy represented a calculated investment in the kingdom’s future rather than simple profit maximisation. Enhanced practitioners would contribute to national defence, economic recovery, and political stability that would benefit everyone long-term.","Lola observed the price adjustment with knowing approval.","\"Smart decision,\" she commented quietly.","As Valeria prepared to depart with her purchases, her expression carried gratitude. She understood that Noah’s pricing adjustment represented genuine support for the kingdom’s recovery rather than a mere commercial transaction.","\"Thank you,\" she said with quiet dignity. \"For everything. The kingdom won’t forget this generosity. I will make sure to share this news with the powerful people who deserve strength in this kingdom.\""]},{"number":182,"title":"Chapter 182: Huge profits.","paragraphs":["The next few hours passed with shocking speed, and the results were completely unlike what Noah had expected when he’d made his pricing decision.","After Valeria left with her energy drink, she had clearly wasted no time spreading word about the price reduction throughout Esta’s powerful practitioner community. Within an hour, she returned with everyone powerful in her guild—adept-rank swordsmen, adept-level mages, and accomplished people who had saved substantial coin from successful missions.","But Valeria hadn’t stopped with her own organisation. She had brought back representatives from other major guilds, independent practitioners, and many others.","Most surprisingly, Princess Elara herself had arrived with a small retinue of royal guards and court mages, her presence lending official legitimacy to the occasion.","\"Noah,\" the princess greeted him with excitement, \"Valeria told me about your pricing adjustment. This could revolutionise our kingdom’s defensive capabilities.\"","Every person who entered thanked Noah personally as they made their purchases, their gratitude reflecting genuine appreciation for making legendary enhancement accessible to serious practitioners rather than only the extraordinarily wealthy.","The atmosphere in his shop had transformed from routine commerce into something approaching a celebration of national strengthening. Practitioners who had never dreamed of affording or spotting such permanent enhancement were suddenly able to improve their power.","Before Noah fully comprehended what was happening, every single premium item in his inventory had been sold.","All of it. Gone.","Nine energy drinks, twelve beef jerky packages, and twelve protein bars had found eager customers who understood exactly what permanent attribute enhancement could mean for their capabilities and survival.","The income from premium sales alone was staggering—4,950 golden coins from items that would have gathered dust at his original pricing structure.","Noah gulped as he processed the astronomical figure. He had clearly been foolish to maintain demon kingdom pricing in a completely different economic environment. The massive sales volume at reduced prices had generated far more revenue than slow trickle sales at maximum cost.","But premium items weren’t his only success story during the unexpected rush.","Those same customers had also purchased substantial quantities of his regular inventory. Thirty-two additional loaves of bread and sixteen bottles of iced tea had found buyers among practitioners who wanted comprehensive enhancement rather than single-item improvement.","His total golden coin income for the day had reached 5,190 coins. An amount that represented more wealth than most nobles accumulated in years of careful resource management.","Noah stared at his updated status screen with amazement at how dramatically his financial situation had improved through strategic pricing adjustments.","—","Host: Noah Carter","Age: 28","Shop Level: 2","Daily Revenue: $295,000 (or equivalent)","Current Assets: $1,118,640","Shop Points: 6,360","Attributes: Strength: 30, Vitality: 30, Intelligence: 20, Agility: 30","Skills: Swordsmanship(Level 9), Mana Control (Level 8), Wind Manipulation (Level 8), Aura (Level 8), Body Tempering (Level 5), Surviving on Ramen (Level 3), Cooking (Level 3), Finance (Level 3), Programming (Level 2), Gaming (Level 2)","—","His finance skill had levelled up to level three after his decision. It was as if the system was rewarding him for the step he had taken.","His current assets had skyrocketed to over one million dollars, while his shop points had increased to 6,360—more than halfway toward the 10,000 required for Shop Level 3 advancement.","The auto-maker’s progress showed improvement across all categories:","—","[Auto-IceTea Maker] Level: 4","Production Rate: 4 Iced teas every hour","Max Stock: 96 Progress: 164/400","—","[Auto-Baker] Level: 4","Production Rate: 8 Loaves every hour","Max Stock: 96 Progress: 256/400","—","[Auto-ProteinBar] Level: 1","Production Rate: 1 bar every 2 hours","Max Stock: 12 Progress: 16/100","—","[Auto-EnergyDrink] Level: 1","Production Rate: 1 Energy Drink every 2 hours","Max Stock: 12 Progress: 13/100","—","[Auto-BeefJerky] Level: 1","Production Rate: 1 Beef Jerky every 2 hours","Max Stock: 12 Progress: 13/100","—","The bread and iced tea makers showed substantial advancement toward their next levels, while even their premium auto-makers had gained meaningful progress from the day’s unprecedented sales volume.","Princess Elara approached as the crowd began dispersing, her expression carrying satisfaction that transcended personal enhancement.","\"You’ve done something remarkable today,\" she said with genuine appreciation. \"The practitioners who bought your items represent the kingdom’s defensive backbone. Their enhancement will strengthen our entire kingdom.\"","Noah nodded, naturally understanding the strategic implications beyond simple profit generation.","The success had validated Noah’s instinct that strategic pricing could generate better results than rigid profit maximisation. Volume sales at accessible prices had created more revenue, stronger customer relationships, and a genuine contribution to kingdom security.","Most importantly, the enhanced practitioners would spread word about what had transpired today throughout the realm’s magical community, creating a customer base that would support sustainable business growth as the kingdom’s economy recovered.","The day’s events had transformed Noah from a shopkeeper with interesting products into a genuine contributor to national defence, while simultaneously advancing his personal financial goals through adaptation to market conditions.","As he surveyed his empty displays, Noah smiled with satisfaction at having discovered the optimal balance between profit and purpose that would serve his interests in the human kingdom.","After everyone had left and the shop had returned to relative quiet, Princess Elara lingered behind while the others departed with their precious items. They were all busy individuals, and they still needed to consume the item and perhaps try to gain more benefit from it than just eating it now.","Some decided to head to fight creatures that had been too difficult for them before, whilst others had a different purpose.","She reached into her pocket and withdrew a storage ring, extending it toward Noah.","\"What’s this?\" Noah asked, accepting the elegant ring with curiosity about its contents.","Elara smiled with a pleased expression. \"You forgot already? This is your reward from Baron Richard’s investigation. He had amassed an incredible amount of wealth from ripping off both the extremists and his fellow humans.\"","The confiscated assets from the conspiracy...right.","\"Even after paying back all those he had wronged,\" she continued, satisfied that justice had been served.","She paused for a second before continuing. \"There were still around a thousand golden coins remaining, and as father had promised, these are yours.\""]},{"number":183,"title":"Chapter 183: Noah’s new estate","paragraphs":["A thousand golden coins represented substantial wealth even by his current standards, equivalent to roughly $100,000 in Earth currency.","Baron Richard’s criminal profits turned into legitimate profits just like he had planned.","Poetic justice.","\"Furthermore,\" Elara added with building excitement, \"my father also told me to let you know that the viscount’s estate has been completely cleared and prepared for your use. You can move in whenever you want.\"","Noble estate.","Her amber eyes sparkled with curious anticipation as she made her next suggestion. \"In fact, would you like to check it out now? I could show you around the grounds personally.\"","Noah considered the invitation carefully. His shop was completely sold out of inventory, the opportunity to inspect his new noble property with the princess didn’t seem to bad.","Perfect timing. Nothing left to sell, and I should probably see what I actually own. Perhapse I could sell it later.","\"That sounds like an excellent idea,\" he replied with growing interest. \"I should probably familiarise myself with the property before making any decisions about actually living there.\"","Princess Elara’s smile widened with obvious pleasure at his acceptance. \"Wonderful! It’s only about ten minutes from here. The estate is quite impressive—The viscount spared no expense when he built it with his ill-got gains.\"","Noah turned toward Lola, who had been observing their conversation with amused interest from behind the counter.","\"You can close the shop whilst I’m gone, there is no need for you to work, it’s not your shift time,\" he said.","\"Alright. I will be in my room when you are done. Also, take your time exploring your new domain, Lord Viscount.\" She said before winking.","She’s never going to let me forget about the noble title.","Noah secured the shop and joined Princess Elara outside, where a royal carriage waited with discreet guards positioned for security without ostentation.","As they settled into the comfortable interior, Elara provided additional details about his new estate.","\"The estate includes the main manor house, extensive gardens, productive farmland, and several outbuildings that could serve various purposes,\" she explained.","\"The farmland alone generates enough revenue to maintain the grounds and provide comfortable living expenses. You won’t need to rely entirely on your shop income for basic needs.\"","The carriage rolled through Esta’s streets toward the outskirts, where noble estates provided space for the kind of expansive properties that demonstrated wealth and status.","..","Arriving at the estate, Noah raised an eyebrow in genuine surprise at the impressive sight before him.","The main manor house looked like a castle straight from those medieval shows he’d watched on Earth.","elegant stone architecture with graceful towers, arched windows, and detailed stonework. The building was incredibly spacious, with dozens of rooms spread across multiple floors.","This is what noble wealth looks like. That viscount definitely lived well on his criminal profits.","Princess Elara led him inside the manor house, and the interior only increased his amazement at the property’s quality and attention to detail.","The furniture maintained perfect consistency with medieval aesthetics while clearly representing the finest available craftsmanship. Everything had been maintained in spotless condition; it was clear that the king had made sure that it was ready for new ownership.","They really prepared this place thoroughly. No expense spared in making it ready for occupancy.","Everything looked perfect for someone wanting to live like authentic medieval nobility, but Noah’s modern sensibilities immediately identified several troublesome aspects that would require attention.","The toilets weren’t great, naturally, in a medieval setting, they lacked the modern conveniences that made personal hygiene comfortable and sanitary.","Medieval plumbing. Definitely not up to standards.","However, Noah wasn’t particularly worried about such practical challenges. If he decided to make the manor house his holiday residence in this place, he would naturally upgrade the facilities himself using knowledge from Earth.","All he needed was to develop skills in plumbing, electrical work, and various other real-world engineering disciplines before implementing improvements or teaching local craftsmen how to install modern conveniences.","Learning Earth skills to upgrade the magical world infrastructure. That’s actually an interesting project. But I will have to delay it for now, I don’t have the time or need for it currently.","In fact, improving the estate had been part of his long-term vision for quite some time. He planned to acquire crucial technical skills from modern Earth and introduce them to this magical world, believing that the combination of magic and technology could create something truly extraordinary.","Magical enhancement of modern engineering. The possibilities are endless.","The gardens, productive farmlands, and various outbuildings spanned across ten acres of well-maintained property. A significant estate by any reasonable standard. The agricultural land alone could generate substantial income, while the gardens provided both beauty and potential agricultural opportunities.","Perhaps Noah could plant his own fruits to harvest.","After completing their tour of the extensive grounds, Elara presented him with the keys and all relevant documentation before offering to transport him back to his shop.","Before she departed, Noah made an important announcement about his business plans.","\"The pricing event that occurred today will continue for a few more days. You can bring whoever you think would truly benefit the kingdom’s security and prosperity.\"","He paused to emphasise the security considerations that came with such powerful items. \"Make sure that they are trustworthy and loyal. We don’t want to accidentally strengthen potential enemies or people who might misuse permanent enhancement.\"","Princess Elara’s face brightened with obvious happiness at the news, understanding that continued access to legendary enhancement items could transform the kingdom’s capabilities.","\"I will discuss this with my father once I return immediately. Thank you once again for your contributions to our kingdom... Noah.\"","Royal gratitude and continued partnership. Excellent foundation for future business relationships.","Noah nodded with satisfaction at their collaboration before stepping out of the carriage and returning to his shop.","Back inside his familiar business environment, he faced a pressing decision about how to invest his dramatically improved financial resources. Two attractive options demanded consideration, each offering different advantages."]},{"number":184,"title":"Chapter 184: Rice Cakes","paragraphs":["Option one involved purchasing the fourth item from his shop upgrade slot, which would introduce intelligence-enhancing consumables that complemented his existing product line perfectly.","If he bought this item immediately, it would initially remain on display until purchased. Lola could buy the first unit, triggering the auto-maker system that would produce twelve items by tomorrow. Each item would sell for 150 golden coins based on his new pricing strategy.","Twelve items at 150 coins each equals 1,800 golden coins gross revenue.","After accounting for one unit for personal consumption and another for Lola’s daily salary compensation, ten units would generate 1,500 golden coins in sales revenue, recovering half the 3,000 golden coin investment cost in a single day.","Return on investment within 48 hours. Plus ongoing daily income of 150 golden coins.","Option two involved purchasing the idle room upgrade for one million dollars, which would provide automated optimisation of his business operations but wouldn’t generate immediate revenue or expand his product offerings. Instead, it would allow him to speed him his skill levels, albeit he didn’t know by how much.","Skill upgrade versus product diversification. Both have merit.","After considering both options carefully, Noah decided that immediate product expansion offered better strategic value than operational automation.","When tomorrow’s sales began generating revenue from the new product line, he could then afford the idle room upgrade while also benefiting from expanded inventory options.","Sequential investment. New product first, then operational upgrades.","The decision also came down to the fact that he really had no need to increase his power rapidly at this time. He had a master-level succubus with him, and he was practically immortal inside the shop.","As for Earth, unless he was shot by heavy machinery or there were hidden practitioners like him, he doubted that there would be a need for such a thing.","With his decision made, Noah accessed his shop upgrade interface and selected the fourth item for purchase.","<Item 4: Rice Cakes>","<Effects: Increases Intelligence attribute by 50% for twenty minutes. Permanently increases Intelligence attribute by 10 upon first consumption.>","<Price: $300,000>","...","After buying the rice cake, the item materialised on his shelf once again, just like all his system-generated products. Noah grabbed the rice cake and made his way to the second floor, remembering that Lola had mentioned she would be upstairs once he returned from the estate tour.","The second floor maintained the privacy arrangements the system had created for employee accommodation. Noah approached Lola’s room with the new product sample in his storage ring, intending to offer her first purchase rights as usual.","He knocked on her door softly with courtesy, just in case she was asleep. \"Lola? Are you asleep?\"","The door opened to reveal Lola wearing an expression that immediately made Noah’s pulse quicken. Her ruby eyes carried a mischievous look while a knowing smirk played across her lips, creating an atmosphere that made Noah’s body tense.","The tension radiating from her presence made him pause uncertainly at the doorstep.","\"Uh... I’ll come back another time,\" Noah said, already beginning to turn away from whatever game she was clearly planning.","But before he could retreat to safer territory, Lola’s hand shot out and grasped his wrist with gentle but firm pressure. She guided him inside her room.","Clink!","The door closed, and Noah was stuck with her inside the room.","\"Where are you going? Don’t you... want to see the present I promised you?\" she asked her voice dropping to the seductive whisper that always made his concentration waver.","The way she emphasised ’present’ carried thoughts that sent Noah’s heart rate climbing several beats per minute despite his attempts to maintain composure.","\"Uh, I’ll look at it another time,\" he muttered, his calm voice not betraying the nervousness he was feeling.","Seeing his reaction to her deliberate provocation, Lola couldn’t contain herself any longer. She burst into genuine laughter that filled the room with musical sound, her carefully constructed seductive atmosphere dissolving into pure amusement at his expense.","She’s been playing with me this entire time. Again.","The realisation that he’d fallen for another of her teasing schemes triggered something in Noah that had been building through a week of similar incidents. Instead of retreating in embarrassment as usual, he felt a surge of determination to turn the tables for once.","Without warning, Noah stepped forward and grasped both her shoulders, using his strength to gently but firmly push her backwards until she was pressed against the wall. The sudden role reversal caught Lola completely off guard.","Her ruby eyes widened with shock as she processed this unprecedented show of boldness from someone who typically retreated from her advances.","\"W-What are you...\" she began, her usual confident persona cracking as the tables turned unexpectedly.","Noah leaned in closer, bringing his face near hers intimately.","His movements were slow and tense.","Lola’s breathing quickened as she interpreted his advance, her eyes fluttering closed as she leaned forward slightly, clearly expecting the kiss that seemed inevitable given their position.","But the kiss never came.","When she opened her eyes after several moments of anticipation, she found Noah wearing a triumphant smirk that mirrored her own typical expression after successful teasing.","\"That’s what you get for constantly teasing me,\" he declared with satisfaction at finally managing to turn one of her games against her.","\"HEY! THAT’S MEAN!\" Lola pouted with indignation, though the smile breaking through her outrage revealed genuine appreciation for his unexpected boldness.","This young boss is really getting bolder, she thought with pleased surprise. He is no longer the shy merchant who used to blush at every comment.","The successful counter-tease had changed their growing relationship in subtle but meaningful ways, demonstrating that Noah was developing confidence that matched his growth.","After enjoying his moment of triumph, Noah stepped back and retrieved the rice cake from his inventory, returning their interaction to business matters with a smooth transition, as if the earlier tension between them had never occurred."]},{"number":185,"title":"Chapter 185: Grandmaster","paragraphs":["\"I actually came here to show you this,\" he explained, presenting the new product. \"It’s called rice cake, increases intelligence by 10 permanently, same enhancement as the other items. Would you like to buy it?\"","New product launch with my most reliable customer and employee.","Lola examined the rice cake with obvious interest, her enhanced senses detecting the concentrated magical properties contained within what appeared to be simple food.","\"How much?\" she asked, though her tone suggested she was already committed to making the purchase regardless of price.","\"However much you want to pay,\" Noah replied with the generosity he typically showed toward his most valued ally and employee.","Lola considered the offer thoughtfully, her expression suggesting careful calculation of fair value rather than an attempt to exploit his generosity.","\"Well, I have a decent amount of golden coins saved up,\" she mused aloud. \"I don’t have much use for them in normal circumstances, so... 600 again?\"","Noah smiled at the fact that she was still willing to pay a premium price despite the flexibility of his offer. It showed how genuine she was as a person.","Her daily salary was astonishingly high, yet she never took it for granted. Noah had saved her from certain death, given her shelter, and offered her a job, humble in title but priceless in value, something even emperors envy.","\"Deal,\" he agreed.","The transaction completed their interaction on a positive note, with both parties satisfied by the exchange.","Noah, with his successful product launch and revenge for countless teasing incidents, and Lola, with her new item and appreciation for his developing confidence.","...","Lola’s expression suddenly turned serious as she held the rice cake, her ruby eyes glinting slightly.","\"I will be in seclusion for the next few hours. I want to break through to the grandmaster rank. I believe I can achieve it after consuming this enhancement along with the other items I’ve saved from my daily salary.\"","Grandmaster rank. That’s an enormous advancement, but it makes sense; she isn’t a normal master-level mage.","Noah raised an eyebrow with genuine surprise at the ambitious nature of her goal. Breakthrough attempts between major ranks carried substantial risks, especially when attempting to reach the legendary grandmaster level that few practitioners ever achieved.","\"Take your time with the process. Don’t rush anything for the sake of work obligations. The shop can wait—your wellbeing is more important.\" Noah said immediately, feeling concerned for her safety during such a dangerous endeavour.","She’s risking everything for advancement. I need to make sure she has every possible safety measure.","His protective instincts kicked in as he considered the complications that could arise during forced breakthrough attempts.","\"You can reopen for business once you’re completely finished and feeling stable. If you feel fatigued afterwards, or if anything goes wrong during the process, use any items from the shop that might help,\" he continued, emphasising that her personal condition had more priority over the shop’s night shift.","\"You can use the items in the shop as emergency healing. Beefy jerky, anything that can help. Enhancement could be crucial if the breakthrough strains your constitution beyond normal limits.\"","Better safe than sorry.","The genuine worry in his voice and actions sent unexpected warmth flooding through Lola’s chest. In her years of existence, few people had ever expressed such sincere concern for her personal safety.","He’s worried about me...Not because I’m useful to his business, but because he actually cares about my well-being.","Most relationships in her experience had been transactional—allies who valued her power, enemies who feared her, or admirers who desired her supernatural beauty. But Noah’s concern transcended such superficial considerations.","He sees me as someone worth protecting rather than just a powerful tool to be utilised.","The realisation that someone cared about her survival for purely personal reasons rather than value created emotional responses she hadn’t experienced in decades. The master-level succubus found herself momentarily speechless at the depth of consideration he was showing.","When was the last time anyone worried about my safety? Has anyone ever cared this much?","\"Thank you, your concern means more than you might realise,\" she whispered softly, her voice carrying emotion that went far beyond gratitude.","The moment stretched between them. Noah’s protective instincts had revealed the depth of genuine care that was developing between them.","\"I’ll be extremely careful.\" She promised with sincerity that reflected her appreciation for his worry.","Why does he treat me so kindly...He’s making me fall for him more and more.","Noah nodded with obvious relief at her commitment to safety before stepping toward the door to give her the privacy such intensive work required.","\"Good luck with the advancement. I know you’ll achieve grandmaster rank—you have the skill and determination to succeed,\" he said with a captivating smile that stole her breath and a thumbs up.","After leaving Lola to her breakthrough preparations, Noah found himself with several hours of unexpected free time while his employee focused on magical advancement.","Looking at the time, he decided this represented an excellent opportunity to work on his own development.","Time to focus on swordsmanship advancement while Lola handles her breakthrough.","Noah made his way to his estate, which had a clear, open area where he could practice intensive sword work without disturbing others or damaging property.","The manual Lola had given him days ago remained in his storage ring, containing techniques that would allow him to reach the pinnacle of adept-rank swordsmanship more efficiently than standard training methods.","Advanced techniques should accelerate my progression toward apprentice rank significantly.","He wanted to reach Level 10 swordsmanship if possible, officially advancing from novice to apprentice rank before the mysterious tournament that Master Yamamoto had invited him to join.","The training session would serve multiple purposes. Personal advancement, productive use of available time, and preparation for challenges that would test every aspect of his developing capabilities.","Drawing his practice sword in the open field, Noah opened the advanced manual and began studying techniques that would push his swordsmanship beyond its current limitations."]},{"number":186,"title":"Chapter 186: Level 10 Swordsmanship skill","paragraphs":["Noah opened the advanced manual that Lola had provided, its pages filled with detailed illustrations and descriptions of sword stances. The manual was organised into three distinct sections corresponding to major skill ranks.","Time to see what separates novices from apprentice swordsmen.","He began by skimming through the novice section; his experience and knowledge allowed him to skim through the techniques and principles that had once seemed impossibly complex. To his surprise, most of the foundational material felt familiar rather than challenging.","I’ve already mastered these basics through weeks of intensive training with Master Tanaka, coupled with the hunting sessions with Valeria and Lola.","Footwork patterns, basic striking sequences, defensive positioning—all the fundamental elements that formed novice-rank swordsmanship had become second nature through dedicated practice and physical power.","The realisation that he had progressed beyond basic instruction filled Noah with confidence as he turned to the apprentice-level section, where real learning would begin.","This is where the manual’s true value reveals itself.","The apprentice techniques immediately proved far more demanding than anything he had previously attempted. Complex combination attacks that required precise timing, advanced defensive manoeuvres, integrated with footwork, blade positioning, and reflexes that demanded split-second decision-making.","Whoosh!","His first attempt at the \"Threading Needle\" technique, a precise thrust designed to exploit gaps in enemy defences, resulted in completely missing his intended target. The coordination required between enhanced attributes and refined techniques proved more challenging than expected.","This is going to take serious work.","For the next hour, Noah struggled with movements that seemed simple in illustration but demanded extraordinary accuracy in execution. The \"Flowing River\" combination required seamless transitions between seven different strikes, each building momentum for the next while maintaining perfect balance.","Crash!","His sword struck the ground as he overcompensated during a spinning transition.","But gradually, through persistent repetition and careful attention to the manual’s detailed instructions, Noah began finding the rhythm that allowed his body to work with rather than against the sword technique.","Swish! Crack!","The \"Mountain Cleaver\" downward strike finally achieved the devastating force the manual promised; his strength was fully channelled through perfect form to create attacks that would shatter large boulders.","The \"Wind Step\" evasion technique took even longer to master, requiring him to have more control over his footwork.","Whoosh!","When he finally executed the technique correctly, Noah found himself moving faster than he had imagined possible at his level; his agility was utilised properly through the footwork technique that strengthened him even more.","Noah began to understand what being an apprentice meant. It didn’t just mean having a more powerful body, whether it was faster, stronger or healthier. It was also about learning how to effectively utilise your current power and bring out its utmost potential.","The second hour of training brought breakthrough moments as his muscle memory began incorporating the advanced techniques into instinctive responses.","The previously complex combinations now flowed more naturally, while defensive positioning became more instinctive rather than a conscious effort.","Swish! Crack! Whoosh!","\"Alright, let’s try this out,\" Noah muttered before closing his eyes and taking a deep breath.","After exhaling, his eyes snapped open, and he began. A complete apprentice-level sequence, attack, counter, evasion, and follow-up strike was executed perfectly, marking his true advancement beyond novice limitations.","[Your Swordsmanship skill has reached level 10!]","The transformation his body had undergone became immediately visible to Noah. After all, the feeling was overwhelming and impossible to ignore. Power surged through Noah’s body like lightning as his body adapted to handle capabilities that transcended normal humans.","His muscles felt denser, more responsive, while his nervous system processed movement commands with supernatural speed that made the world seem to slow around him.","—","Host: Noah Carter","Age: 28","Shop Level: 2","Daily Revenue: $355,000 (or equivalent)","Current Assets: $860,018,640","Shop Points: 6370","Attributes: Strength: 60, Vitality: 30, Intelligence: 20, Agility: 60","Skills: Swordsmanship(Level 10), Mana Control (Level 8), Wind Manipulation (Level 8), Aura (Level 8), Body Tempering (Level 5), Surviving on Ramen (Level 3), Cooking (Level 3), Finance (Level 3), Programming (Level 2), Gaming (Level 2),","—","Sixty points in both Strength and Agility. It feels amazing... Noah thought as he inspected his new body.","Noah felt power rampaging through his body, every muscle fibre rebuilt to handle forces that would have destroyed his previous constitution. The sensation was intoxicating, like wearing a suit of power that responded to his slightest intention.","Time to test my new power.","He raised his practice sword and executed a simple horizontal swing, channelling his doubled strength through his now refined technique.","Whoosh!","The air parted with a sound far more audible than anything he had produced before. The displaced atmosphere created visible disturbance while the sword’s passage generated pressure waves.","That’s not just double-strength. The enhancement multiplied my combat power aggressively.","His speed proved even more remarkable than raw power. When Noah attempted basic footwork, his new agility carried him across distances that should have required multiple steps; his movement was no longer the same.","I need to get used to this gradually.","Despite the dramatic enhancement, Noah understood that reaching apprentice rank in swordsmanship alone didn’t grant complete apprentice-level power. True rank advancement requires comprehensive development across all related skills.","Although I could definitely kill that Crimson Horn Bear much more easily now, this still isn’t my full potential at the apprentice rank.","He needed to advance his aura skill to Level 10 to achieve genuine apprentice-rank capabilities that integrated all aspects of his combat development. Only then would he truly possess the power that the rank represented.","Aura advancement next. Then I’ll have the power of an apprentice-level swordsman.","Still, the current enhancement was nothing to dismiss lightly. With the base power, speed, and skill set of an apprentice swordsman, Noah felt incredibly satisfied with his advancement toward tournament readiness.","A few more days until the tournament.","The training session had achieved everything he’d hoped for while revealing new goals that would push his development even further."]},{"number":187,"title":"Chapter 187: Ethan’s team.","paragraphs":["After his remarkable advancement to apprentice rank, Noah decided it was time to return to the shop, check on Lola’s breakthrough progress, and then head home for some well-deserved rest after such an intensive day.","The walk back felt different with his new attributes—each step carried him further than expected, while his heightened awareness made him notice details in the environment that had previously escaped his attention.","Moving with sixty points in agility takes adjustment. Everything feels effortless but almost too responsive. Noah thought, a smile on his face. He wasn’t complaining about the boost, not at all.","Arriving at his shop, Noah found the space empty and quiet. Lola wasn’t behind the counter, and the \"closed\" sign remained in place, indicating that her advancement attempt was still ongoing.","She’s been at this for around two hours. Grandmaster breakthrough must be incredibly demanding.","He made his way upstairs slowly, taking care not to create any noise that might disturb her concentration during such a critical process. Rank advancement required complete focus, and interruptions could prove dangerous or even fatal.","Outside her room, Noah found the door slightly ajar, allowing him to check on her condition without intrusion. Through the gap, he could see Lola maintaining perfect meditative posture, her body radiating so much energy that it made Noah’s eyes widen.","If he had to put it into words, she was like a small sun radiating energy all over the room.","Still in deep meditation. The beef jerky remains untouched beside her, which suggests everything is proceeding normally.","The beef jerky’s presence by her side provided reassurance that she had emergency healing available if complications arose during the breakthrough attempt. Her steady breathing and stable posture indicated that the process was demanding but proceeding safely.","Noah smiled with relief at her apparent stability and decided not to worry about the extended duration. Grandmaster advancement naturally required substantial time investment, often lasting many hours for particularly challenging transitions.","She’s handling it well. Better to let her finish without interference.","Returning downstairs to the main shop area, Noah found himself staring thoughtfully at his inventory displays. The day’s events had reminded him of family members who could benefit from his products, particularly his cousin Ethan.","Ethan’s Type 1 diabetes. I’ve been meaning to address that.","His cousin had been managing the chronic autoimmune condition for some time now, requiring constant monitoring and insulin management that significantly impacted his quality of life. While modern medicine could control the symptoms, it couldn’t cure the underlying immune system dysfunction.","Type 1 diabetes is an autoimmune disease. Maybe the bread’s healing could help restore proper immune function.","Noah considered his options between beef jerky and healing bread. The bread’s thirty percent healing acceleration might help his cousin’s immune system recover proper function, while the beef jerky’s permanent vitality enhancement could strengthen his overall constitution and cure him.","Start with bread first. If it doesn’t work, then I will use the beef jerky. There is no need to jump to the beef jerky just yet.","He decided to begin with the healing bread, reasoning that the temporary enhancement would provide insight into whether magical healing could address autoimmune conditions without the permanent commitment that beef jerky represented.","Having nothing to lose and a sick cousin to potentially heal, it’s worth trying.","Noah carefully selected one of his loaves and stored it in his dimensional ring, planning to visit Ethan tomorrow after school or perhaps drop by their family home during his free time.","Tomorrow I’ll test whether magical healing can help with his conditions.","With his family stuff planned, Noah secured the shop and made his way home to his comfortable house. The day had been extraordinarily productive, whether it was the estate tour, the massive sales success, or the swordsmanship advancement.","Time to process everything that happened today. I’ve advanced far beyond what I thought possible.","At home, Noah headed straight for the shower to wash away the dirt and sweat accumulated during his intensive sword training. The hot water felt amazing against his body.","After cleaning up thoroughly, he changed into fresh, comfortable clothes.","The evening routine felt luxurious compared to his previous struggles with poverty and uncertainty. Having a real home, financial security, and with his dad healthy by his side, everything felt complete in ways Noah had never imagined possible.","Real stability. Not just surviving, but actually thriving.","Noah settled at his desk, wanting to relax and decompress after such an intensive day. He powered up his gaming setup, looking forward to an hour of simple entertainment before heading to sleep.","Just because he could practice magic and operate a shop in another world didn’t mean he would discard the enjoyable aspects of his previous life. Gaming, family time, and normal Earth activities remained important for maintaining balance and connection to his roots.","Logging into the game, Noah immediately noticed that Ethan was online and currently in a group with several other players.","He’s probably training with that esports team that offered him the contract. He mentioned they had practice sessions scheduled.","During their family dinner, Ethan had enthusiastically explained how the professional team required extensive coordination practice to prepare for upcoming tournaments. The opportunity represented exactly the kind of career breakthrough his cousin had been working toward.","Better not disturb his professional training. Solo queue for me tonight.","Noah queued up for a solo match, settling back in his chair as the familiar interface searched for opponents of appropriate skill level.","Meanwhile, across the city in his family’s modest apartment, Ethan sat focused at his computer with intense concentration that had become his trademark during play.","Whenever his viewers on the stream saw that look, they called him ’Locked-in Larry.’","\"Alright, team, remember our strategy for this map,\" called the team captain through voice chat. \"Ethan, you’ll be handling the aggressive flanking routes we practised yesterday.\"","\"Got it, captain.\" Ethan replied.","His positioning and timing have been improving consistently under the training he had been undergoing."]},{"number":188,"title":"Chapter 188: Ethan Vs Noah!","paragraphs":["The other professional players chimed in with confirmations, their coordination showing the difference that separated amateur enthusiasts from tournament-level competitors.","\"World championship qualification is only three weeks away,\" Their captain reminded them. \"Every practice session matters for fine-tuning our team synergy.\"","World championship. The biggest tournament in their game’s competitive scene.","Ethan felt his heart beat quicken with anticipation at the stakes involved. Qualifying for world championship would transform his gaming hobby into a legitimate career opportunity while providing financial security for himself.","Naturally, Ethan, who was in his teenage years, wanted to have the freedom to buy the things he wanted without worrying about burdening his family. Whilst they were well off, they weren’t in a position to get him what he wanted, like the new sneakers that dropped, or various other things that people at his age wanted.","Furthermore, seeing his cousin’s success drove Ethan to become a better version of himself. To reach the heights that his cousin did, to become rich and bless his family and perhaps one day pay back Noah for what he had done for him.","\"Let’s show them what we can do,\" Ethan said with determination, too engrossed in team preparation.","The matchmaking algorithm worked its magic, balancing skill levels and connection quality to create fair, competitive matches for hundreds of thousands of simultaneous players.","<Match Found!>","<Entering in 3...2...1!>","Both Noah and Ethan’s professional teams received the same notification simultaneously, neither realising that family members were about to compete against each other in what would become an unexpectedly personal gaming session.","The loading screen displayed team compositions while players prepared for battle.","...","\"Remember, stay grouped and communicate everything,\" the captain instructed as the match environment loaded around both teams.","They were currently in a 5v5 tactical shooter mode where coordination and precise aim determined victory. The high-stakes competitive format demanded both individual skill and team strategy to succeed against organised opponents.","The round began with the familiar tension that characterised serious competitive play. Ethan’s team had been assigned to the attacking side for the first half, requiring them to coordinate pushes against defensive positions while managing limited resources.","Ethan, still completely engrossed with his team’s tactical discussions, hadn’t bothered checking the opposing roster. Even if he had examined individual player names, Noah’s streamer mode would have hidden his actual username behind generic placeholder text.","\"Basic weapons first round,\" called their in-game leader as the team purchased standard weapons and utility items. \"Save economy for better equipment in round two.\"","Ethan’s professional team moved together toward their designated attack routes, their training evident in smooth positioning and timing that amateur teams rarely achieved.","Meanwhile, on the defending side, Noah coordinated with his randomly matched teammates about defensive positioning.","\"I’ll handle the common chokepoint,\" Noah announced, selecting a defensive position that would utilise his agent’s special abilities effectively. \"My kit works well for slowing pushes through that corridor.\"","His enhanced reflexes and agility translated remarkably well to competitive gaming, providing reaction times that were much higher compared to normal human capabilities.","The attack began with Ethan’s team executing a coordinated multi-site assault designed to overwhelm defensive positions through simultaneous pressure. But while they focused their main push on one side of the map, a flanking player attempted to breach Noah’s defensive position.","Pop!","Noah’s enhanced reaction time allowed him to eliminate the flanking attacker with precision that would have impressed professional players; his aim adjustment appeared at speeds that seemed almost fake in their perfection.","\"Nice pick,\" called one of his teammates. \"That stops their split push completely.\"","But the celebration proved premature as reports came in from across the map.","\"Four people!\" called another defender. \"They broke through the main site!\"","Noah found himself alone against Ethan’s remaining four teammates, who had successfully eliminated his allies and planted the explosive device that would secure round victory unless he could achieve an improbable comeback.","Noah made his way towards the site where the plant was bombed. As he made his way, one of the team members encountered Noah, and they immediately started shooting.","Pop! Headshot!","The first elimination came as Noah’s aim allowed him to get the pick quickly. Unfortunately, the kill didn’t come for free; the other player had hit a body shot, which made his health lower.","Pop! Pop! Another down!","His supernatural aim consistency continued as hand-eye coordination made shots that should have been difficult feel like aim-bot.","\"What the hell?\" came a voice from the attacking team’s voice chat. \"This guy’s aim is insane!\"","But professional teams earned their reputation through tactical superiority rather than individual skill alone. As Noah moved for his third elimination, the remaining attackers established a crossfire position that made an approach impossible without exposing himself to multiple angles simultaneously.","Pop!","Noah managed to eliminate the third opponent but found himself caught in the prepared crossfire setup, with his low health too; his reflexes were insufficient to overcome the positioning and tactical advantage.","\"Good round,\" Ethan called to his team as they secured the victory. \"That defender had incredible aim, but our coordination pulled us through.\"","The game continued through multiple rounds, with Noah’s aim creating spectacular individual performances that kept his team competitive despite facing a professional team.","His reflexes allowed him to win impossible clutch situations—five rounds where he eliminated entire enemy teams single-handedly when his teammates fell early.","But while Noah’s enhanced agility provided incredible aim and reaction time, his positioning, game sense, and tactical knowledge remained at amateur levels that professional teams could exploit through superior strategy.","After twelve rounds, the scoreboard showed 7-5 in favour of Ethan’s professional team. The agility stat had kept Noah competitive, but coordinated teamwork and professional-level game knowledge provided advantages that individual skill couldn’t overcome with mere reflexes.","They’re better as a team. My agility boost could only go so far against such high-level execution and knowledge of the map. Noah thought, sighing at the inevitable loss situation he was thrust into. The problem was that two members of his team were actually drunk!"]},{"number":189,"title":"Chapter 189: Ethan Vs Noah (2)","paragraphs":["As teams swapped sides for the second half, Noah checked the scoreboard with mixed feelings about his performance. His individual statistics were impressive, but the team score reflected the reality of competing against organised professionals with two drunkards.","Fortunately, something positive emerged from those challenging twelve rounds of competition.","[Your Gaming skill has reached level 3!]","Throughout those same twelve rounds, Noah had gradually learnt some good positioning and tactical things from the other team.","During those rounds, he had also checked the usernames of those against him. They weren’t weak at all, and he was shocked.","He was up against his own cousin’s professional team!","The discovery added personal stakes to what had been simple evening entertainment, though Noah’s streamer mode continued hiding his identity from the opposing team.","Meanwhile, in Ethan’s team chat, animated discussion centered on their mysterious opponent’s capabilities.","\"That defender’s aim is absolutely insane,\" the captain observed with professional appreciation mixed with suspicion. \"I’m starting to wonder if he’s using assistance software.\"","\"His crosshair placement is perfect,\" added another teammate. \"Every shot lands exactly where he aims, like he’s got some kind of aimbot running.\"","Ethan nodded in agreement, having witnessed several impossible shots that defied normal human reaction time. \"What’s weird is that his game sense doesn’t match his aim. His positioning and decision-making are maybe semi-professional level at best.\"","That’s what’s throwing them off. Enhanced reflexes without corresponding game knowledge.","\"Semi-pros don’t have aim like that,\" the coach interjected from his observer position. \"Something doesn’t add up about this player.\"","\"Should we report for investigation?\" asked their support player.","\"Let’s finish the match first,\" the captain decided. \"If he’s cheating, the anti-cheat system will catch it. If he’s legitimate, we’re witnessing something incredible.\"","The professional team had been forced to completely adjust their strategy, focusing multiple players on neutralising Noah’s position specifically rather than executing the tactical setups they had practised.","...","The attacking portion began with a completely transformed dynamic. Noah’s team, having witnessed his incredible individual performances during five impossible clutch situations, now regarded him with the respect typically reserved for those at the top.","\"Alright, what’s the plan?\" asked his team’s entry fragger, his tone carrying deference that hadn’t existed at the match’s beginning.","\"Yeah, you’ve been carrying us hard,\" added another teammate. \"We’ll follow your calls.\"","He had complete trust from random teammates. That’s what clutching five 1v5 situations earned him.","Before reaching Level 3 gaming skill, Noah’s knowledge had been insufficient to create comprehensive strategies against professional opposition. His reflexes could win him duels, but coordinated team play required understanding that went beyond raw mechanical skill.","But now, with his upgraded gaming abilities, Noah found himself analysing the professional team’s previous tactics with understanding that hadn’t existed during the defensive half.","I can now understand their rotational timings, their utility usage patterns, and their preferred angles. Level 3 gaming skill has shown me the strategic layer behind their previous steps.","\"Listen up,\" Noah announced, confident in his next play. \"I’ve been watching their defensive setups for twelve rounds. Here’s what we’re going to do.\"","His plan emerged with strategic sophistication that surprised even himself. \"They’re over-rotating to counter my individual plays, which creates predictable gaps in their defensive coverage.\"","Use their adaptation against them. Professional teams are creatures of habit once they establish patterns.","\"I need two of you to execute a loud, obvious push on the main site,\" Noah continued, his tactical thinking operating at levels his previous gaming skill couldn’t have achieved. \"Draw their rotational response, then immediately fall back. Although this is a very basic tactic that is known by everyone, they will not expect it. We have not used it once since the game began.\"","His teammates listened with growing respect as Noah outlined a complex bait-and-switch strategy that would exploit the professional team’s disciplined rotational habits.","\"That’s going to get us killed,\" observed their support player with understandable concern.","\"That’s the point, your deaths create the opening that wins us the round. Are you willing to sacrifice for team victory?\"","Sacrificial tactics. Using teammates as strategic resources rather than trying to keep everyone alive.","The team exchanged a few words before accepting the plan. \"If you think it’ll work, we’re in.\"","\"Good. I’ll be flanking through their weak rotation while they’re focused on your distraction. Trust the plan.\"","The round began with Noah’s teammates executing their sacrificial assault with convincing aggression. Their attack looked genuine enough that Ethan’s professional team responded exactly as predicted.","\"Rotate, rotate!\" called Ethan’s captain as defenders moved to reinforce against the apparent main push. \"Standard defensive adjustment!\"","In more advanced games, they would have never done such a thing; it would definitely lead to a loss. But the people against them really didn’t have such a skill level; they were just unlucky to face them in quick play.","The reason they wanted to rotate immediately was because they didn’t want Noah to pick them off one by one; it would be tragic.","But as the professional team shifted their positioning, Noah moved through the gaps their rotation had created.","Pop! Pop! Headshot!","Noah’s aim eliminated two defenders before they realised their rotational response had been manipulated into creating exactly the vulnerability he needed.","\"What the hell?\" came Ethan’s voice through his team’s chat. \"He was lurking!\"","Pop! Pop! Pop!","The remaining defenders fell to Noah’s reaction time and insane aim as he cleared the site with speed that was simply outrageous.","\"Round won,\" Noah announced to his celebrating teammates. \"Same strategy next round, different site. They won’t expect us to do it twice, also we have the advantage. Someone buy me, I need a powerful gun.\"","Immediately, someone used all his credits and bought Noah the most powerful rifle. He was left with no utility or guns for himself, but who cared? Noah himself was like a whole team, and arming him meant arming a whole team, no, in fact, it was better!","Meanwhile, in Ethan’s team chat, confused voices tried to process what had just occurred."]},{"number":190,"title":"Chapter 190: It was Noah!","paragraphs":["\"That wasn’t the same player,\" the captain said with obvious bewilderment. \"His positioning was completely different. Professional level. The way he hid and waited for both of us to appear before killing us both, too, his composure, everything had changed.\"","\"His game sense just jumped from amateur to expert mid-match,\" Ethan added with growing concern. \"That’s not normal improvement. Maybe he just got lucky in this round, let’s wait and see in the next rounds.\"","Their coach’s voice carried scepticism. \"Players don’t develop tactical understanding that quickly. Something changed.\"","The next round proceeded with Noah’s team executing another variation of the sacrificial strategy. This time, Noah directed a three-person distraction while he and one teammate attacked from an unexpected angle.","Pop! Pop! Pop! Pop!","Four quick eliminations followed as Noah’s agility combined with Level 3 tactical knowledge to dismantle the professional defence with relative ease.","\"This guy is definitely a top player,\" Ethan declared with frustrated certainty. \"No amateur plays like this. I think he is part of the top tier bracket; he is simply insane.\"","Professional players weren’t all at the same skill level. Not at all, they were split into brackets. The team that Ethan was currently debuting for was part of the lowest bracket.","\"His mechanical skill was always insane,\" the captain agreed, \"but now his positioning and timing are perfect. I think he was just playing normally initially, and now he has decided to finally play seriously.\"","Round after round, Noah’s tactical innovations, coupled with his aim, continued to overwhelm Ethan’s team.","Pop! Pop! Pop!","Another flawless round execution as Noah eliminated three defenders while his teammates secured the objective.","\"We’re getting destroyed, I really can’t wait for the match to end.\"","\"Check his account after the match,\" the coach instructed. \"This might be a known professional player testing strategies on a secondary account.\"","Pop! Pop!","Noah’s supernatural aim continued producing highlight-reel eliminations that would have impressed tournament audiences, each shot landing with consistency that seemed almost fake in its perfection.","The score rapidly shifted from 7-5 to 7-11 as Noah’s leadership transformed his random teammates into a coordinated unit capable of outplaying professional opposition.","\"New strategy. Forget everything we practised. This guy is reading our standard plays like a book.\" The captain announced during their brief period of defence preparation.","Another ace, five eliminations in a single round, as Noah’s performance reached levels that were the pinnacle of competitive gaming.","\"This is insane,\" Ethan said with admiration. The man in front of him was simply insane.","As the final round approached, Ethan’s professional team demonstrated exactly why they had earned contracts with a competitive organisation. Despite facing overwhelming individual skill that had dismantled their strategies, they refused to surrender or lose focus.","\"This is the best learning opportunity we could possibly ask for. Win or lose, we’re absorbing everything this player is teaching us,\" Their captain declared.","\"Exactly,\" Ethan agreed, his frustration transforming into focus. \"Watch his positioning, his timing, his utility usage. This is top-level gameplay.\"","Their coach’s voice carried approval through the team chat. \"This mindset is why you’re professionals. Turn every challenge into education. We can’t win everything, we win some and we lose some.\"","The team had approached this match expecting normal practice and warm-up exercises before their upcoming tournament preparations. Instead, they’d encountered gameplay that would become a highlight in their personal development—a match they would remember and reference for years.","This single game probably advanced their tactical understanding more than weeks of standard practice against normal opponents.","Throughout the final round, they continued experimenting with counter-strategies while carefully observing Noah’s responses. Every adaptation he made, every tactical innovation he employed, every mechanical display of supernatural aim—all of it was being absorbed and analysed for future application.","\"We’ve already recorded everything. This footage will be studied extensively during tomorrow’s review session.\" The coach confirmed.","Professional players didn’t just play and create tactics. They learnt from their mistakes by reviewing the matches they won and lost. They are always trying to find something to improve on.","The match concluded with Noah’s team achieving a decisive 13-7 victory that showcased their complete domination during the second half. What had begun as a 7-5 deficit had transformed into an overwhelming win through Noah’s leadership and skill.","As the final elimination registered and victory screens appeared, both teams prepared for the traditional post-match analysis that competitive players used to evaluate performance.","The moment the match officially ended, leaderboard information became available to all participants.","Ethan’s team immediately began checking detailed statistics and player identification, their curiosity eager to find who had just beaten them.","\"Let’s see who this mystery player actually is,\" the captain announced as he accessed the detailed match report.","The familiar name that appeared on Ethan’s screen made him do a double-take before staring in complete disbelief. The name definitely looked familiar, but he couldn’t believe it; he had to double-check the tag, too.","Immediately, Ethan opened his friends list, cross-referencing the revealed username and tag against his cousins.","That username... it can’t be.","\"Noah?\" Ethan muttered, his voice barely audible as he finally realised who had just beaten them so effortlessly.","He checked and rechecked the information, comparing the match participant data against his friends list to confirm what seemed impossible. The evidence was undeniable—his cousin had just destroyed a professional esports team with a gameplay that made them think he had been hacking.","When did he get this good...how? He is incredible.","\"What did you say?\" asked the team captain, having caught Ethan’s confused whisper.","\"Noah,\" Ethan repeated, louder this time, but still carrying shocked disbelief. \"The player who just dominated us... His name is Noah.\"","\"You know him?\" His teammate asked with obvious curiosity about their mysterious opponent’s identity.","Ethan’s throat felt dry after what he had just discovered. \"He’s...my cousin.\"","Silence filled the team chat as his professional teammates absorbed this unexpected connection, their new teammate was related to someone at the level of the top professional players."]},{"number":191,"title":"Chapter 191: Daily Income.","paragraphs":["\"Your cousin is a professional player?\" the captain asked with obvious assumptions about Noah’s background and training.","\"What games does he compete in?\" added another teammate. \"His mechanical skill shows he has years of high-level experience.\"","Ethan shook his head slowly, still struggling to reconcile the Noah he knew with the gaming phenomenon they’d just encountered.","\"No, he’s not a professional player in any game,\" Ethan said with growing amazement. \"He just started playing this game a few days ago. Before that, he played other games casually, nothing competitive.\"","The team chat fell completely silent as Ethan’s words sank into their brain. A casual player with minimal experience had just outplayed an entire professional team using knowledge and mechanical skill that should have required years to develop.","\"A few days?\" the captain repeated with obvious disbelief. \"That’s impossible. Nobody develops game sense like that in a few days.\"","\"His aim was already inhuman, but his strategic understanding was tournament-level. That doesn’t happen overnight. Unless...he has wall hacks on, and he isn’t really using any strategy.\"","Ethan found himself defending his cousin’s legitimacy while simultaneously trying to understand how Noah had achieved such an impossible improvement in such a short timeframe.","\"I know how it sounds,\" Ethan replied with helpless honesty, \"but I’m telling you the truth. A few days ago, he was asking me basic questions about game mechanics. Tonight, he just gave us the most brutal defeat we’ve ever experienced.\"","The professional team struggled to process information that challenged everything they understood about skill development and competitive gaming progression.","\"We need to watch this recording frame by frame,\" the captain decided with obvious fascination. \"If your cousin really developed these capabilities in days, we need to understand how. Don’t be offended, Ethan, but I really feel like your cousin is cheating. Nobody can have such aim and mechanical skill in a few days.\"","As the team began planning their intensive review session, Ethan found himself typing a private message to his cousin through the game’s chat system, his fingers hesitating over the keyboard as he struggled to process what had just occurred.","How do I even start this conversation? ’Hey cousin, you just destroyed my professional team’?","Finally, he sent a simple message: \"Noah... was that really you? My team thinks you’re hacking. They can’t believe someone could play like that.\"","Noah’s response came immediately—a simple smiling emoji that somehow carried smugness despite being just a yellow face on screen.","Ethan typed back almost immediately. \"Seriously, my team is convinced you’re using aimbot and wall hacks. They’re going to review every frame of that match looking for evidence.\"","Noah’s reply was confident: \"Let them review it. They’ll see.\"","He’s not worried at all. Ethan thought.","Before Ethan could send another message, Noah’s status shifted to offline, leaving his cousin staring at an empty chat window with dozens of unanswered questions swirling through his mind.","He just logged off like nothing happened...absolute cinema.","That one game had been extraordinary—the kind of match that would be discussed and analysed for days within their professional circle if Noah turned out to be legit.","...","The Next Morning","Noah woke up feeling refreshed after a night of excellent sleep, his constitution requiring less rest while providing more restorative benefits than his previous normal human physiology.","My high vitality is something else. My recovery rates are through the roof. I haven’t gotten such good sleep ever.","He made his way downstairs, checking his daily system notification.","[You have received your daily income!]","[$355,000 has been rewarded!]","Noah had already changed the wind orb into money. He had around 5 of those orbs, and there was no need for more. When he needed more, he could simply get them himself. For now, money was more important since he had an idle room to open.","His daily income had also increased because of the rice cake that Lola had bought.","Three hundred fifty-five thousand dollars. Just a few weeks ago, I was struggling to afford ramen and dodging debt collectors.","Noah smiled at the astronomical figure that represented more money than most people earned in an entire year. The transformation from poverty to wealth had been so rapid that he sometimes needed reminders of how dramatically his circumstances had changed.","From a daily income of $300 to $355,000. That’s more than a thousand-fold increase.","Downstairs, Noah discovered his father had already awakened and prepared breakfast for both of them. The sight of Alan moving around the kitchen with energy and a smile on his face made Noah feel happy for his father.","The beef jerky was really a life changer.","He looks twenty years younger. The permanent vitality enhancement transformed everything about his health and energy.","After checking on his father the previous evening, Noah had found him sleeping peacefully, no longer the restless, pain-interrupted sleep that had become a part of his condition during the illness.","\"Noah? You’re awake,\" Alan called with obvious pleasure at seeing his son. \"Come join me. I made breakfast for both of us.\"","Alan sounded genuinely happy. Not just healthy, but enthusiastic about life again.","\"Dad, you didn’t have to do this,\" Noah replied with a gentle smile on his face, feeling some concern over his father’s effort. \"You should be relaxing. I could have made breakfast or ordered delivery.\"","Alan waved away his son’s concerns with a confident expression.","\"Don’t worry, son. These old bones are much healthier now,\" he said with obvious satisfaction at his new body. \"Come on, let’s eat.\"","Alan’s smile carried contentment of someone who had rediscovered simple pleasures in life that illness had made difficult, such as cooking for family, moving without pain, and planning activities rather than merely enduring them.","Noah smiled wryly at his father’s obvious pleasure in resuming normal parental activities and joined him at the table for their shared meal.","The breakfast was excellent; his dad’s cooking did not disappoint.","Noah could tell that his father was enjoying it. He knew that his father had probably thought of himself as a burden to his only son."]},{"number":192,"title":"Chapter 192: Surpassing Master Tanaka","paragraphs":["So, when cooking for his son and doing these small acts of kindness, his father felt rejuvenated, as if he was providing for his son, not necessarily using money, but providing what he could.","After they finished eating, Noah reached into his wallet and withdrew a substantial amount of cash, placing it on the table in front of his father.","\"Dad, here’s a thousand dollars, just in case you need anything during the day. I’ll be heading to the dojo for training. Do you need anything from me on the way?\"","Alan looked at the cash with obvious surprise, his hand moving to push the money back toward his son.","\"I’m fine, and there’s really no need for so much money,\" he protested.","Noah gently stopped his father’s hand before it could return the cash.","He insisted patiently. \"It’s fine, Dad. Keep it,\" he said with warm firmness that gave no room for argument.","Alan sighed with acceptance, recognising the futility of arguing with his son’s obvious determination.","\"Alright,\" he conceded with a mixture of gratitude and concern. \"Get there safely, and don’t speed. Speeding kills.\"","\"Yes, boss,\" Noah laughed before heading toward the garage where his GT-R waited for another trip to the dojo.","...","Noah arrived at the dojo with anticipation building in his chest. His advancement to apprentice rank had transformed his capabilities beyond anything he’d previously experienced, and he was eager to test how his new skills would translate to real combat against his respected instructor.","The familiar wooden building welcomed him. Inside, the other students were already engaged in their morning routines. They were all improving steadily from consistent practice under Master Tanaka’s guidance.","The Dojo didn’t earn its good reputation for no reason after all.","Noah began his warm-up with the same exercises.","Basic strikes dlowed with more elequence, more grace than before and it shocked him.","Swish! Whoosh!","The students and Tanaka looked at Noah’s strikes wirh growing apprehension. Despite his amazing technique before, their Dojo’s champion seemed to have made it even better.","I need to be careful. With my current strength I could easily injure Master Tanaka.","Several students paused their own training to observe Noah’s warm-up routine.","\"He feels different today,\" one of the older students whispered to his training partner.","\"Yeah, I can feel it too. If aura existed, it’s definitely radiating from him,\" the partner agreed. \"Like he’s operating on a completely different level. He’s giving me a vibe that makes me feel like he’s better than Master Tanka himself.\"","Master Tanaka approached Noah, his experienced eyes immediately noticed the transformation in Noah’s bearing and movement quality.","Something has changed with him. His posture, his balance, his energy flow—everything is...","\"Ready for today’s session?\" Tanaka asked, though his tone carried curiosity.","\"Ready, Master,\" Noah replied with confidence.","They moved to the centre sparring area, drawing the attention of every student in the dojo.","Master Tanaka settled into his opening stance with decades of muscle memory guiding his stance.","But as Noah mirrored the preparation, Tanaka’s eyes detected a new stance from Noah.","This isn’t the same student I trained yesterday. It’s like he became...a different person.","The initial exchange began with Tanaka’s customary testing strikes, attacks designed to evaluate Noah’s current skills while providing instruction through demonstration.","Clang!","But instead of the expected defensive struggle, Noah’s response came effortlessly; he no longer only intercepted Tanaka’s attack but transitioned immediately into a counter-sequence that forced the master to step back.","Tanaka’s eyes widened with genuine surprise as he realised Noah was pushing him back already.","The apprentice-rank advancement had elevated capabilities to the point where their sparring represented genuine competition in skill rather than instruction.","This requires my full attention.","For the first time in their training relationship, Master Tanaka stopped providing running commentary and focused entirely on the immediate combat situation. Noah’s new skills demanded complete concentration to avoid being overwhelmed.","Clang! Swish! Crack!","Their wooden swords created rapid impacts as both fighters operated at levels that made other students step back to safer distances. But Noah was carefully moderating his strength and speed to avoid accidentally injuring his respected instructor.","I could move faster, strike harder, but that would be disrespectful and dangerous.","The consideration that Noah showed wasn’t lost on Tanaka, and it touched him deeply.","Despite possessing skills and power that clearly exceeded his instructor’s, the young man maintained appropriate respect and control rather than allowing power to corrupt his character.","He’s holding back to protect me.","Crack! Clang! Swish!","The sparring continued with increasing intensity as both fighters pushed each other within safe limits.","Whoosh! Clang!","The session concluded when both fighters simultaneously achieved perfect striking positions, their wooden swords stopping mere inches from vital targets in mutual recognition of the other’s skill.","A draw. But not really.","Tanaka lowered his weapon with an expression that mixed pride, amazement and contentment. He understood perfectly that Noah had been respectful rather than competitive, choosing to demonstrate capability while ensuring his instructor’s safety.","Power didn’t corrupt him. That’s the mark of true character.","\"You are a monster in the way of the sword, you were born for this,\" Tanaka said with obvious admiration for what Noah had accomplished.","The word ’monster’ carried no negative connotation in martial arts circles. It represented the highest praise for someone whose talent and skill were far above normal humans.","\"Thank you, Master,\" Noah replied with genuine gratitude for the recognition and continued guidance that had brought him to this point.","Despite his system’s help, Lola’s, and Valeria’s help. Noah did not forget the help that Master Tanaka had bestowed upon him. No matter how small or big, help was help. The man had offered to train him completely free of charge.","Naturally, Noah wasn’t going to let that happen. He had decided that before he left for the tournament, he would pay the master a thousand bucks. It wasn’t a lot, but it was around ten times the monthly subscription.","He knew that if he gave more, the master would not accept it.","This young man might actually win that tournament. But I won’t spoil the surprise for either him or Yamamoto. Tanaka thought, with a growing smile."]},{"number":193,"title":"Chapter 193: Lola’s Breakthrough","paragraphs":["\"By the way, the tournament is happening in two days. Yamamoto told me he’ll come here in two days to pick you up. Just giving you advance notice.\" Tanaka said, relaying Yamamoto’s words.","Two days...not too bad.","Noah nodded with appreciation for the information. \"Thank you for letting me know. I’ll be ready.\"","Around the dojo, the quiet sound of conversations had started. Students stood clustered in pairs or small groups, whispering to one another as they stole glances at Noah.","His performance during this last sparring session had left an impression, one they were still processing. His speed, control, composure and finally skill were far beyond what they had seen from him just a day before. It was clear to everyone that something extraordinary had taken place during this day of training.","They didn’t attribute it to a system or anything supernatural; instead, they attributed it to a potential enlightenment and his monstrous talent.","This time, Noah didn’t need to take a shower. His body was so fit that he didn’t even sweat despite the practice he had done with Tanaka. After today’s sparring, he realised that the old master could no longer teach him, which was fine.","Tanaka had also told him that there was no need for him to come for training anymore; he could simply wait until the tournament and prepare. Noah didn’t act polite either, accepting the idea.","Respectful honesty rather than false modesty. Tanaka appreciated directness.","He would simply have to practise more in the other world under the guidance of Valeria, Lola and the swordsmanship manual.","Tanaka had already expressed his appreciation for Noah’s remarkable skill advancement and wished him luck in the upcoming tournament. Noah accepted graciously, thanking the experienced master for his weeks of invaluable guidance.","This time, Noah didn’t need to take a shower after their intensive sparring session. His constitution was so efficient that he hadn’t even sweated despite the training that would have exhausted his previous self.","\"Thank you for everything, Master Tanaka,\" Noah said as they walked toward the dojo entrance.","\"It’s been a pleasure to train here. I’ll come by again in two days when Master Yamamoto is here. And to everyone here,\" he said, raising his voice slightly so the surrounding students could hear, \"keep training hard. This place made me better. Let it do the same for you.\"","Master Tanaka smiled at the obvious marketing that Noah was giving him. To the students inside the dojo, Noah had become an Idol. So, hearing him praise dojo would make them more loyal to the dojo and towards their training. Hopeing they could reach Noah’s heights someday in their life.","Future sword training would fall under practising in the magical world under Valeria’s guidance, Lola’s insights, and continued study of the Tier 4 swordsmanship manual that contained techniques beyond earthly martial arts.","...","On his way back home, Noah decided to adjust his schedule to include a visit to Ethan’s school. The location wasn’t far from his new house, his car provided convenient transportation, and he didn’t want to delay testing whether magical healing could address his cousin’s chronic condition.","Time to see if magical healing can help with Type 1 diabetes.","While the entire family had shared healing bread during their recent dinner, the single loaf had been distributed among multiple people, diluting the magical effects considerably. Ethan needed concentrated healing focused specifically on his autoimmune condition for the full duration of the bread.","If one dedicated loaf works but shows a slow effect, I’ll increase the dose. Otherwise, I’ll escalate to beef jerky for permanent vitality enhancement.","At home, Noah discovered his father had departed for some unknown activity. The house stood empty, but Noah felt no concern about Alan’s absence.","His health and strength are excellent now. He can handle whatever he’s doing.","The permanent vitality enhancement had restored capabilities that made independence natural rather than worrisome. Alan could finally live normally rather than requiring constant monitoring.","He can be active, and I don’t need to worry constantly.","Heading to his room, Noah decided to check on Lola’s breakthrough attempt and current shop operations. He hadn’t been worried about her safety; his shop points had increased substantially, indicating that she was working and making successful sales during his absence.","She’s clearly succeeded and returned to work. Time to offer congratulations.","Appearing in the shop through his portal, Noah found Lola behind the counter professionally serving a customer with a smile on her face.","\"Thank you for your patronage,\" she said with genuine courtesy as the transaction concluded.","The customer nodded appreciatively before turning to leave, only to find Noah standing behind him where empty space had existed moments before.","The man was startled by Noah’s sudden appearance and almost fell.","\"Viscount Noah!\" the man exclaimed with obvious surprise, recovering quickly to offer appropriate noble greetings. \"Good morning, my lord.\"","Noah smiled warmly and returned the greeting with appropriate courtesy before the customer departed with obvious satisfaction about his purchases.","Noble recognition is still surreal, but useful for business credibility.","After the customer left, Noah turned toward Lola with pleasure at seeing her successful and obviously enhanced by the rank advancement she had achieved.","\"Congratulations on your breakthrough to grandmaster rank,\" he said with a warm smile of appreciation for her accomplishment.","Lola’s ruby eyes sparkled with amusement. \"How do you know I succeeded? I might have failed entirely.\"","\"No, I knew you had it in you,\" Noah replied with confidence. \"Good job, you are now more powerful than before.\"","...Grandmaster-level succubus working as my sales assistant.","She chuckled lightly, her expression carrying warmth. \"Well, thank you for believing in me. Your support earlier meant more than you might realise.\"","Noah stood there for a second, not responding as he could feel the emotions behind her gratitude.","After a moment, he responded with a small smile. \"You are welcome, I will be here whenever you need me.\"","Lola blushed slightly before immediately changing the topic. \"Now for the practical matters. Sales went exactly as you instructed. Forty-eight iced teas were sold to general customers, with the remainder reserved for royal guards and Valeria’s guild.\"","\"As for bread, all ninety-six units were sold throughout the shift,\" she continued with obvious satisfaction at the robust demand.","\"The premium items remained untouched as you requested, waiting for your authorisation to resume special pricing.\"","Noah nodded with appreciation. \"Thank you for the excellent work. Having someone I can trust completely makes everything so much easier.\"","Staring at his updated status that reflected the night’s operations, Noah felt good."]},{"number":194,"title":"Chapter 194: Idle Room","paragraphs":["—","Host: Noah Carter","Age: 28","Shop Level: 2","Daily Revenue: $355,000 (or equivalent)","Current Assets: $1,287,640","Shop Points: 7810","Attributes: Strength: 60, Vitality: 30, Intelligence: 20, Agility: 60","Skills: Swordsmanship(Level 10), Mana Control (Level 8), Wind Manipulation (Level 8), Aura (Level 8), Body Tempering (Level 5), Surviving on Ramen (Level 3), Cooking (Level 3), Finance (Level 3), Gaming (Level 3), Programming (Level 2),","—","Nearly eight thousand shop points. Closing in on the ten thousand needed for Shop Level 3.","The steady progression towards the next shop level filled Noah with anticipation for expanded shop and power opportunities.","Checking the time, he noticed there were about ten minutes remaining before Lola’s shift officially ended. Her dedication to maintaining the schedule despite achieving such a monumental advancement demonstrated the professionalism he valued.","Noah turned toward Lola with consideration for her need to adapt to her new power.","\"By the way, you can familiarise yourself with your new power,\" he said with an understanding tone. \"You’ve just advanced to grandmaster rank—I’m sure you still need time to stabilise at that level. I’ll take things from here.\"","As someone who advanced often, he understood that the bigger the jump, the more time and effort you needed to put in to get used to the change.","Lola looked at him with genuine gratitude for his thoughtful recognition of her needs. \"Thank you, I will work extra hard when I come back~\" she said with a wink.","Despite her teasing, her expression showed appreciation that went beyond words.","After expressing her thanks, Lola didn’t head upstairs to her room as usual. Instead, she departed the shop entirely, clearly intending to test her grandmaster capabilities somewhere with adequate space and privacy.","Alone in the store, Noah’s eyes landed on Leo, who remained in deep sleep beside the counter. The young golden mane lion had undergone remarkable physical development during his magical enhancement recovery.","His body has tripled in size. Those premium enhancement items really accelerated his growth.","The juvenile lion now displayed the proportions of an adolescent predator rather than a small cub, his frame containing strength and agility that would soon match his adept potential.","He’s going to be formidable when he reaches full development.","Noah settled beside his sleeping companion and focused on his personal advancement. His swordsmanship had reached apprentice rank, but his other skills needed similar development to achieve balance.","He wanted to level up his Mana control skill to level 10, then the aura skill. After doing that, he would be a near-complete apprentice-rank warrior.","Drawing upon his enhanced concentration, Noah began the systematic exercises that would push his mana manipulation toward mastery. The familiar sensation of magical energy responding to his will felt more refined with each practice session.","Twenty minutes of focused training should yield some progress.","The meditation proceeded smoothly.","After about twenty minutes of productive training, familiar voices outside the shop announced the arrival of his regular institutional customers.","Representatives from both Valeria’s guild and the royal family entered with courtesy, their greetings carrying appropriate respect for his noble status combined with genuine appreciation for his products.","\"Good afternoon, Viscount Carter,\" called the royal representative. \"Here for our regular order.\"","\"Same for the Silver Wolf Guild,\" added Valeria’s messenger with obvious satisfaction at the established routine.","The transaction proceeded efficiently.","48 iced teas and 96 bread loaves were distributed between the two organisations according to their established agreements.","Daily institutional sales are complete. Now the auto-makers can reset for a new production cycle.","The sale generated 1,440 shop points and $72,000 in revenue, adding meaningful progress toward his various advancement goals while providing steady income that supported his overall business operations.","Nearly 9,000 shop points total. Shop Level 3 upgrade approaching rapidly.","Noah didn’t worry about the relatively modest income compared to his premium sales events. His departure from the human kingdom was approaching in a few days, and he found himself curious about what destination the system would select next.","Where will the shop relocate?","The uncertainty created anticipation rather than anxiety. Each new location brought fresh opportunities for business expansion, cultural exchange, and personal development that had transformed his life from where it was.","Noah glanced at the stock, then at the time.","The powerful practitioners of the kingdom would arrive in about four hours to buy his premium items.","With abundant free time and his financial assets crossing the one-million-dollar threshold, Noah decided to finally investigate the idle room that had been tempting him for weeks.","He walked to the mysterious door on the second floor, its plain appearance belying the advanced magical technology contained within. The system prompt for purchase appeared as he approached.","Taking a deep breath, he activated the purchase.","[Idle Room purchased for $1,000,000]","The substantial cost barely registered given his current wealth and the effect of the room, and immediately, the room’s door opened.","The interior was... empty, except for one thing that stood out.","It immediately caught Noah’s attention; it was a large screen mounted on the wall, its surface displaying information that made him step closer with growing excitement.","All of my skills are listed there. Every single one.","The screen showed a comprehensive interface displaying his complete skill set:","->Swordsmanship (Level 10)","->Mana Control (Level 8)","...","After examining the room and experimenting with the screen interface, Noah gradually understood the idle room’s function and limits.","It had a daily time restriction of four hours. He could only train a skill for four hours inside the room; he could split the four hours into four different skills with an hour each, too.","The second limitation was one that was related to the level of skills.","The idle room only works on skills below Level 20, but the limit would rise alongside his shop level. When his shop reaches level 3, the limit will increase too.","The third limit, which was the one that hurt Noah the most, was...money."]},{"number":195,"title":"Chapter 195: Leo’s Evolution","paragraphs":["He had to pay money in order to train his skills, and the price of the training differed based on the skill level. The effectiveness also dropped as the level increased.","Levels 1-5: $1,000 per hour (3x speed multiplier compared to personal training)","Levels 6-10: $50,000 per hour (2x multiplier compared to personal training)","Levels 11-20: $100,000 per hour (1.5x multiplier compared to personal training)","It was expensive, but most definitely efficient. The cost scales with the value of advancement.","While Noah felt satisfaction at finally accessing this advanced training system, the pricing structure meant each session would consume his money. The higher-level training costs were particularly steep.","\"System, can others use the idle room, or is it just me?\" Noah asked, feeling his heart beating faster at the thought.","[No, host. At the current level, this is not a viable function. However, it will be later on.]","Noah nodded. \"I see...\"","Noah’s attention went back to the current features. Based on his estimation, for around $2,000 to 3,000, he could evolve a single skill to level 5","As for the skills above level 5, he wasn’t sure. But he would find out by using it.","Using this will definitely impact my finances, but the time savings could be worth it.","He checked his remaining liquid assets after the room purchase, and approximately $359,000 remained available for immediate use.","Enough for several high-level training sessions. Let’s start with something important.","After consideration, Noah decided to advance his mana control skill to Level 10, bringing it in line with his swordsmanship and creating a foundation for the apprentice rank.","Mana control from Level 8 to Level 10. Two levels at the 6-10 tier pricing.","He pressed the mana control skill on the interface, accessing detailed training options and duration settings.","Two hours should be sufficient for testing the system while achieving meaningful advancement. Since the effectiveness of the idle training is comparable to four hours of my normal training.","Setting the training duration to two hours. Noah confirmed the session parameters.","[$100,000 immediately deducted from account]","The screen immediately displayed a small avatar representing Noah engaged in intensive mana control exercises.","That’s actually pretty cool. Watching my advancement in real-time.","The visualisation showed his training avatar cycling through mana manipulation exercises, each repetition building upon previous improvements with efficiency that surpassed normal learning curves.","This is what a hundred thousand dollars of training looks like. Let’s see if the results justify the cost.","Two hours passed and Noah had to say he was impressed. His skill had levelled up to level 9. Excited at the gain, he decided to add it once more. Another two hours passed by, and level 10 had arrived before him. He had reached level 10 mana control by spending $200,000 in four hours.","During that time, Noah wasn’t idle. He had been training simultaneously outside the idle room. He had levelled up his body tempering to level 6 through physical exercises while waiting.","Before reaching level 10, he had also eaten his rice cake to increase his intelligence to 30, so that when his mana control reached level 10, it would double to 60—and it did.","Noah pulled up his updated status with satisfaction.","—","Host: Noah Carter","Age: 28","Shop Level: 2","Daily Revenue: $355,000 (or equivalent)","Current Assets: $159,640","S hop Points: 9250","Attributes: Strength: 60, Vitality: 30, Intelligence: 60, Agility: 60","Skills: Swordsmanship(Level 10), Mana Control (Level 10), Wind Manipulation (Level 8), Aura (Level 8), Body Tempering (Level 6), Surviving on Ramen (Level 3), Cooking (Level 3), Finance (Level 3), Gaming (Level 3), Programming (Level 2),","—","There is some balance across my primary attributes. Sixty points in strength, intelligence, and agility, with thirty in vitality. The next skill I will focus on will be Body Tempering to level 10. Then I will decide whether to improve my important skills or level up my lower skills to level 5.","With his Idle Room daily limit exhausted, Noah headed downstairs. It was almost time for his premium customers to arrive—the powerful practitioners who could afford his higher-tier products.","As he descended the stairs, Leo stirred from his extended nap, the young lion’s enhanced senses detecting Noah’s approach.","Noah raised an eyebrow. The young cub had finally woken up from his extended sleep.","\"Hey there, buddy,\" Noah said, scratching behind Leo’s ears. \"How are you feeling? You’ve slept for two days now.\"","Leo purred contentedly at the petting before shocking Noah.","\"I’m feeling good, Father. The food you gave me last time was really good and filled with benefits; my body couldn’t help but take a break to absorb everything. I feel much stronger and more powerful.\" Leo spoke, making Noah’s eyes widen in shock.","Noah immediately assessed his status, and that shocked him. The young lion was no longer a juvenile, but in his Adolescent stage, as for his skills...they’ve evolved!","Even Leo’s potential grew from adept to master. His size manipulation was also available for use now.","—","[Pet No.1] Leo","[Growth] Adolescent","[Rank] Adept","[Potential] Master","[Skills]","[Size Manipulation] – Leo has the latent ability to shift his physical size, ranging from a small kitten to a full-grown lion with a majestic mane.","[Savage Rift Claw] – An evolved form of Claw Sweep. Leo channels raw energy into his claws, unleashing a rending strike that tears through multiple enemies and leaves a lingering energy scar that deals damage over time.","[King’s Dominion] – The evolved Roar. Leo releases a thunderous, kingdom-shaking roar that asserts his dominance across the battlefield. Enemies suffer debuffs such as Fear, Stun, or Weaken, while allies within range gain morale, minor healing, and temporary attack buffs.","—","Noah stared at Leo’s status screen, his mind still processing the dramatic transformation his companion had undergone.","\"Leo, can you show me your size manipulation?\" Noah asked curiously.","Leo’s golden eyes sparkled with obvious pride. \"Of course, Father. Watch this.\"","Noah felt somewhat weird hearing that coming from his companion’s voice directly. When he told the young lion to call him papa, Leo was young. But now that he is somewhat older, it feels...","The adolescent lion began to shrink before Noah’s eyes, his form compacting until he resembled the small kitten Noah had first encountered.","Then, just as smoothly, Leo expanded back to his current size, roughly that of a large dog, before continuing to grow until he matched a full-grown lion complete with a developing mane."]},{"number":196,"title":"Chapter 196: Biggest Sale, Half a million in sales","paragraphs":["That’s... actually terrifying. He could go from house pet to a lion’s size in seconds.","\"Incredible,\" Noah breathed, watching Leo return to his preferred adolescent size. \"Your growth has been remarkable.\"","...","\"The food you provided contained power beyond anything I’ve experienced,\" Leo explained, his mental voice carrying gratitude and appreciation. \"My body needed time to fully absorb and integrate such concentrated energy.\"","The conversation was interrupted by familiar voices outside the shop. Noah’s enhanced hearing detected Princess Elara’s distinctive laughter mixed with Valeria’s voice, accompanied by several other voices he didn’t immediately recognise.","Right on schedule.","Noah moved toward the door, peering outside to see an impressive assembly gathering near his shop entrance. Princess Elara and Valeria led the group, but behind them stood figures whose very presence radiated an aura of power.","They were the kingdom’s strongest warriors.","This is going to be my biggest sale yet.","The shop door opened with the familiar chime, and Princess Elara entered first.","She was startled by Noah’s appearance at the door, but then relaxed and greeted him.","Noah returned the greeting to everyone before moving inside and letting them in. The shop was large enough to accommodate them all.","Entering inside, Elara’s amber eyes landed on Leo, who was too big not to notice.","\"Oh my!\" she exclaimed with genuine delight, her royal bearing momentarily forgotten as she spotted Noah’s companion. \"Leo woke up! And look how much he’s grown!\"","Valeria followed close behind. \"He’s already reached adept rank,\" she observed with obvious amazement. \"That level of advancement in just two days... It’s incredible.\"","Noah nodded with pride in his companion’s achievement. \"His potential has also increased. His potential is master-level now.\"","\"Wow,\" Elara breathed in a cold breath.","Master-level pets were by no means easy to find. The strongest pet the royal family had was an adept-rank wolf at the end of his potential. \"That’s... incredibly rare. Master-potential magical beasts are considered national treasures in most kingdoms.\"","\"Hello, Princess!\" Leo greeted, he saw her as his father’s friend, and greeting was an obligation.","\"He’s so cute, hi Leo.\"","The other members of their group began filing into the shop, their expressions equally impressed as they sensed Leo’s aura and noticed the abundant premium products displayed throughout the space.","Noah recognised several faces from the day before, but others were completely new, figures whose reputations preceded them into any room they entered.","\"Welcome to the Idle Store,\" Noah announced with courtesy, gesturing toward his premium product displays. \"I have fresh stock of all enhancement items available. A new item has also been added.\"","The assembled warriors moved through the shop with obvious appreciation for the quality and variety of options available.","\"Those are the rare treasures: protein bars, beef jerky, energy drinks,\" one of the newer customers muttered aloud. \"All permanent enhancement items of the highest quality.\"","But Princess Elara’s attention had focused on the new item that Noah had just spoken about. The one that hadn’t been present during her previous visits.","\"Rice cakes?\" she asked with obvious curiosity, approaching the display with growing interest. \"This is the new product.\"","Noah nodded. \"Just introduced today. They provide permanent intelligence enhancement along with the standard temporary boost.\"","The reaction from the assembled group was quite dramatic, to say the least. Intelligence enhancement items were rare even among permanent attribute boosters, their rarity making them more valuable than the other items.","\"Permanent intelligence enhancement...Incredible,\" breathed a court mage whose robes marked him as one of the academy’s senior instructors.","\"How much?\" Elara asked immediately, mirroring everyone’s internal question.","\"Same price as the other premium items,\" Noah replied smoothly. \"One hundred fifty golden coins.\"","Without hesitation, Elara produced her coin pouch and counted out the payment with obvious eagerness to test the new product.","\"I’ll take one immediately,\" she declared, accepting the rice cake with careful hands.","The assembled warriors watched with fascination as Princess Elara unwrapped the enhancement item and took her first bite.","As the princess, she had privileges that others didn’t, so none of them complained about her buying the first product. They also knew her relationship with the viscount wasn’t simple.","Elara’s expression immediately transformed, eyes widening with surprise at both the flavour and the effect.","\"It’s... incredible,\" she murmured, her senses allowing her to feel the intelligence boost taking effect in real-time. \"The taste is unlike anything I’ve experienced.\"","\"I’ll take a protein bar, please,\" announced a master-level berserker whose reputation for strength was known throughout the kingdom.","\"An energy drink, please,\" added a guild captain whose agility-based combat style would benefit enormously from the enhancement.","\"One of the rice cakes and one beef jerky, please,\" declared a court mage who wanted to not only improve his power as a mage, but also his weakness, his vitality.","The transactions proceeded with enthusiasm as Noah distributed his premium stock among customers who understood exactly what they were purchasing. Each warrior approached their selections with careful consideration.","They were investing in their future power after all.","Within ten minutes, Noah’s entire premium inventory had been completely depleted. Eleven protein bars, eleven packages of beef jerky, eleven energy drinks, and ten rice cakes—all sold to the kingdom’s most elite practitioners.","Each item commanded its standard price of one hundred fifty golden coins, generating a total revenue that made Noah’s head spin with satisfaction.","Forty-three items multiplied by one hundred fifty coins equals... six thousand four hundred fifty golden coins.","The calculation translated to $645,000 in his currency conversion system, immediately restoring more than half of what he’d invested in idle room training just hours earlier.","But beyond the monetary value, each sale had generated ten shop points, bringing his total to nearly ten thousand, tantalizingly close to finishing one of the requirements for the Shop Level 3 upgrade that would allow him to gain new products and new features like the idle room.","As the last customer completed their purchase and departed with obvious satisfaction, Noah found himself alone with Princess Elara, Valeria and Leo."]},{"number":197,"title":"Chapter 197: Growth, and departing","paragraphs":["\"Your products continue to amaze,\" Elara said with genuine appreciation for what she’d witnessed.","\"The kingdom’s strongest warriors have all been strengthened thanks to your items and generosity, to lower the price of such valuable treasures.","No matter how many times we thank you, it won’t be enough to repay you. Thank you, Noah. You are one of the best people to ever step foot into this kingdom.\"","Valeria nodded in agreement. \"More than half of the kingdom’s Adept and master-level practitioners just became significantly more powerful thanks to your inventory. That’s going to shift the balance of our war with the extremists.\"","...","Before Valeria and Elara left, Noah informed them that he would be moving once again in two days.","When he would return was unknown, but he hoped that everything would go well for them during his absence.","The duo tried to persuade him to stay, their expressions carrying genuine disappointment at losing their reliable friend before being their supplier.","\"You’ve become integral to our kingdom’s defence,\" Elara argued with concern for the safety of the people and her own personal reasoning. \"Your products have strengthened our forces beyond what we thought possible.\"","Valeria nodded in agreement.","Despite their persuasion, Noah still shook his head with gentle firmness, his decision already made despite their arguments.","\"I really can’t,\" Noah said with an apologetic smile on his face.","Staying in the human kingdom, while it would be nice to be next to friends, it would limit my progress significantly. I need to explore the world, discover new opportunities, and continue growing","The realisation had crystallised during his time in the demon kingdom. Each new location brought unique challenges, customers, and experiences that expanded his capabilities in ways that remaining stationary never could.","Comfort is the enemy of growth. Back when he first became the shopkeeper of the idle store, he was nothing but a scared man. Afraid of even stepping outside for fear of experiencing the pain of death three times over.","But now? He had grown, not only in strength, but in confidence. He no longer feared every shadow, afraid that his death was drawing near.","Both women sighed with resignation, recognising the determination in his voice that indicated no amount of persuasion would change his mind.","\"At least you’re giving us proper notice this time,\" Valeria said with wry humour, remembering his sudden disappearance during the last time he had left.","\"We’ll be here before you leave,\" Elara promised, her composure cracking as she tried to mask the personal sadness at another farewell. \"Thank you for not giving us short notice like last time.\"","He had given them two days to prepare mentally and practically for his departure.","They departed reluctantly, leaving Noah alone with Leo in the shop that had become their temporary sanctuary.","Leo nestled next to his father, the young lion’s high intelligence allowing him to sense the mixed emotions surrounding their impending relocation.","\"Father, are you sad about leaving them?\" Leo asked with curiosity about human emotional complexity.","Leo no longer called Noah papa; his growth had also started affecting his personality and the way he spoke, not just his strength and potential.","\"A little,\" Noah admitted, stroking Leo’s mane gently with affection. \"But growth requires change. Staying comfortable would mean staying weak.\"","\"I understand. New places mean new adventures and new food!\"","His perspective is refreshingly simple. Adventure for more food.","Noah smiled at his companion’s optimistic outlook before checking his updated status to assess their current position.","—","Host: Noah Carter","Age: 28","Shop Level: 2","Daily Revenue: $355,000 (or equivalent)","Current Assets: $828,640","Shop Points: 10,160","Attributes: Strength: 60, Vitality: 30, Intelligence: 60, Agility: 60","Skills: Swordsmanship(Level 10), Mana Control (Level 10), Wind Manipulation (Level 8), Aura (Level 8), Body Tempering (Level 6), Surviving on Ramen (Level 3), Cooking (Level 3), Finance (Level 3), Gaming (Level 3), Programming (Level 2),","—","The numbers reflected more than just the premium sales. During his four hours of idle room training, the auto-makers had continued their steady production, generating thirty-two loaves of bread and sixteen iced teas that had sold to the same customers who had bought the premium items.","His assets had nearly reached the million-dollar threshold once again, providing financial freedom.","Most importantly, his shop points had crossed the crucial 10,000 mark, fulfilling one of the two conditions required for the Shop Level 3 upgrade that would unlock new features and opportunities.","Half the requirements complete. Progress toward the next tier.","The second condition, however, presented a significantly greater challenge that would require sustained effort and patience.","[Auto-IceTea Maker] Level: 4","Production Rate: 4 Iced teas every hour","Max Stock: 96 Progress: 180/400","—","[Auto-Baker] Level: 4","Production Rate: 8 Loaves every hour","Max Stock: 96","Progress: 288/400","—","[Auto-ProteinBar] Level: 1","Production Rate: 1 bar every 2 hours","Max Stock: 12","Progress: 27/100","—","[Auto-EnergyDrink] Level: 1","Production Rate: 1 Energy Drink every 2 hours","Max Stock: 12","Progress: 24/100","—","[Auto-BeefJerky] Level: 1","Production Rate: 1 Beef Jerky every 2 hours","Max Stock: 12","Progress: 24/100","—","[Auto-RiceCake] Level: 1","Production Rate: 1 Rice Cake every 2 hours","Max Stock: 12","Progress: 10/100","—","The premium auto-makers are making the same normal progress, it will take me about 9 days to level all of them up to level 2, from there it should pick up speed, hopefully, my next destination is well off.","The bread and iced tea makers were approaching Level 5 with steady advancement, their progress reflecting consistent sales to customers who could afford their reasonable pricing.","But the premium enhancement items remained stuck at Level 1, their astronomical costs having previously limited the customer base to royalty and master-level practitioners. He had solved the issue two days ago, which started helping.","At this rate, it would take a few weeks or perhaps a month to achieve Level 4 across all categories.","The reality was sobering. Each premium auto-maker needed to complete four level upgrades, requiring hundreds of total sales per category. If he stayed in the human kingdom, reaching Shop Level 3 through auto-maker advancement alone would take at least half a year’s worth of operation.","Check AUTHOR’S NOTES! IMPORTANT!"]},{"number":198,"title":"Chapter 198: Sixth Item, Powerfull!","paragraphs":["So, moving away is a must. Hopefully, I can be relocated to an area with wealthier customer bases or significantly increase demand somehow.","Despite the extended timeline, Noah found himself surprisingly unbothered. His shop was already exceeding his wildest expectations, providing daily income that supported a comfortable living while funding personal development through systems like the idle room.","Noah was patient, he was in no rush to level up his shop. Sustainability mattered more than speed. Better to finish the race strong than to sprint at the start and burn out halfway.","Besides, he knew that numerous shop items remained locked behind purchase requirements, suggesting that unlocking the complete product would take time, and each item would add more to his daily revenue, making him even richer.","Each new product type could accelerate my revenue through multiple income streams.","Most importantly, his upcoming relocation might solve the premium customer shortage by transporting his shop to locations with different economic structures.","New worlds, new economies, new opportunities.","Noah leaned back against Leo’s warm fur, his companion’s steady breathing providing comfort as he contemplated their uncertain but exciting future.","\"Father, where do you think we’ll go next?\" Leo asked with curious anticipation rather than anxiety about the unknown.","\"I have no idea,\" Noah replied honestly, \"but that’s what makes it interesting.\"","The system had consistently chosen locations that challenged him in different ways: the medieval human kingdom with its political complexities, the demon realm with its cultural misunderstandings and extremist threats. Each destination had forced him to adapt while providing unique opportunities to grow.","Two days remained to prepare for departure, finalise any remaining business in the human kingdom, and ensure his friends understood that his absence didn’t represent abandonment but rather necessary evolution.","Change was never easy, even when it led toward better outcomes. But growth required leaving comfort zones behind.","Noah decided to check up on his next item to purchase before going out on a hunt with Leo. Lola had been clear, Leo was never meant to be a pet kept in a small room. For him to grow properly, Noah had to take him out on hunts where the young lion could develop his combat instincts and natural abilities.","Opening the shop slot interface, Noah’s eyes moved toward the next available purchase. The fifth item in the progression sequence, positioned after the rice cakes he’d just introduced to his inventory.","What appeared on the screen made Noah’s breath catch in his throat.","[Item 5: Instant Coffee]","[Effects: Dramatically accelerates all recovery rates by 100% for thirty minutes. Grants enhanced focus, stronger immunity to mental attacks and doubled comprehension speed for the thirty-minute duration. Permanently increases Intelligence by 30 upon first consumption.]","[Price: $1,000,000]","Noah stared at the display for several long seconds, his mind struggling to process the sheer magnitude of what he was reading. The effects listed weren’t just improvements; they represented a complete transformation. This was exactly what he had been looking for since he saw Alissa’s talent.","Thirty permanent intelligence points.","The number hit him like a physical blow. His current intelligence sat at sixty points. His attributes were approximately 1.5x normal apprentice-rank practitioners, and he was about to increase that even more.","The thirty additional points would bring him to ninety total, a 1.5x increase to his current intelligence, which would have a noticeable effect on his magic power.","But the permanent enhancement was only the beginning of the coffee’s incredible effects. The temporary benefits read like a wishlist of every advantage a practitioner could desire.","Enhanced focus and stronger immunity to mental attacks.","Noah’s mind immediately grasped the benefits. Mental attacks were among the most feared abilities in magical combat, capable of incapacitating even powerful warriors through confusion, fear, or direct mind control. Stronger immunity would make him untouchable against entire categories of enemy techniques.","This doubled comprehension speed effect alone would revolutionise his development.","Learning new skills, mastering complex techniques, understanding magical theory, everything would occur at twice the normal rate.","The thought of doing the same work for twice the result sent excitement coursing through his body. His friends, Kip and Alissa, had the advantage of natural talent, but the new doubled comprehension speed could close the gaps between them. Especially with his Idle room, too.","One hundred percent recovery rate acceleration for thirty minutes.","Whether it was physical recovery, mental fatigue, or any form of exhaustion, every form of restoration would double in efficiency. Training sessions that normally required hours of rest could be repeated immediately.","After consuming the instant coffee, the person would have thirty minutes of peak efficiency.","Noah found himself standing up from his comfortable position on Leo’s warm fur. This wasn’t just another enhancement item, it was a complete shift that would elevate him beyond anything he’d thought possible.","But the price...","One million dollars.","He was still around $178,000 short of the price of the item.","Despite his inability to currently buy it, Noah felt that the item was worth every penny.","Even after Lola sells the night batch of bread and Iced tea, I would still be unable to purchase it today. It seems like I would have to wait till tomorrow. Noah thought with a wry smile.","He had hoped that he could buy it today, so when tomorrow rolls over, he would have a couple of them on the shelf.","Leo watched his father’s agitation with curious concern, the young lion’s senses detecting the excitement and amazement radiating from Noah’s emotional state.","\"Father, you seem very excited about something. What did you discover?\"","\"Something incredible,\" Noah replied, his voice carrying awe that made Leo’s ears perk up with interest. \"Something that could make me significantly more powerful than I am now. And something that you would like to drink.\"","\"Really! What is it, what is it!\" Leo jumped up from his resting spot with an excited expression. If his father had said that it’s a drink that he would like to try, then he definitely would.","\"It’s called Instant Coffee, Leo. I can’t give you it now because I still don’t have it. I will make you try it in a few days, okay?\"","Leo’s expression did not falter, despite his inability to try the mysterious drink. \"Yes, father!\""]},{"number":199,"title":"Chapter 199: Hunting With Leo","paragraphs":["Before heading out on a hunt with Leo, Noah decided to quickly level up his aura skill to level 10. With his mana control at level 10, creating a strong foundation for aura manipulation would be straightforward; the two skills complemented each other naturally.","Noah immediately calmed his beating heart from the excitement over the instant coffee and sat down in a meditation position. His high intelligence made the connection between mana control and aura development crystal clear, allowing him to approach the training with a focused mind.","Level 8 to level 10. This shouldn’t take long with my current foundation.","Drawing upon his mana control, Noah began channelling his internal energy outward, extending his personal aura beyond his body. The technique flowed as naturally as breathing.","His aura expanded steadily, growing stronger and more refined with each repetition. The invisible energy field that surrounded his body became denser, more responsive to his will.","The outline of mana around his body grew stronger, more condensed as time passed by.","Ten minutes later, the familiar system notification appeared in his vision.","[Your Aura skill has reached level 10!]","Noah stood up from his meditation spot with a satisfied smile. The progression felt natural, a step toward the balanced development he was pursuing.","Three skills at level 10 now. Swordsmanship, mana control, and aura. A solid apprentice-rank foundation. It would be perfect if I could level up my Wind manipulation skill, too, but one step at a time.","\"Are you ready to go on a hunt, Leo?\" Noah asked, turning toward his companion with anticipation for their first joint combat experience.","Leo’s ears immediately perked up, his tail whipping back and forth with obvious excitement. The young lion had been waiting for this opportunity since awakening with his evolved abilities.","\"Let’s go, Father! I want to test my new skills against real opponents!\"","Noah could hear the enthusiasm that Leo was feeling. He could tell that his companion was eager to prove himself in actual combat.","Noah led Leo through Esta’s streets toward the same location where Valeria had originally taken him for monster hunting alongside Alissa and Kip.","As they approached the hunting grounds, Noah made a strategic decision about their training approach.","\"We’re not practising against novice-rank monsters,\" he announced to Leo with confidence in their new abilities. \"It would be a waste of time for both of us.\"","Leo nodded his head in agreement. Novice-rank beasts were too weak for even a warmup. As an adept, he could slap a novice-rank beast to death.","I’m much stronger than a normal apprentice-rank practitioner now. Leo’s combat potential exceeds normal Adept rank as well.","\"We’ll warm up against apprentice-rank beasts, then head toward the minotaur area where the adept-rank creatures roam.\"","Leo’s eyes gleamed with satisfaction at the challenging prospect. \"Perfect. I want to fight something that can actually make me try.\"","His combat instincts are flaring. Good.","The hunting ground opened before them, the same rocky terrain where Noah had fought against his first apprentice-rank beast under Valeria’s guidance. But now he approached as a capable warrior rather than a man in training.","...","Two apprentice-rank crimson horn bears emerged from behind the rocks, their massive frames rippling with malevolent energy that made normal humans flee in terror. Each beast stood incredibly tall, their distinctive red-tinted horns gleaming with magical power that could pierce through steel armour.","These creatures had once represented serious threats that required him to create a careful strategy and flawless execution to defeat them safely.","Now? They were nothing but a warm-up.","The crimson horn bears were significantly more dangerous than other apprentice-rank beasts, their combination of raw physical power and magical horn attacks making them feared throughout the territory in which they lived. Their thick hides could deflect most weapons, while their charging attacks had been known to kill many apprentice-rank warriors.","\"One each,\" Noah declared, drawing his blade with fluid motion from its scabbard.","Leo roared before the young lion’s body began expanding through his size manipulation ability, growing to something approaching a large lion’s size.","\"Time to hunt!\"","His body settled at thrice his earlier dog-size, muscles rippling beneath his golden fur that gleamed with mana, creating an ethereal scene to anyone who saw it. The transformation revealed the true majesty that his species was known for.","Leo was an apex predator designed for domination.","He looks magnificent. It’s hard to believe that he is the same lion that was the size of a cat a few days ago.","The crimson horn bears sensed the sudden change before them. His opponent seemed to change his size at will!","Their confidence was wavering as they felt the immense power radiating from the lion before them.","They were facing enemies who radiated genuine danger rather than vulnerable prey. The larger bear’s horn began glowing with concentrated magical energy, preparing for its signature piercing attack.","Before the bear could finish preparing to attack, Noah moved with incredible speed. His natural agility attribute, already 50% greater than that of apprentice-rank practitioners, was further enhanced by his wind manipulation skill and the aura that accelerated his movement and empowered every strike.","The first bear charged with earth-shaking force, its horn aimed directly at Noah’s chest with killing intent. The attack that would have been fatal to his previous self now seemed manageable.","Swish! Clang!","Noah sidestepped the charge with the grace of a master at work, his agility making the bear’s assault appear sluggish. His blade found its spot on the Crimson bear’s hide, slicing through the flesh without any struggle.","This feels... easy. Too easy.","The bear roared in pain and fury, spinning to face Noah with aggression. But its movements were predictable, its techniques crude compared to the refined combat he’d experienced against human opponents.","Brute force without sophistication.","Meanwhile, Leo engaged his opponent with fury that showcased his evolved combat abilities. His first attack was a demonstration of raw power that left no doubt about his advancement.","[Savage Rift Claw]"]},{"number":200,"title":"Chapter 200: Hunting With Leo (2)","paragraphs":["Leo’s evolved claw skill erupted with energy as he unleashed his technique. The attack didn’t just slash, it tore through the wind barrier itself.","WHOOSH!","The crimson horn bear’s pained bellow echoed across the rocky terrain as Leo’s attack proved far too powerful for his defences. Deep gouges appeared across the beast’s hide, glowing with lingering energy that continued dealing damage.","\"This is...too easy!\" Leo said as he pressed his advantage.","The bear attempted to gore Leo with its horn, but the lion’s reflexes made evasion effortless. Leo flowed around the attack like the wind, positioning himself for another devastating assault.","[King’s Dominion]","A thunderous roar erupted from Leo’s throat, the sound carrying magical force that made the very air tremble. The crimson horn bear stumbled backwards, its eyes glazing with fear as debilitating effects took hold.","On the other side, another battle was taking place between Noah and the second Crimson Horn Bear.","Noah quickly finished his opponent with a combination of strikes, each blow finding the bear’s weak points. His aura made every attack devastatingly more effective against the bear’s natural defences.","Thud!","The creature collapsed with a final groan, its massive body no longer moving.","Apprentice-rank opponents are no longer challenging. Noah thought, using the bear’s fur to clean his blade from its blood.","Leo’s battle concluded moments later as his combination of evolved techniques overwhelmed his opponent entirely. The second bear fell with deep claw marks that continued glowing with residual energy.","\"Well done,\" Noah called to Leo, who was standing proudly over his defeated opponent, his size returning to normal adolescent proportions. \"Ready for something more challenging?\"","Leo’s response was quick and enthusiastic. \"Lead the way to the minotaurs! These bears were barely a warm-up.\"","They moved deeper into the hunting grounds, approaching the territory where adept-rank creatures made their lairs.","Leo is an adept-rank golden mane lion now. As a superior magical beast species, he should be significantly stronger than typical adept-rank opponents.","The rocky terrain in the Minotaur’s territory appeared ahead.","...","Leo and Noah walked into the minotaur area, their footsteps echoing softly against the rocky terrain that marked the transition from apprentice-rank hunting grounds to more dangerous territory.","Stone boulders jutted from the ground like sentinels, creating a difficult terrain to fight in.","This is where real hunting begins.","As they navigated between large rock pillars, they encountered their first target. A minotaur stood in a small clearing ahead, its massive humanoid body topped by a bull’s head that surveyed the area with intelligence.","The creature stood eight feet tall, its muscled torso covered in brown fur, while powerful hands gripped a crude but effective stone club. This was exactly the kind of opponent Noah had been hoping to find, an adept-rank beast worthy of Leo’s power.","Noah turned toward Leo with confidence in his companion’s abilities.","\"He’s all yours, big boy,\" he announced, gesturing toward the minotaur with obvious trust in Leo’s combat prowess.","Leo roared in excitement, the sound carrying anticipation for genuine combat rather than the easy victories they’d just experienced. His voice practically vibrated with eagerness.","\"Finally! A good challenge!\"","The young lion prepared to lunge forward and engage the minotaur in the kind of battle that would truly test his evolved abilities against appropriate opposition.","But as Leo began his advance, Noah frowned, his eyes spotting something that didn’t align with his expectations.","The minotaur looks... weak?","Something was fundamentally wrong with the creature’s posture and movement. Instead of the confident bearing typical of healthy adept-rank beasts, this minotaur moved with obvious difficulty.","As if answering Noah’s question, the minotaur turned for a second as he looked around the terrain frantically.","The truth became apparent and deeply concerning.","The minotaur’s body was bloodied, dark stains matting its fur. It had clearly been subjected to recent violence. A large wound gaped across its torso, the injury severe enough that the creature was barely standing upright.","These are some fresh wounds. Noaght thought, with a growing frown appearing on his face.","Immediately, Noah felt alarm bells ringing in his mind. Minotaurs were apex predators in their territory, feared by most creatures and capable of holding their own against other apprentice-rank opponents in the area without issue.","What could injure an adept-rank minotaur this severely?","\"Leo, drop back!\" Noah commanded urgently.","Without hesitation, Leo obeyed immediately. He recognised the concern in his father’s voice. The young lion retreated to Noah’s side, his excitement replaced by alertness.","\"I sense it too, Father. Something dangerous is nearby.\"","Good instincts. His predator senses are detecting the threat that I can’t. I only knew something was wrong because of the injuries to the minotaur.","Noah’s hearing suddenly picked up a sound coming from the dense jungle vegetation adjacent to where the wounded minotaur stood. The noise was guttural, malevolent, carrying a tone that made his survival instincts scream warnings.","That’s not a normal creature sound.","\"What’s that sound...\" Noah muttered, his hand instinctively moving to his sword hilt as every sense focused on identifying the source of the disturbing noise.","Before long, the sight that emerged from the jungle told him exactly what they were facing, and the revelation sent ice through his veins.","A larger, stronger, and definitely more fearsome minotaur stepped into view. This creature dwarfed its injured counterpart, standing nearly twelve feet tall with muscles that rippled beneath pristine fur unmarked by any wounds.","The aura radiating from the newcomer was overwhelming, a pressure that made the air itself scream.","Power rolled off the creature in waves. Noah could practically feel the pressure despite the distance between them. This was no Adept-rank minotaur.","The wounded minotaur that had seemed like appropriate prey now revealed itself as the survivor of an encounter with this predator.","The minotaur they first spotted was an adept-rank creature that had barely escaped with its life.","Before Noah could react or formulate an escape plan, the larger minotaur let out a loud shout, his voice shaking the weak branches on the trees, and then the large minotaur charged forward."]}]);
